 'High-order alpha2 split (VS removed at same x) output: virtual_alpha_decomposition.csv; algebraic only.'; ...
 'R1_EXACT vs V19 historical comparison only meaningful with V11_19 and estimate 0.01.'; ...
 'The near-zero mapping divisor guard is diagnostic: never trust high-order HLC outputs past its guard.'; ...
 'HLC-generated functions, physical input bounds and model stay unchanged.'; ...
 'No asynchronous EKF in this standalone diagnostic.'; ...
 'All outcome files including CBF_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER_V28.txt are inside ZIP.'; ...
 'R1_BLEND is a diagnostic and may VIOLATE CBF constraints; do not call it safe.'; ...
