% === V23 ADDENDUM / 2026-11-16 ===
% Goal: diagnose HLC torque explosion before modifying CBF.
% V19 evidence: R1 straight_single thrust CBF modification first t=2.150s, raw torque >1Nm first t=2.275s, 135.229Nm at t=2.300s, position error >5cm first t=2.325s.
% V19 NOMINAL same scene raw HLC torque <= 0.002134 Nm; large tracking error alone did not cause this 135Nm spike.
