% 別資料：R193の AF7R58R186_FLAT_EVAL は15次Bernsteinの0〜7階解析jetを評価。これはFlightの再計画用候補で、今回の新規C7横移動参考ケースとは同一でない。
% 先行するV30の意味：157条件で水平方向の大きな静的目標ずれ自体が一様な大トルクを起こすわけではなく、急なC6変更は6階導関数を大きくしてCBFなしでも飽和できた。一方V30の HLC仮想入力監査と同一状態スナップショット監査は sc.dt 欠落で未実施。今回のV32コードではそのスコープエラーも修正。
% V32: SINGLE FILE common_matlab/test_CBF_HLC_RootCause.m を上書きする。実行時に common_matlab/_CBF_TEST_OUTPUT/CBF_HLC_ROOTCAUSE_V32_日時.zip を作り、解析CSV、C7微分監査、原参照の出典、イベント、全過去引継ぎを内包。ZIPの生成・展開確認後に中間ファイルを消す。異常時は診断をアーカイブして失敗と報告。過去ZIPは削除しない。
% V32で直接元Flightの gen_ref_line および gen_ref_for_rigid_body を使用。これらが無ければ明示的に停止し、任意の生成波形に置き換えない。z軸の吊り荷基準は position order0 にのみ -L を適用。HLCに渡す4×7=28成分の yaw/各導関数も元ジェネレータ由来とし、従来の一律yaw=0にはしない。
% 比較：ORIGINAL_NOMINAL / ORIGINAL_R1_EXACT（元R1を周期ごと再評価） / ORIGINAL_POST_V1_T / ORIGINAL_V1_VALUE / ORIGINAL_V1_JET / C7_LANE_FAST / C7_LANE_SLOW、詳細版は10ケース。軌道の C7 横移動はS7積分多項式を用い7階まで各接続点で連続、元Flightの高階軌道に解析加算する。急/緩条件では回避軌道微分要求と推力・トルク限界を比較する。
% 物理モデル: opts.plant='R193_24' で V19のオリジナル24状態積分アダプタを使用（元Flight全スケジューラの完全再現ではない）、25ms毎にHLC/R1再評価、区間は元モデル4分割で積分。既存19状態モデルも明示選択可能。原プラント真値mL=.14kg、コントローラ推定初期値mhat=.01kgを混同しない。EKF現在値はユーザーによる時系列指定時のみ使用。
% 初期条件の注意：元Flightの離陸・遷移フェーズを診断コードが起動したという誤主張をしない。初期条件はデフォルトでは、元Flight名目の位置・速度・ヨーに対応する診断用定速状態。実Flightの同時刻の状態を持っている場合はopts.continuousInitialState19で明示的に供給できるが、参照時刻原点との一致も必要。
% 仮想整合：V1値のみとV1の0..4階解析修正を比較。V1_JETは追加修正分だけ解析的一致。元HLCのVfdは離散写像 powers 由来のため全体を完全な連続時間微分列と断言しない。後段の実推力修正とHLC経由の修正が同じ指令推力を持ってもトルクは異なり得る。飽和時はHLC対応関係を保った物理入力だと判定しない。
% 学術的限界：現行CBFはケーブル外接楕円体と楕円体障害物、R1推力のみ。R2や仮想4入力CBFが実装されたと主張しない。サンプル時刻のh>=0は連続時間不変性を保証しない。推力・トルク上限と張力は記録/停止する。実MATLAB実行なし、ソース静的監査とPythonによるS7解析値、引継ぎ全文一致だけ確認。
% 次はV32実測で元公称の入力飽和有無、後段修正の増幅、値のみ再逆変換と微分jet再逆変換の残差、滑らかな回避目標の変更速度による高階微分・飽和の差を比較し、CBFとの接続方式を決める。Reference Governor研究（Delansnay & Vande Wouwer 2023）や高階追従・CBFの知見は次段階の候補だが、吊り荷付き実3Dモデルへの適用条件は別途証明する。
% V33_FULL_V32_HANDOVER_END


% =========================================================================
% V42: CLOSED-LOOP FLIGHT SURVIVAL AUDIT. OBSERVATION, NOT CERTIFICATION.
% =========================================================================
function v42FlightSurvivalAudit(work,summary,opts,L)
% The previous nClipped COUNTS desired->applied changes AFTER the HLC
% baseline was already saturated. It can be ZERO even with raw HLC
% torque > 1 Nm. Log both phenomena separately.
files=dir(fullfile(work,'v40_trace_*.csv'));
fields={'caseID','scenarioStatus','lastLoggedTime_s','initialError_m',...
 'finalError_m','errorReduction_m','maxRawHlcThrust_N',...
 'maxRawHlcTorque_Nm','rawThrustOverflowMax_N',...
 'rawTorqueOverflowMax_Nm','nRawHlcOverLimit','firstRawHlcOverLimit_s',...
 'nDesiredInputClips','firstDesiredInputClip_s',...
 'minCableHIncludingSubsteps','firstSampledCableHNegative_s',...
 'minAppliedCableTension_N','firstNonpositiveTension_s',...
 'minLoadZ_m','minDroneZ_m','firstGroundCrossing_s',...
 'minBetaRcond','maxVsNorm','maxAlpha2Norm',...
 'sampledObstacleStatus','physicalFlightStatus',...
 'trackingRecoveryStatus','interpretation'};
rows=cell(0,numel(fields));
for j=1:numel(files)
  f=files(j);p=fullfile(work,f.name);T=readtable(p);
  if isempty(T),continue;end
  id=upper(f.name(numel('v40_trace_')+1:end-4));
  where=find(strcmpi(string(summary.caseID),id),1);
  if isempty(where),runStatus='NO_SUMMARY';else,runStatus=char(summary.status(where));end
  t=T.time_s(:);N=numel(t);
  rawOverT=max(T.rawThrustOverflow_N(:),0);
  rawOverTau=max(T.rawTorqueOverflow_Nm(:),0);
  rawOver=(rawOverT>1e-8)|(rawOverTau>1e-8);
  desiredClip=T.desiredToAppliedClipInf(:)>1e-8;
  h=T.minCableH(:);
  if ismember('minSubstepCableH',T.Properties.VariableNames)
      hs=T.minSubstepCableH(:);valid=isfinite(hs);
      h(valid)=min(h(valid),hs(valid));
  end
  cableUnsafe=isfinite(h)&h<0;
  tension=T.appliedTension_N(:);
  if ismember('minSubstepTensionN',T.Properties.VariableNames)
      ts=T.minSubstepTensionN(:);valid=isfinite(ts);
      tension(valid)=min(tension(valid),ts(valid));
  end
  noTension=isfinite(tension)&tension<=0;
  % Physical state convention from the R193 adapter: payload pL,
  % cable q=(pL-pD)/L; hence drone pD=pL-L*q.
  loadZ=T.loadZ_m(:);
  droneZ=loadZ-L*T.truePlantQz(:);
  ground=(isfinite(loadZ)&loadZ<=0)|(isfinite(droneZ)&droneZ<=0);
  sampledCable='NO_NEGATIVE_H_IN_RECORDED_SAMPLES';
  if any(cableUnsafe),sampledCable='SAMPLED_CABLE_OBSTACLE_VIOLATION';end
  physicalStatus='NO_SAMPLED_GROUND_OR_TENSION_LOSS';
  if any(ground),physicalStatus='SAMPLED_GROUND_CONTACT_OR_BELOW';end
  if any(noTension),physicalStatus='TAUT_CABLE_MODEL_INVALID_NONPOSITIVE_TENSION';end
  if ~strcmp(runStatus,'COMPLETED_DIAGNOSTIC_NOT_SAFETY_CERTIFIED')
      physicalStatus=['EARLY_STOP_' runStatus];
  elseif any(rawOver)
      physicalStatus='HLC_RAW_INPUT_EXCEEDS_ASSUMED_LIMIT';
  end
  initialError=T.posError_m(1);finalError=T.posError_m(end);
  if finalError<=.5
      recovery='WITHIN_0P5M_AT_END_ONLY';
  elseif finalError<initialError
      recovery='PARTIAL_RECOVERY_NOT_WITHIN_0P5M';
  else
      recovery='NO_TRACKING_RECOVERY_IN_LOG';
  end
  rows(end+1,:)={id,runStatus,t(end),initialError,finalError,...
     initialError-finalError,...
     v42FiniteMax(T.HLC_rawT_N(:)),...
     v42FiniteMax(T.HLC_rawTauInf_Nm(:)),...
     v42FiniteMax(rawOverT),v42FiniteMax(rawOverTau),...
     sum(rawOver),v42First(t,rawOver),...
     sum(desiredClip),v42First(t,desiredClip),...
     v42FiniteMin(h),v42First(t,cableUnsafe),...
     v42FiniteMin(tension),v42First(t,noTension),...
     v42FiniteMin(loadZ),v42FiniteMin(droneZ),...
     v42First(t,ground),v42FiniteMin(T.betaRcond(:)),...
     v42FiniteMax(T.VsNorm(:)),v42FiniteMax(T.alpha2Norm(:)),...
     sampledCable,physicalStatus,recovery,...
     '25ms ZOH + numerical substeps; no motor model, live EKF or ground CBF'}; %#ok<AGROW>
end
assert(size(rows,2)==numel(fields),'CBF:HLCV42AuditShape',...
 'V42 survival audit row length mismatch');
out=cell2table(rows,'VariableNames',fields);
writetable(out,fullfile(work,'V42_FLIGHT_SURVIVAL_AUDIT.csv'));
% Compare actual applied input vectors on a COMMON 25ms grid.
% Matching one scalar magnitude or the method name is insufficient.
pairFields={'baselineCase','testCase','nCommonSamples',...
 'maxAppliedThrustDifference_N','maxAppliedTorqueVectorDifference_Nm',...
 'maxFinalPositionDifference_m','samePhysicalInputToNumericalTolerance',...
 'comparisonNote'};
P=cell(0,numel(pairFields));
pairs={...
 'F_BASE_0_V40_EQUAL_POST','F_BASE_0_V40_EQUAL_VIRTUAL';...
 'F_PX_10_V40_EQUAL_POST','F_PX_10_V40_EQUAL_VIRTUAL';...
 'F_PY_10_V40_EQUAL_POST','F_PY_10_V40_EQUAL_VIRTUAL';...
 'F_PX_20_V40_EQUAL_POST','F_PX_20_V40_EQUAL_VIRTUAL';...
 'V19_V40_EQUAL_POST','V19_V40_EQUAL_VIRTUAL';...
 'V19_V37_NATIVE_ALL','V19_V37_POST_SAME_ALL'};
for k=1:size(pairs,1)
  id1=pairs{k,1};id2=pairs{k,2};
  a=fullfile(work,['v40_trace_' lower(id1) '.csv']);
  b=fullfile(work,['v40_trace_' lower(id2) '.csv']);
  if ~isfile(a)||~isfile(b),continue;end
  A=readtable(a);B=readtable(b);
  n=min(height(A),height(B));if n==0,continue;end
  if any(abs(A.time_s(1:n)-B.time_s(1:n))>1e-10),continue;end
  dT=max(abs(A.appliedT_N(1:n)-B.appliedT_N(1:n)));
  tor1=[A.appliedTauX_Nm(1:n),A.appliedTauY_Nm(1:n),A.appliedTauZ_Nm(1:n)];
  tor2=[B.appliedTauX_Nm(1:n),B.appliedTauY_Nm(1:n),B.appliedTauZ_Nm(1:n)];
  dTau=max(abs(tor1(:)-tor2(:)));
  dP=norm([A.loadX_m(n)-B.loadX_m(n);...
           A.loadY_m(n)-B.loadY_m(n);A.loadZ_m(n)-B.loadZ_m(n)]);
  same=dT<1e-9 && dTau<1e-9;
  P(end+1,:)={id1,id2,n,dT,dTau,dP,same,...
     'Only a physically identical 4-input history permits a pure representation-equivalence comparison'}; %#ok<AGROW>
end
assert(size(P,2)==numel(pairFields),'CBF:HLCV42PairShape');
writetable(cell2table(P,'VariableNames',pairFields),...
 fullfile(work,'V42_APPLIED_INPUT_PAIR_AUDIT.csv'));
textNote=sprintf([...
 'V42 JOINT FLIGHT SURVIVAL INTERPRETATION\n',...
 'HLC raw input beyond assumed actuator bounds is recorded separately from desired-to-applied clipping.\n',...
 'Physical flight events sampled: load altitude, inferred drone altitude, cable tension, geometry.\n',...
 'A cable h<0 is a sampled obstacle safety failure, even if Flight finished its time horizon.\n',...
 'No sampled ground contact/tension loss is NOT a theorem of continuous flight survival.\n',...
 'The R193 24-state adapter is not Flight takeoff/flight switching, actual EKF, or motor dynamics.\n',...
 'Failed HLC inverse for a particular safety-CBF thrust is a FEASIBILITY stop, not an actual crash.\n',...
 'INPUT ASSUMPTIONS: T in [0,20] N and each tau in [-1,1] Nm; not certified motor hardware.\n',...
 'Current audit contains %d non-empty physical traces of %d scheduled cases.\n'],...
 height(out),height(summary));
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V42_JOINT_SAFETY_INTERPRETATION.txt'),textNote);
end

function t0=v42First(times,mask)
idx=find(mask,1,'first');t0=NaN;
if ~isempty(idx),t0=times(idx);end
end
function value=v42FiniteMin(x)
x=x(isfinite(x));value=NaN;
if ~isempty(x),value=min(x);end
end
function value=v42FiniteMax(x)
x=x(isfinite(x));value=NaN;
if ~isempty(x),value=max(x);end
end

function v42WriteHandover(work,root,opts)
% Entire earlier history is retained in V41's embedded writer.
v41WriteHandover(work,root,opts);
p=fullfile(work,'CBF_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER_V41.txt');
if ~isfile(p),return;end
prior=fileread(p);
add=strjoin({... 
'============================================================';...
'V42 / 2026-11-17 : 飛行継続とCBF安全性を必ず同時判定';...
'============================================================';...
'V41の実行ZIP CBF_HLC_ROOTCAUSE_V41_20261117_143938_779.zip を読み取り、36条件中33件が診断終了、1件が張力<=0、1件がR1共有推力制約不可行、1件が仮想入力逆変換の rcond<=1e-13 / 非有限アサートで停止したことを確認。33件の終了は安全飛行の証明ではない。';...
'元の通常参照の基準F_BASE_0_NOMINALは紐楕円体h最小-0.052893で衝突安全に失敗。+10m x の名目生トルク最大1.1525Nm、+20mは2.3051Nm、+30mは3.4576Nmで想定上限1Nm超。以前のnClipped=0は生HLC入力に予め飽和をかけた後のdesired->appliedだけを数え、raw->baselineの飽和を数えないことがある。V42で両者を区別して集計する。';...
'V19_R1_EXACTはt=2.35sにR1制約不可行で停止、t=2.30sの生トルク135.229Nm。Cable hが正でも継続飛行に必要なHLCトルクとCBF要求を同時実現できるとは限らない。R1推力にv1(0)を逆算するV41_R1_MATCH_T_V1_ZEROで特異となった場合には新しい入力を適用せずSTOP_R1_MATCHED_VIRTUAL_INVERSE_UNREALIZABLEに変換して記録する。これは飛行墜落を実測したという意味ではない。';...
'V42は既存の元通常6階参照を変更しない。元のR193_24プラントの25ms連続状態伝搬と、別枠V19 19状態の実R1分岐を維持する。離陸・実EKF・モーター推力応答・LiDARの更新は試していない。推定荷重0.01kgはEKF初期値固定。';...
'V42_FLIGHT_SURVIVAL_AUDIT.csvで raw thrust/torque bounds, applied input clipping, first sampled h<0, first tension<=0, estimated drone height pDz=pLz-Lqz, load ground contact, maxVs, max alpha2, beta rcond, final tracking recoveryを個別出力。安全飛行認定ではない。V42_APPLIED_INPUT_PAIR_AUDIT.csvで物理4入力が本当に一致しているかを検算。';...
'今後のCBF成功基準：全時刻の適用4入力が物理可行、張力>0、紐楕円体h>=0、地上クリアランス正、HLC逆変換が成立、実状態が閉ループで追跡可能領域に留まり復帰できること。実機のintersample保証やEKF/motor不確かさは別途設計が必要。';...
'生HLC入力のクリップはCBF安全拘束を破り得る。次の研究ではHLCを安全入力の単なるnominalとして使い、CBF側で1周期以上の可行性と制御余裕を調べ、必要に応じて実行可能な参照ガバナ・安全バックアップ・回復可能集合を設計する。';...
'V42のMATLAB動作はユーザ実行前のため未検証。以前の累積引継ぎ全文はV41 writerにより保持し、上記のみ追記。'...
},newline);
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'CBF_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER_V42.txt'),...
 [prior newline newline add newline]);
delete(p);
end


% =========================================================================
% V43: HLC-NONCOLLAPSE ENVELOPE / SAME ORIGINAL 0..6 REFERENCE
% =========================================================================
function out=v43EnvelopeSuite(work,opts)
% Goal: identify which changes of physical and virtual inputs let the HLC
% remain in a dynamically realizable, tension-positive, nondegenerate
% closed-loop region over an entire horizon. NO CBF safety claim.
assert(strcmpi(opts.parameterSet,'R193'),'CBF:HLCV43Set','R193 only');
assert(abs(opts.dt-.025)<1e-12,'CBF:HLCV43Sampling','25 ms HLC sampling only');
assert(opts.v43Duration>0 && abs(round(opts.v43Duration/opts.dt)*opts.dt-opts.v43Duration)<1e-8,...
 'CBF:HLCV43Duration','Duration must be divisible by dt');
sc=v40OriginalReferenceScenario(opts);  % unchanged source R193 trajectory
s=sc.settings;
if strcmpi(opts.v43EnvelopeLevel,'quick')
    offsetNames={'BASE','PX_2','PX_10'};
    offsets={[0;0;0],[2;0;0],[10;0;0]};
    amps=[.25,1];rises=[.7,1.6];
    modes={'V37_POST_T','V37_NATIVE_V1','V37_NATIVE_ALL',...
           'V37_POST_INDEPENDENT'};
elseif strcmpi(opts.v43EnvelopeLevel,'full')
    offsetNames={'BASE','PX_2','NX_2','PY_2','PX_5','PX_10'};
    offsets={[0;0;0],[2;0;0],[-2;0;0],[0;2;0],[5;0;0],[10;0;0]};
    amps=[.25,.5,1];rises=[.7,1.6];
    modes={'V37_POST_T','V37_NATIVE_V1','V37_NATIVE_ALL',...
           'V37_POST_INDEPENDENT','V37_NATIVE_VS',...
           'V40_EQUAL_POST','V40_EQUAL_VIRTUAL'};
else
 error('CBF:HLCV43Profile','v43EnvelopeLevel must be quick or full');
end
names={'caseID','initialPositionOffset_m','mode','virtualV1Amplitude',...
 'rampRiseTime_s','status','lastTime_s','nSamples',...
 'maxHlcRawThrust_N','maxHlcRawTauInf_Nm',...
 'maxRawThrustOverflow_N','maxRawTorqueOverflow_Nm',...
 'nHlcRawLimitViolations','firstHlcRawLimitViolation_s',...
 'nRequestedInputClips','firstRequestedInputClip_s',...
 'minBeta2Rcond','minHlcThrustDenominatorAbs',...
 'maxVsNorm','maxAlpha2Norm',...
 'maxCableTilt_deg','maxCableOmega_radps',...
 'initialPositionError_m','finalPositionError_m','positionErrorReduction_m',...
 'minSampledCableH','firstCableHNegative_s',...
 'minAppliedCableTension_N','firstNonpositiveTension_s',...
 'minLoadZ_m','minDroneZ_m','firstGroundContact_s',...
 'maxPointwiseMapResidual','maxAppliedInputDifferenceFromHlcRaw',...
 'hlcOperatingClass','obstacleSafetyClass','interpretation'};
R=cell(0,numel(names));traceCount=0;
for k=1:numel(offsets)
 scLocal=sc;scLocal.x0(8:10)=scLocal.x0(8:10)+offsets{k};
 local=opts;local.plant='R193_24';local.v40StartTime=0;
 local.continuousDuration=opts.v43Duration;
 local.continuousV1Start=.6;local.continuousV1Hold=.4;
 local.continuousV1Fall=1.0;
 % One nominal baseline per exact initial physical state, not per wave.
 configs=cell(0,3);
 configs(end+1,:)={'NOMINAL',0,1.6};
 for m=1:numel(modes)
   for ia=1:numel(amps)
     for ir=1:numel(rises)
       configs(end+1,:)={modes{m},amps(ia),rises(ir)}; %#ok<AGROW>
     end
   end
 end
 for j=1:size(configs,1)
   mode=configs{j,1};A=configs{j,2};r=configs{j,3};
   local.continuousV1Amplitude=A;
   local.continuousV1Rise=r;
   % Normalize the torque intervention along with the v1 wave so the
   % amplitude is a single documented experiment intensity coordinate.
   local.continuousTorqueAmplitudeNm=.05*A;
   local.v37DeltaVs=A*[.15;.10;.05];
   id=sprintf('E_%s_%s_A%03d_R%03d',offsetNames{k},mode,...
              round(1000*A),round(100*r));
   fprintf('[HLC V43] %s\n',id);
   try
     [T,S]=v32RunContinuousOne(scLocal,mode,local);
     if opts.v43SaveTraces
        writetable(T,fullfile(work,['v43_trace_' lower(id) '.csv']));
     end
     traceCount=traceCount+1;
     if isempty(T)
         error('CBF:HLCV43EmptyTrace','No physical state samples recorded');
     end
     mrow=v43EnvelopeRow(id,norm(offsets{k}),mode,A,r,S,T,s.physical.cableLength);
     R(end+1,:)=mrow; %#ok<AGROW>
   catch ME
     errRow=cell(1,numel(names));errRow(:)={NaN};
     errRow(1:6)={id,norm(offsets{k}),mode,A,r,['MATLAB_ERROR_' ME.identifier]};
     errRow(end-2:end)={'MATLAB_RUNTIME_ERROR','UNKNOWN_NO_TRACE',ME.message};
     R(end+1,:)=errRow; %#ok<AGROW>
     v23WriteText(fullfile(work,['V43_ERROR_' id '.txt']),...
       getReport(ME,'extended','hyperlinks','off'));
   end
 end
end
assert(size(R,2)==numel(names),'CBF:HLCV43Shape','Envelope row mismatch');
resultTable=cell2table(R,'VariableNames',names);
writetable(resultTable,fullfile(work,'V43_HLC_NONCOLLAPSE_ENVELOPE.csv'));
status=string(resultTable.status);
out=struct('nCases',height(resultTable),...
 'nFailedCases',sum(status~='COMPLETED_DIAGNOSTIC_NOT_SAFETY_CERTIFIED'),...
 'nRuntimeErrors',sum(startsWith(status,'MATLAB_ERROR_')),...
 'nR1FilterStops',sum(startsWith(status,'R1_FILTER_STOP_')));
note=sprintf([...
 'HLC V43: NONCOLLAPSE ENVELOPE, NOT A SAFETY FILTER.\n',...
 'Original R193 gen_ref_line + rigid-body 0..6 jet UNCHANGED.\n',...
 'Every case is a CLOSED-LOOP nonlinear 24-state integration from one of the named initial physical states.\n',...
 'HLC commands and plant states are recomputed every %.6g seconds.\n',...
 'Recorded cases: %d; traces saved: %d; level=%s.\n',...
 'A: v1 smooth-wave nominal intensity; torque direct adjustment .05*A Nm; Vs additional offset scales with A.\n',...
 'Modes are NOT the same input vectors. Compare applied waveforms before inferring a virtual-vs-post advantage.\n',...
 'nRequestedInputClips differs from nHlcRawLimitViolations; former omits initial raw-HLC saturation.\n',...
 'HLC operating classification requires NO raw HLC bounds violations, NO requested input clipping,\n',...
 'NO loss of cable tension, NO ground intersection, completed horizon and nondegenerate map.\n',...
 'This strict HLC class is diagnostic and MAY be conservative; raw-HLC saturation is not synonymous with a crash.\n',...
 'The separate sampled obstacle h classification is NOT a formal forward-invariance certificate.\n',...
 'Assumed limits: T in [0,20]N, each torque in [-1,1]Nm; not validated against actual motors.\n',...
 '24-state R193 simulation adapter, initial fixed load estimate not live EKF; no Flight takeoff/mode transitions.\n'],...
 opts.dt,height(resultTable),traceCount,char(opts.v43EnvelopeLevel));
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V43_ENVELOPE_PROTOCOL.txt'),note);
end

function r=v43EnvelopeRow(id,offset,mode,amp,rise,S,T,L)
t=T.time_s(:);n=height(T);
rawT=T.rawThrustOverflow_N(:);rawTau=T.rawTorqueOverflow_Nm(:);
rawLimit=(rawT>1e-9)|(rawTau>1e-9);
reqClip=T.desiredToAppliedClipInf(:)>1e-9;
h=T.minCableH(:);
if ismember('minSubstepCableH',T.Properties.VariableNames)
  sH=T.minSubstepCableH(:);
  h(isfinite(sH))=min(h(isfinite(sH)),sH(isfinite(sH)));
end
hb=isfinite(h)&h<0;
tension=T.appliedTension_N(:);
if ismember('minSubstepTensionN',T.Properties.VariableNames)
  sT=T.minSubstepTensionN(:);
  tension(isfinite(sT))=min(tension(isfinite(sT)),sT(isfinite(sT)));
end
lostT=isfinite(tension)&tension<=0;
loadZ=T.loadZ_m(:);
droneZ=loadZ-L*T.truePlantQz(:);
ground=(loadZ<=0)|(droneZ<=0);
rawThrust=v43FiniteMax(T.HLC_rawT_N(:));
rawTorque=v43FiniteMax(T.HLC_rawTauInf_Nm(:));
beta=v43FiniteMin(T.betaRcond(:));
den=v43FiniteMin(abs(T.HLCdenominator(:)));
err0=T.posError_m(1);errEnd=T.posError_m(end);
% Note: the last sample represents the terminal state when the run completes.
completed=strcmp(S.status,'COMPLETED_DIAGNOSTIC_NOT_SAFETY_CERTIFIED') &&...
 abs(t(end)-t(1)-round((t(end)-t(1))/.025)*.025)<1e-7;
% This is an empirical operating screen, NOT a stability theorem.
if ~completed
  opClass='NONCOMPLETED_OR_EARLY_STOP';
elseif any(lostT)||any(ground)||beta<1e-13||den<1e-6
  opClass='PLANT_TENSION_GROUND_OR_HLC_DOMAIN_FAIL';
elseif any(rawLimit)
  opClass='HLC_RAW_COMMAND_OUTSIDE_ASSUMED_LIMITS';
elseif any(reqClip)
  opClass='PROPOSED_INPUT_REQUIRED_CLIPPING';
elseif errEnd>err0+0.25
  opClass='TRACKING_ERROR_NOT_RECOVERING';
else
  opClass='HLC_PHYSICALLY_FEASIBLE_OVER_RECORDED_HORIZON';
end
if any(hb)
  obs='RECORDED_OBSTACLE_CONSTRAINT_VIOLATED';
else
  obs='NO_RECORDED_OBSTACLE_VIOLATION_NOT_PROVEN_SAFE';
end
r={id,offset,mode,amp,rise,S.status,t(end),n,rawThrust,rawTorque,...
 v43FiniteMax(rawT),v43FiniteMax(rawTau),sum(rawLimit),v43First(t,rawLimit),...
 sum(reqClip),v43First(t,reqClip),beta,den,...
 v43FiniteMax(T.VsNorm(:)),v43FiniteMax(T.alpha2Norm(:)),...
 v43FiniteMax(acos(max(-1,min(1,-T.truePlantQz(:))))*180/pi),...
 v43FiniteMax(T.cableOmegaNorm(:)),...
 err0,errEnd,err0-errEnd,v43FiniteMin(h),v43First(t,hb),...
 v43FiniteMin(tension),v43First(t,lostT),...
 v43FiniteMin(loadZ),v43FiniteMin(droneZ),v43First(t,ground),...
 v43FiniteMax(T.physicalVirtualMapResidual(:)),...
 v43FiniteMax(T.rawToAppliedClipInf(:)),...
 opClass,obs,...
 'Diagnostic only: no actuator dynamics/live EKF/intersample safety proof'};
end

function a=v43First(t,mask)
k=find(mask,1,'first');a=NaN;if ~isempty(k),a=t(k);end
end
function a=v43FiniteMax(x)
x=x(isfinite(x));a=NaN;if ~isempty(x),a=max(x);end
end
function a=v43FiniteMin(x)
x=x(isfinite(x));a=NaN;if ~isempty(x),a=min(x);end
end

function v43WriteHandover(work,root,opts)
v42WriteHandover(work,root,opts);
p=fullfile(work,'CBF_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER_V42.txt');
if ~isfile(p)
  error('CBF:HLCV43History','V42 history was not saved');
end
prior=fileread(p);
add=strjoin({... 
 '============================================================';...
 'V43追記：CBF後のHLCを壊さないための閉ループ運用領域判定';...
 '============================================================';...
 'ユーザの研究目的はCBF条件単体でなく、実際に修正した推力・トルクの結果、元HLCが飽和・脱調・姿勢崩壊せず、飛行と障害物回避を両立できる条件を発見すること。入力修正の正しい仮想表現だけでは足りず、将来のHLC応答と物理可行性を同時判定。';...
 'V41ユーザZIPは36条件（35計測時系列＋1件MATLABエラー）。33件は時間末まで計算、1件張力<=0、1件R1不可行、1件R1推力からv1第0列の逆算時に非有限または悪条件のためエラー。V42は逆変換不可時を停止理由に変更し、以降の入力を偽装しない。';...
 'R193通常6階軌道で初期+10m x偏差は名目生トルク最大1.1525Nm、+20mは2.3051Nm、+30mは3.4576Nmで、各軸±1Nmのシミュレーション上限超過。これは直ちに墜落の実証ではない。3秒で追従誤差はそれぞれ3.9006m/7.9164m/12.0376mまで減少。従来nClipped=0でも、raw HLCを既に飽和してから desired->applied を集計していたため、元HLCの飽和は別計数必須。';...
 'V19実R1は2.300sにHLC生トルク135.229Nm、2.35sにR1共有推力制約不可行。滑らかな診断波形の後段推力修正は11.041Nm、仮想v1修正は3.7723Nmだが物理上限1Nmを超え、しかも実R1と同じ物理入力波形ではないため方式の優劣の証明ではない。';...
 'V43_HLC_NONCOLLAPSE_ENVELOPE.csv は通常6階軌道を固定し、現物理状態BASE,+2m,+5m,+10m（fullでは-2mや+y2m追加）から4秒間の25ms閉ループを走らせる。推力修正/対応するv1高階列とVsの再計算/4仮想入力/独立後段トルク/同程度のトルクノルムを、振幅・立上り時間ごと比較する。quick/full切替。';...
 'V43では元HLC生指令の制限超過と、追加希望入力のクリップを分離し、張力・荷高度・機体高度・幾何h・beta2 rcond・推力分母・追従誤差の回復を別々に集計する。実入力が常に上下限内に飽和されても、生HLCの要求が不可能ならHLC逆変換と実運動は一致しない。';...
 'この実験で分かるのはモデル・特定シナリオ内の経験的な HLC operating envelope であり、特定値を一般の安全修正上限やCBF前方不変性の厳密保証と主張しない。CBF方式と正規化して公正比較するには同じ状態と目標、同じ障害物、安全条件、可能なら4D実入力時系列の一致度を別途監査する。';...
 '元通常6階軌道は全試験で変更なし。R193_24アダプタは実Flightモード遷移やlive EKF、モーター応答ではない。質量推定は指定値または初期0.01kg固定。想定入力限界T[0,20]N tau各軸±1Nmは実機値の確認が必要。';...
 'V43は静的点検段階でユーザ側MATLAB未実行。過去累積本文はv42 writerを通して保持し、V43追記を行う。'...
 },newline);
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'CBF_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER_V43.txt'),...
  [prior newline newline add newline]);
delete(p);
end


% =========================================================================
% V44 CAUSAL MECHANISM STUDY. The normal R193 six-derivative trajectory is
% never rewritten. There are two diagnostic initial states (nominal and
% explicitly perturbed) and a separately labelled historical V19 replay.
% The purpose is to find WHY the HLC demand amplifies, NOT a torque cutoff.
% =========================================================================
function out=v44CausalitySuite(work,opts)
assert(strcmpi(opts.parameterSet,'R193') && abs(opts.dt-.025)<1e-10,...
 'CBF:HLCV44Conditions','V44 isolates causes only on R193 at dt=25 ms');
assert(exist('gen_ref_line','file')==2 && exist('gen_ref_for_rigid_body','file')==2,...
 'CBF:HLCV44SourceReference','Original Flight reference sources required');
sc=v40OriginalReferenceScenario(opts);
scTilt=sc;theta=5*pi/180;phi=2*pi/180;
scTilt.x0(14:16)=[0;sin(theta);-cos(theta)];
scTilt.x0(17:19)=[0;.08*cos(theta);.08*sin(theta)];
scTilt.x0(1:4)=[cos(phi/2);sin(phi/2);0;0];
scTilt.x0(11)=scTilt.x0(11)+.05;
sc19=CBF_V19_Scenarios('straight_single','R193');sc19.dt=opts.dt;
[x19,why]=v40GetV19PreInterventionState(sc19,opts,2.125);
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V44_V19_BRANCH_PROVENANCE.txt'),why);
if any(~isfinite(x19))
 error('CBF:HLCV44V19State','Exact pre-R1 V19 state cannot be regenerated; do not substitute nominal');
end
sc19.x0=x19;
sets={ 'NORMAL_R193',sc,0,3.0,'R193_24';...
       'TILTED_R193',scTilt,0,3.0,'R193_24';...
       'V19_PRECBF',sc19,2.125,.725,'V11_19' };
baseModes={'NOMINAL','POST_T_STEP','POST_T_SMOOTH','NATIVE_V1_SMOOTH',...
 'POST_ROLL_STEP','POST_ROLL_SMOOTH',...
 'POST_PITCH_STEP','POST_PITCH_SMOOTH',...
 'POST_YAW_STEP','POST_YAW_SMOOTH',...
 'PITCH_VS_EXACT_SAME_TORQUE','JOINT_POST_SMOOTH','JOINT_NATIVE_SMOOTH'};
shortModes={'NOMINAL','POST_T_STEP','POST_T_SMOOTH','NATIVE_V1_SMOOTH',...
            'POST_PITCH_STEP','POST_PITCH_SMOOTH'};
summaryCols={'cohort','mode','status','firstIntervention_s',...
 'lastTime_s','peakRawTorque_Nm','peakRawTorqueTime_s',...
 'peakVsDependentTorque_Nm','peakVsIndependentTorque_Nm',...
 'peakVsNorm','peakAlphaNorm','worstBetaRcond',...
 'minThrustDenominatorAbs','peakPositionError_m',...
 'peakUnclippedThrust_N','peakHlcRawClip_NmOrN',...
 'peakAppliedCorrectionInf','peakPostThrustTorqueCouplingMismatch_Nm',...
 'minTension_N','minCableH',...
 'firstRawTorqueExceeds1Nm_s','firstRawTorqueExceeds10Nm_s',...
 'peakOneStepTorqueChange_Nm','nSamples'};
R=cell(0,numel(summaryCols));nerr=0;nStop=0;
for z=1:size(sets,1)
 cohort=sets{z,1};ss=sets{z,2};t0=sets{z,3};D=sets{z,4};plant=sets{z,5};
 if z==1,modes=shortModes;else,modes=baseModes;end
 if z==3,modes=[modes,{'R1_EXACT'}];end
 for i=1:numel(modes)
    mode=modes{i};fprintf('[HLC V44] %s / %s\n',cohort,mode);
    local=opts;local.plant=plant;
    try
      [tr,branches,ssum]=v44RunMechanism(ss,t0,D,mode,local);
      if opts.v44SaveTraces
        writetable(tr,fullfile(work,['V44_TRACE_' lower(cohort) '_' lower(mode) '.csv']));
        if ~isempty(branches)
          writetable(branches,fullfile(work,['V44_ONE_STEP_' lower(cohort) '_' lower(mode) '.csv']));
        end
        if height(tr)>1
            tt=tr.time_s;
            vf0=tr.v1Base;vf1=tr.v1Derivative1Base;
            target0=tr.v1Target;target1=tr.v1Derivative1Target;
            dtime=diff(tt);
            check=table(tt(1:end-1),dtime,diff(vf0)./dtime,...
                .5*(vf1(1:end-1)+vf1(2:end)),...
                diff(target0)./dtime,...
                .5*(target1(1:end-1)+target1(2:end)),...
                'VariableNames',{'time_s','dt_s','actualSlopeNativeV1_0',...
                'claimedNativeV1_D1Average','actualSlopeTargetV1_0',...
                'claimedTargetV1_D1Average'});
            check.nativeMismatch=check.actualSlopeNativeV1_0-...
                check.claimedNativeV1_D1Average;
            check.targetMismatch=check.actualSlopeTargetV1_0-...
                check.claimedTargetV1_D1Average;
            writetable(check,fullfile(work,['V44_V1_TIME_RELATION_' ...
                lower(cohort) '_' lower(mode) '.csv']));
        end
      end
      rr={cohort,mode,ssum.status,ssum.firstIntervention,...
        ssum.tEnd,ssum.peakRawTau,ssum.tPeakRawTau,...
        ssum.peakVsTau,ssum.peakNoVsTau,ssum.peakVs,...
        ssum.peakAlpha,ssum.worstRcond,ssum.minDen,...
        ssum.peakPosErr,ssum.peakRawThrust,ssum.peakHlcClip,...
        ssum.peakAppliedCorrection,ssum.peakCoordTauMismatch,...
        ssum.minTension,ssum.minH,...
        ssum.first1,ssum.first10,ssum.peakOneStepChange,height(tr)};
      R(end+1,:)=rr; %#ok<AGROW>
      if ~strcmp(ssum.status,'COMPLETED_DIAGNOSTIC'),nStop=nStop+1;end
    catch ME
      nerr=nerr+1;
      rr=cell(1,numel(summaryCols));rr(:)={NaN};
      rr(1:3)={cohort,mode,['MATLAB_ERROR_' ME.identifier]};
      R(end+1,:)=rr; %#ok<AGROW>
      v23WriteText(fullfile(work,['V44_ERROR_' cohort '_' mode '.txt']),...
        getReport(ME,'extended','hyperlinks','off'));
    end
 end
end
assert(size(R,2)==numel(summaryCols),'CBF:HLCV44SummaryShape','summary shape mismatch');
writetable(cell2table(R,'VariableNames',summaryCols),...
 fullfile(work,'V44_CAUSAL_MECHANISM_SUMMARY.csv'));
out=struct('nCases',size(R,1),'nFailedCases',nerr+nStop,...
 'nRuntimeErrors',nerr,'nR1FilterStops',sum(startsWith(string(R(:,3)),...
 'R1_FILTER_STOP_')));
info={...
 'V44 isolates causal mechanisms, not allowable torque saturation thresholds.';...
 'NORMAL_R193: ORIGINAL six-jet Flight straight reference, actual 24-state step adapter, initial nominal state.';...
 'TILTED_R193: SAME original six-jet target, but explicit physical initial tilt 5deg, roll 2deg, cable omega .08rad/s, vx .05m/s.';...
 'V19_PRECBF: exact V19 original straight_single reference (DIFFERENT FROM R193 Flight reference) from R1 replay at t=2.125s; original V11 19-state dynamics.';...
 'Physical inputs at 25ms are ZERO-ORDER HELD. Smooth command envelopes cannot remove the inherent sample-to-sample ZOH change.';...
 'Step and smooth bumps match peak nominal v1 amplitude but NOT integrated impulse/energy; a difference is a waveform effect, NOT definitive proof that mathematical discontinuity alone caused it.';...
 'POST_T_SMOOTH and NATIVE_V1_SMOOTH have the SAME specified instantaneous thrust change at SAME STATE, but may diverge as physical states differ over time.';...
 'NATIVE_V1_SMOOTH changes v1 orders0..5 from one C6 analytic bump and recomputes Vs, Uf, Beta2, V2_alpha2 at each time.';...
 'Original Vfd outputs are NOT proven physical time derivatives along intervened closed loop; only incremental v1 analytic bump is derivative coherent.';...
 'PITCH_VS_EXACT_SAME_TORQUE reconstructs EXACTLY the physical torque of POST_PITCH_SMOOTH by solving the local Vs-to-torque Jacobian; same physical input MUST yield same state.';...
 'JOINT_POST and JOINT_NATIVE have NOT IDENTICAL applied torque vectors; comparison must inspect their four physical input time series, not infer virtual superiority.';...
 'One-step counterfactual comparisons hold the SAME physical x,t,mass,reference. They separate thrust-only, torque-only and simultaneous input effects on NEXT HLC requirement.';...
 'Vs-dependent torque decomposition removes Vs algebraically in alpha2 at SAME state. It is NOT a realizable alternative feedback loop.';...
 'No crash criterion is imposed based on 1Nm or 10Nm: these are only event timestamps for historical spike visualization.';...
 'A large raw torque number alone does NOT necessarily increase the cost of a fixed-size Beta2\alpha2 solve; optimization ill-scaling, infeasibility, saturation-induced tracking competition and loss of numerical conditioning must be evaluated separately.';...
 'HLC raw input clipping and additional applied correction clipping must not be conflated. R1 infeasible is different from a numerical failure.';...
 'CBF h/tension and physical feasibility are diagnostic checks, not formal obstacle/ground safety proof.';...
 'R193 test excludes Flight takeoff, live EKF and motor dynamics. 0.01kg fixed estimate must not be called true mass/current EKF.'};
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V44_CAUSAL_PROTOCOL.txt'),strjoin(info,newline));
end

function [T,B,S]=v44RunMechanism(sc,t0,D,mode,opts)
H=v23MakeHLC(sc.settings,opts.dt);x=sc.x0(:);s=sc.settings;
lo=[s.input.thrustMin;s.input.torqueMin(:)];
hi=[s.input.thrustMax;s.input.torqueMax(:)];
N=round(D/opts.dt);assert(abs(N*opts.dt-D)<1e-10,...
 'CBF:HLCV44Duration','Duration must be multiple of 25ms');
c={'time_s','rawT_N','rawTauX_Nm','rawTauY_Nm','rawTauZ_Nm',...
 'requestedT_N','requestedTauX_Nm','requestedTauY_Nm','requestedTauZ_Nm',...
 'appliedT_N','appliedTauX_Nm','appliedTauY_Nm','appliedTauZ_Nm',...
 'deltaAppliedT_N','deltaAppliedTauX_Nm','deltaAppliedTauY_Nm','deltaAppliedTauZ_Nm',...
 'v1Base','v1Target','v1Derivative1Base','v1Derivative1Target',...
 'v2Base','v3Base','v4Base','v2Target','v3Target','v4Target',...
 'vsNorm','alphaNorm','tauFromVsInf_Nm','tauFromNoVsInf_Nm',...
 'betaRcond','absThrustDenominator','positionError_m',...
 'cableAngle_deg','cableOmega_radps','cableH','tension_N',...
 'originalRawHlcClipInf','requestedClipInf',...
 'instantVirtualTorqueResidual','normalHlcDemandTauInf',...
 'originalHlcVs0_AuditResidual',...
 'postThrustImpliedV1_0','postThrustCoupledTorqueMismatch_Nm'};
tr=cell(N+1,numel(c));nb=0;
bc={'time_s','deltaT_N','deltaTauX_Nm','deltaTauY_Nm','deltaTauZ_Nm',...
 'nextDemandTauBase_Nm','nextDemandTauThrustOnly_Nm',...
 'nextDemandTauTorqueOnly_Nm','nextDemandTauCombined_Nm',...
 'nextVsBase','nextVsThrustOnly','nextVsTorqueOnly','nextVsCombined',...
 'nextAlphaBase','nextAlphaThrustOnly','nextAlphaTorqueOnly','nextAlphaCombined',...
 'thrustEffectTau_Nm','torqueEffectTau_Nm','interactionTau_Nm',...
 'combinedMinusBaseTau_Nm','nextPositionDiff_m'};
br=cell(N+1,numel(bc));nr=0;
S=struct('status','COMPLETED_DIAGNOSTIC','tEnd',t0,...
 'firstIntervention',NaN,'peakRawTau',0,'tPeakRawTau',NaN,...
 'peakVsTau',0,'peakNoVsTau',0,'peakVs',0,'peakAlpha',0,...
 'worstRcond',Inf,'minDen',Inf,'peakPosErr',0,'peakRawThrust',0,...
 'peakHlcClip',0,'peakAppliedCorrection',0,...
 'peakCoordTauMismatch',0,'minTension',Inf,...
 'minH',Inf,'first1',NaN,'first10',NaN,'peakOneStepChange',0);
start=t0+(.6*(t0==0)+.025*(t0>0));
rise=.15;hold=.20;fall=.15;
for k=0:N
 t=t0+k*opts.dt;
 try
    a=v23HLC(x,t,sc,H,v23EstimatedMass(opts,t));
 catch ME
    S.status=['STOP_HLC_CALC_' ME.identifier];S.tEnd=t;break;
 end
 if any(~isfinite([a.raw;a.alphaNorm;a.vsNorm])) || ...
    a.betaRcond<1e-14
    S.status='STOP_HLC_NONFINITE_OR_ILL_CONDITIONED';S.tEnd=t;break;
 end
 base=max(lo,min(hi,a.raw));requested=a.raw;
 targetVf=a.vfRaw(:).';targetVs=a.vsRaw(:);
 v1Wave=zeros(1,6);dTau=zeros(3,1);
 wave=v44C6BumpJet(t,start,rise,hold,fall,0);
 stepWave=double(t>=start && t<start+rise+hold+fall);
 v1Wave(1:6)=opts.v44AmplitudeV1*arrayfun(...
    @(j)v44C6BumpJet(t,start,rise,hold,fall,j),0:5);
 % The original Uf map is affine in v1(0) at fixed x,reference,mass.
 vp=a.vfRaw(:).';vp(1)=vp(1)+1;
 probe=H.obj.Uf_SuspendedLoadxyDst(x,a.XD,vp,a.HLCparam);
 g=probe(1)-a.raw(1);
 if ~isfinite(g) || abs(g)<1e-12
    S.status='STOP_THRUST_V1_MAP_DEGENERATE';S.tEnd=t;break;
 end
 tauAmp=opts.v44TorqueAmplitudeNm;
 v1Amp=opts.v44AmplitudeV1;
 if strcmp(mode,'R1_EXACT')
    [uR1,msg]=v25R1ExactFilter(x,s,sc.obstacles,base);
    if ~strcmp(msg,'OK')
        S.status=['R1_FILTER_STOP_' msg];S.tEnd=t;break;
    end
    requested=uR1;
 elseif startsWith(mode,'POST_T_')
    if strcmp(mode,'POST_T_STEP'),sig=stepWave;else,sig=wave;end
    requested(1)=a.raw(1)+g*v1Amp*sig;
 elseif strcmp(mode,'NATIVE_V1_SMOOTH') || strcmp(mode,'JOINT_NATIVE_SMOOTH')
    targetVf(1:6)=targetVf(1:6)+v1Wave;
    [phys,vs,~,beta]=v30VirtualMap(H,x,a,targetVf);
    targetVs=vs(:);
    if strcmp(mode,'JOINT_NATIVE_SMOOTH')
        targetVs=targetVs+([.15;.10;.05]*wave);
        alpha=H.obj.V2_alpha2_SuspendedLoadxyDst(...
            x,a.XD,targetVf,targetVs,a.HLCparam);
        requested=[phys(1);beta\alpha(:)];
    else
        requested=phys;
    end
 elseif startsWith(mode,'POST_ROLL_') || ...
        startsWith(mode,'POST_PITCH_') || startsWith(mode,'POST_YAW_')
    if endsWith(mode,'_STEP'),sig=stepWave;else,sig=wave;end
    if contains(mode,'ROLL'),ax=1;
    elseif contains(mode,'PITCH'),ax=2;else,ax=3;end
    dTau(ax)=tauAmp*sig;requested(2:4)=a.tau+dTau;
 elseif strcmp(mode,'PITCH_VS_EXACT_SAME_TORQUE')
    dTau(2)=tauAmp*wave;
    % Affine local virtual torque authority; map physical post-input exactly.
    J=zeros(3,3);
    for j=1:3
       vsUnit=a.vsRaw(:);vsUnit(j)=vsUnit(j)+1;
       al=H.obj.V2_alpha2_SuspendedLoadxyDst(...
                   x,a.XD,a.vfRaw,vsUnit,a.HLCparam);
       J(:,j)=a.beta\(al(:)-a.alpha(:));
    end
    if rcond(J)<1e-12
        S.status='STOP_VS_TORQUE_MAP_RANK';S.tEnd=t;break;
    end
    targetVs=a.vsRaw(:)+J\dTau;
    al=H.obj.V2_alpha2_SuspendedLoadxyDst(...
        x,a.XD,a.vfRaw,targetVs,a.HLCparam);
    requested(2:4)=a.beta\al(:);
    if norm(requested(2:4)-(a.tau+dTau),Inf)>1e-8
        error('CBF:HLCV44TorqueIdentity','Vs inverse not algebraically equivalent');
    end
 elseif strcmp(mode,'JOINT_POST_SMOOTH')
    requested(1)=a.raw(1)+g*v1Amp*wave;
    requested(2:4)=a.tau+[0;tauAmp*wave;0];
 elseif ~strcmp(mode,'NOMINAL')
    error('CBF:HLCV44Mode','Unrecognized causal mode: %s',mode);
 end
 % Diagnostic only: which v1(0) would explain the REQUESTED thrust?
 % Hold all OTHER native v1 derivatives as-is, recompute native Vs and
 % torque.  The residual measures the missing coordination for post-HLC
 % thrust changes; it does not test a legitimate full-jet virtual input.
 inferredV1=a.vfRaw(1)+(requested(1)-a.raw(1))/g;
 pointwiseTauMismatch=NaN;
 try
    vfPoint=a.vfRaw(:).';vfPoint(1)=inferredV1;
    [referenceU,~,~,~]=v30VirtualMap(H,x,a,vfPoint);
    pointwiseTauMismatch=norm(referenceU(2:4)-requested(2:4),Inf);
 catch
    % Lack of invertibility is logged via NaN and other map monitors;
    % NEVER substitute referenceU as applied input.
 end
 u=max(lo,min(hi,requested));
 if norm(u-base,Inf)>1e-9 && isnan(S.firstIntervention),S.firstIntervention=t;end
 try
     a0=H.obj.V2_alpha2_SuspendedLoadxyDst(x,a.XD,...
          a.vfRaw,zeros(3,1),a.HLCparam);
     tauVs=norm(a.beta\(a.alpha(:)-a0(:)),Inf);
     tauNoVs=norm(a.beta\a0(:),Inf);
 catch
     tauVs=NaN;tauNoVs=NaN;
 end
 h=v23CableSafety(x,sc);ten=v23Tension(x,s,u(1));
 res=NaN;identityResidual=NaN;
 if strcmp(mode,'NATIVE_V1_SMOOTH') || ...
      strcmp(mode,'JOINT_NATIVE_SMOOTH') ||...
      strcmp(mode,'PITCH_VS_EXACT_SAME_TORQUE')
    bet=H.obj.Beta2_SuspendedLoadxyDst(x,a.XD,targetVf,a.HLCparam);
    al=H.obj.V2_alpha2_SuspendedLoadxyDst(...
        x,a.XD,targetVf,targetVs,a.HLCparam);
    res=norm(bet*requested(2:4)-al(:));
 end
 if strcmp(mode,'PITCH_VS_EXACT_SAME_TORQUE')
    identityResidual=norm(requested(2:4)-(a.tau+dTau),Inf);
 end
 nb=nb+1;
 vals={t,a.raw(1),a.tau(1),a.tau(2),a.tau(3),...
 requested(1),requested(2),requested(3),requested(4),...
 u(1),u(2),u(3),u(4),...
 u(1)-base(1),u(2)-base(2),u(3)-base(3),u(4)-base(4),...
 a.vfRaw(1),targetVf(1),a.vfRaw(2),targetVf(2),...
 a.vsRaw(1),a.vsRaw(2),a.vsRaw(3),...
 targetVs(1),targetVs(2),targetVs(3),...
 a.vsNorm,a.alphaNorm,tauVs,tauNoVs,a.betaRcond,...
 abs(a.thrustDenominator),a.posErr,a.cableTilt*180/pi,...
 a.cableOmega,h,ten,norm(a.raw-base,Inf),...
 norm(requested-u,Inf),res,a.rawTorqueInf,identityResidual,...
 inferredV1,pointwiseTauMismatch};
 assert(numel(vals)==numel(c),'CBF:HLCV44TraceShape',...
  'V44 causal trace value count %d header count %d',numel(vals),numel(c));
 tr(nb,:)=vals;
 S.peakRawThrust=max(S.peakRawThrust,abs(a.raw(1)));
 if a.rawTorqueInf>S.peakRawTau
   S.peakRawTau=a.rawTorqueInf;S.tPeakRawTau=t;
 end
 S.peakVsTau=max(S.peakVsTau,tauVs);
 S.peakNoVsTau=max(S.peakNoVsTau,tauNoVs);
 S.peakVs=max(S.peakVs,a.vsNorm);S.peakAlpha=max(S.peakAlpha,a.alphaNorm);
 S.worstRcond=min(S.worstRcond,a.betaRcond);
 S.minDen=min(S.minDen,abs(a.thrustDenominator));
 S.peakPosErr=max(S.peakPosErr,a.posErr);
 S.peakHlcClip=max(S.peakHlcClip,norm(a.raw-base,Inf));
 S.peakAppliedCorrection=max(S.peakAppliedCorrection,norm(u-base,Inf));
 if isfinite(pointwiseTauMismatch)
   S.peakCoordTauMismatch=max(S.peakCoordTauMismatch,pointwiseTauMismatch);
 end
 S.minTension=min(S.minTension,ten);S.minH=min(S.minH,h);
 if isnan(S.first1) && a.rawTorqueInf>1,S.first1=t;end
 if isnan(S.first10) && a.rawTorqueInf>10,S.first10=t;end
 S.tEnd=t;
 if k==N,break;end
 if ten<=0
    S.status='STOP_TENSION_NONPOSITIVE';break;
 end
 if abs(a.thrustDenominator)<opts.mappingDenominatorGuard
    S.status='STOP_THRUST_MAP_DOMAIN';break;
 end
 % Small numerical causal experiment at selected intervention ticks. It
 % measures NEXT HLC commands from four physical-input counterfactuals.
 % Never confuse this single-step comparison with long-horizon stability.
 if (mod(k,4)==0 || abs(t-start)<1e-10 || ...
      (t0>0 && t>=start && t<=start+.175+1e-10)) && ...
    (t>=start-opts.dt) &&...
    (norm(u-base,Inf)>1e-9 || a.rawTorqueInf>1)
    try
      xb=v25StepOnce(x,base,s,opts);
      xt=v25StepOnce(x,[u(1);base(2:4)],s,opts);
      xq=v25StepOnce(x,[base(1);u(2:4)],s,opts);
      xf=v25StepOnce(x,u,s,opts);
      ab=v23HLC(xb,t+opts.dt,sc,H,v23EstimatedMass(opts,t+opts.dt));
      at=v23HLC(xt,t+opts.dt,sc,H,v23EstimatedMass(opts,t+opts.dt));
      aq=v23HLC(xq,t+opts.dt,sc,H,v23EstimatedMass(opts,t+opts.dt));
      af=v23HLC(xf,t+opts.dt,sc,H,v23EstimatedMass(opts,t+opts.dt));
      dtEffect=norm(at.tau-ab.tau,Inf);
      tqEffect=norm(aq.tau-ab.tau,Inf);
      interaction=norm(af.tau-at.tau-aq.tau+ab.tau,Inf);
      overall=norm(af.tau-ab.tau,Inf);
      nr=nr+1;
      branchVals={t,u(1)-base(1),u(2)-base(2),u(3)-base(3),u(4)-base(4),...
       norm(ab.tau,Inf),norm(at.tau,Inf),norm(aq.tau,Inf),norm(af.tau,Inf),...
       ab.vsNorm,at.vsNorm,aq.vsNorm,af.vsNorm,...
       ab.alphaNorm,at.alphaNorm,aq.alphaNorm,af.alphaNorm,...
       dtEffect,tqEffect,interaction,overall,norm(xf(8:10)-xb(8:10))};
      assert(numel(branchVals)==numel(bc),'CBF:HLCV44BranchShape',...
       'one-step counterfactual field count mismatch');
      br(nr,:)=branchVals;
      S.peakOneStepChange=max(S.peakOneStepChange,overall);
    catch
      % Failure of a hypothetical ONE-STEP non-physical branch is not a
      % failure of the actually applied closed-loop state trajectory.
    end
 end
 x=v25StepOnce(x,u,s,opts);
 if any(~isfinite(x)) || ...
    abs(norm(x(1:4))-1)>1e-3 || abs(norm(x(14:16))-1)>1e-3
    S.status='STOP_PLANT_STATE_INVALID';break;
 end
end
T=cell2table(tr(1:nb,:),'VariableNames',c);
B=cell2table(br(1:nr,:),'VariableNames',bc);
end

function z=v44C6BumpJet(t,start,rise,hold,fall,k)
z=v44C6StepJet(t-start,rise,k)-...
  v44C6StepJet(t-(start+rise+hold),fall,k);
end

function z=v44C6StepJet(time,D,k)
% Smoothstep order n=6, degree 13, C6 at segment boundaries.
% All incremental v1 derivatives from one common time function.
if time<=0,z=0;return;end
if time>=D,z=double(k==0);return;end
s=time/D;z=0;n=13-k;
% Bernstein forward differences avoid large polynomial cancellations in
% the high derivatives near endpoints (MATLAB double precision).
for j=0:n
    dj=0;
    for ell=0:k
        dj=dj+(-1)^(k-ell)*nchoosek(k,ell)*double(j+ell>=7);
    end
    if dj~=0
        z=z+dj*nchoosek(n,j)*s^j*(1-s)^(n-j);
    end
end
z=z*(factorial(13)/factorial(n))/D^k;
end

function v44WriteHandover(work,root,opts)
% Keep all V43 embedded historical material; append V44 rather than
% replacing or shortening prior cumulative text.
v43WriteHandover(work,root,opts);
p=fullfile(work,'CBF_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER_V43.txt');
assert(isfile(p),'CBF:HLCV44History','V43 cumulative handover missing');
prior=fileread(p);
add=strjoin({... 
 '============================================================';...
 'V44追記 2026-11-17：HLCの入力修正で発生する異常増幅の因果調査';...
 '============================================================';...
 '研究目的はHLCが何Nmまで飽和せずに飛ぶかではない。一定の飽和を許容しつつ、CBFによる推力または3軸トルク修正がHLCのどの数式・状態フィードバックを通じて135Nm等の巨大生指令へ増幅されるか、その最初の直接原因を特定すること。';...
 'V19でt=2.15sにR1推力介入、2.275sに生トルク1.68Nm、2.300sに135.23Nm。2.300sのBeta2条件数約4.23、Vs依存トルク約132.84Nm。Beta2特異化のみを主因にするのは不適切。';...
 'HLC_SUSPENDED_LOAD.doは毎周期Vfd、Vs、Uf、Beta2、V2_alpha2を現在推定状態と元の6階参照から再計算。明示的な積分器に入力差が蓄積する構造ではなく、介入後の実状態の変化が次の高階仮想入力・逆変換に増幅される可能性を優先して検査。';...
 '数式上、推力段のUfはv1(0)にアフィンであり、1サンプルの推力修正でも次時刻の運動・紐角加速度を変える。トルク変更は直ちに機体角加速度を変え、次の姿勢・推力方向と高階運動へ作用。どちらも同じ物理入力を実現する限り仮想表現だけでは運動を改善しない。';...
 '入力の不連続自体は25ms ZOHに元々含まれる。HLC増幅の因果候補：入力波形の急変、v1高階微分とv234の不整合、状態追従誤差のF2/F3等による拡大、飽和後の実入力と要求入力の偏差、推力分母/逆行列の悪条件化。異なる現象をひとまとめにしない。';...
 'V44は元R193 Flight等速直線6-jetを変更しない通常初期状態群と、ケーブル傾斜5度・機体ロール2度・ケーブル角速度0.08rad/s群に加え、別の過去V19試験目標とV11プラントの2.125秒状態を再現する群を明確に分離。';...
 '毎25msの閉ループで推力を後段急変/滑らか修正、v1増分0..5階が単一C6波形由来でVs・Beta2・alpha2を再計算する方式、ロール/ピッチ/ヨーの個別急変・滑らか修正、推力＋トルク同時修正、実R1-CBFを比較。';...
 'ピッチトルクをVsへ逆算して同じ実物理トルクを出す対照は、ラベルに依存する運動改善が起こらないことの必須検算であり、HLC整合の安定性証明ではない。JOINT_NATIVEとJOINT_POSTの入力ベクトルは異なるため、両者の最大トルクを直接比較して整合の効果と断定してはいけない。';...
 '同一時刻・同一状態から、基準、推力のみ変更、トルクのみ変更、両方変更の4本を25ms進める介入的な反実仮想分岐を追加。次時刻のVs、alpha2、生トルクで増幅の入口を検査。';...
 'V2_alpha2からVsを代数的にゼロ化したトルク寄与を各周期で測るが、これは物理実現可能な制御則ではない。F2各個別項の寄与解析は既存V28データも併用。';...
 '1Nmおよび10Nm超過は診断タイムスタンプのためだけ。破綻基準には使わない。元のHLC生入力の飽和と追加希望入力の飽和は区別して記録。紐安全余裕や張力も監視するが原因の切り分けが主目的。';...
 '新規テストの状態：V44 MATLAB未実行。ソース構文、スキーマ、元HLCと元プラントは静的点検。R193_24は完全なFlight/EKF/モーター応答ではなく、質量推定はユーザ指定（初期0.01kg固定が既定）。'...
 },newline);
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'CBF_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER_V44.txt'),...
  [prior newline newline add newline]);
delete(p);
end


% =========================================================================
% V46 - RESEARCH ONLY. V19 actual R1 thrust held at EVERY feedback update.
% Compare raw HLC torque without intervention, R1 thrust only, R1 thrust
% with 25-ms one-step TORQUE co-correction.  No proposed control is certified.
% Previous V44 experiment modes and all generated HLC/plant functions stay intact.
% =========================================================================
function r=v46MechanismSuite(work,opts)
assert(abs(opts.dt-.025)<1e-12 && strcmpi(opts.parameterSet,'R193') && ...
    strcmpi(opts.plant,'V11_19'), ...
    'CBF:HLCV46Protocol','V46 exact V19 controls need V11_19, R193, dt=0.025');
assert(opts.v46FDNm>0 && opts.v46Ridge>0, ...
    'CBF:HLCV46Options','Finite difference and ridge must be positive');
sc=CBF_V19_Scenarios('straight_single','R193');sc.dt=opts.dt;
[x0,where]=v40GetV19PreInterventionState(sc,opts,2.125);
assert(all(isfinite(x0)),'CBF:HLCV46Replay','V19 preintervention state invalid');
sc.x0=x0;
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V46_V19_STATE_PROVENANCE.txt'),where);
modes={'NOMINAL','R1_EXACT','R1_NEXT_TAU','R1_NEXT_VS'};
if isfield(opts,'v47Mechanism') && opts.v47Mechanism
    modes=[modes,{'R1_NEXT_T','R1_NEXT_4U'}];
end
labels={'mode','status','lastTime_s','firstR1Intervention_s', ...
    'peakRawHlcTau_Nm','peakRequestedTau_Nm','peakVsNorm', ...
    'minimumBetaSigma','minimumCableH','minimumTension_N', ...
    'largestThrustCorrection_N','largestTorqueCorrection_Nm', ...
    'largestOneStepTauPredict_Nm','steps'};
summ=cell(0,numel(labels));errors=0;stops=0;
for j=1:numel(modes)
    m=modes{j};fprintf('[HLC V47] V19 / %s\n',m);
    try
        [tr,sv,loc,meta,extra,geo]=v46Run(sc,opts,m);
        if opts.v49GeometryAudit
            writetable(geo,fullfile(work,['V49_THRUST_ATTITUDE_CAUSE_' m '.csv']));
        end
        writetable(tr,fullfile(work,['V46_TRACE_' m '.csv']));
        writetable(sv,fullfile(work,['V46_BETA_SVD_' m '.csv']));
        if ~isempty(loc)
            writetable(loc,fullfile(work,['V46_TORQUE_AUTHORITY_' m '.csv']));
        end
        if ~isempty(extra)
            writetable(extra,fullfile(work,['V47_INPUT_AUTHORITY_' m '.csv']));
        end
        row={m,meta.status,meta.tEnd,meta.firstR1,meta.peakRawTau, ...
            meta.peakWantedTau,meta.peakVs,meta.minSigma,meta.minH, ...
            meta.minTen,meta.maxDT,meta.maxDTau,meta.maxPredictTau,height(tr)};
        summ(end+1,:)=row; %#ok<AGROW>
        if ~strcmp(meta.status,'COMPLETE_DIAGNOSTIC'),stops=stops+1;end
    catch ME
        errors=errors+1;
        row=cell(1,numel(labels));row(:)={NaN};
        row(1:2)={m,['MATLAB_ERROR_' ME.identifier]};
        summ(end+1,:)=row; %#ok<AGROW>
        v23WriteText(fullfile(work,['V46_ERROR_' m '.txt']), ...
            getReport(ME,'extended','hyperlinks','off'));
    end
end
if isfield(opts,'v47Mechanism') && opts.v47Mechanism
  name='V47_MECHANISM_AND_CORRECTION_SUMMARY.csv';
else
  name='V46_MECHANISM_AND_CORRECTION_SUMMARY.csv';
end
writetable(cell2table(summ,'VariableNames',labels),fullfile(work,name));
notes={ ...
 'All four trials start from the SAME V19 R1 preintervention physical state at t=2.125 s.'; ...
 'Original V19 straight_single 6-jet reference and V11_19 nonlinear plant; NOT R193 standard Flight reference.'; ...
 'NOMINAL: original HLC (with existing simulator clipping) with no R1 intervention.'; ...
 'R1_EXACT: every 25 ms recompute original R1 force and retain original clipped HLC torque.'; ...
 'R1_NEXT_TAU: exactly the same CURRENT R1 force calculation at that state, choose physically bounded torque via local next-sample nonlinear predictor so NEXT raw HLC torque is smaller.'; ...
 'R1_NEXT_VS: same actual R1 force calculation, choose physically bounded torque via local predictor so NEXT Vs norm is smaller.'; ...
 'These are one-step *hypothesis probes*. NO CBF safety or recursive feasibility guarantee; current R1 force may differ across runs after states diverge.'; ...
 'The torque optimization is finite-difference ridge local: Jacobian of next raw HLC demand w.r.t each physical torque, plus exact nonlinear verification of fractions of the proposed step.'; ...
 'It does not optimize high-order virtual time jets or guarantee HLC physical realizability beyond the next ZOH sample.'; ...
 'V46_BETA_SVD_* records the three directional contributions from LEFT singular projection alpha2 and the inverse singular values; unlike rcond alone it quantifies actual torque directions.'; ...
 'V46_TORQUE_AUTHORITY_* records J singular values and baseline/predicted actual next sample demand. A weak Jacobian means torque changes cannot repair the next demand locally.'; ...
 'NOMINAL, R1, and co-correction scenarios use input bounds only to describe what physical input was actually applied. Exceeding the raw HLC bound is NOT automatic failure.'; ...
 'Observe if torque cannot prevent R1 infeasibility or if h, cable tension, or beta-domain deteriorates; do not claim collision avoidance success.'; ...
 'Raw HLC v1 time series are NOT assumed to be exact continuous-time derivatives along an intervened plant.'; ...
 'No full Flight EKF, sensor loop, rotor dynamics. Fixed user-supplied estimated mass is not a live EKF trace.'};
if isfield(opts,'v47Mechanism') && opts.v47Mechanism
  notes{end+1}='V47: R1_NEXT_T and R1_NEXT_4U alter ACTUAL thrust (within original R1 feasible thrust interval) and optionally 3 physical torques. Both channels are propagated through the same nonlinear physical model every sample.';
  notes{end+1}='V47 objective uses NEXT raw HLC thrust+torques relative to the no-R1 counterfactual next HLC at the identical state. Scaling parameters are numerical weighting, NOT absolute bounds or proof of safety.';
  notes{end+1}='V47 co-correction is a one-step local diagnostic. The previously verified V19 R1 exact 135 Nm replay is not replaced; whether joint correction helps is judged from the user MATLAB run.';
end
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V46_PROTOCOL.txt'),strjoin(notes,newline));
r=struct('nCases',numel(modes),'nFailedCases',errors+stops, ...
    'nRuntimeErrors',errors,'nR1FilterStops',sum(startsWith( ...
    string(summ(:,2)),'R1_FILTER_STOP_')));
end

function [trace,svdTable,localTable,meta,extra,geoTable]=v46Run(sc,opts,mode)
s=sc.settings;H=v23MakeHLC(s,opts.dt);x=sc.x0(:);
lo=[s.input.thrustMin;s.input.torqueMin(:)];
hi=[s.input.thrustMax;s.input.torqueMax(:)];
t0=2.125;N=round(opts.v46Duration/opts.dt);
assert(abs(N*opts.dt-opts.v46Duration)<1e-10, ...
    'CBF:HLCV46Horizon','Duration must be an integer multiple of dt');
cols={'time_s','rawThrust_N','rawTauX_Nm','rawTauY_Nm','rawTauZ_Nm', ...
    'r1DesiredThrust_N','appliedThrust_N','appliedTauX_Nm', ...
    'appliedTauY_Nm','appliedTauZ_Nm','r1DeltaThrust_N', ...
    'tauCorrectionX_Nm','tauCorrectionY_Nm','tauCorrectionZ_Nm', ...
    'VsNorm','alphaNorm','tauFromVsInf_Nm', ...
    'posError_m','cableOmega_radps','cableH','tension_N', ...
    'betaRcond','betaSigmaMin','betaSigmaMax', ...
    'predictNextHlcTauBefore_Nm','predictNextHlcTauAfter_Nm', ...
    'predictNextVsBefore','predictNextVsAfter', ...
    'predictNextRawThrustBefore_N','predictNextRawThrustAfter_N', ...
    'localInputMapReliability'};
scCols={'time_s','sigmaLarge','sigmaMiddle','sigmaSmall', ...
    'alphaProjectionLarge','alphaProjectionMiddle','alphaProjectionSmall', ...
    'torqueContributionLarge','torqueContributionMiddle', ...
    'torqueContributionSmall','vsContributionLarge', ...
    'vsContributionMiddle','vsContributionSmall', ...
    'noVsContributionLarge','noVsContributionMiddle', ...
    'noVsContributionSmall','torqueNormReconstructionError'};
locCols={'time_s','JacobianSigmaLarge','JacobianSigmaMiddle', ...
    'JacobianSigmaSmall','JacobianRcond','baselineNextRawTauInf_Nm', ...
    'chosenNextRawTauInf_Nm','baselineNextVsNorm','chosenNextVsNorm', ...
    'candidateTorqueDeltaInf_Nm','selectedFraction','candidateValid'};
R=cell(N+1,numel(cols));S=cell(N+1,numel(scCols));L=cell(N+1,numel(locCols));n=0;nL=0;
newCols={'time_s','mode','baselineNextRawT_N','modifiedNextRawT_N', ...
    'baselineNextTauInf_Nm','modifiedNextTauInf_Nm', ...
    'targetNominalNextRawT_N','targetNominalNextTauInf_Nm', ...
    'jacobianSigma1','jacobianSigma2','jacobianSigma3','jacobianSigma4', ...
    'normChangeThrust_N','normChangeTorqueInf_Nm', ...
    'baselineMismatchCost','selectedMismatchCost','selectedFraction', ...
    'r1ProjectionResidual_N','nextCableH','nextTension_N','status'};
A47=cell(N+1,numel(newCols));n47=0;
[geoCols,~]=v49GeometryAudit([],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]);
G49=cell(N+1,numel(geoCols));
meta=struct('status','COMPLETE_DIAGNOSTIC','tEnd',t0,'firstR1',NaN, ...
    'peakRawTau',0,'peakWantedTau',0,'peakVs',0,'minSigma',Inf, ...
    'minH',Inf,'minTen',Inf,'maxDT',0,'maxDTau',0,'maxPredictTau',0);
for k=0:N
  t=t0+opts.dt*k;
  try
      a=v23HLC(x,t,sc,H,v23EstimatedMass(opts,t));
  catch ME
      meta.status=['HLC_ERROR_' ME.identifier];meta.tEnd=t;break;
  end
  if any(~isfinite([a.raw;a.alphaNorm;a.vsNorm])) || ...
          a.betaRcond<1e-14
      meta.status='STOP_HLC_NONFINITE_OR_BAD_INVERSE';meta.tEnd=t;break;
  end
  base=max(lo,min(hi,a.raw));wanted=base;T_r1=NaN;
  if ~strcmp(mode,'NOMINAL')
      [r1,msg]=v25R1ExactFilter(x,s,sc.obstacles,base);
      if ~strcmp(msg,'OK')
          meta.status=['R1_FILTER_STOP_' msg];meta.tEnd=t;break;
      end
      T_r1=r1(1);wanted(1)=T_r1;
  end
  p0=NaN;p1=NaN;vs0=NaN;vs1=NaN;nt0=NaN;nt1=NaN;quality=NaN;
  if k<N
      % Exact nonlinear future demand from the same current physical state
      try
          next0=v46Predict(x,wanted,t,sc,H,opts);
          p0=norm(next0.tau,Inf);vs0=norm(next0.vsRaw(:));
          p1=p0;vs1=vs0;nt0=next0.thrust;nt1=nt0;
          if (strcmp(mode,'R1_NEXT_TAU') || strcmp(mode,'R1_NEXT_VS')) && ...
                  abs(T_r1-base(1))>1e-8
              [wanted,aa,rec]=v46TorqueRepair(x,wanted,t,sc,H,opts,lo,hi,mode,next0);
              p1=norm(aa.tau,Inf);vs1=norm(aa.vsRaw(:));nt1=aa.thrust;
              quality=rec.rcond;
              nL=nL+1;
              lv={t,rec.sig(1),rec.sig(2),rec.sig(3),rec.rcond, ...
                 p0,p1,vs0,vs1,norm(wanted(2:4)-base(2:4),Inf), ...
                 rec.fraction,rec.valid};
              assert(numel(lv)==numel(locCols),'CBF:HLCV46LocalShape');
              L(nL,:)=lv;
          elseif (strcmp(mode,'R1_NEXT_T') || strcmp(mode,'R1_NEXT_4U')) && ...
                    abs(T_r1-base(1))>1e-8
              % V47 both force and torque: preserve original R1 admissible
              % thrust condition while evaluating the actual next HLC demand.
              nominalNext=v46Predict(x,base,t,sc,H,opts);
              [wanted,aa,rec]=v47JointRepair(x,wanted,base,t, ...
                  sc,H,opts,lo,hi,mode,next0,nominalNext);
              p1=norm(aa.tau,Inf);vs1=norm(aa.vsRaw(:));nt1=aa.thrust;
              quality=rec.condition;
              hPlus=NaN;tPlus=NaN;
              try
                  xPlus=v25StepOnce(x,wanted,s,opts);
                  hPlus=v23CableSafety(xPlus,sc);
                  tPlus=v23Tension(xPlus,s,wanted(1));
              catch
                  % Preserve explicit NaN, not a claimed successful state.
              end
              n47=n47+1;
              av={t,mode,next0.thrust,aa.thrust,norm(next0.tau,Inf), ...
                norm(aa.tau,Inf),nominalNext.thrust, ...
                norm(nominalNext.tau,Inf),rec.sig(1),rec.sig(2), ...
                rec.sig(3),rec.sig(4),abs(wanted(1)-T_r1), ...
                norm(wanted(2:4)-base(2:4),Inf),rec.initialScore, ...
                rec.score,rec.fraction,rec.r1Residual,hPlus,tPlus,rec.status};
              assert(numel(av)==numel(newCols),'CBF:HLCV47LocalShape');
              A47(n47,:)=av;
          end
      catch MEpredict
          % One-step predictor failure is NOT grounds to fake a successful
          % torque correction. Keep original current R1 thrust and HLC torque.
          if any(strcmp(mode,{'R1_NEXT_TAU','R1_NEXT_VS','R1_NEXT_T','R1_NEXT_4U'}))
              meta.status=['STOP_PREDICTOR_' MEpredict.identifier];
              meta.tEnd=t;break;
          end
      end
  end
  u=max(lo,min(hi,wanted));
  if opts.v49GeometryAudit
      [~,newRow]=v49GeometryAudit(x,a,u,base,s,H,t,opts,sc);
      G49(k+1,:)=newRow;
  end
  h=v23CableSafety(x,sc);ten=v23Tension(x,s,u(1));
  try
      alNo=H.obj.V2_alpha2_SuspendedLoadxyDst( ...
            x,a.XD,a.vfRaw,zeros(3,1),a.HLCparam);
      tauVs=a.beta\(a.alpha(:)-alNo(:));
      [U,D,V]=svd(a.beta);
      sig=diag(D);proj=U.'*a.alpha(:);
      chan=proj./sig;
      chanVs=(U.'*(a.alpha(:)-alNo(:)))./sig;
      chanNo=(U.'*alNo(:))./sig;
      check=norm(V*chan-a.tau,Inf);
      svVals={t,sig(1),sig(2),sig(3),proj(1),proj(2),proj(3), ...
        chan(1),chan(2),chan(3),chanVs(1),chanVs(2),chanVs(3), ...
        chanNo(1),chanNo(2),chanNo(3),check};
      assert(numel(svVals)==numel(scCols),'CBF:HLCV46SVDShape');
  catch MEsvd
      meta.status=['STOP_SVD_' MEsvd.identifier];meta.tEnd=t;break;
  end
  n=n+1;
  vals={t,a.raw(1),a.tau(1),a.tau(2),a.tau(3),T_r1, ...
      u(1),u(2),u(3),u(4),u(1)-base(1), ...
      u(2)-base(2),u(3)-base(3),u(4)-base(4), ...
      a.vsNorm,a.alphaNorm,norm(tauVs,Inf),a.posErr,a.cableOmega, ...
      h,ten,a.betaRcond,a.sigmaMin,a.sigmaMax,p0,p1,vs0,vs1, ...
      nt0,nt1,quality};
  assert(numel(vals)==numel(cols),'CBF:HLCV46TraceShape');
  R(n,:)=vals;S(n,:)=svVals;
  meta.tEnd=t;
  meta.peakRawTau=max(meta.peakRawTau,norm(a.tau,Inf));
  meta.peakWantedTau=max(meta.peakWantedTau,norm(wanted(2:4),Inf));
  meta.peakVs=max(meta.peakVs,a.vsNorm);
  meta.minSigma=min(meta.minSigma,a.sigmaMin);
  meta.minH=min(meta.minH,h);
  meta.minTen=min(meta.minTen,ten);
  meta.maxDT=max(meta.maxDT,abs(u(1)-base(1)));
  meta.maxDTau=max(meta.maxDTau,norm(u(2:4)-base(2:4),Inf));
  if isfinite(p1),meta.maxPredictTau=max(meta.maxPredictTau,p1);end
  if isnan(meta.firstR1) && abs(u(1)-base(1))>1e-8
      meta.firstR1=t;
  end
  if k==N,break;end
  if ten<=0,meta.status='STOP_TENSION_NONPOSITIVE';break;end
  x=v25StepOnce(x,u,s,opts);
  if any(~isfinite(x)) || abs(norm(x(1:4))-1)>1e-3 || ...
        abs(norm(x(14:16))-1)>1e-3
      meta.status='STOP_PLANT_STATE_INVALID';break;
  end
end
trace=cell2table(R(1:n,:),'VariableNames',cols);
svdTable=cell2table(S(1:n,:),'VariableNames',scCols);
localTable=cell2table(L(1:nL,:),'VariableNames',locCols);
extra=cell2table(A47(1:n47,:),'VariableNames',newCols);
if opts.v49GeometryAudit
    geoTable=cell2table(G49(1:n,:),'VariableNames',geoCols);
else
    geoTable=table();
end
end

function aNext=v46Predict(x,u,t,sc,H,opts)
xx=v25StepOnce(x,u,sc.settings,opts);
assert(all(isfinite(xx)),'CBF:HLCV46FutureState','Predicted state nonfinite');
aNext=v23HLC(xx,t+opts.dt,sc,H, ...
    v23EstimatedMass(opts,t+opts.dt));
assert(all(isfinite(aNext.raw)) && aNext.betaRcond>1e-14, ...
    'CBF:HLCV46FutureHLC','Predicted HLC nonfinite or singular');
end

function [u,after,record]=v46TorqueRepair(x,u0,t,sc,H,opts,lo,hi,mode,next0)
% Small LOCAL 25-ms experiment, not a validated flight controller.
% The R1 thrust is held fixed; compensate only the three torques.
tau0=u0(2:4);J=zeros(3,3);
if strcmp(mode,'R1_NEXT_TAU')
    z0=next0.tau(:);
else
    z0=next0.vsRaw(:);
end
for j=1:3
    step=opts.v46FDNm;
    if tau0(j)+step>hi(j+1)
        step=-step;
    end
    if tau0(j)+step<lo(j+1)
        error('CBF:HLCV46NoTorquePerturbation','No feasible finite difference');
    end
    test=u0;test(j+1)=tau0(j)+step;
    nxt=v46Predict(x,test,t,sc,H,opts);
    if strcmp(mode,'R1_NEXT_TAU')
        z=nxt.tau(:);
    else
        z=nxt.vsRaw(:);
    end
    J(:,j)=(z-z0)/step;
end
sing=svd(J);assert(numel(sing)==3,'CBF:HLCV46SVDMap');
reg=opts.v46Ridge;
change=-(J.'*J+reg*eye(3))\(J.'*z0);
change=max(lo(2:4)-tau0,min(hi(2:4)-tau0,change));
bestScore=norm(z0)^2;bestU=u0;after=next0;bestFraction=0;
for fraction=[.25,.50,1.0]
    uTry=u0;uTry(2:4)=max(lo(2:4),min(hi(2:4),tau0+fraction*change));
    try
        nTry=v46Predict(x,uTry,t,sc,H,opts);
    catch
        continue;
    end
    if strcmp(mode,'R1_NEXT_TAU'), z=nTry.tau(:);
    else,z=nTry.vsRaw(:);end
    score=norm(z)^2+reg*norm(uTry(2:4)-tau0)^2;
    if score<bestScore
        bestScore=score;bestU=uTry;after=nTry;bestFraction=fraction;
    end
end
u=bestU;
record=struct('sig',sing,'rcond',rcond(J), ...
    'fraction',bestFraction,'valid',isfinite(bestScore));
end



% =========================================================================
% V47 - physically applied THRUST + TORQUE local causal co-correction.
% The HLC-generated six-column v1 need NOT equal time derivatives along
% the intervened plant: compare ACTUAL next HLC demand instead.
% The R1 thrust feasibility projection is applied at every candidate.
% =========================================================================
function [uBest,nextBest,r]=v47JointRepair(x,uR1,uNom,t,sc,H,opts,lo,hi,mode,nextR1,nextNom)
assert(any(strcmp(mode,{'R1_NEXT_T','R1_NEXT_4U'})), ...
    'CBF:HLCV47Mode','Unsupported joint correction');
assert(all(isfinite([opts.v47FDThrust opts.v47FDTorque ...
    opts.v47Ridge opts.v47ScaleThrust opts.v47ScaleTorque])) && ...
    all([opts.v47FDThrust opts.v47FDTorque opts.v47Ridge ...
    opts.v47ScaleThrust opts.v47ScaleTorque]>0), ...
    'CBF:HLCV47Config','Finite difference, scaling and ridge must be positive');
inputScale=[1;0.05;0.05;0.05]; % numerical units for local linearization
fd=[opts.v47FDThrust; repmat(opts.v47FDTorque,3,1)];
outputScale=[opts.v47ScaleThrust; repmat(opts.v47ScaleTorque,3,1)];
select=1;
if strcmp(mode,'R1_NEXT_4U'), select=1:4;end
u0=uR1(:);uBest=u0;nextBest=nextR1;
target=[nextNom.thrust;nextNom.tau(:)];
raw0=[nextR1.thrust;nextR1.tau(:)];
y0=(raw0-target)./outputScale;
J=zeros(4,numel(select));active=false(1,numel(select));
for k=1:numel(select)
    col=select(k);delta=fd(col);
    for sg=[1,-1]
        trial=u0;trial(col)=trial(col)+sg*delta;
        if trial(col)>hi(col) || trial(col)<lo(col)
            continue;
        end
        try
            [accepted,~]=v47R1PhysicalTrial(x,trial,sc,lo,hi);
            if ~accepted,continue;end
            n=v46Predict(x,trial,t,sc,H,opts);
            actual=[n.thrust;n.tau(:)];
            J(:,k)=((actual-target)./outputScale-y0)/(sg*delta/inputScale(col));
            active(k)=true;break;
        catch
            % An invalid finite-difference direction is not authority.
        end
    end
end
sig=zeros(4,1);sv=svd(J);sig(1:numel(sv))=sv;
score0=norm(y0,2)^2;bestScore=score0;frac=0;projErr=0;
condition=0;
if ~isempty(sv) && sv(1)>0,condition=sv(end)/sv(1);end
if any(active)
    Js=J(:,active);
    dz=-(Js.'*Js+opts.v47Ridge*eye(sum(active)))\(Js.'*y0);
    % A trust region is ONLY for validity of the *local linearization*,
    % not a physical upper limit or an HLC safety guarantee.
    dz=max(-2,min(2,dz));
    direction=zeros(4,1);
    direction(select(active))=inputScale(select(active)).*dz;
    for fraction=[.25,.50,1,1.5]
        uTry=u0+fraction*direction;
        if any(uTry<lo-1e-12) || any(uTry>hi+1e-12),continue;end
        try
            [accepted,r1res]=v47R1PhysicalTrial(x,uTry,sc,lo,hi);
            if ~accepted,continue;end
            nTry=v46Predict(x,uTry,t,sc,H,opts);
            % Exclude physically invalid cable tension, rather than
            % declaring reduced HLC demand as proof of useful control.
            if v23Tension(x,sc.settings,uTry(1))<=0,continue;end
            y=([nTry.thrust;nTry.tau(:)]-target)./outputScale;
            penalty=opts.v47Ridge*sum(((uTry-uR1)./inputScale).^2);
            scr=norm(y)^2+penalty;
            if isfinite(scr) && scr<bestScore
                bestScore=scr;uBest=uTry;nextBest=nTry;
                frac=fraction;projErr=r1res;
            end
        catch
            continue;
        end
    end
end
if bestScore<score0
    status='SELECTED_LOCAL_IMPROVEMENT_NOT_SAFETY_CERTIFIED';
elseif ~any(active)
    status='NO_FEASIBLE_LOCAL_DERIVATIVE';
else
    status='NO_IMPROVING_FEASIBLE_LOCAL_CANDIDATE';
end
r=struct('sig',sig,'condition',condition,'fraction',frac, ...
    'initialScore',score0,'score',bestScore, ...
    'r1Residual',projErr,'status',status);
end

function [accepted,residual]=v47R1PhysicalTrial(x,u,sc,lo,hi)
% This checks the EXACT V19 R1 pointwise thrust inequality implementation.
% It does not imply sampled or continuous-time CBF safety invariance.
accepted=false;residual=Inf;
if any(~isfinite(u)) || any(u<lo-1e-10) || any(u>hi+1e-10),return;end
[projected,reason]=v25R1ExactFilter(x,sc.settings,sc.obstacles,u);
if ~strcmp(reason,'OK'),return;end
residual=abs(projected(1)-u(1));
accepted=(residual<1e-7);
end

function v46WriteHandover(work,root,opts)
v44WriteHandover(work,root,opts);
p=fullfile(work,'CBF_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER_V44.txt');
assert(isfile(p),'CBF:HLCV46MissingHandover','V44 cumulative history absent');
old=fileread(p);
appendV45=strjoin({ ...
  ''; ...
  ''; ...
  '===================================================================='; ...
  'V45追記 (2026-11-17): V44 実測ZIPの再解析 / HLC異常増幅の原因切り分け'; ...
  '===================================================================='; ...
  '実測対象: CBF_HLC_ROOTCAUSE_V44_20261117_151131_119.zip。103ファイル。'; ...
  'V44_CAUSAL_MECHANISM_SUMMARY.csvによる33条件は32 COMPLETED_DIAGNOSTIC、V19_PRECBF/R1_EXACTのみR1_FILTER_STOP、MATLAB実行エラーなし。32条件完走は障害物安全・HLC無飽和・実Flight完全再現を意味しない。ほとんどのR193群でminCableH<0。'; ...
  ''; ...
  '主観測1: V19の実R1では2.150sにCBF実推力を+3.304579N変更、2.175s+4.935346N、2.250s+7.266826N、2.275s+9.671646N、2.300s+13.086339N。HLCの生トルクは2.150s約0.001596Nm、2.175s約0.088193Nm、2.275s約1.679520Nm、2.300s約135.22944Nm。R1は2.350sに不可行停止。最後のログ行は2.325sであり、停止した未適用入力との混同に注意。V44のR1結果はV19独自のstraight_single目標とV11_19プラント（R193通常Flight参照や24状態ではない）、制御質量推定初期0.01kg固定である。'; ...
  ''; ...
  '主観測2: V19_PRECBFという同じ2.125sの状態から一定振幅の推力のみを後段でSTEPまたはC6滑らかに変更すると、最大生トルクはそれぞれ約0.128197Nm、0.128939Nm。元の実R1の135.229Nmと大きく異なる。不連続だけで135Nmが発生するという仮説はこの実験条件で支持されない。ただし対照推力の最大追加が約3.10Nに対して実R1は最大+16.4475N、持続時間・インパルス・CBF閉ループ更新も異なるため、不連続性単独の厳密な因果否定ではない。サンプル25msでのZOHは残る。'; ...
  ''; ...
  '主観測3: 仮想整合修正モードNATIVE_V1_SMOOTHは、各サンプルで単一の解析C6波形からv1の0..5列を変え、Vs/Beta2/V2_alpha2/Ufを再計算する。V19_PRECBFで元HLC生トルク最大0.489735Nmと表示されても、これは修正前の元HLCの生指令であり、修正後のrequestedTauを直接計測すると最大567.9191Nm。TILTED_R193でも生トルク最大2.05406Nmに対し、requestedTauは最大約478.8032Nm。JOINT_NATIVE_SMOOTHも同様にV19約567.8Nm、傾斜約479.1Nm。これらは要求トルクを各軸±1Nmにclipしてプラントに適用しており、代数的整合型要求が物理実現できたわけではない。「仮想整合なら安全・HLC正常」とは結論できない。対象波形の高階微分要求が極大となることが主要候補で、すべての整合型入力修正に一般化しない。JOINT_POSTとの入力系列が一致しないため優劣の直接比較は不適当。'; ...
  ''; ...
  '主観測4: V19のR1 2.300sで|Vs|約657.37、||alpha2||約669.215、Vs依存トルク約132.836Nm、非依存トルク約2.393Nm。元V27の同じ実測状態において、Beta2最小特異値は2.275s約20.8767→2.300s約4.94874、最大特異値308.686→20.9163、条件数14.786→4.2266。rcond改善だけで逆変換作用が正常だと判定してはいけない。最小特異値の減少とalpha2の弱作用方向への投影の可能性があり、SVD方向別の (u_i^T alpha2)/sigma_i を次に直接出力する必要がある。2.300s HLC生推力0.41539Nに対して実適用CBF推力13.50173N（2.275s生2.84985N、適用12.52150N）。Beta2生成式がv1(0)に依存する点も含め、推力と仮想入力の食い違いによる係数行列の変化を厳密に確認する。直ちに特異化と断定しない。'; ...
  ''; ...
  '主観測5: V44の1サンプル反実仮想分岐（同じx,t,推定質量・参照・HLC、異なる実入力）では、R1の2.275sで通常入力を25ms保持した次周期の生トルクは約0.53115Nm、CBF推力だけを適用した次周期は約135.22944Nm、次位置差は約3.35mm。大きな位置追従誤差の蓄積なしでも、変更後の速度・ケーブル/姿勢状態が次周期の高階指令を大きく変え得る。これは短期の因果作用を強く裏づけるが、v1微分列・Vsフィードバック・Beta2 SVD方向投影の寄与をまだ分解し切っていない。'; ...
  ''; ...
  '主観測6: 各軸0.05Nmの後段トルク修正ではV19_PRECBFの最大生トルクはroll STEP約0.06399Nm、pitch STEP約0.06590Nm、yaw STEP約0.05665Nmであり、STEPと滑らかな波形で本質的な巨大化は観測されなかった。この大きさ・初期状態の範囲に限定した結果であり、任意のトルク修正量・方向で起こらないとは言えない。PITCH_VS_EXACT_SAME_TORQUEはPOST_PITCH_SMOOTHと最終物理入力が数値精度で一致し状態も一致した。代数的言い換えだけでは運動は変わらない。'; ...
  ''; ...
  '集計上の重要な落とし穴: V44_CAUSAL_MECHANISM_SUMMARY.csvのpeakRawTorque_Nmは「変更前のHLC生トルク」。NATIVE型やJOINT_NATIVE型で変更後に要求されたトルク最大値を示さない。修正後要求はV44_TRACE_*のrequestedTauX/Y/Zを直接読む。peakPostThrustTorqueCouplingMismatch_Nmはv1(0)のみ逆算し、他の高階列を旧値に固定した仮想的比較との差であり、NATIVE型が高階まで整合している場合にも大きく出るので整合失敗の直接証拠にしてはいけない。V44のvsNorm/alphaNormも元HLCの値であって修正後targetVs/targetAlphaのノルムではない（CSV targetVsはv2Target/v3Target/v4Targetとして記録）。要求入力clip後は実際の物理運動が仮想整合に従うとは言えない。'; ...
  ''; ...
  'V44のV1_TIME_RELATIONはサンプル間差分と宣言されたD1列を比べるだけで、元Vfd列が実物理時間微分と一致することを解析的には立証・否定できない。元HLCが使用するV1の5階列について、現在のUf/Vs/Beta2/V2_alpha2各生成関数が直接使用する最大列を逐一調べること。VsはV1 0..3階、V2_alpha2はV1 0..4階、Beta2/UfはV1(0)。V1第5階が今回の実トルクへ実際に入るかは別の検査対象。'; ...
  ''; ...
  '次回実験の最優先事項（ケースを漫然と増やさない）:'; ...
  '(1) V19の2.250/2.275/2.300sと直前の連続各サンプルでBeta2の3特異値・左/右特異ベクトル・alpha2への投影・方向別トルク寄与・実適用TとHLCのUf理想Tを同時記録。v1(0)の低下によるBeta2の絶対作用変化を要検証。F2の第3項等の寄与も同時記録する。'; ...
  '(2) 実R1で観測された実推力の変更量を、毎周期同一または近接する実入力系列に統一した「後段」「同時トルク補償」「物理入力限界を満たす仮想整合」候補で比較する。最終的な実入力差を明示し、同じ実入力なら状態も同じという検算を行う。CBF制約充足を満たさない制御は診断対照と表示。'; ...
  '(3) 同じ最大推力・トルク修正量だけでなく修正時間幅、各階微分、ZOHの差、インパルスを揃えて、急変と滑らかさを独立因子に近づける。入力コマンドの急変自体と、継続的なCBFフィードバック・飽和の寄与を区別。'; ...
  '(4) トルク3軸を個別および同時に、推力と組み合わせ、応答の開始時刻（機体角加速度、推力方向、ケーブル角速度、Vs、alpha2、beta特異方向）を比較する。0.05Nmしか測っていないため広範囲の安全性は主張しない。'; ...
  '(5) 名目生入力の大きさを最適化の計算時間増大と同一視しない。CBF目的関数スケール、QP条件数、不可行・実行時間は別計測。'; ...
  '(6) いずれも元の6階通常Flight参照を改変しない。V19ベンチは別目標/別プラントであること、モータ・センサ・EKF完全統合ではないことを記録し、将来のFlight検証との混同を防ぐ。'; ...
  ''; ...
  'この追記は既存の全引継ぎ本文を削らず後ろへ付け足したもの。V45は分析版名であり、MATLABコード改変・V45実行を意味しない。' ...
},newline);
appendV46=strjoin({ ...
  ''; ...
  ''; ...
  '============================================================'; ...
  'V46追記 (2026-11-17): 実CBF推力に連動する3軸トルク補償の因果検証'; ...
  '============================================================'; ...
  '研究目的: トルク上限を小さく設定して見かけの異常を隠すことではなく、V19で推力後段変更後にVs/alpha2/Beta2が増幅される過程を式と数値から解明し、その原因に直接対処できる修正方法を探す。'; ...
  '設計仮説: 同じR1-CBF推力を現在の実状態で求めたまま、現在加える3軸トルクを変更して1周期後のHLC要求トルクまたはVsを減らせるか調べる。トルク変更は3軸、25ms ZOH、元V11_19プラントでの次状態を使う。仮想入力の代数的言い換えではなく、異なる物理トルクを適用する介入的比較。'; ...
  'V46モード NOMINAL, R1_EXACT, R1_NEXT_TAU, R1_NEXT_VS。各試行はV19の2.125秒の再現状態から開始し、R1は毎周期元CBFで再計算、トルク修正に伴い将来R1推力が変化することは隠さない。過去V19目標は元の6階滑らかなトラジェクトリから独立した別試験であり、実Flight全モード統合試験ではない。'; ...
  '修正候補は3x3の局所的な次周期HLC出力対物理トルク微分Jを非線形プラントで数値推定し、Tを現在のR1要求へ固定したまま正則化付き最小二乗でトルク候補を算出し、元のプラントをもう一度積分して次時刻のHLC要求が本当に小さくなったか検算する。これは局所・1周期先の検査で、安定・CBF・安全・物理可行性の証明ではない。'; ...
  'Beta2について毎時刻のSVDを記録し、alpha2とVs由来/非由来項の左特異ベクトルへの投影と1/sigmaの方向別寄与を出力する。Beta2の条件数だけでは原因を説明できない。最小特異値だけでも不十分で、alpha2との方向整合が必要。'; ...
  'V46では巨大な生トルクを制御の良否と一意に決めず、実際の作用、状態、張力、h、R1不可行を別々に記録する。局所Jが弱くてトルクだけでは次HLC要求を抑えられない場合、それは修正可能性の否定的な結果として残す。'; ...
  '将来の本設計には、予測された複数周期のHLC動作、元の6階目標軌道、CBF安全余裕、25msサンプル間、実入力上限、姿勢・紐張力、推定質量誤差、計算時間を一つの制約付き安全フィルタへ統合する必要がある。現段階でV46の局所補償を実機用CBFと称さない。'; ...
  'V46 MATLABは静的な構造検査のみ。数値結果はユーザ側の実行ZIPを確認するまで未確定。元のHLC・プラント・R1本体の数式は変更していない。' ...
},newline);
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'CBF_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER_V46.txt'),...
  [old appendV45 appendV46]);
delete(p);
end

function v47WriteHandover(work,root,opts)
v46WriteHandover(work,root,opts);
p=fullfile(work,'CBF_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER_V46.txt');
assert(isfile(p),'CBF:HLCV47Handover','V46 cumulative handover missing');
prior=fileread(p);
add47=strjoin({ ...
  ''; ...
  ''; ...
  '============================================================'; ...
  'V47追記 2026-11-17：推力と3軸トルクを同時に考慮するHLC増幅機構の検証'; ...
  '============================================================'; ...
  '目的：名目HLC・元のCBFおよび元の19状態物理プラントは変更せず、CBFが要求する推力の実修正と3軸物理トルク修正のどちらが次周期のHLC生推力・生トルクへ増幅するのか、数値的に原因を切り分ける。飽和しただけでは失敗判定しない。コスト小＝安全でも安定でもない。'; ...
  'V47既存比較：NOMINAL、R1_EXACT、R1_NEXT_TAU（元R1推力を維持、3軸トルクで次時刻生トルクを抑制）、R1_NEXT_VS（同推力、次時刻Vsを抑制）。'; ...
  'V47新規比較：R1_NEXT_T は3軸トルクは名目のままで、元R1の同一状態の制約を満たす推力候補から次周期の生HLC入力を調整。R1_NEXT_4U は元R1制約を守る範囲の推力と3軸実トルクを同時に変更。CBF不等式は各候補の現時刻で再チェックする。どれも同一2.125秒のV19再現状態から25 msごとに非線形プラントで閉ループ計算する。'; ...
  '最適化は研究用の1周期局所感度。現物理入力のT,τに対する次時刻のHLC要求(T_HLC,τ_HLC)の4×1または4×4数値Jacobianを、元のプラントで計算する。対象は同じ状態から名目HLC入力で進んだ1周期後のHLC生入力との差。数値スケールの1N・1Nm等は重みであり、上限やCBF安全証明ではない。正則化＋複数候補の実プラント再積分で実際の低減を再確認。3軸トルクの動特性を無視せず、推力とトルクの相互作用も局所4入力行列に含まれる。'; ...
  '重要な限界：一周期のHLC入力差が小さくなっても、追従が改善したか／ケーブルhが安全か／将来のR1可行性が保たれたかは別。短い終了時間では135Nmを発生する時刻まで到達しない場合もあるので、ユーザMATLAB結果で必ず時刻、事象を確認する。'; ...
  '入力の実行可能範囲0..20N・±1Nmは既存シミュレーションの仮定であり実機認証されたものではない。R1が不可行になったら理由を保存し、無理にCBF成功とは呼ばない。V47の推力修正はR1そのものを改造するのではなく、元のR1許容区間内で選ぶ研究用候補である。時間微分整合型の別の仮想入力修正を実装したとは言わない。'; ...
  '元の生成済みHLCで v1 の第0..5列が実際の連続時間微分列であることは未証明。高階微分整合を保証するには動力学に沿う連鎖律と推力アクチュエータの動的拡張の検討が必要。現V47は物理プラントと次のHLC要求を直接比べるため、その仮定には依存しない。'; ...
  'V44のBeta2問題はSVD方向別の左右特異ベクトルとalpha2の投影を引き続き記録する。特異値の最小値と条件数だけでトルク増幅の因果割合を断定してはいけない。推力、Vs、Beta2、張力、h、次時刻の入力を並べる。'; ...
  '試験の状態：コードを静的点検。MATLAB本体はこの環境に無いので数値結果未検証。V45までの累積記録とV46追記全文は独立TXTとMATLAB内蔵文に保持。' ...
},newline);
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'CBF_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER_V47.txt'), ...
   [prior newline add47]);
delete(p);
end


function [cols,row]=v49GeometryAudit(x,a,u,base,s,H,t,opts,sc)
% V49: original HLC Uf decomposition and body/cable attitude diagnosis.
% This is an OBSERVER only. It does not change controller, CBF or plant.
cols={'time_s','bodyRoll_deg','bodyPitch_deg','bodyYaw_deg',...
 'bodyThrustAxisTilt_deg','cableTilt_deg','cableVsThrustAxis_deg',...
 'qz','qDotB3','thrustDenominator',...
 'v1_0','v1PosContribution','v1VelContribution','v1FeedbackSumResidual',...
 'zError_m','vzError_mps','loadZ_m','droneZ_m','loadVz_mps',...
 'UfFeedbackTerm_N','UfGravityAndReferenceTerm_N','UfCableRotationTerm_N',...
 'UfNumeratorSum_N','UfNumeratorFromRawThrust_N','UfReconstructionError_N',...
 'rawHlcThrust_N','r1OrOtherAppliedThrust_N','appliedMinusRawThrust_N',...
 'rawHlcTauX_Nm','rawHlcTauY_Nm','rawHlcTauZ_Nm',...
 'appliedTauX_Nm','appliedTauY_Nm','appliedTauZ_Nm',...
 'VsNorm','alpha2Norm','beta2SigmaMin','beta2Rcond',...
 'cableOmega_radps','bodyOmega_radps','tension_N',...
 'nextLoadVzDifferenceFromCorrection_mps',...
 'nextV1DifferenceFromCorrection','nextRawThrustDifferenceFromCorrection_N',...
 'nextRawTorqueDifferenceFromCorrection_Nm'};
row={};
if isempty(x),return;end
q=x(1:4);q=q(:)/norm(q);
qw=q(1);qx=q(2);qy=q(3);qzquat=q(4);
roll=atan2(2*(qw*qx+qy*qzquat),1-2*(qx*qx+qy*qy));
pitch=asin(max(-1,min(1,2*(qw*qy-qzquat*qx))));
yaw=atan2(2*(qw*qzquat+qx*qy),1-2*(qy*qy+qzquat*qzquat));
b3=[2*(qx*qzquat+qw*qy);2*(qy*qzquat-qw*qx);...
    qw*qw-qx*qx-qy*qy+qzquat*qzquat];
b3=b3/norm(b3);
pT=x(14:16);pT=pT(:);
pT=pT/norm(pT);
qDotB3=dot(pT,b3);qVertical=pT(3);
den=qVertical*qDotB3;
bodyTilt=acos(max(-1,min(1,b3(3))));
cableTilt=acos(max(-1,min(1,-qVertical)));
% A hanging cable points DOWN while the thrust axis points UP.
relative=acos(max(-1,min(1,-qDotB3)));
m=s.physical.massDrone;mHat=a.HLCparam(6);
L=s.physical.cableLength;gravity=s.physical.gravity;
refZa=a.XD(11);v1=a.vfRaw(1);
ze=a.XD(3)-x(10);vze=a.XD(7)-x(13);
v1Pos=H.F1(1)*ze;v1Vel=H.F1(2)*vze;
feedbackTerm=(m+mHat)*v1;
gravityRefTerm=(m+mHat)*(refZa+gravity);
omegaCable=x(17:19);omegaCable=omegaCable(:);
cableTerm=L*m*qVertical*norm(cross(omegaCable,pT))^2;
num=feedbackTerm+gravityRefTerm+cableTerm;
raw=a.raw(1);numFromRaw=raw*den;
nV1=NaN;nT=NaN;nTau=NaN;dVz=NaN;
try
    if opts.v49GeometryAudit
       xNom=v25StepOnce(x,base,s,opts);
       xApp=v25StepOnce(x,u,s,opts);
       dVz=xApp(13)-xNom(13);
       hn=v23HLC(xNom,t+opts.dt,sc,H,v23EstimatedMass(opts,t+opts.dt));
       ha=v23HLC(xApp,t+opts.dt,sc,H,v23EstimatedMass(opts,t+opts.dt));
       nV1=ha.vfRaw(1)-hn.vfRaw(1);
       nT=ha.raw(1)-hn.raw(1);
       nTau=norm(ha.tau-hn.tau,Inf);
    end
catch
    % Keep NaN on failed counterfactual, never label a failed predictor safe.
end
row={t,roll*180/pi,pitch*180/pi,yaw*180/pi,...
 bodyTilt*180/pi,cableTilt*180/pi,relative*180/pi,...
 qVertical,qDotB3,den,...
 v1,v1Pos,v1Vel,v1-(v1Pos+v1Vel),...
 ze,vze,x(10),x(10)-L*qVertical,x(13),...
 feedbackTerm,gravityRefTerm,cableTerm,num,numFromRaw,num-numFromRaw,...
 raw,u(1),u(1)-raw,...
 a.tau(1),a.tau(2),a.tau(3),...
 u(2),u(3),u(4),...
 a.vsNorm,a.alphaNorm,a.sigmaMin,a.betaRcond,...
 norm(omegaCable),norm(x(5:7)),v23Tension(x,s,u(1)),...
 dVz,nV1,nT,nTau};
assert(numel(row)==numel(cols),'CBF:HLCV49GeomShape',...
 'V49 diagnostic header/value mismatch');
if abs(num-numFromRaw)>1e-7*max(1,abs(num))
 error('CBF:HLCV49UfParity',...
  'Generated Uf differs from independently reconstructed terms at t=%g',t);
end
end


function v49WriteHandover(work,root,opts)
% Base V47 handover is generated from the original complete embedded history.
v47WriteHandover(work,root,opts);
p=fullfile(work,'CBF_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER_V47.txt');
assert(isfile(p),'CBF:HLCV49BaseHandover','V47 cumulative handover missing');
prior=fileread(p);
addition=strjoin({ ...
 '';
 '';
 '============================================================';
 'V48 追記（2026-11-17）: V47実測ZIPの推力・トルク両方の再分析';
 '============================================================';
 '対象: CBF_HLC_ROOTCAUSE_V47_20261117_153602_805.zip。元V47のデータと引継ぎを削除せず追記。';
 '実行: 6条件 / NOMINALのみ診断完了、R1を用いる5条件がR1_FILTER_STOP_INFEASIBLE_SHARED_THRUSTで終了。MATLAB実行エラー0。これは物理的な墜落を意味しない。R1介入直前2.125秒から開始するV19 straight_single/V11_19、dt25ms、制御側推定荷重質量は初期0.01 kg固定。通常のR193 Flight本番軌道・live EKFではない。';
 '';
 '推力の3種類を分離: rawThrust_N はHLC Ufの無飽和生推力; r1DesiredThrust_N はV19 R1フィルタ希望推力; appliedThrust_N は物理プラントに適用した推力。rawが負なら元HLCの基準入力 base は0..20Nでclipされた後、R1を適用する。V46_TRACEのr1DeltaThrust_N は appliedThrust - clipped(rawThrust) であり appliedThrust - rawThrust ではない。後者を見ないと生推力との不一致を過小評価する。';
 '';
 'NOMINAL 2.125..2.650秒: rawThrust 8.86665..8.8764 N、applied一致、生トルク最大約0.002134 Nm。';
 'R1_EXACT: 時刻2.150 rawT8.86767N/appliedT12.17225N; 2.175 rawT7.04008/applied11.97543; 2.250 rawT4.98845/applied12.25528; 2.275 rawT2.84985/applied12.52150/rawPitch1.67952Nm; 2.300 rawT0.415391/applied13.50173/rawPitch135.22944Nm; 2.325 rawT-2.72272/applied16.44754/rawPitch2.65545Nm。2.325sの真の生推力対適用推力の差は+19.17026N。一方r1DeltaThrust_N列は+16.44754N（負の生推力を0へクリップした後の差）。2.325sから次25msの推定HLC生推力は-7.71566N。ただし2.350sはR1不可行で停止しており、その負値が実際に適用されたと誤解しない。V47の実適用推力は5.176..16.448N、負推力や20N超の実適用は記録されていない。短い区間だけからその後の巨大正推力が起きないとは言えない。';
 '';
 '6条件の比較: NOMINALのrawT min8.86665, max8.8764N; R1_EXACT raw min-2.72272, max8.86767, applied max16.44754; R1_NEXT_T raw min-2.80871, applied max16.4837; R1_NEXT_4UはR1_EXACTと全時系列同一; R1_NEXT_TAU raw min-1.5909, applied max17.19356、2.325sでR1不可行; R1_NEXT_VS raw min-1.4690, applied max16.89398、2.325sでR1不可行。NEXT_TAU/VSの生トルク最大は約9.8247/11.7698Nmに抑えられたが、生推力の負値を解決せず、R1不可行は早まっている。NEXT_Tは2.300sで実推力を約+0.155N変えて1周期先の生トルク要求を2.65545→2.43164Nmと小幅改善したが、2.275→2.300sの135.229Nmには改善がなく、2.325sの次周期生推力予測は-7.82921N。NEXT_4U候補は7評価時刻で改善候補採用ゼロ（NO_IMPROVING_FEASIBLE_LOCAL_CANDIDATE）で、全域での有効な修正不存在という意味ではない。';
 '';
 'トルク逆変換の確認: R1_EXACT 2.275sではBeta2特異値(308.686,231.974,20.877)、alpha2の投影は中間特異方向(-389.605)へ集中しトルク-1.67952Nm。2.300sでは特異値(20.9163,6.58287,4.94874)、alpha2の投影は最小特異方向(-669.215)へ集中し-669.215/4.94874=-135.229Nm。Vs由来は約-132.837Nm、その他-2.393Nm。条件数だけでなく絶対特異値と右辺の方向を確認する必要がある。生推力が0.415Nになった同時刻にBeta2の弱方向が急に変わるため、HLCのUf分子・分母およびV1第0列と、Beta2の推力依存を優先検証する。これは同時発生の関連性であり、推力低下が唯一の原因という証明ではない。';
 '';
 '元HLC Ufの記号式: 推力の分子は概ね(m+mL)*(v1(0)+目標z加速度+g+ケーブル角運動補償)、分母はケーブル垂直成分×推力軸との内積。Beta2もv1(0)とz目標加速度に依存する。V47時系列にはv1(0), Ufの分子/分母、各高階v1、各HLC生推力の項別寄与がないため、生推力が大きく負になった直接の数式要因（v1由来か幾何分母由来か等）は未確定。入力飽和を小さくして隠す修正は行わず、まずこの信号を露出する。';
 '';
 '次回の最優先ログ: 毎周期のrawT, clippedRawT, R1desiredT, requestedT, appliedT, (applied-rawT), (applied-clippedRawT), ΔT/Δt, v1第0〜5列、Ufの鉛直加速度相当の分子各項と幾何分母、q_z, q^Tb3、Beta2の特異値とalpha投影、Vsの追従項、高階目標微分、HLC推定質量、適用3軸トルクと生トルク、姿勢/紐速度、張力、h、1周期先のHLC生推力、CBF不可行原因。加えてR1の適用推力がHLC生推力を急速に低下させるか、同一状態からTだけ/τだけ/4入力変更で非線形分岐し比較。短期差・閉ループ長期差・原因仮説を混同しない。生推力の巨大な正値はこのV47区間では観測されなかったが、負値への転落は既に異常であり、R1補償で解決していない。';
 '';
 '解析から生成した付属資料: V47_THRUST_TORQUE_ALL6_REAUDIT.csv、V47_R1_THRUST_MECHANISM_TIMELINE.csv、V47_R1_RAW_VS_APPLIED_THRUST_AND_TORQUE.png、V48_THRUST_CAUSAL_ANALYSIS.txt。元V47プログラムは変更なし、MATLABの新規実行なし。全数値は元V47のCSV由来。';
 '';
 '';
 '============================================================';
 'V49追記 2026-11-17：姿勢・ケーブル姿勢・Uf分子の独立再構成とCBF状態制約候補';
 '============================================================';
 '今回の問い：V19のR1介入後HLC生推力が8.87N→0.415N→負値となった原因が、機体傾斜・紐傾斜・推力方向の幾何分母なのか、v1など分子の変化なのか分離する。推力・三軸トルク・張力・姿勢を同時記録し、どちらの異常が先か時系列で検証する。';
 '既存V44実測：2.300秒のケーブル傾斜4.167度、|qz*(qTb3)|=0.99705、v1(0)=-9.271、HLC生推力0.415N、CBF実推力13.502N、生トルク135.229Nm。qは下向きでb3上向きの通常姿勢で、推力軸とケーブル反対向きの相対角は約1.414度。従って三角不等式による機体推力軸の鉛直傾斜上界は約5.581度。これは実測ロール・ピッチではなく、既存軌道の幾何データによる上界。大角度が直接原因という仮説は当該時刻には支持されないが、他の異常状態や将来を排除しない。';
 'V49は従来V47のV19 6ケース全てについて、クォータニオンから実ロール・ピッチ・ヨー、推力軸鉛直角、qTb3、ケーブル傾斜、機体・吊り荷高度、z位置/速度誤差とF1それぞれのv1寄与、元Ufの鉛直仮想入力・重力参照・紐角運動補償の分子3項、推力分母、全ての生/適用Tと3軸τ、1周期後の反実仮想差を観測するCSVを追加する。元制御器/CBF/プラント/軌道を変更しない。';
 'もし元HLC推力分子が小さくなるならF1*z誤差・F1*vz誤差・ケーブル項を別々に読む。幾何分母が小さくなるのは別の故障経路であり、二つの故障は混同しない。最小特異値とαの投影によるトルクの方向別増幅も既存ログを併記する。';
 'CBF候補：機体推力軸傾斜h_R=e_z^T b3-cos(theta_Rmax)、ケーブル方向h_q=-q_z-cos(theta_qmax)、逆変換整合の幾何余裕h_g=q_z(q^Tb3)-epsilon、張力tension>=T_min、安全高度h_groundと衝突楕円体h_obs。機体姿勢h_Rはトルクに通常相対次数2、ケーブル方向h_qには推力とトルクの混合相対次数/入力作用退化、張力は推力に直接依存する場合がある。単に各h>=0とQPに追加するだけでは前方不変性を保証しない。高階CBF/動的拡張/離散時間予測と有界入力で可行性を検証する必要。角度上限は研究設計値であり固定真理ではない。';
 '重要：角度や姿勢だけをCBFで制限しても、V19 2.300秒では既に幾何姿勢が正常に近いため、v1低下→Uf分子キャンセル→Beta2の弱方向＋Vsの大増幅という別の連鎖を防ぐ保証はない。CBF適用時に異常なHLC要求を予測して回避するため、現在の状態と次周期のHLC生T/τも併用評価する。';
 '検証の限界：本ログはEKF初期値0.01kg固定でV19の状態再現を使い、完全Flight EKFやロータ動特性ではない。V49のMATLAB実行は未検証、結果は出てから判断する。';
 '';
},newline);
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'CBF_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER_V49.txt'),...
    [prior addition]);
delete(p);
end


% =========================================================================
% V51: mechanistic operating-domain investigation of original HLC.
% Original V19 straight_single reference/CBF/plant/HLC left unchanged.
% A) Exact nonlinear R1 replay every 25 ms; extract state & raw HLC.
% B) Same-state position-only / speed-only changes (NOT flight trials).
% C) Fixed-state v1 zeroth-component sweep incl. re-evaluation Vs & Beta2.
% D) Feasible current R1-thrust plus physical-axis torque one-step probes.
% All one-step probes are diagnostic and not recursive CBFs.
% =========================================================================
function out=v51Suite(work,opts)
assert(strcmpi(opts.plant,'V11_19') && strcmpi(opts.parameterSet,'R193') ...
    && abs(opts.dt-0.025)<1e-12, 'CBF:HLCV51Protocol', ...
    'V51 V19 replay requires V11_19, R193, dt=0.025');
out=v46MechanismSuite(work,opts);
try
    v51Replay(work,opts);
catch ME
    out.nRuntimeErrors=out.nRuntimeErrors+1;
    out.nFailedCases=out.nFailedCases+1;
    v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V51_CAUSAL_AUDIT_ERROR.txt'), ...
        getReport(ME,'extended','hyperlinks','off'));
end
end

function v51Replay(work,opts)
sc=CBF_V19_Scenarios('straight_single','R193');sc.dt=opts.dt;
[x,info]=v40GetV19PreInterventionState(sc,opts,2.125);
assert(all(isfinite(x)),'CBF:HLCV51Replay','Unable to initialize pre-R1 state');
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V51_REPLAY_SOURCE.txt'),info);
s=sc.settings;H=v23MakeHLC(s,opts.dt);
lo=[s.input.thrustMin;s.input.torqueMin(:)];
hi=[s.input.thrustMax;s.input.torqueMax(:)];
col={'t_s','zError_m','vzError_mps','actualLoadVz_mps','criticalLoadVzForRawThrustZero_mps', ...
    'velocityMarginToRawThrustZero_mps','v1_0','v1Pos','v1Vel', ...
    'rawThrust_N','cbfAppliedThrust_N','rawMinusAppliedThrust_N', ...
    'appliedThrustRate_Nps','r1Active','rawTauInf_Nm','VsNorm','alphaNorm','sigmaMinBeta2','betaCondition', ...
    'thrustDenominator','bodyTilt_deg','cableTilt_deg', ...
    'r1Residual','cableH','tension_N','r1Status'};
rows=cell(0,numel(col));
compCols={'t_s','variant','rawThrust_N','rawTauInf_Nm','VsNorm', ...
    'sigmaMinBeta2','v1_0','bodyTilt_deg','cableTilt_deg'};
comp=cell(0,numel(compCols));
sweepCols={'t_s','v1Test','rawThrust_N','rawTauInf_Nm', ...
    'VsNorm','alphaNorm','sigmaMinBeta2','betaCondition', ...
    'rawTauVsFrozenInf_Nm','testInterpretation'};
sweep=cell(0,numel(sweepCols));
probeCols={'t_s','caseName','candidateT_N','candidateTauY_Nm', ...
    'cbfResidual','cbfAuditStatus','nextRawThrust_N', ...
    'nextRawTauInf_Nm','nextVsNorm','nextBetaSigmaMin', ...
    'nextLoadVz_mps','nextCableH','nextTension_N','probeStatus'};
probe=cell(0,numel(probeCols));
prevAppliedThrust=NaN;

for i=0:round(0.225/opts.dt)
    t=2.125+i*opts.dt;
    a=v23HLC(x,t,sc,H,v23EstimatedMass(opts,t));
    base=min(hi,max(lo,a.raw));
    [u,msg]=v25R1ExactFilter(x,s,sc.obstacles,base);
    if ~strcmp(msg,'OK')
        v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V51_REPLAY_STOP.txt'), ...
            sprintf('t=%.9f: R1 filter status %s',t,msg));
        break;
    end
    [~,res,~,audit]=v28R1Audit(x,s,sc.obstacles,u(1));
    appliedRate=(u(1)-prevAppliedThrust)/opts.dt;
    r1Active=double(abs(u(1)-base(1))>1e-8);
    ez=a.XD(3)-x(10); ev=a.XD(7)-x(13);
    kp=H.F1(1);kd=H.F1(2);
    mTot=s.physical.massDrone+a.HLCparam(6);
    w=x(17:19);q=x(14:16);
    cableTerm=s.physical.cableLength*s.physical.massDrone ...
        *q(3)*norm(cross(w,q))^2;
    vcrit=a.XD(7)+(kp*ez+a.XD(11)+s.physical.gravity ...
         +cableTerm/mTot)/kd;
    z={t,ez,ev,x(13),vcrit,vcrit-x(13),a.vfRaw(1), ...
       kp*ez,kd*ev,a.raw(1),u(1),a.raw(1)-u(1), ...
       appliedRate,r1Active,norm(a.tau,Inf),a.vsNorm,a.alphaNorm,a.sigmaMin, ...
       a.betaCond,a.thrustDenominator,aBodyTilt(x), ...
       a.cableTilt*180/pi,res,v23CableSafety(x,sc), ...
       v23Tension(x,s,u(1)),audit};
    assert(numel(z)==numel(col),'CBF:HLCV51RowShape');
    rows(end+1,:)=z; %#ok<AGROW>

    if any(abs(t-[2.15 2.225 2.275 2.300 2.325])<1e-7)
        v={'ACTUAL','RESET_Z_ONLY','RESET_VZ_ONLY','RESET_BOTH'};
        for j=1:numel(v)
            xx=x;
            if j==2 || j==4,xx(10)=a.XD(3);end
            if j==3 || j==4,xx(13)=a.XD(7);end
            aa=v23HLC(xx,t,sc,H,v23EstimatedMass(opts,t));
            zz={t,v{j},aa.raw(1),norm(aa.tau,Inf),aa.vsNorm, ...
                aa.sigmaMin,aa.vfRaw(1),aBodyTilt(xx),aa.cableTilt*180/pi};
            assert(numel(zz)==numel(compCols),'CBF:HLCV51CounterfactualShape');
            comp(end+1,:)=zz; %#ok<AGROW>
        end
        % Algebraic v1 sweep: keep higher v1 columns fixed and recalc Vs.
        % NOT a time-consistent physical v1 trajectory or a controller.
        values=unique([linspace(-15,3,37),a.vfRaw(1), ...
            -a.XD(11)-s.physical.gravity-cableTerm/mTot]);
        for zix=1:numel(values)
            ufT=NaN;tnorm=NaN;frozenNorm=NaN;
            vsNorm=NaN;alphaNorm=NaN;sigMin=NaN;condBeta=NaN;
            interpret='SAME_STATE_V1_0_ONLY_HIGHER_COLUMNS_FROZEN';
            try
                vv=a.vfRaw;vv(1)=values(zix);
                uf=H.obj.Uf_SuspendedLoadxyDst(x,a.XD,vv,a.HLCparam);
                bb=H.obj.Beta2_SuspendedLoadxyDst(x,a.XD,vv,a.HLCparam);
                vs=H.obj.Vs_SuspendedLoadxyDst(x,a.XD,vv, ...
                      a.HLCparam,H.F2,H.F3,H.F4);
                al=H.obj.V2_alpha2_SuspendedLoadxyDst( ...
                    x,a.XD,vv,vs(:),a.HLCparam);
                alFrozen=H.obj.V2_alpha2_SuspendedLoadxyDst( ...
                    x,a.XD,vv,a.vsRaw(:),a.HLCparam);
                ufT=uf(1);vsNorm=norm(vs(:));alphaNorm=norm(al(:));
                if all(isfinite([bb(:);al(:);alFrozen(:)]))
                    sig=svd(bb);rc=rcond(bb);
                    sigMin=min(sig);condBeta=max(sig)/max(min(sig),realmin);
                    if rc>1e-14
                        tt=bb\al(:);ttFrozen=bb\alFrozen(:);
                        tnorm=norm(tt,Inf);frozenNorm=norm(ttFrozen,Inf);
                    else
                        interpret='BETA_DEGENERATE_NO_VALID_INVERSE';
                    end
                else
                    interpret='NONFINITE_GENERATED_HLC_TERMS';
                end
            catch MEsweep
                interpret=['SWEEP_EVALUATION_ERROR_' MEsweep.identifier];
            end
            rr={t,values(zix),ufT,tnorm,vsNorm,alphaNorm, ...
                sigMin,condBeta,frozenNorm,interpret};
            assert(numel(rr)==numel(sweepCols),'CBF:HLCV51SweepShape');
            sweep(end+1,:)=rr; %#ok<AGROW>
        end
        % Local causal probes: retain actual R1 constraint, test thrust
        % and 3 torque axes. NEVER classify a one-step trial as flight-safe.
        tests={'R1_EXACT',0,zeros(3,1); ...
               'T_PLUS_0P5',0.5,zeros(3,1); ...
               'T_PLUS_1',1.0,zeros(3,1); ...
               'PITCH_MINUS',0,[0;-0.2;0]; ...
               'PITCH_PLUS',0,[0;0.2;0]; ...
               'ROLL_PLUS',0,[0.2;0;0]; ...
               'YAW_PLUS',0,[0;0;0.2]; ...
               'T_PLUS_0P5_PITCH_MINUS',0.5,[0;-0.2;0]; ...
               'T_PLUS_0P5_PITCH_PLUS',0.5,[0;0.2;0]};
        for j=1:size(tests,1)
            uu=u; uu(1)=min(hi(1),u(1)+tests{j,2});
            uu(2:4)=max(lo(2:4),min(hi(2:4),u(2:4)+tests{j,3}));
            [~,rr0,~,status]=v28R1Audit(x,s,sc.obstacles,uu(1));
            nextRawT=NaN;nextRawTau=NaN;nextVs=NaN;
            nextSig=NaN;nextVz=NaN;nextH=NaN;nextTen=NaN;
            trial='PREDICTED_ONE_CYCLE_ONLY';
            try
                xp=v25StepOnce(x,uu,s,opts);
                ap=v23HLC(xp,t+opts.dt,sc,H, ...
                    v23EstimatedMass(opts,t+opts.dt));
                nextRawT=ap.raw(1);nextRawTau=norm(ap.tau,Inf);
                nextVs=ap.vsNorm;nextSig=ap.sigmaMin;nextVz=xp(13);
                nextH=v23CableSafety(xp,sc);
                nextTen=v23Tension(xp,s,uu(1));
            catch MEtrial
                trial=['PREDICTION_ERROR_' MEtrial.identifier];
            end
            if rr0 < -1e-7 || ~strcmp(status,'OK')
                trial=['CBF_CURRENT_CONSTRAINT_VIOLATION_' trial];
            end
            pp={t,tests{j,1},uu(1),uu(3),rr0,status, ...
                nextRawT,nextRawTau,nextVs,nextSig,nextVz, ...
                nextH,nextTen,trial};
            assert(numel(pp)==numel(probeCols),'CBF:HLCV51LocalShape');
            probe(end+1,:)=pp; %#ok<AGROW>
        end
    end
    if i==round(0.225/opts.dt),break;end
    prevAppliedThrust=u(1);
    x=v25StepOnce(x,u,s,opts);
end
assert(~isempty(rows),'CBF:HLCV51NoReplay','No replay samples');
writetable(cell2table(rows,'VariableNames',col), ...
    fullfile(work,'V51_R1_VERTICAL_AND_HLC_AUTHORITY.csv'));
writetable(cell2table(comp,'VariableNames',compCols), ...
    fullfile(work,'V51_SAME_STATE_Z_VZ_CAUSAL_KNOCKOUT.csv'));
writetable(cell2table(sweep,'VariableNames',sweepCols), ...
    fullfile(work,'V51_SAME_STATE_V1_BETA_ALPHA_SWEEP.csv'));
writetable(cell2table(probe,'VariableNames',probeCols), ...
    fullfile(work,'V51_R1_FEASIBILITY_AUDITED_ONE_STEP_4INPUT_MAP.csv'));
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V51_AUDIT_INTERPRETATION.txt'),strjoin({ ...
    'V51 operates on the original V19/R193 straight_single test case, 19-state nonlinear plant, dt=25 ms.'; ...
    'Every step recomputes original HLC and original R1 thrust constraint. Original CBF and HLC equations UNMODIFIED.'; ...
    'rawThrust=0 critical velocity is a STATE-DEPENDENT algebraic condition, NOT a safety/flight threshold.'; ...
    'RESET_Z / RESET_VZ change states counterfactually at same instant, not physically propagated states.'; ...
    'v1 sweep changes ONLY the zeroth v1 component, freezes five higher columns; purely algebraic, NOT a consistent virtual input trajectory.'; ...
    '4 input local probes use CURRENT feasible R1 thrust, physical input bounds, 25 ms nonlinear plant; they do NOT prove recursive feasibility or safety.'; ...
    'For comparable hypotheses, compare next RAW THRUST and all 3 RAW TORQUES, Vs, beta sigmaMin, and CBF residual. Never use raw torque limit alone as breakdown classifier.'; ...
    'No live EKF, rotor model, physical experiments, or continuous-time CBF safety proof.'},newline));
end

function angle=aBodyTilt(x)
qq=x(1:4);qq=qq(:)/norm(qq);
b3z=qq(1)^2-qq(2)^2-qq(3)^2+qq(4)^2;
angle=acos(max(-1,min(1,b3z)))*180/pi;
end

