%|V52 2026-11-17: V51 MATLAB outcome review and root-cause interpretation
%|============================================================
%|[Scope and status]
%|The uploaded CBF_HLC_ROOTCAUSE_V51_20261117_160632_228.zip contains 36 files, all 4 V51 audit CSVs plus 6-mode baseline records. The V51 R1 exact replay reaches t=2.325 s, and V51_REPLAY_STOP.txt records a shared-thrust R1 infeasibility at t=2.350 s. No V51 CAUSAL_AUDIT_ERROR.txt file present. The main HLC and R1 computation is unchanged. The V19 straight_single 19-state replay is not the usual Flight EKF + 6-jet R193 reference; mass estimator is fixed at initial 0.01 kg.
