%|========== V68 THEORY ==========
%|# V68 — R193高階仮想入力（0～5階）の数学的生成法とCBF接続条件
%|2026-11-17 / 理論整理。新しい制御入力の閉ループ成功は未実証。MATLABの元HLCは変更していない。
%|
%|## 0. 根拠となるソースと観測
%|- `R193_USED_FLIGHT_20261030_222702_252.zip` 内 `controller/@HLC_SUSPENDED_LOAD/` の `HLC_SUSPENDED_LOAD.m`、`Vfd_SuspendedLoadxyDst.m`、`Uf_SuspendedLoadxyDst.m`、`Vs_SuspendedLoadxyDst.m`、`Beta2_SuspendedLoadxyDst.m`、`V2_alpha2_SuspendedLoadxyDst.m` を確認。
%|- V67結果 `CBF_HLC_ROOTCAUSE_V67_20261117_201325_493.zip` の `V67_SOURCE_VFD_0TO5_AUDIT.csv` と `V67_ACTUAL_FIRST_DERIVATIVE_CAUSAL.csv` を確認。
%|- `Vfd` は0～5番目を生成。`Uf`/`Beta2` は0階、`Vs` は0～3階、`V2_alpha2` は0～4階の仮想入力成分を使用する。
%|- V67では実装Vfdが `F*A_d^k*e` (k=0,...,5) とほぼ機械精度で一致。一方、`F*A_c^k*e` とは一致しない。`Vfd` をそのまま連続時間微分だと仮定してCBF補正の連続時間微分を加算する方法は根拠不足。
%|- 元HLC単独の追従実績は維持する。V67の比較から元HLCの設計ミスを断定しない。
%|
%|## 1. 公称連続時間の数学的定義
%|鉛直位置・速度誤差 `e=[z_d-z_L; dz_d-dz_L]`, `F=[k_p,k_d]`、鉛直仮想入力 `v_n=F e` とする。鉛直加速度が**理想的に** `ddz_L=ddz_d+v_n` と一致するとき
%|
%|    de/dt = A_c e,
%|    A_c = [0 1; -k_p -k_d].
%|
%|この条件の下でのみ `v_n^(k)=F A_c^k e` (k=0,...,5) が連続時間の公称導関数となる。これは元のVfdの置換を直ちに正当化しない。
%|
%|R193の生成式と一致する離散誤差行列は
%|
%|    A_d = [1-k_p*h^2/2, h-k_d*h^2/2; -k_p*h,1-k_d*h].
%|    Vfd(k+1)= F A_d^k e (k=0,...,5).
%|
%|`A_d^k` は予測されたサンプル値を与える作用であり、連続時間微分の作用 `A_c^k` ではない。`(A_d-I)^k/h^k` なら前進差分であり、これも一般に連続時間の厳密導関数とは異なる。
%|
%|## 2. CBF介入中の **正しい** 高階仮想入力（理想的な鉛直線形化系）
%|CBFの効果を鉛直加速度相当の滑らかな補正 `delta(t)` と表し、
%|
%|    ddz_L = ddz_d + F e + delta,
%|    de/dt = A_c e - B delta,
%|    B = [0;1],
%|    v_c(t) = F e(t) + delta(t).
%|
%|とする。このとき delta がC^5で、理想鉛直モデルが実現されていれば、0～5階は
%|
%|    q_0 = e,
%|    J_k = F q_k + delta^(k),                   k = 0,...,5,
%|    q_(k+1) = A_c q_k - B delta^(k),           k = 0,...,4.
%|
%|という再帰式で**正確に**作れる。等価な閉形式は
%|
%|    J_0 = F e + delta,
%|    J_k = F A_c^k e
%|          - sum_{j=0}^{k-1} F A_c^(k-1-j) B delta^(j)
%|          + delta^(k),                         k = 1,...,5.
%|
%|例えば
%|
%|    J_1 = F A_c e - F B delta + delta_dot,
%|    J_2 = F A_c^2 e - F A_c B delta - F B delta_dot + delta_ddot.
%|
%|これまでの `F A_c^k e + delta^(k)` だけでは **CBF介入で e の時間発展が変化する効果** が欠落する。これは前後の軌道を同一の微分体系で扱うための必要な補正である。再帰と閉形式の一致はk=0,...,5についてSymPyで恒等式（全差0）として確認。
%|
%|## 3. 実プラント（モデル誤差、トルク変更、推定誤差）へ拡張するとき
%|指令した加速度に対する実加速度の残差 `rho(t)` を
%|
%|    ddz_L = ddz_d + F e + delta + rho
%|
%|で定義すれば
%|
%|    de/dt = A_c e - B(delta+rho)
%|
%|となる。そこで実軌道上の0～5階は
%|
%|    q_0 = e,
%|    J_k = F q_k + delta^(k),
%|    q_(k+1) = A_c q_k - B[delta^(k)+rho^(k)]
%|
%|である。閉形式では `delta^(j)` による誤差ダイナミクスの寄与に加え `rho^(j)` の寄与が現れる（ただし最後の +delta^(k) は維持）。
%|
%|**重要**：rhoやその高階導関数を勝手にゼロ固定しない。もし補正を「実現加速度そのもの」と定義するならrho=0と置けるが、その場合delta自体が実入力と状態を通じて決まり、deltaの高階導関数は未知の入力微分に依存する。両者を都合よく混用しない。
%|
%|「CBFなしで設計したnominal jet」と「CBFで変化した実プラント上の jet」は別物。後者を全て正確に求めるには、入力が十分な滑らかさを持ち、参照・運動方程式・実入力微分が定まっている必要がある。
%|
%|## 4. 推力との高階対応：元のUfからの厳密な恒等式
%|元の推力生成式は
%|
%|    D(x) T = M[ v_c + ddz_d + g ] + C(x),  M = m+m_L,
%|
%|と書ける（Mは定数として微分）。`C(x)` は元ソースのケーブル角運動補償項、`D(x)` は幾何学的分母である。この等式を時間微分すれば、k>=1について
%|
%|    D T^(k)
%|      = M[ J_k + z_d^(k+2) ] + C^(k)
%|        - sum_{j=1}^{k} binom(k,j) D^(j) T^(k-j).
%|
%|従って
%|
%|    T^(k) = { M[J_k+z_d^(k+2)] + C^(k)
%|               - sum_{j=1}^{k} binom(k,j) D^(j) T^(k-j) }/D,
%|
%|ただし `D≠0` と十分な滑らかさが必要。`k=0` のみ重力定数を加えた元式を使う。機体姿勢やケーブル方向が変わるので `D^(j)` と `C^(j)` を落とせない。**全てのTの導関数をゼロに置くことはできない。**
%|
%|元HLCの逆変換に直接現れるJ_0,...,J_4なら、最上位の推力微分はこの形式ではT^(4)、参照微分はz_d^(6)まで。生成されるJ_5も微分整合性のために保存するが、J_5を経由してT^(5)まで計算する場合は参照z_d^(7)など追加の定義が必要（現在の参照入力範囲0～6とは別）。
%|
%|同一状態でT_HLCとT_CBFの差を鉛直加速度補正へ変換する式は
%|
%|    delta = D(x) [T_CBF - T_HLC(x,t)] / M
%|
%|である（この等式は完全一致の元モデル内で成立）。deltaの微分にはDの微分と、`T_HLC(x(t),t)` の全時間微分が入る。**25 ms差分でCBFが出したTの差だけを微分したものは、一般にはdeltaの正しい微分ではない。**
%|
%|## 5. HLCの水平・ヨー層との接続
%|- `Vs`：同じJ_0,...,J_3を使い、v_2,v_3,v_4を計算する。
%|- `Beta2`：同じJ_0を使う。
%|- `V2_alpha2`：同じJ_0,...,J_4とv_2,v_3,v_4を使う。
%|- 三軸トルクは `Beta2(x,J_0)*tau = V2_alpha2(x,ref,J_0..J_4,v_234)` を満たす。変数を独立の補正後数列とせず、全て同じ微分再帰から得たJを渡す。
%|- 元のHLCには5階を生成するコードがあるが、列6は現在の実入力逆変換では直接参照されない。5階の存在を理由に無条件で実入力を5階微分する、あるいは5階を捨てる、のいずれも正当化できない。
%|- 正則性と物理実現可能性は別途必要。`Beta2` が正則でも、右辺が大きければトルクは過大になりうる。
%|
%|## 6. 後付け補正を避けるための正しい入力決定構造（方式選定前の共通必要条件）
%|deltaの時間関数を「計算済みTの後付け差分」から生成してはいけない。例えば内部状態 `d_0..d_5` を設定し
%|
%|    dot(d_0)=d_1,...,dot(d_4)=d_5, dot(d_5)=w
%|
%|をモデルへ含めることで、`d_k=delta^(k)` を連続に定義できる。これは**共通条件の表現例**であり、動的拡張CBF採用の確定ではない。別手法でも同じ整合関係を満たせばよい。
%|
%|そのとき `J` は上記の真の再帰で評価し、`
%| T=Uf(x,J), tau` と `Beta2*tau=...`, 物理入力 `0<=T<=20`, `|tau_j|<=1`, および各障害物の真の高階CBF補助集合と不等式を、**入力決定の前に同一問題内で**確認する。全ての制約が満たせないときは「不可行」と判断し、限界を隠すために生推力や未定義の推力微分をゼロにしない。
%|
%|`d_0=0` だからといって `d_1,...,d_5=0`とは限らない。補正の介入/解除時には高階境界条件も必要。1サンプルで大きなdeltaを完成させることは高階入力を増大させ得るため、CBF自身が時間的実現可能性を考慮して安全入力を決定する必要がある。
%|
%|## 7. 推力急減は高階微分の定義とは別の因果効果
%|`N=M(F e+ddz_d+g)+C` としたとき
%|
%|    dot(N) = M[ k_p*(dz_d-dz_L) + k_d*(ddz_d-ddz_L) + z_d^(3) ] + dot(C).
%|
%|同じx,tで別の実入力を適用する二つのケースの差は
%|
%|    Delta dot(N) = -M*k_d*Delta(ddz_L) + Delta dot(C).
%|
%|V65ではCBF側がHLC側より約246.91 N/sだけNを減少させる方向で、主因は速度フィードバックの加速度依存。高階ジェットを正しく作っても、この閉ループの力学的競合が自動的に消えるわけではない。人工的な生推力の下限は現段階で追加しない。
%|
%|## 8. 実装前に必ず行うべき検証と停止判定
%|1. **Vfdの数学的意味**：元の離散的な値列を無条件で連続時間微分とみなさない。元の導出（generateの記号計算）からどの信号が要求されるかを確認する。元HLCを事前に書き換えない。
%|2. **数学的恒等式**：与えた滑らかなdelta(t)で、J_k再帰と閉形式がk=0..5で一致すること。単位一致を確認。
%|3. **物理微分との照合**：同じ状態・4入力・参照について、実プラントの1階Lie微分とJ_1を比較。理想残差rhoが非ゼロなら、2～5階を理想で代用したことを明示し、rho導関数を数式から導出するまで実機での厳密整合とは呼ばない。
%|4. **高階逆変換**：J_0..J_4を用いて `Vs/Beta2/V2_alpha2` を同時再評価し、等式残差、Beta2特異値、トルク生値と物理上限を記録する。J_5は次周期の整合確認にも使う。
%|5. **CBFの成立**：安全関数ごとの入力作用・相対次数を実プラントで導出する。4階と決めつけない。全階の補助集合と物理実入力制限の同時可行性を確かめる。
%|6. **復帰・停留**：介入停止時のdeltaと全高階導関数、元HLCへの復帰時の生推力・生トルクを検証。位置・速度・加速度誤差の持続の影響を区別する。
%|
%|**未完了**：R193の本来のsymbolic導出ファイルはR193_USED_FLIGHTのフライト用ZIPには見つかっていないため、各生成関数の`dV1`がどの厳密な導出から来たかの原資料照合は未完了。MATLABでの新しい閉ループ改善実証は実施していない。V68は高階ジェットの理論生成を確定する段階である。
%|
%|========== V69 GENERATOR AND TEST ==========
%|# V69 — 高階微分の生成を独立に確定する試験
%|
%|## 対象と非対象
%|- 対象：鉛直仮想入力の0～5階成分を**数学的に**構成する方法と、R193既存Vfdの意味の分離。
%|- 非対象：推力の上下限・動的拡張の採否、CBF制約、実際の4入力、HLC式・ゲイン変更、閉ループでの回避・安定化。
%|- 入力は数学的テスト用の既知の滑らかな補正 `δ` と、必要なら非ゼロの実現残差 `ρ`。現実の未観測 `ρ` がゼロと決まったわけではない。
%|
%|## R193の実ソースに対応する式
%|`Vfd_SuspendedLoadxyDst.m` は、`e=[zd-zL; vzd-vzL]`, `F=[kp,kd]`, サンプリング幅 `h` に対し、
%|
%|    Ad = [1 - kp*h^2/2, h - kd*h^2/2;
%|          -kp*h,         1 - kd*h ];
%|    Vfd(k+1) = F*Ad^k*e,  k=0,...,5
%|
%|を計算する。V67で生成関数と機械精度の一致を確認。これは `k` 階の導関数ではなく **k回後の公称予測値**。
%|`Vs` / `V2_alpha2` はこれらを `dV1`, `d2V1` 等の変数名で使用しているが、生成元の記号導出との厳密な整合性は依然未確定。
%|
%|## A. 真の連続時間0～5階微分（モデル条件付き）
%|定義を `v=F e + δ`、実現加速度差を `ρ` とすると、
%|
%|    e_dot = Ac*e - B*(δ + ρ),
%|    Ac = [0 1; -kp -kd], B=[0;1].
%|
%|補正 `δ` と残差 `ρ` に必要な階数の時間微分が存在するなら、
%|
%|    q0=e,
%|    Jk=F*qk+δ^(k),
%|    q(k+1)=Ac*qk-B*(δ^(k)+ρ^(k)),   k=0,...,4.
%|
%|得られた `J0...J5` は **実際にこの誤差力学が成立する場合に限り** `v^(0)...v^(5)` である。
%|等価な閉形式：
%|
%|    Jk=F*Ac^k*e+δ^(k)
%|       -sum_{j=0}^{k-1} F*Ac^(k-1-j)*B*(δ^(j)+ρ^(j)).
%|
%|`ρ` を物理プラントで評価せずゼロ固定して現実の厳密微分と呼ばない。
%|
%|## B. R193の離散Vfdと同じ表現で補正を含めるとき
%|R193ソースの離散近似に対し、サンプルごとに与えた `δ_j, ρ_j` に対して、
%|
%|    Bd=[h^2/2;h],
%|    e(j+1)=Ad*e(j)-Bd*(δ_j+ρ_j),
%|    Vk=F*e(k)+δ_k.
%|
%|明示的な式は
%|
%|    Vk=F*Ad^k*e(0)+δ_k
%|       -sum_{j=0}^{k-1} F*Ad^(k-1-j)*Bd*(δ_j+ρ_j).
%|
%|これは `Vk` が**サンプル時刻の加速度指令値**であることを意味する。`Vk` を `v^(k)` と呼んではならない。
%|`Bd` はR193の位置テイラー・速度オイラー型の離散化に整合する補正であり、連続線形系の厳密ZOH行列ではない。
%|
%|## 単位・混用禁止
%|- 連続微分 `Jk` の単位は m/s^(2+k)。
%|- 離散列 `Vk` の単位は kに依らず m/s^2。
%|- `v1+Δv1` だけを差し替えたり、元の `Vfd` に連続時間の高階微分だけを直接加算しても、一貫した導関数列・離散列とは限らない。
%|- 0～5階を並べることは必要な形式の一例だが、実際の4入力HLCとCBFへの接続は、生成側と受取側の数学的意味を統一してから行う。
%|
%|## 検証コード
%|`test_CBF_HLC_RootCause.m` はV69でデフォルトで**高階生成のみ**実行。先行するV67機能を消していないが、V69では飛行・HLC・CBFのシミュレーションは行わない。
%|
%|`clear test_CBF_HLC_RootCause; rehash; result=test_CBF_HLC_RootCause(); disp(result.status); disp(result.zipPath);`
%|
%|`common_matlab/_CBF_TEST_OUTPUT` に結果ZIPだけを残す。V69の結果ZIPに再帰式と閉形式の誤差テーブルと理論整理を同梱。元の `V67` モードを明示的に呼ぶ場合は `struct('v69JetOnly',false)` を指定する。
%|
%|## 判定限界
%|この試験が通れば「宣言した連続・離散の数式に従う0～5階生成器」は構成できる。ただし、実19状態プラントの2～5階Lie微分、元のSymbolic Math Toolbox生成元、4入力CBFの可行性や実飛行が確認されたことにはならない。これらは次の独立した段階。
% V69_FULL_HISTORY_END


% ========================================================================
% V70: source-grounded 19-state Taylor AD along actual R193 flight model.
% Sources: R193 /model/substance/with_load_model_euler_for_HL.m
% and @HLC_SUSPENDED_LOAD/HLC_SUSPENDED_LOAD.m (controller estimator x).
% Physical: x=[q4;omegaB3;pL3;vL3;pT3;omegaL3].
% u=[T;tau3]. k=0..5 of v1=kp*(zd-zL)+kd*(vzd-vL).
% High derivatives are conditional on KNOWN input command jets. They are
% not determined by an instantaneous state x and u0 alone.
% ========================================================================
function result=v70ActualPlantJetOnly(opts)
    root=fileparts(mfilename('fullpath'));
    if exist('test_CBF_SetupPaths','file')==2, test_CBF_SetupPaths(); end
    needed={'CBF_V19_Scenarios','with_load_model_euler_for_HL','lqrd'};
    for i=1:numel(needed)
        if exist(needed{i},'file')==0
            error('CBF:V70MissingSource','Required installed R193 source missing: %s',needed{i});
        end
    end
    if exist('HLC_SUSPENDED_LOAD','class')~=8
        error('CBF:V70HLCMissing','R193 HLC_SUSPENDED_LOAD class missing');
    end
    sc=CBF_V19_Scenarios('straight_single','R193');
    sc.dt=0.025;s=sc.settings;
    H=v23MakeHLC(s,sc.dt);
    mHat=0.01; % original R193 initial EKF mass, NOT measured live EKF!
    if isfield(opts,'v70MassEstimate')
        mHat=opts.v70MassEstimate;
    end
    assert(isscalar(mHat)&&isfinite(mHat)&&mHat>0,'CBF:V70MassEstimate');
    x=sc.x0(:);
    assert(numel(x)==19 && all(isfinite(x)),'CBF:V70x19');
    cases=[0 0.5 2.125];
    rowList=cell(0,14); sourceRows=cell(0,8); supportRows=cell(0,9);
    sampleRows=cell(0,15); validationRows=cell(0,8);
    worstSource=0;worstFirst=0;worstTaylor=0;
    tNow=0;
    lo=[s.input.thrustMin;s.input.torqueMin(:)];
    hi=[s.input.thrustMax;s.input.torqueMax(:)];
    for ci=1:numel(cases)
        tc=cases(ci);
        while tNow<tc-1e-10
            a=v23HLC(x,tNow,sc,H,mHat);
            u=min(hi,max(lo,a.raw(:))); % actual applied command in THIS simulation
            x=v70Step(x,u,s,sc.dt,4);
            tNow=tNow+sc.dt;
        end
        a=v23HLC(x,tc,sc,H,mHat);
        u=min(hi,max(lo,a.raw(:)));
        dx=v70RHS19(x,u,s);
        % Independently compare vector field to full 24-state symbolic
        % R193 source, mapped using physically available 19-state values.
        d24=v70Source24(x,u,s);
        dFrom24=[dx(1:4);d24(10:12);d24(13:15);d24(16:18); ...
            d24(19:21);d24(22:24)];
        err=max(abs(dx-dFrom24));
        worstSource=max(worstSource,err);
        sourceRows(end+1,:)={tc,'SIMULATED_ESTIMATOR_LAYOUT_19', ...
            err,norm(x(1:4))-1,norm(x(14:16))-1, ...
            x(14:16)'*x(17:19),u(1),norm(u(2:4),Inf)};
        if ~isfinite(err) || err>5e-9
            error('CBF:V70PlantMismatch', ...
                'Reduced 19-state formula disagrees with R193 source24: %.9g at t=%.3f',err,tc);
        end
        % This simulation explicitly executes a ZOH command for each 25ms
        % interval. Only INSIDE that OPEN INTERVAL are derivatives >=1 zero.
        U=zeros(4,5);U(:,1)=u(:);
        [J,X]=v70PhysicalJet(x,U,s,sc,tc,H.F1);
        ref0=sc.ref(tc,0);ref1=sc.ref(tc,1);ref2=sc.ref(tc,2);
        J0=H.F1(1)*(ref0(3)-x(10))+H.F1(2)*(ref1(3)-x(13));
        J1=H.F1(1)*(ref1(3)-x(13))+ ...
           H.F1(2)*(ref2(3)-dx(13));
        firstErr=max(abs([J(1)-J0,J(2)-J1]));
        worstFirst=max(worstFirst,firstErr);
        if firstErr>1e-8
            error('CBF:V70FirstDerivative','Physical 0-1 derivative failed');
        end
        for k=0:5
            avail='NOT_DETERMINED_FROM_INSTANT_X_U';
            if k==0,avail='ESTIMATED_STATE_AND_REFERENCE';end
            if k==1,avail='STATE_REFERENCE_AND_ACTUAL_T_MODEL';end
            rowList(end+1,:)={tc,'ZOH_APPLIED_COMMAND_INSIDE_HOLD',k, ...
                J(k+1),avail,u(1),u(2),u(3),u(4), ...
                X(13,k+1)*factorial(k),norm(x(14:16)), ...
                norm(x(17:19)),mHat,s.physical.massLoad};
            % The following entries are separate from the conditional ZOH jet.
            if k<2, instantaneous=J(k+1);else, instantaneous=NaN;end
            sampleRows(end+1,:)={tc,k,instantaneous,J(k+1), ...
                k<2,'ACTUAL_T_UNVERIFIED_ON_HARDWARE', ...
                'ZOH_COMMAND_ONLY__NO_MOTOR_DYNAMICS', ...
                u(1),u(2),u(3),u(4),J0,J1,x(10),x(13)};
        end
        % Independent low-order causality: same measured state and same
        % applied present value, different admissible future commands.
        % This is an IDENTIFIABILITY COUNTEREXAMPLE, not flight input.
        for j=1:4
            for d=1:4
                W=U;W(j,d+1)=1; % perturb known hypothetical d-th input derivative
                [K,~]=v70PhysicalJet(x,W,s,sc,tc,H.F1);
                for k=0:5
                    supportRows(end+1,:)={tc,j,d,k,K(k+1)-J(k+1), ...
                      abs(K(k+1)-J(k+1))>1e-8, ...
                      'SAME_X_AND_U0_TWO_POSSIBLE_INPUT_LAWS', ...
                      'NO_PHYSICAL_INPUT_DERIVATIVE_WAS_ASSUMED',1};
                end
            end
        end
        % Test Taylor ODE coefficients against independent source-model
        % numerical integration over one short constant-input interval.
        for h=[0.001 0.002 0.004]
            xn=v70Step(x,u,s,h,12);
            % This reference is provided by the source at actual future t.
            refPos=sc.ref(tc+h,0);refVel=sc.ref(tc+h,1);
            vActual=H.F1(1)*(refPos(3)-xn(10))+ ...
                    H.F1(2)*(refVel(3)-xn(13));
            approx=0;
            for k=0:5,approx=approx+J(k+1)*h^k/factorial(k);end
            ev=abs(vActual-approx);
            worstTaylor=max(worstTaylor,ev);
            validationRows(end+1,:)={tc,h,vActual,approx,ev, ...
                norm(xn(14:16))-1,norm(xn(1:4))-1, ...
                'ZOH_SOURCE_MODEL_RK4_VS_5TH_TAYLOR'};
        end
    end
    outdir=fullfile(root,'_CBF_TEST_OUTPUT');
    if exist(outdir,'dir')~=7,mkdir(outdir);end
    work=tempname;mkdir(work); tidy=onCleanup(@()v69Cleanup(work)); %#ok<NASGU>
    writetable(cell2table(rowList,'VariableNames', ...
        {'time_s','assumedInputTimeLaw','order','continuousJet', ...
         'instantInformationProvenance','appliedT_N','tau1_Nm', ...
         'tau2_Nm','tau3_Nm','loadVzDerivative_k','pTNorm', ...
         'cableOmegaNorm','HLCMassEstimate_kg','plantMass_kg'}), ...
        fullfile(work,'V70_ACTUAL_PLANT_C0_C5_JETS.csv'));
    writetable(cell2table(sourceRows,'VariableNames', ...
        {'time_s','stateSource','max19vs24DerivativeError', ...
        'quaternionNormError','cableDirectionNormError', ...
        'cableTangencyDot','appliedThrust_N','appliedTorqueInf_Nm'}), ...
        fullfile(work,'V70_R193_SOURCE24_MATCH.csv'));
    writetable(cell2table(sampleRows,'VariableNames', ...
        {'time_s','order','instantOnlyValue_NaNIfUnknown', ...
        'ZOHConditionalValue','instantResolvableFromStateAndAppliedInput', ...
        'hardwareThrustAvailability','ZOHProvenance', ...
        'appliedThrust_N','tauX_Nm','tauY_Nm','tauZ_Nm', ...
        'v1FromStates','v1DotFromPlant','loadZ_m','loadVz_mps'}), ...
        fullfile(work,'V70_REALTIME_AVAILABILITY_AUDIT.csv'));
    writetable(cell2table(supportRows,'VariableNames', ...
        {'time_s','inputChannel_1Thrust_2to4Torque','inputDerivativeOrder', ...
        'jetOrder','differenceSameStateSameU0','differentAtNumericalThreshold', ...
        'counterexampleNature','unknownInputDerivativePolicy','testPerturbationUnit'}), ...
        fullfile(work,'V70_INPUT_JET_IDENTIFIABILITY.csv'));
    writetable(cell2table(validationRows,'VariableNames', ...
        {'time_s','h_s','integratedStateRealV1','fifthTaylorV1','absError', ...
        'cableDirectionNormError','quaternionNormError','testMeaning'}), ...
        fullfile(work,'V70_TAYLOR_VS_SOURCE_INTEGRATION.csv'));
    theory=v70TheoryText(worstSource,worstFirst,worstTaylor,mHat);
    v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V70_THEORY_AND_LIMITATIONS.txt'),theory);
    v69WriteEmbeddedHistory(fullfile(work,'V70_FULL_UPDATED_HANDOVER.txt'));
    fid=fopen(fullfile(work,'V70_FULL_UPDATED_HANDOVER.txt'),'a','n','UTF-8');
    if fid<0,error('CBF:V70HistoryWrite','Cannot append handover');end
    fprintf(fid,'\n\n==================== V70 NEW CHAPTER ====================\n%s\n',theory);
    fclose(fid);
    ok=worstSource<5e-9 && worstFirst<1e-8 && ...
        isfinite(worstTaylor) && worstTaylor<1e-3;
    if ok
        status='PASS_R193_SOURCE_MATCH_AND_CONDITIONAL_ZOH_C0_C5__NOT_HARDWARE_OR_CBF_CERTIFICATION';
    else
        status='FAIL_V70_SOURCE_OR_DERIVATIVE_CONSISTENCY';
    end
    stamp=datestr(now,'yyyymmdd_HHMMSS_FFF');
    zipPath=fullfile(outdir,['CBF_HLC_JET_V70_' stamp '.zip']);
    zip(zipPath,{'V70_ACTUAL_PLANT_C0_C5_JETS.csv', ...
        'V70_R193_SOURCE24_MATCH.csv', ...
        'V70_REALTIME_AVAILABILITY_AUDIT.csv', ...
        'V70_INPUT_JET_IDENTIFIABILITY.csv', ...
        'V70_TAYLOR_VS_SOURCE_INTEGRATION.csv', ...
        'V70_THEORY_AND_LIMITATIONS.txt','V70_FULL_UPDATED_HANDOVER.txt'},work);
    if exist(zipPath,'file')~=2,error('CBF:V70NoZip');end
    result=struct('status',status,'zipPath',zipPath, ...
        'nCases',numel(cases),'nRuntimeErrors',0,'nFailedCases',double(~ok), ...
        'nR1FilterStops',0,'maxSource24RHSerror',worstSource, ...
        'maxFirstDerivativeError',worstFirst,'maxTaylorError',worstTaylor);
end

function d=v70RHS19(x,u,s)
    x=x(:);u=u(:);
    m=s.physical.massDrone;ml=s.physical.massLoad;
    L=s.physical.cableLength;g=s.physical.gravity;
    J=s.physical.inertia(:);
    assert(numel(x)==19 && numel(u)==4 && numel(J)==3);
    q=x(1:4);w=x(5:7);p=x(14:16);wl=x(17:19);
    b3=[2*(q(2)*q(4)+q(1)*q(3)); ...
        2*(q(3)*q(4)-q(1)*q(2)); ...
        q(1)^2-q(2)^2-q(3)^2+q(4)^2];
    qc=[-q(2:4)'*w;q(1)*w+cross(q(2:4),w)]*0.5;
    wdot=(u(2:4)-cross(w,J.*w))./J;
    cp=cross(wl,p);
    radial=(u(1)*dot(p,b3)-m*L*dot(cp,cp))/(m+ml);
    d=[qc;wdot;x(11:13);-g*[0;0;1]+radial*p; ...
        cp;-(u(1)/(m*L))*cross(p,b3)];
end

function d=v70Source24(x,u,s)
    % Independent generated original 24-state Euler source evaluator.
    q=x(1:4);p=x(14:16);wl=x(17:19);
    L=s.physical.cableLength;
    sinp=2*(q(1)*q(3)-q(4)*q(2));
    if abs(sinp)>=0.995
        error('CBF:V70EulerChart','Euler comparison near pitch singularity');
    end
    pitch=asin(sinp);
    roll=atan2(2*(q(1)*q(2)+q(3)*q(4)), ...
        1-2*(q(2)^2+q(3)^2));
    yaw=atan2(2*(q(1)*q(4)+q(2)*q(3)), ...
        1-2*(q(3)^2+q(4)^2));
    pDrone=x(8:10)-L*p;
    vDrone=x(11:13)-L*cross(wl,p);
    x24=[pDrone;roll;pitch;yaw;vDrone;x(5:7); ...
        x(8:10);x(11:13);p;wl];
    param=zeros(1,24); % generated model reads in3(:,index), row-shaped
    param(1)=s.physical.massDrone;
    param(6:8)=s.physical.inertia(:);
    param(9)=s.physical.gravity;
    param(20)=s.physical.massLoad;
    param(21)=L;
    d=with_load_model_euler_for_HL(x24,u(:),param);
    d=d(:);
    assert(numel(d)==24&&all(isfinite(d)),'CBF:V70SourceOutput');
end

function x=v70Step(x,u,s,h,n)
    dt=h/n;
    for j=1:n
        a=v70RHS19(x,u,s);b=v70RHS19(x+0.5*dt*a,u,s);
        c=v70RHS19(x+0.5*dt*b,u,s);
        d=v70RHS19(x+dt*c,u,s);
        x=x+(dt/6)*(a+2*b+2*c+d);
    end
end

function [J,X]=v70PhysicalJet(x,Uderiv,s,sc,t,F)
    % Taylor-mode automatic differentiation of the genuine R193 19 RHS.
    % Uderiv(:,k+1) = d^k u/dt^k, k=0..4, explicitly supplied.
    % For a known ZOH command: all k>=1 are zero ONLY on its open hold interval.
    if ~isequal(size(Uderiv),[4,5]) || ~all(isfinite(Uderiv(:)))
        error('CBF:V70UnknownInputJets', ...
            '0..5 physical derivatives require known input derivatives 0..4');
    end
    N=6;X=zeros(19,N); X(:,1)=x(:);
    U=zeros(4,N);
    for k=0:4,U(:,k+1)=Uderiv(:,k+1)/factorial(k);end
    for k=0:4
        DX=v70JetRHS(X,U,s);
        X(:,k+2)=DX(:,k+1)/(k+1);
    end
    J=zeros(1,N);
    for k=0:5
        r0=sc.ref(t,k);r1=sc.ref(t,k+1);
        if any(~isfinite([r0(:);r1(:)]))
            error('CBF:V70ReferenceJet','Reference jet 0..6 unavailable');
        end
        zL=factorial(k)*X(10,k+1);
        vzL=factorial(k)*X(13,k+1);
        J(k+1)=F(1)*(r0(3)-zL)+F(2)*(r1(3)-vzL);
    end
end

function D=v70JetRHS(X,U,s)
    N=size(X,2);D=zeros(19,N);
    q=X(1:4,:);w=X(5:7,:);p=X(14:16,:);wl=X(17:19,:);
    q0=q(1,:);qx=q(2,:);qy=q(3,:);qz=q(4,:);
    b3=[2*(v70Mul(qx,qz)+v70Mul(q0,qy)); ...
        2*(v70Mul(qy,qz)-v70Mul(q0,qx)); ...
        v70Mul(q0,q0)-v70Mul(qx,qx)-v70Mul(qy,qy)+v70Mul(qz,qz)];
    D(1,:)=-0.5*v70Dot(q(2:4,:),w);
    D(2:4,:)=0.5*(v70Scale(w,q0)+v70Cross(q(2:4,:),w));
    JJ=s.physical.inertia(:);
    D(5:7,:)=(U(2:4,:)-v70Cross(w,JJ.*w))./JJ;
    D(8:10,:)=X(11:13,:);
    cableVel=v70Cross(wl,p);
    num=v70Mul(U(1,:),v70Dot(p,b3)) ...
       -s.physical.massDrone*s.physical.cableLength*v70Dot(cableVel,cableVel);
    rad=num/(s.physical.massDrone+s.physical.massLoad);
    D(11:13,:)=v70Scale(p,rad);
    D(13,1)=D(13,1)-s.physical.gravity;
    D(14:16,:)=cableVel;
    D(17:19,:)=-(1/(s.physical.massDrone*s.physical.cableLength))* ...
           v70Scale(v70Cross(p,b3),U(1,:));
end

function out=v70Mul(a,b)
    a=a(:).';b=b(:).';N=numel(a);
    assert(numel(b)==N,'CBF:V70JetMulShape');
    out=zeros(1,N);
    for k=0:N-1
        for j=0:k,out(k+1)=out(k+1)+a(j+1)*b(k-j+1);end
    end
end
function out=v70Scale(v,a)
    out=zeros(size(v));
    for k=1:size(v,1),out(k,:)=v70Mul(v(k,:),a);end
end
function out=v70Dot(a,b)
    out=zeros(1,size(a,2));
    for k=1:size(a,1),out=out+v70Mul(a(k,:),b(k,:));end
end
function out=v70Cross(a,b)
    out=[v70Mul(a(2,:),b(3,:))-v70Mul(a(3,:),b(2,:)); ...
         v70Mul(a(3,:),b(1,:))-v70Mul(a(1,:),b(3,:)); ...
         v70Mul(a(1,:),b(2,:))-v70Mul(a(2,:),b(1,:))];
end

function textBody=v70TheoryText(e24,e01,eTaylor,mhat)
    textBody=sprintf([ ...
      'V70 2026-11-17: physical 19-state Taylor-jet generator and source audit\n' ...
      'SOURCE: R193_USED_FLIGHT_20261030_222702_252.zip, exact MATLAB generated\n' ...
      '  model/substance/with_load_model_euler_for_HL.m (24 states).\n' ...
      '  @HLC_SUSPENDED_LOAD/HLC_SUSPENDED_LOAD.m maps estimator to x19.\n' ...
      'x19=[quaternion4;bodyOmega3;loadPosition3;loadVelocity3;cableDirection3;cableOmega3].\n' ...
      'These x19 components are available to the HLC as estimated states;\n' ...
      '  this test uses simulated such states, NOT uploaded hardware EKF logs.\n' ...
      'Plant params are model source values; mL of the simulator is not asserted\n' ...
      '  to be directly known on real hardware. Historical HLC mL estimate=%.9g kg.\n' ...
      'Exact compact vector field, source-matched at tested x,u:\n' ...
      '  R(q)e3=b3, cp=omegaL cross pT.\n' ...
      '  qdot=0.5*q multiply [0,omegaB].\n' ...
      '  omegaBdot=J^{-1}*(tau-omegaB cross J*omegaB).\n' ...
      '  pLdot=vL; vLdot=-g*e3 + pT*(T*(pT dot b3) - m*L*norm(cp)^2)/(m+mL).\n' ...
      '  pTdot=omegaL cross pT; omegaLdot=-T/(m*L)*(pT cross b3).\n' ...
      'Taylor automatic differentiation (no fifth numerical difference):\n' ...
      '  x(t+h)=sum_{k=0..5} x[k]*h^k, x[0]=CURRENT ESTIMATED STATE.\n' ...
      '  u[k]=u^(k)/k! must be KNOWN or DECLARED by a verified signal law.\n' ...
      '  x[k+1]=coefficient_k(f(x_series,u_series))/(k+1).\n' ...
      '  v1^(k)=kp*(zd^(k)-zL^(k))+kd*(zd^(k+1)-vL^(k)); k=0..5.\n' ...
      '  Source reference must provide derivatives zd^(0..6).\n' ...
      'Instantaneous x plus CURRENT physically applied T determines v1^(0..1)\n' ...
      '  within the known 19-state model. Higher orders are NOT identifiable\n' ...
      '  without derivative information for u or a known physical input law.\n' ...
      '  Actual motor thrust may differ from the commanded thrust; the test\n' ...
      '  assumes exact commanded input in the R193 ideal simulation only.\n' ...
      'ZOH zero derivatives are NOT artificial choices: they are conditional\n' ...
      '  on the documented 25ms simulator input hold for t within an open interval.\n' ...
      '  At switching times, two-sided high derivatives may not exist.\n' ...
      '  Any unmeasured real thrust rate or torque rate is NOT set to zero.\n' ...
      'Input-derivative counterexamples are hypotheticals to demonstrate\n' ...
      '  non-identifiability and are NEVER applied as physical flight inputs.\n' ...
      'Inputs and states are current estimates/commands only: NO prediction,\n' ...
      '  no extra hypothetical full-state observer, no CBF actuation claims.\n' ...
      'Simulation uses unchanged R193 HLC, original gains and bounds;\n' ...
      '  high-order jets only observed, never fed into HLC.\n' ...
      'Results source match: %.9g, first derivative: %.9g, Taylor/RK4: %.9g.\n' ...
      'Previous V69 proves model-conditional algebra, V67 proves Vfd is discrete.\n' ...
      'V70 proves neither input-jet real-time availability on hardware nor\n' ...
      '  a certified fifth-order CBF or closed-loop safety.\n' ...
      'HANDOVER: full previous V69 embedded history plus this new chapter.\n'], ...
      mhat,e24,e01,eTaylor);
end


function result=v70ErrorArtifact(ME)
    % A diagnosis ZIP must be produced even when this independent source
    % audit fails. Do not convert a failing validation into a PASS.
    root=fileparts(mfilename('fullpath'));
    outdir=fullfile(root,'_CBF_TEST_OUTPUT');
    if exist(outdir,'dir')~=7,mkdir(outdir);end
    work=tempname;mkdir(work);clean=onCleanup(@()v69Cleanup(work)); %#ok<NASGU>
    report=getReport(ME,'extended','hyperlinks','off');
    v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V70_RUNTIME_ERROR_DETAILS.txt'),report);
    try
        v69WriteEmbeddedHistory(fullfile(work,'V70_FULL_UPDATED_HANDOVER.txt'));
    catch EH
        v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V70_HISTORY_ERROR.txt'),EH.message);
    end
    v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V70_FAILED_RUN_SCOPE.txt'), ...
        ['V70 failed BEFORE full physical high-order validation. ' ...
         'No claims of success. Send ZIP for precise correction.']);
    stamp=datestr(now,'yyyymmdd_HHMMSS_FFF');
    zipPath=fullfile(outdir,['CBF_HLC_JET_V70_ERROR_' stamp '.zip']);
    files={'V70_RUNTIME_ERROR_DETAILS.txt','V70_FAILED_RUN_SCOPE.txt'};
    if exist(fullfile(work,'V70_FULL_UPDATED_HANDOVER.txt'),'file')==2
        files{end+1}='V70_FULL_UPDATED_HANDOVER.txt';
    end
    if exist(fullfile(work,'V70_HISTORY_ERROR.txt'),'file')==2
        files{end+1}='V70_HISTORY_ERROR.txt';
    end
    zip(zipPath,files,work);
    % Preserve archive even if historical material was unavailable.
    result=struct('status',['FAILED_V70_RUNTIME_' ME.identifier], ...
        'zipPath',zipPath,'nCases',0,'nRuntimeErrors',1, ...
        'nFailedCases',1,'nR1FilterStops',0);
end


% ========================================================================
% V71: Causal C5 6-stage 4-input generator and source-matched v1 jet.
% TARGET r_n from current estimator state at t_n. No future command.
% Dynamic stage state y_1..y_6 is known controller internal memory.
% u(t)=y_6(t) is APPLIED to ideal R193 plant, not the discontinuous target.
% For targets piecewise constant between samples, y_6 is C5 even across
% target jumps. u^(k) for k=0..5 depends on stages ONLY, not target r_n.
% Stage dynamics do not imply a hardware motor tracks this input. A
% physically calibrated actuator must be addressed before real deployment.
% ========================================================================
function result=v71CausalC5JetTest(opts)
    root=fileparts(mfilename('fullpath'));
    if exist('test_CBF_SetupPaths','file')==2,test_CBF_SetupPaths();end
    needed={'CBF_V19_Scenarios','with_load_model_euler_for_HL','lqrd'};
    for i=1:numel(needed)
        assert(exist(needed{i},'file')~=0,'CBF:V71SourceMissing', ...
            'Required R193 source missing: %s',needed{i});
    end
    assert(exist('HLC_SUSPENDED_LOAD','class')==8,'CBF:V71HLCMissing');
    sc=CBF_V19_Scenarios('straight_single','R193');
    sc.dt=0.025;s=sc.settings;
    H=v23MakeHLC(s,sc.dt);
    mHat=0.01; % R193 initial historical mass estimate; not actual EKF log.
    if isfield(opts,'v71MassEstimate'),mHat=opts.v71MassEstimate;end
    assert(isscalar(mHat)&&isfinite(mHat)&&mHat>0,'CBF:V71MassEstimate');
    rates=[20 40];
    if isfield(opts,'v71Omega'),rates=opts.v71Omega(:).';end
    assert(~isempty(rates)&&all(isfinite(rates))&&all(rates>0)&&numel(rates)<=4);
    horizon=2.4;
    if isfield(opts,'v71Horizon'),horizon=opts.v71Horizon;end
    assert(isscalar(horizon)&&horizon>0&&horizon<=4);
    lo=[s.input.thrustMin;s.input.torqueMin(:)];
    hi=[s.input.thrustMax;s.input.torqueMax(:)];
    modes={'NOMINAL_TARGET','R1_TARGET_AFTER_2P125'};
    summary=cell(0,15); rows=cell(0,26); checkRows=cell(0,13); % V71 historical CSV width fix
    maxContinuity=0;maxFirst=0;maxSource=0;maxTaylor=0;
    for wi=1:numel(rates)
        omega=rates(wi);
        [A,P]=v71CascadeMatrix(omega,sc.dt);
        for mi=1:numel(modes)
            mode=modes{mi};
            if mi==2 && exist('CBF_V18_R1_RectifiedCable','file')~=2
                error('CBF:V71R1SourceMissing', ...
                    'V71 R1 case requires original CBF_V18_R1_RectifiedCable');
            end
            x=sc.x0(:); t=0; nSteps=round(horizon/sc.dt);
            a0=v23HLC(x,0,sc,H,mHat);
            tgt=min(hi,max(lo,a0.raw(:)));
            y=repmat(tgt,1,6);  % 4x6, y1..y6; known physical initial command
            prevTarget=tgt; prevJet=v71OutputJets(y,omega);
            prevActual=tgt;
            nSample=0; nR1=0; firstSwitch=NaN; failure='OK';
            maxTargetJump=0; maxAppliedJump=0; maxJetAtSwitch=0;
            maxLowOrderError=0; maxModelError=0; maxLocalTaylor=0;
            maxTrackingGap=0;maxBoundViolation=0;maxRawTorque=0;
            maxExactStageError=0;prevStage=y;
            for i=0:nSteps
                t=i*sc.dt;
                a=v23HLC(x,t,sc,H,mHat);
                r=min(hi,max(lo,a.raw(:)));
                r1Required=NaN;
                if mi==2 && t>=2.125-1e-9
                    [candidate,reason]=v25R1ExactFilter(x,s,sc.obstacles,r);
                    if ~strcmp(reason,'OK')
                        failure=['R1_TARGET_UNAVAILABLE_' reason];
                        break; % STOP, no nominal fallback pretending safety
                    end
                    r=candidate(:);
                    r1Required=r(1);nR1=nR1+1;
                    if isnan(firstSwitch),firstSwitch=t;end
                end
                % Cross-check the previous held-target flow using exact
                % cascade matrix exponential, independently of RK4.
                exactStageErr=0;
                if i>0
                    eq=repmat(prevTarget,1,6);
                    exactStage=eq+(prevStage-eq)*P.';
                    exactStageErr=max(abs(y(:)-exactStage(:)));
                    maxExactStageError=max(maxExactStageError,exactStageErr);
                end
                % The new target r is not assigned into any stage.
                % Thus APPLIED u and u^(1)..u^(5) cannot jump at sample time.
                left=v71OutputJets(y,omega);
                right=v71OutputJets(y,omega);
                switchErr=max(abs(left(:)-right(:)));
                if i>0
                    targetJump=norm(r-prevTarget,Inf);
                    appliedJump=norm(y(:,6)-prevActual,Inf);
                else
                    targetJump=0;appliedJump=0;
                end
                maxTargetJump=max(maxTargetJump,targetJump);
                maxAppliedJump=max(maxAppliedJump,appliedJump);
                maxJetAtSwitch=max(maxJetAtSwitch,switchErr);
                maxContinuity=max(maxContinuity,switchErr);
                if targetJump>1e-8,nSample=nSample+1;end
                U=right(:,1:5); % applied input derivatives 0..4, from states only
                u=U(:,1);
                [jet,~]=v70PhysicalJet(x,U,s,sc,t,H.F1);
                direct=v70RHS19(x,u,s);
                r0=sc.ref(t,0);r1=sc.ref(t,1);r2=sc.ref(t,2);
                jet0=H.F1(1)*(r0(3)-x(10))+H.F1(2)*(r1(3)-x(13));
                jet1=H.F1(1)*(r1(3)-x(13))+H.F1(2)*(r2(3)-direct(13));
                lowErr=max(abs([jet(1)-jet0,jet(2)-jet1]));
                maxFirst=max(maxFirst,lowErr);maxLowOrderError=max(maxLowOrderError,lowErr);
                % Independent original R193 symbolic 24-state RHS, with
                % the actual generated output (NOT the target r).
                d24=v70Source24(x,u,s);
                from24=[direct(1:4);d24(10:12);d24(13:15);d24(16:18); ...
                    d24(19:21);d24(22:24)];
                modelErr=max(abs(direct-from24));
                maxSource=max(maxSource,modelErr);maxModelError=max(maxModelError,modelErr);
                % Exact local C5 Taylor validation against independently
                % integrated (x,y1..y6) with frozen CURRENT target, h<dt.
                h=0.001;
                if i==nSteps,h=0.0005;end
                [xb,yb]=v71AugStep(x,y,r,omega,s,h,8);
                rp=sc.ref(t+h,0);rv=sc.ref(t+h,1);
                vNext=H.F1(1)*(rp(3)-xb(10))+H.F1(2)*(rv(3)-xb(13));
                approximate=sum(jet.*(h.^(0:5))./factorial(0:5));
                tayErr=abs(vNext-approximate);
                maxLocalTaylor=max(maxLocalTaylor,tayErr);maxTaylor=max(maxTaylor,tayErr);
                trackingGap=norm(u-r,Inf);
                boundViolation=max([max(lo-u),max(u-hi),0]);
                maxBoundViolation=max(maxBoundViolation,boundViolation);
                maxTrackingGap=max(maxTrackingGap,trackingGap);
                maxRawTorque=max(maxRawTorque,norm(a.tau,Inf));
                if mod(i,5)==0 || targetJump>0.05 || i==nSteps
                    rows(end+1,:)={mode,omega,t, ...
                        r(1),u(1),r(2),r(3),r(4),u(2),u(3),u(4), ...
                        targetJump,trackingGap, ...
                        U(1,2),U(1,3),U(1,4),U(1,5), ...
                        jet(1),jet(2),jet(3),jet(4),jet(5),jet(6), ...
                        r1Required,boundViolation,switchErr}; %#ok<AGROW>
                    checkRows(end+1,:)={mode,omega,t,modelErr,lowErr, ...
                        tayErr,switchErr,appliedJump, ...
                        norm(x(1:4))-1,norm(x(14:16))-1, ...
                        dot(x(14:16),x(17:19)),exactStageErr, ...
                        'C5_GENERATOR_STATE_KNOWN__IDEAL_INPUT_TRACKING'}; %#ok<AGROW>
                end
                if ~(all(isfinite([jet,u(:).',a.raw(:).',modelErr,tayErr])) ...
                        && modelErr<1e-7 && lowErr<1e-8 && tayErr<1e-5)
                    failure='NUMERICAL_OR_MODEL_JET_CHECK_FAILED';break;
                end
                if i<nSteps
                    % Actual 4-input command is continuously generated
                    % while r_n is held. HLC/R1 recomputes ONLY next sample.
                    yBeforeAdvance=y;
                    [x,y]=v71AugStep(x,y,r,omega,s,sc.dt,10);
                    if any(~isfinite(x))||any(~isfinite(y(:)))
                        failure='NONFINITE_AUGMENTED_STATE';break;
                    end
                    prevActual=u;prevJet=right;prevTarget=r;prevStage=yBeforeAdvance;
                end
            end
            nStepsDone=i;
            pass=strcmp(failure,'OK');
            summary(end+1,:)={mode,omega,pass,failure,nStepsDone, ...
                maxTargetJump,maxJetAtSwitch,maxLowOrderError, ...
                maxModelError,maxLocalTaylor,maxTrackingGap, ...
                maxBoundViolation,nR1,firstSwitch,maxExactStageError}; %#ok<AGROW>
        end
    end
    outdir=fullfile(root,'_CBF_TEST_OUTPUT');
    if exist(outdir,'dir')~=7,mkdir(outdir);end
    work=tempname;mkdir(work); tidy=onCleanup(@()v69Cleanup(work)); %#ok<NASGU>
    writetable(cell2table(summary,'VariableNames', ...
        {'mode','omega_radps','completeWithoutEarlyStop','stopReason', ...
         'lastSampleIndex','maxTargetJumpInf','maxJetJumpAtUpdate', ...
         'maxDirectJet01Error','max19toSource24Error', ...
         'maxLocalTaylorError','maxAppliedVsTargetGap', ...
         'maxPhysicalBoundViolation','nR1TargetSamples','firstR1Sample_s', ...
         'maxRK4VsExactGeneratorStateError'}), ...
         fullfile(work,'V71_CAUSAL_GENERATOR_SUMMARY.csv'));
    writetable(cell2table(rows,'VariableNames', ...
        {'mode','omega_radps','time_s','targetThrust_N','appliedThrust_N', ...
         'targetTauX','targetTauY','targetTauZ', ...
         'appliedTauX','appliedTauY','appliedTauZ', ...
         'targetChangeInf','appliedTargetGapInf', ...
         'appliedTdot','appliedTddot','appliedT3','appliedT4', ...
         'v1Jet0','v1Jet1','v1Jet2','v1Jet3','v1Jet4','v1Jet5', ...
         'R1TargetThrust_IfActive','physicalBoundViolation','C5JetJumpAtUpdate'}), ...
         fullfile(work,'V71_CAUSAL_C5_4INPUT_TRACE.csv'));
    writetable(cell2table(checkRows,'VariableNames', ...
        {'mode','omega_radps','time_s','max19vs24RHSerror', ...
        'directJet01error','oneMsTaylorVsAugRK4error','jetJumpAtUpdate', ...
        'prevSampleVsCurrentAppliedChange','quaternionNormError', ...
        'cableDirectionNormError','cableTangencyDot', ...
         'RK4VsExactGeneratorStateError','provenance'}), ...
        fullfile(work,'V71_R193_MODEL_AND_SWITCH_AUDIT.csv'));
    ok=all(cell2mat(summary(:,8))<1e-8) && ...
        all(cell2mat(summary(:,9))<1e-7) && ...
        all(cell2mat(summary(:,10))<1e-5) && ...
        all(cell2mat(summary(:,7))<1e-12) && ...
        all(cell2mat(summary(:,12))<1e-8) && ...
        all(cell2mat(summary(:,15))<1e-4);
    % R1 target infeasibility under plant modification is NOT a C5
    % mathematical failure. It DOES mean no safety / reachability result.
    nErr=sum(strcmp(summary(:,4),'NUMERICAL_OR_MODEL_JET_CHECK_FAILED'));
    nErr=nErr+sum(strcmp(summary(:,4),'NONFINITE_AUGMENTED_STATE'));
    status='PASS_CAUSAL_C5_INPUT_JETS_MODEL_CONDITIONAL__NOT_CBF_OR_HARDWARE_CERTIFIED';
    if ~ok||nErr>0,status='FAIL_V71_CAUSAL_JET_CHECK';end
    chapter=v71HandoverChapter();
    v71WriteFullHandover(fullfile(work,'V71_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt'),chapter);
    v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V71_THEORY_AND_SCOPE.txt'),chapter);
    stamp=datestr(now,'yyyymmdd_HHMMSS_FFF');
    zipPath=fullfile(outdir,['CBF_HLC_JET_V71_' stamp '.zip']);
    names={'V71_CAUSAL_GENERATOR_SUMMARY.csv', ...
        'V71_CAUSAL_C5_4INPUT_TRACE.csv','V71_R193_MODEL_AND_SWITCH_AUDIT.csv', ...
        'V71_THEORY_AND_SCOPE.txt','V71_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt'};
    zip(zipPath,names,work);
    assert(exist(zipPath,'file')==2,'CBF:V71OutputZipMissing');
    result=struct('status',status,'zipPath',zipPath,'nCases',size(summary,1), ...
        'nRuntimeErrors',0,'nFailedCases',double(~ok)+nErr, ...
        'nR1FilterStops',sum(startsWith(string(summary(:,4)), ...
        'R1_TARGET_UNAVAILABLE_')), 'maxJetUpdateJump',maxContinuity, ...
        'maxR193SourceError',maxSource,'maxTaylorError',maxTaylor, ...
        'maxFirstDerivativeError',maxFirst);
end

function [A,P]=v71CascadeMatrix(omega,dt)
    A=omega*(-eye(6)+diag(ones(5,1),-1));
    P=expm(A*dt);
end

function U=v71OutputJets(y,omega)
    % y is 4-by-6; r_n can jump. For k<=5, e6'*A^k*y
    % has NO explicit r_n term, because stage1->6 path needs six steps.
    assert(isequal(size(y),[4 6]),'CBF:V71StageShape');
    A=omega*(-eye(6)+diag(ones(5,1),-1));
    M=eye(6);U=zeros(4,6);
    for k=0:5
        U(:,k+1)=y*M(6,:).';
        M=M*A;
    end
    if any(~isfinite(U(:))),error('CBF:V71JetNonfinite');end
end

function [x,y]=v71AugStep(x,y,r,omega,s,h,n)
    % RK4 integration of the COMBINED physical plant + physical input
    % generator. No ZOH applied force: the TARGET r_n is ZOH only.
    dt=h/n;
    z=[x(:);y(:)];
    for j=1:n
        a=v71AugRHS(z,r,omega,s);
        b=v71AugRHS(z+0.5*dt*a,r,omega,s);
        c=v71AugRHS(z+0.5*dt*b,r,omega,s);
        d=v71AugRHS(z+dt*c,r,omega,s);
        z=z+dt*(a+2*b+2*c+d)/6;
    end
    x=z(1:19);y=reshape(z(20:end),4,6);
end

function dz=v71AugRHS(z,r,omega,s)
    x=z(1:19);y=reshape(z(20:end),4,6);
    dy=omega*([r(:),y(:,1:5)]-y);
    dx=v70RHS19(x,y(:,6),s);
    dz=[dx;dy(:)];
end

function v71WriteFullHandover(filePath,chapter)
    src=fileread([mfilename('fullpath') '.m']);
    startTag=['% V71_FULL_' 'HISTORY_BEGIN'];endTag=['% V71_FULL_' 'HISTORY_END'];
    a=strfind(src,startTag);b=strfind(src,endTag);
    if numel(a)~=1||numel(b)~=1||b<=a
        error('CBF:V71HistoryEmbedded','V70 cumulative history markers are missing');
    end
    body=src(a+numel(startTag):b-1);
    body=regexprep(body,'(?m)^%[|]','');
    f=fopen(filePath,'w','n','UTF-8');
    assert(f>=0,'CBF:V71HandoverWrite');
    fprintf(f,'%s\n\n%s\n',body,chapter);fclose(f);
end

function chapter=v71HandoverChapter()
    chapter=sprintf([ ...
        '\n========== V71 CAUSAL C5 FOUR-INPUT COMMAND GENERATOR ==========\n' ...
        '2026-11-18. User requested to turn V70 conditional derivatives into\n' ...
        '  causal, sample-boundary-valid 0..5 jets. Scope: actual estimated-\n' ...
        '  layout 19-state R193 simulation, four commands, original HLC/R1\n' ...
        '  used ONLY to generate targets. Original HLC/plant/CBF not edited.\n' ...
        'SAMPLE UPDATE: occurs every 25ms even WITHOUT CBF. A direct ZOH\n' ...
        '  physical command generally jumps, so its classical time derivative\n' ...
        '  at the jump does not exist. R1 engaging is one example.\n' ...
        'DYNAMIC GENERATOR: for each of 4 channels, y1dot=w*(r-y1),\n' ...
        '  y2dot=w*(y1-y2),...,y6dot=w*(y5-y6), physical u=y6.\n' ...
        '  r is latest saturated original-HLC or original-R1 target and is\n' ...
        '  known at current sample from current state. The internal 24 y\n' ...
        '  states are controller-owned memory, NOT external measured states.\n' ...
        '  For k=0..5, u^(k)=e6^T*A^k*y, A=w*(-I+subdiag(1)).\n' ...
        '  This depends on y ONLY. Therefore u through u^(5) is C0 at\n' ...
        '  arbitrary jumps in r if y remains continuous. u(t) is C5.\n' ...
        '  V70 v1^(0..5) requires u^(0..4), obtained here causally.\n' ...
        '  Taylor AD uses the ACTUAL applied u=y6, not target r.\n' ...
        '  Combined R193 plant + six stages integrated with RK4. Source24\n' ...
        '  comparison, direct 0/1 derivative check, 1ms Taylor/RK4 check.\n' ...
        '  Switch test compares BOTH SIDES AT SAME INSTANT. A difference\n' ...
        '  in applied u between successive sample times is NOT a jump.\n' ...
        '  omega=20,40 rad/s are experimental bandwidths, not identified\n' ...
        '  actuator bandwidths or guaranteed safe values. Rates/horizon can\n' ...
        '  be changed through opts.v71Omega/opts.v71Horizon.\n' ...
        '  The six-stage filter causes DELAY. Original R1 interval constraint\n' ...
        '  applies to its selected target, NOT filtered applied u. Hence\n' ...
        '  R1 safety and HOCBF invariance are NOT certified; the filter may\n' ...
        '  violate obstacle CBF constraints, may make original HLC lag.\n' ...
        '  On R1 infeasibility the test stops and NEVER silently replaces\n' ...
        '  target with nominal safe input or calls it a success.\n' ...
        '  Six stages introduce new INTERNAL dynamic state. Later safety\n' ...
        '  QP must constrain that augmented dynamics and 4 physical bounds\n' ...
        '  jointly, not filter an already solved safety input afterward.\n' ...
        '  Real motor/ESC dynamics may differ from this virtual generator,\n' ...
        '  and actual force must be measured/estimated or actuator modelled\n' ...
        '  before claiming REAL physical jets from sensed data.\n' ...
        '  Source-matched model coefficients use simulator true mL=0.14kg;\n' ...
        '  nominal HLC initial load estimate=0.01kg, not real EKF logs.\n' ...
        '  V67 Vfd source is discrete nominal sequence, NOT 0..5 real jet;\n' ...
        '  V71 does not substitute true jets into HLC inverses or solve that\n' ...
        '  separate semantic mismatch. No added thrust lower floor.\n' ...
        '  See output SUMMARY and TRACE for measured success/failure.\n' ...
        '  Next: model real actuator tracking; simultaneous safety optimizer\n' ...
        '  involving filter state, feasibility and obstacle constraints,\n' ...
        '  HLC consistency and idle equilibrium/CBF release analysis.\n' ...
        '===============================================================\n']);
end

function result=v71ErrorArtifact(ME)
    root=fileparts(mfilename('fullpath'));
    outdir=fullfile(root,'_CBF_TEST_OUTPUT');
    if exist(outdir,'dir')~=7,mkdir(outdir);end
    work=tempname;mkdir(work); clean=onCleanup(@()v69Cleanup(work)); %#ok<NASGU>
    report=getReport(ME,'extended','hyperlinks','off');
    v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V71_RUNTIME_ERROR.txt'),report);
    try
        v71WriteFullHandover(fullfile(work,'V71_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt'),v71HandoverChapter());
        files={'V71_RUNTIME_ERROR.txt','V71_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt'};
    catch EH
        v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V71_HANDOVER_ERROR.txt'),EH.message);
        files={'V71_RUNTIME_ERROR.txt','V71_HANDOVER_ERROR.txt'};
    end
    stamp=datestr(now,'yyyymmdd_HHMMSS_FFF');
    zipPath=fullfile(outdir,['CBF_HLC_JET_V71_ERROR_' stamp '.zip']);
    zip(zipPath,files,work);
    result=struct('status',['FAILED_V71_RUNTIME_' ME.identifier], ...
        'zipPath',zipPath,'nCases',0,'nRuntimeErrors',1, ...
        'nFailedCases',1,'nR1FilterStops',0);
end


