%|=== V24 EXECUTED RESULTS ANALYSIS / 2026-11-17 / original measured ZIP cross-checked ===
%|Scope: one scenario straight_single; three interventions NOMINAL, THRUST_PULSE, THRUST_RATE_LIMIT; 0.025 s; 161 samples for 0--4 s. Existing MATLAB code not modified. First two previous V23 runs had fileread failure; V24 succeeded for all three diagnostic experiments.
