    fwrite(fid,['ENT.png; V52_V51_BETA_TORQUE_EVENT.png. Original 36 files of V51 output preserved in review ZIP. No MATLAB controller or CBF formulas changed. MATLAB full-run execution of next method is NOT claimed.' char(10) char(10) char(10) '============================================================' char(10) 'V53: original HLC torque amplification (2026-11-17)' char(10) '============================================================' char(10) 'V51/V52 measured t=2.275 to 2.300: raw tau max 1.6795 to 135.2294 Nm; active alpha projection -389.605 to -669.215, active beta singular 231.974 to 4.949; ratio about 80.5. SVD rank indices switch; track projected active channel instead of only sigmaMin or cond.' char(10) 'V53 mode: seven original-V19 R1 nonlinear continuous closures, torque-only +/-0.2 Nm 0.100s early diagnostic pulses on three axes t=2.150...2.225; thrust determined by ORIGINAL R1 every sample. Existing HLC/Vfd/Vs/Uf/Beta2/V2_alpha2 untouched.' char(10) 'V53 decomposes HLC raw tau with singular value channels, V2_alpha2 at Vs=0 and each of its 3 isolated components. Checks reconstruction residual to detect nonlinear in Vs.' char(10) 'At SAME physical state changes only v1(0), freezes higher columns; evaluate alpha-only/beta-only/full changes and interaction, plus central difference tau derivative identity beta^-1*(dAlpha-dBeta*tau). These are algebraic counterfactuals, not physical admissible virtual inputs.' char(10) 'One-step 4U causal branches maintain original current R1 thrust audit and physical input limits, but are not guaranteed future-safe. Raw HLC thrust, actual thrust, 3 raw torques, 3 actual torques, cable H, tension and next 25ms HLC demand recorded.' char(10) 'NO claim of controller improvement until MATLAB runs and proves sustained behavior. R1 original uses V11_19 19-state plant; 0.01kg fixed initial EKF mass estimate, NOT live EKF. No obstacle CBF redesign, reference ch'],'char');
    fwrite(fid,['ange, or hardware validation.' char(10) char(10) char(10) '============================================================' char(10) 'V54: source-supported V53 RESULT REVIEW + next-step feasibility and actual-thrust mapping audits (2026-11-17)' char(10) '============================================================' char(10) 'V53 seven modes all stop on original R1 infeasible-shared-thrust: R1_EXACT at 2.350s; early pitch minus at 2.375s but minimum tension 0.0001019N and applied thrust 0N at t=2.325s. Early pitch +0.2 reduces peak raw torque 135.23 to 49.98 Nm but decreases min nominal thrust -2.72 to -4.70 N and increases applied thrust peak 16.45 to 19.39N; no success. Early pitch -0.2 lowers peak raw torque to 23.60Nm but does NOT preserve positive cable tension or R1 feasibility.' char(10) 'At t=2.300, exact R1: v1=-9.2710; Traw=.41539N; Tactual=13.50173N; Vs2=657.373; tau raw pitch=135.229Nm, beta sigmaMin=4.94874; body tilt about 5.58deg. No 10m position deviation.' char(10) 'Fixed-state algebraic v1 sensitivity dTauY/dv1 about -514.837 Nm/(m/s^2), decomposed alpha contribution -11.87095 and beta contribution -502.9661; derivative central difference at h=.001 agrees within .0036. The large CURRENT tau (135.229) is mostly Vs-related (132.8365), whereas sensitivity to v1 is mostly beta-related. Do not conflate.' char(10) 'At t=2.275 candidate T+0.5N respects CURRENT R1 and predicts Traw_next=.13863N, betaSigmaMin_next=.55631, raw pitch tau_next=1247.78Nm; T-0.5N predicts next raw pitch tau=46.72Nm but VIOLATES current R1 inequality. This proves CURRENT R1 feasibility alone does not preserve HLC inversion authority one step later.' char(10) 'V54 NEW MATLAB audits only when opts.v54CouplingAudit=true (implicitly enables V53): same-state replace ONLY v1(0) to obtain EXACT applied R1 thrust by algebraic linear Uf mapping, and recompute Beta2/Vs/alpha2 while holding higher v1'],'char');
    fwrite(fid,[' jet columns frozen. This is NOT a realizable or time-consistent controller, only a diagnostic to distinguish nominal vs applied input maps. Also test next R1 feasibility after each ORIGINAL-plant 25ms physical input branch. No CBF, HLC, obstacle, reference, parameter, plant changes. V54 MATLAB EXECUTION NOT YET VERIFIED.' char(10) char(10) char(10) '========== V55-V67 CUMULATIVE FINDINGS ==========' char(10) 'V55: original R1 shared thrust-only CBF becomes infeasible at 2.350 s: thrust >= 27.93 N > physical 20 N. This is a LOCAL feasibility check, not impossibility of earlier corrective actions.' char(10) 'V56: normal HLC tracks smooth descent (0.75 m case) well; hard step down can generate negative raw thrust. CBF initial 0-time rows can be infeasible; avoid treating those rows as flight evidence.' char(10) 'V57/V58: CBF thrust changes around 2.150 s from HLC 8.87 to applied 12.17 N; subsequent vertical speed drives HLC raw thrust near zero and negative; late forced release can hit zero applied thrust and very low cable tension.' char(10) 'V60/V61/V65: rebuilding torque inverse using CBF-applied thrust, but only zero-order v1, reduces torque at 2.300 s from 135 Nm class to 0.035 Nm in the tested state. This is NOT 0:5 derivative consistency. Raw nominal thrust still collapses.' char(10) 'V62: rear differences of 25 ms R1 thrust corrections create huge derivative entries and raw torque (>1000 Nm). At nonsmooth switching these differences are NOT continuous derivatives.' char(10) 'V63: continuous correction integrator chain has consistent correction derivatives, but its applied thrust cannot satisfy the original instantaneous R1 condition. Faster response increases torque demand.' char(10) 'V64: local numerical 4th-order obstacle input action found pitch torque; numerical differences and zero Tdot/Tddot choices DO NOT certify true 4-input HOCBF or feasible control.' char(10) 'V66: e'],'char');
    fwrite(fid,['xact analytic C5 ramp derivative of an OFFLINE R1 thrust command remains huge if squeezed into 25 ms; up to 275548 Nm frozen-state raw inverse. This is NOT a jointly chosen CBF correction. Original R1 constraints failed in closed loops.' char(10) 'V67: source-exact generated Vfd is checked componentwise against F1 Ad^k e; compare against F1 Ac^k e and F1 ((Ad-I)/dt)^k e. Ac is a CONTINUOUS NOMINAL double-integrator error model ONLY; not a claim for actual nonlinear plant high derivatives.' char(10) 'V67: actual first v1 derivative computed using original nonlinear plant at the SAME state for both nominal 4-input and R1-modified applied 4-input. Difference in thrust-numerator derivative is also reported. Do not set unknown thrust/input derivatives to zero.' char(10) 'V67: alternative continuous-nominal 0..5 jet is evaluated in source inverse ONLY in SHADOW; NOT applied as controller, and NOT a proven valid high-order correction under CBF. No thrust floor, artificial input-rate limit, post-hoc smoothing, HLC gain change, or predictive control introduced.' char(10) 'What must be established before a genuine 0..5 jointly determined correction: the chosen regularity of applied thrust and 3 torque inputs, input-affine/mixed-relative-order Lie derivatives, kinematic relation between actual v1 and derivatives along the full plant, generated source Vfd semantic choice, exact beta/alpha inverse equality, actuator bounds and CBF viability. Jet slots cannot be optimized independently without integrability.' char(10) 'The raw HLC thrust-zero condition is determined by its ORIGINAL numerator N=0 at positive geometric D; measured strong vertical-velocity-feedback dependence does NOT imply an arbitrary fixed speed/height limit.' char(10) '========== V67 OBSERVED MATLAB OUTPUT ==========' char(10) '         mode                   status             lastTime_s   '],'char');
    fwrite(fid,[' samples    maxSourceVsDiscreteError    maxSourceVsContinuousDifference    maxShadowTorqueInf_Nm    minNominalThrust_N    lastR1Status' char(10) '    _______________    ________________________    __________    _______    ________________________    _______________________________    _____________________    __________________    ____________' char(10) char(10) '    {''HLC_ONLY''   }    {''COMPLETE_UNCERTIFIED''}      2.325          9              1.3878e-16                     8.1053e+06                      4.7072                  8.8666           {''NOT_R1''} ' char(10) '    {''ORIGINAL_R1''}    {''COMPLETE_UNCERTIFIED''}      2.325          9              8.8818e-16                     5.5861e+07                      9690.5                 -2.7227           {''OK''    } ' char(10) char(10) char(10) char(10) '========== V68 THEORY ==========' char(10) '# V68 — R193高階仮想入力（0～5階）の数学的生成法とCBF接続条件' char(10) '2026-11-17 / 理論整理。新しい制御入力の閉ループ成功は未実証。MATLABの元HLCは変更していない。' char(10) char(10) '## 0. 根拠となるソースと観測' char(10) '- `R193_USED_FLIGHT_20261030_222702_252.zip` 内 `controller/@HLC_SUSPENDED_LOAD/` の `HLC_SUSPENDED_LOAD.m`、`Vfd_SuspendedLoadxyDst.m`、`Uf_SuspendedLoadxyDst.m`、`Vs_SuspendedLoadxyDst.m`、`Beta2_SuspendedLoadxyDst.m`、`V2_alpha2_SuspendedLoadxyDst.m` を確認。' char(10) '- V67結果 `CBF_HLC_ROOTCAUSE_V67_20261117_201325_493.zip` の `V67_SOURCE_VFD_0TO5_AUDIT.csv` と `V67_ACTUAL_FIRST_DERIVATIVE_CAUSAL.csv` を確認。' char(10) '- `Vfd` は0～5番目を生成。`Uf`/`Beta2` は0階、`Vs` は0～3階、`V2_alpha2` は0～4階の仮想入力成分を使用する。' char(10) '- V67では実装Vfdが `F*A_d^k*e` (k=0,...,5) とほぼ機械精度で一致。一方、`F*A_c^k*e` とは一致しない。`Vfd` をそのまま連続時間微分だと仮定してCBF補正の連続時間微分を加算する方法は根拠不足。' char(10) '- 元HLC単独の追従実績は維持する。V67の比較から元HLCの設計ミスを断定しない。' char(10) char(10) '## 1. 公称連続時間の数学的定義' char(10) '鉛直位置・速度誤差 `e=[z_d-z_L; dz_d-dz_L]`, `F=[k_p,k_d]`、鉛直仮想入力 `v_n=F e` とする。鉛直加速度が**理想的に** `ddz_L=ddz_d+v_n` と一致するとき' char(10) char(10) '    de/dt = A_c e,' char(10) '    A_c = [0 1; -k_p -k_d].' char(10) char(10) 'この条件の下でのみ `v_n^(k)=F A_c^k e` (k=0,...,5) が連続時間の公称導関数となる。これは元のVfdの置換を直ちに正当化しない。' char(10) char(10) 'R193の生成式と一致する離散誤差行列は'],'char');
    fwrite(fid,[char(10) char(10) '    A_d = [1-k_p*h^2/2, h-k_d*h^2/2; -k_p*h,1-k_d*h].' char(10) '    Vfd(k+1)= F A_d^k e (k=0,...,5).' char(10) char(10) '`A_d^k` は予測されたサンプル値を与える作用であり、連続時間微分の作用 `A_c^k` ではない。`(A_d-I)^k/h^k` なら前進差分であり、これも一般に連続時間の厳密導関数とは異なる。' char(10) char(10) '## 2. CBF介入中の **正しい** 高階仮想入力（理想的な鉛直線形化系）' char(10) 'CBFの効果を鉛直加速度相当の滑らかな補正 `delta(t)` と表し、' char(10) char(10) '    ddz_L = ddz_d + F e + delta,' char(10) '    de/dt = A_c e - B delta,' char(10) '    B = [0;1],' char(10) '    v_c(t) = F e(t) + delta(t).' char(10) char(10) 'とする。このとき delta がC^5で、理想鉛直モデルが実現されていれば、0～5階は' char(10) char(10) '    q_0 = e,' char(10) '    J_k = F q_k + delta^(k),                   k = 0,...,5,' char(10) '    q_(k+1) = A_c q_k - B delta^(k),           k = 0,...,4.' char(10) char(10) 'という再帰式で**正確に**作れる。等価な閉形式は' char(10) char(10) '    J_0 = F e + delta,' char(10) '    J_k = F A_c^k e' char(10) '          - sum_{j=0}^{k-1} F A_c^(k-1-j) B delta^(j)' char(10) '          + delta^(k),                         k = 1,...,5.' char(10) char(10) '例えば' char(10) char(10) '    J_1 = F A_c e - F B delta + delta_dot,' char(10) '    J_2 = F A_c^2 e - F A_c B delta - F B delta_dot + delta_ddot.' char(10) char(10) 'これまでの `F A_c^k e + delta^(k)` だけでは **CBF介入で e の時間発展が変化する効果** が欠落する。これは前後の軌道を同一の微分体系で扱うための必要な補正である。再帰と閉形式の一致はk=0,...,5についてSymPyで恒等式（全差0）として確認。' char(10) char(10) '## 3. 実プラント（モデル誤差、トルク変更、推定誤差）へ拡張するとき' char(10) '指令した加速度に対する実加速度の残差 `rho(t)` を' char(10) char(10) '    ddz_L = ddz_d + F e + delta + rho' char(10) char(10) 'で定義すれば' char(10) char(10) '    de/dt = A_c e - B(delta+rho)' char(10) char(10) 'となる。そこで実軌道上の0～5階は' char(10) char(10) '    q_0 = e,' char(10) '    J_k = F q_k + delta^(k),' char(10) '    q_(k+1) = A_c q_k - B[delta^(k)+rho^(k)]' char(10) char(10) 'である。閉形式では `delta^(j)` による誤差ダイナミクスの寄与に加え `rho^(j)` の寄与が現れる（ただし最後の +delta^(k) は維持）。' char(10) char(10) '**重要**：rhoやその高階導関数を勝手にゼロ固定しない。もし補正を「実現加速度そのもの」と定義するならrho=0と置けるが、その場合delta自体が実入力と状態を通じて決まり、deltaの高階導関数は未知の入力微分に依存する。両者を都合よく混用しない。' char(10) char(10) '「CBFなしで設計したnominal jet」と「CBFで変化した実プラント上の jet」は別物。後者を全て正確に求めるには、入力が十分な滑らかさを持ち、参照・運動方程式・実入力微分が定まっている必要がある。' char(10) char(10) '## 4. 推力との高階対応：元のUfからの厳密な恒等式' char(10) '元の推力生成式は' char(10) char(10) '    D(x) T = M[ v_c + ddz_d + g ] + C(x),  M = m+m_L,' char(10) char(10) 'と書ける（Mは定数として微分）。`C(x)` は元ソースのケーブル角運動補償項、`D(x)` は幾何学的分母である。この等式を時間微分すれば、k>=1について' char(10) char(10) '    D T^(k)' char(10) '      = M[ J_k + z_d^(k+2) ] +'],'char');
    fwrite(fid,[' C^(k)' char(10) '        - sum_{j=1}^{k} binom(k,j) D^(j) T^(k-j).' char(10) char(10) '従って' char(10) char(10) '    T^(k) = { M[J_k+z_d^(k+2)] + C^(k)' char(10) '               - sum_{j=1}^{k} binom(k,j) D^(j) T^(k-j) }/D,' char(10) char(10) 'ただし `D≠0` と十分な滑らかさが必要。`k=0` のみ重力定数を加えた元式を使う。機体姿勢やケーブル方向が変わるので `D^(j)` と `C^(j)` を落とせない。**全てのTの導関数をゼロに置くことはできない。**' char(10) char(10) '元HLCの逆変換に直接現れるJ_0,...,J_4なら、最上位の推力微分はこの形式ではT^(4)、参照微分はz_d^(6)まで。生成されるJ_5も微分整合性のために保存するが、J_5を経由してT^(5)まで計算する場合は参照z_d^(7)など追加の定義が必要（現在の参照入力範囲0～6とは別）。' char(10) char(10) '同一状態でT_HLCとT_CBFの差を鉛直加速度補正へ変換する式は' char(10) char(10) '    delta = D(x) [T_CBF - T_HLC(x,t)] / M' char(10) char(10) 'である（この等式は完全一致の元モデル内で成立）。deltaの微分にはDの微分と、`T_HLC(x(t),t)` の全時間微分が入る。**25 ms差分でCBFが出したTの差だけを微分したものは、一般にはdeltaの正しい微分ではない。**' char(10) char(10) '## 5. HLCの水平・ヨー層との接続' char(10) '- `Vs`：同じJ_0,...,J_3を使い、v_2,v_3,v_4を計算する。' char(10) '- `Beta2`：同じJ_0を使う。' char(10) '- `V2_alpha2`：同じJ_0,...,J_4とv_2,v_3,v_4を使う。' char(10) '- 三軸トルクは `Beta2(x,J_0)*tau = V2_alpha2(x,ref,J_0..J_4,v_234)` を満たす。変数を独立の補正後数列とせず、全て同じ微分再帰から得たJを渡す。' char(10) '- 元のHLCには5階を生成するコードがあるが、列6は現在の実入力逆変換では直接参照されない。5階の存在を理由に無条件で実入力を5階微分する、あるいは5階を捨てる、のいずれも正当化できない。' char(10) '- 正則性と物理実現可能性は別途必要。`Beta2` が正則でも、右辺が大きければトルクは過大になりうる。' char(10) char(10) '## 6. 後付け補正を避けるための正しい入力決定構造（方式選定前の共通必要条件）' char(10) 'deltaの時間関数を「計算済みTの後付け差分」から生成してはいけない。例えば内部状態 `d_0..d_5` を設定し' char(10) char(10) '    dot(d_0)=d_1,...,dot(d_4)=d_5, dot(d_5)=w' char(10) char(10) 'をモデルへ含めることで、`d_k=delta^(k)` を連続に定義できる。これは**共通条件の表現例**であり、動的拡張CBF採用の確定ではない。別手法でも同じ整合関係を満たせばよい。' char(10) char(10) 'そのとき `J` は上記の真の再帰で評価し、`' char(10) ' T=Uf(x,J), tau` と `Beta2*tau=...`, 物理入力 `0<=T<=20`, `|tau_j|<=1`, および各障害物の真の高階CBF補助集合と不等式を、**入力決定の前に同一問題内で**確認する。全ての制約が満たせないときは「不可行」と判断し、限界を隠すために生推力や未定義の推力微分をゼロにしない。' char(10) char(10) '`d_0=0` だからといって `d_1,...,d_5=0`とは限らない。補正の介入/解除時には高階境界条件も必要。1サンプルで大きなdeltaを完成させることは高階入力を増大させ得るため、CBF自身が時間的実現可能性を考慮して安全入力を決定する必要がある。' char(10) char(10) '## 7. 推力急減は高階微分の定義とは別の因果効果' char(10) '`N=M(F e+ddz_d+g)+C` としたとき' char(10) char(10) '    dot(N) = M[ k_p*(dz_d-dz_L) + k_d*(ddz_d-ddz_L) + z_d^(3) ] + dot(C).' char(10) char(10) '同じx,tで別の実入力を適用する二つのケースの差は' char(10) char(10) '    Delta dot(N) = -M*k_d*Delta(ddz_L) + Delta dot(C).' char(10) char(10) 'V65ではCBF側がHLC'],'char');
    fwrite(fid,['側より約246.91 N/sだけNを減少させる方向で、主因は速度フィードバックの加速度依存。高階ジェットを正しく作っても、この閉ループの力学的競合が自動的に消えるわけではない。人工的な生推力の下限は現段階で追加しない。' char(10) char(10) '## 8. 実装前に必ず行うべき検証と停止判定' char(10) '1. **Vfdの数学的意味**：元の離散的な値列を無条件で連続時間微分とみなさない。元の導出（generateの記号計算）からどの信号が要求されるかを確認する。元HLCを事前に書き換えない。' char(10) '2. **数学的恒等式**：与えた滑らかなdelta(t)で、J_k再帰と閉形式がk=0..5で一致すること。単位一致を確認。' char(10) '3. **物理微分との照合**：同じ状態・4入力・参照について、実プラントの1階Lie微分とJ_1を比較。理想残差rhoが非ゼロなら、2～5階を理想で代用したことを明示し、rho導関数を数式から導出するまで実機での厳密整合とは呼ばない。' char(10) '4. **高階逆変換**：J_0..J_4を用いて `Vs/Beta2/V2_alpha2` を同時再評価し、等式残差、Beta2特異値、トルク生値と物理上限を記録する。J_5は次周期の整合確認にも使う。' char(10) '5. **CBFの成立**：安全関数ごとの入力作用・相対次数を実プラントで導出する。4階と決めつけない。全階の補助集合と物理実入力制限の同時可行性を確かめる。' char(10) '6. **復帰・停留**：介入停止時のdeltaと全高階導関数、元HLCへの復帰時の生推力・生トルクを検証。位置・速度・加速度誤差の持続の影響を区別する。' char(10) char(10) '**未完了**：R193の本来のsymbolic導出ファイルはR193_USED_FLIGHTのフライト用ZIPには見つかっていないため、各生成関数の`dV1`がどの厳密な導出から来たかの原資料照合は未完了。MATLABでの新しい閉ループ改善実証は実施していない。V68は高階ジェットの理論生成を確定する段階である。' char(10) char(10) '========== V69 GENERATOR AND TEST ==========' char(10) '# V69 — 高階微分の生成を独立に確定する試験' char(10) char(10) '## 対象と非対象' char(10) '- 対象：鉛直仮想入力の0～5階成分を**数学的に**構成する方法と、R193既存Vfdの意味の分離。' char(10) '- 非対象：推力の上下限・動的拡張の採否、CBF制約、実際の4入力、HLC式・ゲイン変更、閉ループでの回避・安定化。' char(10) '- 入力は数学的テスト用の既知の滑らかな補正 `δ` と、必要なら非ゼロの実現残差 `ρ`。現実の未観測 `ρ` がゼロと決まったわけではない。' char(10) char(10) '## R193の実ソースに対応する式' char(10) '`Vfd_SuspendedLoadxyDst.m` は、`e=[zd-zL; vzd-vzL]`, `F=[kp,kd]`, サンプリング幅 `h` に対し、' char(10) char(10) '    Ad = [1 - kp*h^2/2, h - kd*h^2/2;' char(10) '          -kp*h,         1 - kd*h ];' char(10) '    Vfd(k+1) = F*Ad^k*e,  k=0,...,5' char(10) char(10) 'を計算する。V67で生成関数と機械精度の一致を確認。これは `k` 階の導関数ではなく **k回後の公称予測値**。' char(10) '`Vs` / `V2_alpha2` はこれらを `dV1`, `d2V1` 等の変数名で使用しているが、生成元の記号導出との厳密な整合性は依然未確定。' char(10) char(10) '## A. 真の連続時間0～5階微分（モデル条件付き）' char(10) '定義を `v=F e + δ`、実現加速度差を `ρ` とすると、' char(10) char(10) '    e_dot = Ac*e - B*(δ + ρ),' char(10) '    Ac = [0 1; -kp -kd], B=[0;1].' char(10) char(10) '補正 `δ` と残差 `ρ` に必要な階数の時間微分が存在するなら、' char(10) char(10) '    q0=e,' char(10) '    Jk=F*qk+δ^(k),' char(10) '    q(k+1)=Ac*qk-B*(δ^(k)+ρ^(k)),   k=0,...,4.' char(10) char(10) '得られた `J0...J5` は **実際にこの誤差力学が成立する場合に限り** `v^(0)...v^(5)` である。' char(10) '等価な閉形式：' char(10) char(10) '    Jk=F*Ac^k*e+δ^(k)' char(10) '       -sum_'],'char');
    fwrite(fid,['{j=0}^{k-1} F*Ac^(k-1-j)*B*(δ^(j)+ρ^(j)).' char(10) char(10) '`ρ` を物理プラントで評価せずゼロ固定して現実の厳密微分と呼ばない。' char(10) char(10) '## B. R193の離散Vfdと同じ表現で補正を含めるとき' char(10) 'R193ソースの離散近似に対し、サンプルごとに与えた `δ_j, ρ_j` に対して、' char(10) char(10) '    Bd=[h^2/2;h],' char(10) '    e(j+1)=Ad*e(j)-Bd*(δ_j+ρ_j),' char(10) '    Vk=F*e(k)+δ_k.' char(10) char(10) '明示的な式は' char(10) char(10) '    Vk=F*Ad^k*e(0)+δ_k' char(10) '       -sum_{j=0}^{k-1} F*Ad^(k-1-j)*Bd*(δ_j+ρ_j).' char(10) char(10) 'これは `Vk` が**サンプル時刻の加速度指令値**であることを意味する。`Vk` を `v^(k)` と呼んではならない。' char(10) '`Bd` はR193の位置テイラー・速度オイラー型の離散化に整合する補正であり、連続線形系の厳密ZOH行列ではない。' char(10) char(10) '## 単位・混用禁止' char(10) '- 連続微分 `Jk` の単位は m/s^(2+k)。' char(10) '- 離散列 `Vk` の単位は kに依らず m/s^2。' char(10) '- `v1+Δv1` だけを差し替えたり、元の `Vfd` に連続時間の高階微分だけを直接加算しても、一貫した導関数列・離散列とは限らない。' char(10) '- 0～5階を並べることは必要な形式の一例だが、実際の4入力HLCとCBFへの接続は、生成側と受取側の数学的意味を統一してから行う。' char(10) char(10) '## 検証コード' char(10) '`test_CBF_HLC_RootCause.m` はV69でデフォルトで**高階生成のみ**実行。先行するV67機能を消していないが、V69では飛行・HLC・CBFのシミュレーションは行わない。' char(10) char(10) '`clear test_CBF_HLC_RootCause; rehash; result=test_CBF_HLC_RootCause(); disp(result.status); disp(result.zipPath);`' char(10) char(10) '`common_matlab/_CBF_TEST_OUTPUT` に結果ZIPだけを残す。V69の結果ZIPに再帰式と閉形式の誤差テーブルと理論整理を同梱。元の `V67` モードを明示的に呼ぶ場合は `struct(''v69JetOnly'',false)` を指定する。' char(10) char(10) '## 判定限界' char(10) 'この試験が通れば「宣言した連続・離散の数式に従う0～5階生成器」は構成できる。ただし、実19状態プラントの2～5階Lie微分、元のSymbolic Math Toolbox生成元、4入力CBFの可行性や実飛行が確認されたことにはならない。これらは次の独立した段階。' char(10) char(10) char(10) '==================== V70 NEW CHAPTER ====================' char(10) 'V70 2026-11-17: physical 19-state Taylor-jet generator and source audit' char(10) 'SOURCE: R193_USED_FLIGHT_20261030_222702_252.zip, exact MATLAB generated' char(10) '  model/substance/with_load_model_euler_for_HL.m (24 states).' char(10) '  @HLC_SUSPENDED_LOAD/HLC_SUSPENDED_LOAD.m maps estimator to x19.' char(10) 'x19=[quaternion4;bodyOmega3;loadPosition3;loadVelocity3;cableDirection3;cableOmega3].' char(10) 'These x19 components are available to the HLC as estimated states;' char(10) '  this test uses simulated such states, NOT uploaded hardware EKF logs.' char(10) 'Plant params are model source values; mL of the simulator is not asserted' char(10) '  to be directly know'],'char');
    fwrite(fid,['n on real hardware. Historical HLC mL estimate=0.01 kg.' char(10) 'Exact compact vector field, source-matched at tested x,u:' char(10) '  R(q)e3=b3, cp=omegaL cross pT.' char(10) '  qdot=0.5*q multiply [0,omegaB].' char(10) '  omegaBdot=J^{-1}*(tau-omegaB cross J*omegaB).' char(10) '  pLdot=vL; vLdot=-g*e3 + pT*(T*(pT dot b3) - m*L*norm(cp)^2)/(m+mL).' char(10) '  pTdot=omegaL cross pT; omegaLdot=-T/(m*L)*(pT cross b3).' char(10) 'Taylor automatic differentiation (no fifth numerical difference):' char(10) '  x(t+h)=sum_{k=0..5} x[k]*h^k, x[0]=CURRENT ESTIMATED STATE.' char(10) '  u[k]=u^(k)/k! must be KNOWN or DECLARED by a verified signal law.' char(10) '  x[k+1]=coefficient_k(f(x_series,u_series))/(k+1).' char(10) '  v1^(k)=kp*(zd^(k)-zL^(k))+kd*(zd^(k+1)-vL^(k)); k=0..5.' char(10) '  Source reference must provide derivatives zd^(0..6).' char(10) 'Instantaneous x plus CURRENT physically applied T determines v1^(0..1)' char(10) '  within the known 19-state model. Higher orders are NOT identifiable' char(10) '  without derivative information for u or a known physical input law.' char(10) '  Actual motor thrust may differ from the commanded thrust; the test' char(10) '  assumes exact commanded input in the R193 ideal simulation only.' char(10) 'ZOH zero derivatives are NOT artificial choices: they are conditional' char(10) '  on the documented 25ms simulator input hold for t within an open interval.' char(10) '  At switching times, two-sided high derivatives may not exist.' char(10) '  Any unmeasured real thrust rate or torque rate is NOT set to zero.' char(10) 'Input-derivative counterexamples are hypotheticals to demonstrate' char(10) '  non-identifiability and are NEVER applied as physical flight inputs.' char(10) 'Inputs and states are current estimates/commands only: NO prediction,' char(10) '  no extra hypothetical full-state observer, no CBF actuation claims.' char(10) 'Simulation uses unchanged R193 HLC, original gains and bounds;' char(10) '  high-order jets only observed, never fed into HLC.' char(10) 'Results source match: 7.10542736e-15, first derivative: 0, Ta'],'char');
    fwrite(fid,['ylor/RK4: 3.35287353e-14.' char(10) 'Previous V69 proves model-conditional algebra, V67 proves Vfd is discrete.' char(10) 'V70 proves neither input-jet real-time availability on hardware nor' char(10) '  a certified fifth-order CBF or closed-loop safety.' char(10) 'HANDOVER: full previous V69 embedded history plus this new chapter.' char(10) char(10) char(10) char(10) '================== V70 RESULT REVIEW / NEXT STEP (2026-11-18) ==================' char(10) char(10) '# V70 結果解析・累積研究引継ぎへの追補（2026-11-18）' char(10) char(10) '## 対象' char(10) 'ユーザー実行結果 `CBF_HLC_JET_V70_20261118_120136_627.zip` を直接展開して解析。元HLC・CBFを新たに改造した結果ではない。V70の結果ZIP内に `V70_FULL_UPDATED_HANDOVER.txt` (426,825 bytes) が存在することを確認。以降はこの累積引継ぎに追加すべき追補。' char(10) char(10) '## 判定' char(10) '実行結果7ファイルが正常収録。24状態元モデルとの19状態RHS照合は3時刻 t=0,0.5,2.125 s で最大 7.105427357601e-15。モデル直接計算の0,1階とテイラーADの整合は最大誤差0。0～5階ジェットによる短区間(1,2,4 ms)テイラー展開と12分割RK4の差は最大3.35287353436797e-14。モデル内・入力ZOH条件下での計算の数値整合は合格。ただし3時刻の短時間テイラー一致のみで任意状態・全階の厳密性を数学的証明したわけではない。' char(10) char(10) '## 実データ：v1^{(k)} ジェット（入力保持区間内の右側微分）' char(10) '|k|t=0.5 s|t=2.125 s|' char(10) '|---:|---:|---:|' char(10) '|0|1.71010446132352|1.65273729490053|' char(10) '|1|-0.172948963501917|-0.0145861822956585|' char(10) '|2|-4.08740790834677|1.08857391472284|' char(10) '|3|0.056681564751466|3.10164950862012|' char(10) '|4|-0.415007372273005|-13.987242614098|' char(10) '|5|-5.90530572979573|-49.1112021565826|' char(10) char(10) '## 入力微分に関する識別可能性（元ZIPのCSVから）' char(10) '`V70_REALTIME_AVAILABILITY_AUDIT.csv` では現在推定19状態+実際の適用入力が既知でモデルが正しければ、0階および1階を現在情報から算出可能。2～5階の `instantOnlyValue` はNaN（未確定）であり、入力時間則がZOHだと宣言した場合にだけ `ZOHConditionalValue` が数値で得られる。実機でのモータ物理推力の測定・同定は今回未検証。' char(10) '`V70_INPUT_JET_IDENTIFIABILITY.csv` は **同一状態・同一現在入力** で入力導関数だけ異なる2つの可能な入力時間則を比較。t=2.125 s の反例：' char(10) '- 推力の1階微分を単位だけ変えると、v1の2階微分が -27.467128 変わる。' char(10) '- 推力の2階微分を単位だけ変えると、v1の3階微分が -27.467128 変わる。' char(10) '- 推力の3階微分を単位だけ変えると、v1の4階微分が -27.467128 変わる。' char(10) '- 推力の4階微分を単位だけ変えると、v1の5階微分が -27.467128 変わる。' char(10) '- ピッチトルク（チャンネル3）の1階微分を単位だけ変えると v1の4階微分が -118.826762 変わり、2階微分を単位だけ変えると5階微分が同量変わる。' char(10) '- 他のトルク成分についてこの3つの主として平面軌道上の状態で感度がゼロでも、一般3D状態でゼロと結論しないこと。'],'char');
    fwrite(fid,[char(10) 'これは高階微分の生成に入力の時間法則が必要という非識別性の実証であって、これらの摂動入力で飛行した実測ではない。' char(10) char(10) '## 元モデル・実機利用での境界' char(10) '- V70の状態は推定器の形式へ並べ替えた **シミュレーション状態** であり、実機センサやEKFログを使ってはいない。ケーブル方向や角速度などが運転中に推定可能な精度で取得できるかは別途検証が必要。' char(10) '- V70ケースは `plantMass_kg=0.14` と HLC に使う `HLCMassEstimate_kg=0.01` が異なる。高階モデル微分はシミュレータの真値パラメータを使用したため、この一致は実機のパラメータ不確かさへの頑健性を証明しない。' char(10) '- シミュレーションの実際の適用コマンドを、物理入力そのものと同一視する理想モデル。実機では回転数/推力の推定またはアクチュエータダイナミクスが必要。' char(10) '- ZOH条件で入力導関数を0とするのは、**制御信号が一定と明示された開区間内部だけ**妥当。25msのサンプル切替瞬間には高階の両側微分は一般に存在せず、連続時間高階逆変換の厳密な入力としてそのまま適用できない。' char(10) '- 元Vfdは連続微分列ではなく離散公称値列（V67）。今回のJを元HLCへそのまま代入して改善すると判断してはならない。元のSymbolic入力変換との対応検証が必要。' char(10) '- この数値成果は0～5階の取得可能性を**条件付きで**示したもの。現実の5階オンライン取得、入力整合CBFの可行性、安全性、トルク増大の防止は未検証。' char(10) char(10) '## 次の作業（推力制限・CBF導入の前）' char(10) '1. 任意の現在推定状態xと、実際に制御器が内部で生成する滑らかな入力時間則u(t)から、テイラーADでジェットJ0..J5を出すインターフェイスを作る。必要な入力導関数u^(0..4)はその生成則または推定器から得て、得られなければ明示的に未確定とする。ゼロを代入して隠さない。' char(10) '2. 入力切替前後で必要な連続性(C^4以上、状況に応じC^5)を設計し、サンプル間も成立する検証をする。ZOHでのジェットは区間内だけの診断に限定。' char(10) '3. 3次元の複数状態（直線、曲線、ヨー・ロール・ピッチ、ケーブル振動、停留）で入力微分感度を検証。5階高次項を別の解析微分/高精度刻み依存試験とも照合し、特定の3スナップショットに依存しない確認を行う。' char(10) '4. 元HLCのVs/Beta2/V2_alpha2の実式が時間微分をどの意味で要請するかを元導出・生成コードで確認。元Vfdの離散値列と真のジェットを混同しない。' char(10) '5. ここまで満たして初めて、補正を先に決めて後から微分するのでなく、補正とその高階時間発展を安全入力決定の内部に組み込む。推力下限を人工的に付加しない。' char(10) char(10) '## 取り扱い' char(10) 'V70の研究引継ぎ原文は受領ZIP内 `V70_FULL_UPDATED_HANDOVER.txt` に収録。今回の文書はその内容を改変せず、**実行結果に基づいた判定と残課題を追記するための別添**である。' char(10) char(10) char(10) char(10) '========== V71 CAUSAL C5 FOUR-INPUT COMMAND GENERATOR ==========' char(10) '2026-11-18. User requested to turn V70 conditional derivatives into' char(10) '  causal, sample-boundary-valid 0..5 jets. Scope: actual estimated-' char(10) '  layout 19-state R193 simulation, four commands, original HLC/R1' char(10) '  used ONLY to generate targets. Original HLC/plant/CBF not edited.' char(10) 'SAMPLE UPDATE: occurs every 25ms even WITHOUT CBF. A direct ZOH' char(10) '  physical command generally jumps, so its classical time derivative' char(10) '  at the jump does not exist. R1 engaging is one exam'],'char');
    fwrite(fid,['ple.' char(10) 'DYNAMIC GENERATOR: for each of 4 channels, y1dot=w*(r-y1),' char(10) '  y2dot=w*(y1-y2),...,y6dot=w*(y5-y6), physical u=y6.' char(10) '  r is latest saturated original-HLC or original-R1 target and is' char(10) '  known at current sample from current state. The internal 24 y' char(10) '  states are controller-owned memory, NOT external measured states.' char(10) '  For k=0..5, u^(k)=e6^T*A^k*y, A=w*(-I+subdiag(1)).' char(10) '  This depends on y ONLY. Therefore u through u^(5) is C0 at' char(10) '  arbitrary jumps in r if y remains continuous. u(t) is C5.' char(10) '  V70 v1^(0..5) requires u^(0..4), obtained here causally.' char(10) '  Taylor AD uses the ACTUAL applied u=y6, not target r.' char(10) '  Combined R193 plant + six stages integrated with RK4. Source24' char(10) '  comparison, direct 0/1 derivative check, 1ms Taylor/RK4 check.' char(10) '  Switch test compares BOTH SIDES AT SAME INSTANT. A difference' char(10) '  in applied u between successive sample times is NOT a jump.' char(10) '  omega=20,40 rad/s are experimental bandwidths, not identified' char(10) '  actuator bandwidths or guaranteed safe values. Rates/horizon can' char(10) '  be changed through opts.v71Omega/opts.v71Horizon.' char(10) '  The six-stage filter causes DELAY. Original R1 interval constraint' char(10) '  applies to its selected target, NOT filtered applied u. Hence' char(10) '  R1 safety and HOCBF invariance are NOT certified; the filter may' char(10) '  violate obstacle CBF constraints, may make original HLC lag.' char(10) '  On R1 infeasibility the test stops and NEVER silently replaces' char(10) '  target with nominal safe input or calls it a success.' char(10) '  Six stages introduce new INTERNAL dynamic state. Later safety' char(10) '  QP must constrain that augmented dynamics and 4 physical bounds' char(10) '  jointly, not filter an already solved safety input afterward.' char(10) '  Real motor/ESC dynamics may differ from this virtual generator,' char(10) '  and actual force must be measured/estimated or actuator modelled' char(10) '  before claiming REAL physical jets from sen'],'char');
    fwrite(fid,['sed data.' char(10) '  Source-matched model coefficients use simulator true mL=0.14kg;' char(10) '  nominal HLC initial load estimate=0.01kg, not real EKF logs.' char(10) '  V67 Vfd source is discrete nominal sequence, NOT 0..5 real jet;' char(10) '  V71 does not substitute true jets into HLC inverses or solve that' char(10) '  separate semantic mismatch. No added thrust lower floor.' char(10) '  See output SUMMARY and TRACE for measured success/failure.' char(10) '  Next: model real actuator tracking; simultaneous safety optimizer' char(10) '  involving filter state, feasibility and obstacle constraints,' char(10) '  HLC consistency and idle equilibrium/CBF release analysis.' char(10) '===============================================================' char(10) char(10) 'V72 ZOH 25ms PHYSICAL ONE-SIDED HIGH-ORDER DERIVATIVES' char(10) 'Date 2026-11-18; based on original R193 HLC and physical plant.' char(10) 'IMPORTANT USER CORRECTION: original HLC and R1 both update every' char(10) '  25ms; applied four controls are ZOH and actually held between updates.' char(10) '  DO NOT insert a six-stage command filter merely to obtain C5 inputs.' char(10) '  V71 changed the physical input law and cannot prove original HLC behavior.' char(10) 'V71 ERROR ARCHIVE 20261118_121412: MATLAB row width mismatch: at' char(10) '  v71CausalC5JetTest line 32015, rows initialized cell(0,25) but' char(10) '  26 cells appended. V71 produced NO flight-validation CSV; this is' char(10) '  a software instrumentation error, NOT high-order mathematics failure.' char(10) 'MATHEMATICAL ZOH SIGNAL: u(t)=u_n on [t_n,t_(n+1)), dt=0.025s.' char(10) '  For each open interval (t_n,t_(n+1)), u^(j)=0, j>=1 BY DEFINITION' char(10) '  of the APPLIED simulation input, not as an arbitrary approximation.' char(10) '  At a boundary t_n, x(t_n-) = x(t_n+) in the ideal plant, but' char(10) '  u(t_n-) = u_(n-1), u(t_n+) = u_n; one-sided state output jets' char(10) '  can differ. Their equality is NOT required by sampled-data HLC.' char(10) '  If controls jump, classical two-sided input derivatives and output' char(10) '  high-orde'],'char');
    fwrite(fid,['r derivatives may be undefined AT THAT SINGLE INSTANT.' char(10) '  Do NOT conflate this with CBF on/off; nominal HLC updates too.' char(10) 'MEASURABLE / AVAILABLE in the R193 IDEAL SIMULATION: current 19-state' char(10) '  estimate-layout x, known actually applied 4-command u_(n-1) and u_n,' char(10) '  known reference derivatives 0..6 and model source parameters.' char(10) '  Source-matched 19-state v70RHS19 and Taylor AD v70PhysicalJet are' char(10) '  unchanged. For each left/right hold, pass U=[u, zeros(4,4)].' char(10) '  Then compute J_(0..5) from the genuine plant (not finite differences).' char(10) '  All jets depend only on the CURRENT state and the CURRENT or PREVIOUS' char(10) '  known held command. No future HLC/CBF input or new actuator state.' char(10) 'ANALYTIC SAME-STATE BOUNDARY CHECK for v1=kp*(zd-zL)+kd*(vzd-vL):' char(10) '  J0+ - J0- = 0;' char(10) '  J1+ - J1- = -kd*(pTz*(pT dot b3)/(m+mL))*(T_n-T_(n-1)).' char(10) '  At that instant, torque jumps need not directly enter v1 dot.' char(10) '  Higher one-sided jets include true torque effects through dynamics.' char(10) 'TEST: original NOMINAL_ZOH versus original R1_ZOH without any filter,' char(10) '  no modifications to HLC, original R1, or physical dynamics.' char(10) '  Applied 4 inputs exactly clipped as in original baseline. R1 failure' char(10) '  stops case, never silently falls back or calls it safe.' char(10) '  Use original CBF_V19_OriginalPlantStep with 4 substeps to propagate' char(10) '  each hold, and independently compare v70Step (same RK4 schedule).' char(10) '  Source24 RHS equality, direct J0/J1, one-ms Taylor vs RK4, boundary' char(10) '  J0 continuity and analytic J1 jump tested. Actual left/right' char(10) '  high-order derivative DIFFERENCES are recorded, NOT marked errors.' char(10) '  A sampled-data CBF safety guarantee requires enforcing a discrete' char(10) '  condition or verified safety across EACH intersample hold. Checking' char(10) '  one-sided jets alone does not prove any barrier invariance.' char(10) '  This is not a continuous-time C5 input controller or'],'char');
    fwrite(fid,[' complete CBF.' char(10) '  No arbitrary new nominal thrust floor. HLC mass estimate 0.01kg' char(10) '  differs from simulator physical 0.14kg; real actuator behavior and' char(10) '  high-order jet accuracy on hardware are not verified.' char(10) '  V67 source Vfd retains discrete nominal value semantics; physical' char(10) '  ZOH one-sided jets are NOT silently plugged into Vs/V2_alpha2.' char(10) '  Next: validate source HLC inverse semantic correspondence, then' char(10) '  design sampled-data CBF using original dt, held 4 physical inputs,' char(10) '  full physical constraints and intersample safety, no postfilter.' char(10) 'CUMULATIVE HISTORY: previous original research history preserved;' char(10) '  V71 theoretical trial and error provenance recorded; V72 added.' char(10) char(10) char(10) char(10) '========== V72 USER MEASURED RESULTS / RESEARCH REVIEW ==========' char(10) char(10) '# V72 ZOH片側高階微分：実測結果と次への引継ぎ' char(10) char(10) '日付：2026-11-18' char(10) '根拠：ユーザー提出 `CBF_HLC_JET_V72_20261118_122152_467.zip`、収録 `V72_ZOH_BOUNDARY_SUMMARY.csv`, `V72_ZOH_C0_C5_ONE_SIDED_JETS.csv`, `V72_ZOH_THEORY_AND_ERROR_REVIEW.txt`、今回照合した `test_CBF_HLC_RootCause.m`。' char(10) char(10) '## 1. 実測された成立事項' char(10) char(10) '- 元R193の25ms理想ZOHを保持。6段平滑化フィルタは使っていない。' char(10) '- NOMINAL_ZOHは2.400秒まで97状態を記録。ORIGINAL_R1_ZOHは2.325秒まで94状態を記録し、次の2.350秒のR1入力決定で`R1_UNAVAILABLE_INFEASIBLE_SHARED_THRUST`により停止。' char(10) '- 19状態と元24状態のRHS一致：両条件とも最大5.3290705182e-15。' char(10) '- 計算した0、1階ジェットと直接微分式：両条件とも誤差0。' char(10) '- 同一状態・同一時刻・更新前後のJ0差：全更新で0。' char(10) '- J1入力切替式の最大誤差：NOMINAL 6.2533311862e-14、R1 8.5265128291e-14。' char(10) '- 1ms Taylor-vs-RK4 最大誤差：NOMINAL 1.0280665208e-13、R1 9.1704421834e-14。' char(10) '- 25ms元24状態積分と別実装19状態積分の差：NOMINAL 8.5098596532e-15、R1 4.0371986865e-9。' char(10) '- 最大のHLC生トルク：NOMINAL 0.0020022Nm、R1 135.2293902Nm。HLC生推力最小：NOMINAL 7.57332N、R1 -2.7227217N。' char(10) '- R1は2.125秒からR1決定を9回試し、実際の推力増加は2.150秒から。' char(10) char(10) '## 2. 具体的な切替時の観測' char(10) char(10) '- 2.150秒：推力 8.866646N → 12.172245N。J1は +0.013560 → -90.774109 (差-90.787669)。モデルから求めたジャンプ式と約8.5e-14の誤差で一致。' char(10) '- 2.200秒：R1出力推力 11.975428N → 5.176124N (差-6.799304N)。2.225秒には 5.176124'],'char');
    fwrite(fid,['N → 12.175467N (差+6.999342N)。これはR1の更新ごとの入力大幅切替であり、微分計算そのものの失敗ではない。' char(10) '- 2.275秒：トルクYは前の約0.220123Nmから上限1Nmへ。J5左約60587.23、右約1199976.48、差約1139389.26 (m/s^7)。各階の単位が違うため、0～5階を混在させた最大ノルムを『物理トルク増大の尺度』とみなさない。' char(10) '- 2.300秒：元HLC生推力0.415391N、実適用推力13.501730N、元生トルク135.229390Nm、適用Yトルク1Nm、吊り荷上昇速度約0.361045m/s。' char(10) '- 2.325秒：元HLC生推力 -2.722722N、実適用推力16.447535N、Yトルク1Nm、吊り荷上昇速度約0.488690m/s。' char(10) char(10) '## 3. 理論的に成立する範囲' char(10) char(10) 'ZOH入力 `u(t)=u_n` は各開区間 `(t_n,t_(n+1))` で一定、`u^(j)=0` (j>=1) は**その区間内部の入力信号の数学的性質**であり、未来の入力を一定と予測した仮定ではない。更新時刻では `u_{n-1}` と `u_n` でそれぞれ片側ジェット `J_j^-`, `J_j^+` (j=0..5) を計算する。`J0` は同一状態で連続、`J1` は推力ジャンプに応じて変化、さらに高階は実モデルから計算される。全時刻で入力と0～5階を連続にする必要はない。' char(10) char(10) '切替時刻の二側連続時間微分は一般には定義されず、片側ジェットをサンプル値HLCの離散入力逆変換に無条件代入してよいわけではない。元`Vfd`の6成分は `F Ad^k e` の**離散公称値列**であり、`Vs`/`V2_alpha2` の生成ソース上の `dV1` 等と数学的に同一かどうかは依然未解決。' char(10) char(10) '## 4. ソフトウェア上の記録ミス（次版で修正）' char(10) char(10) '`V72_ZOH_C0_C5_ONE_SIDED_JETS.csv` の `hasLeftHold` は191行すべて0。ただし実際の左ジェットは初期時刻以外の189行に存在する。`test_CBF_HLC_RootCause.m` 内のV72処理は `n==0` で`hasLeft=false`をセットした後、`n>0`枝で`true`へ代入していない。**フラグの誤記録であり、J0やJ1の数値検算そのものを覆す事実ではない**。次のコード変更時に`n>0`の枝で`hasLeft=true`とし、結果CSVを再検査すること。' char(10) char(10) '## 5. PASSの意味と未完成点' char(10) char(10) 'コード上の`PASS_R193_ZOH_ONE_SIDED_C0_C5_MODEL_CONDITIONAL__NO_SAFETY_CERTIFICATION`は、あくまでモデル・片側ジェットの数値検証の合格。R1は途中で不可行になっているため、閉ループ制御やCBFが成功したという意味ではない。さらに5階ジェットの**独立した解析的証明**や任意状態に対する保証ではなく、短区間の数値一致が得られたことを示す。' char(10) char(10) '未完成：元HLCの高階逆変換と真の片側ジェット／離散公称列の対応、CBF補正の同時決定、入力箱+下位CBF条件+区間内安全の同時可行性、トルク暴走抑制、元HLC生推力の負値・停留時の復帰、実機質量推定・ロータ応答の整合。' char(10) char(10) '## 6. 次の優先事項' char(10) char(10) '1. 元R193の `Vfd/UF/Vs/Beta2/V2_alpha2` と記号導出（可能なら生成元）を照合し、各渡し引数が時間微分か予測値かを厳密に整理。勝手に元HLCを変更しない。' char(10) '2. 25ms ZOHの**サンプル時刻の更新値**を決める時点で、0～5階片側ジェットが入力`u_n`にどう依存するかを用い、同じ状態からの4入力の決定を調べる。CBFが推力を先に決めて後からトルクを合わせる方式を完成としない。' char(10) '3. ZOHでの25ms区間内の安全性、物理入力制限、CBF可行性、停留・復帰を個別に評価する。高階ジェットの計算成功を安全保証と混同しない。' char(10) '4. V65の同一状態でのHLC推力分子時間微分差（CBF/HLC、約-246.91N/s）という原因解析を保持し、今回の上昇速度（2.300秒0.361m/s, 2.'],'char');
    fwrite(fid,['325秒0.489m/s）と関連づける。人工的な生推力下限は導入しない。' char(10) char(10) '保存した過去の研究履歴：同梱元の`V72_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt`を別途連結した新しい累積版に残す。' char(10) char(10) char(10) '========== V73 逆変換整合 / トルク可行性 新章 ==========' char(10) '# V73：R193の高階逆変換整合とトルク暴走防止 — 理論設計・次の実測契約' char(10) char(10) '作成：2026-11-18。状態：**理論の定式化および原ソース照合のみ**。V73の新制御器／MATLAB閉ループ実行はまだ行っていない。V72の取得結果を直接読んだうえでの設計。' char(10) char(10) '## 0. 対象・変更しない前提' char(10) char(10) '- 元R193 HLCの `HLC_SUSPENDED_LOAD.m`、`Vfd_SuspendedLoadxyDst.m`、`Uf_SuspendedLoadxyDst.m`、`Vs_SuspendedLoadxyDst.m`、`Beta2_SuspendedLoadxyDst.m`、`V2_alpha2_SuspendedLoadxyDst.m` の実ソースを照合。' char(10) '- 推定19状態 `x=[q(4); ω_B(3); p_L(3); v_L(3); p_T(3); ω_L(3)]`、参照軌道、既存のR193モデルおよび推定物理パラメータ、25ms ZOH入力 `u_n=[T_n;τ_n]` のみをオンライン入力とする。実プラントの真の吊り荷質量など、制御器が入手できない値をコントローラ内部で使用しない。' char(10) '- 物理入力は `0≤T≤20N`, `|τ_i|≤1Nm`。CBF・地面・紐張力等の制約は次段で含める。本資料で新たな推力下限、トルク飽和後の『逆変換一致』宣言、入力平滑化、入力微分の架空の値は導入しない。' char(10) char(10) '## 1. 何が実測され、何が未達か' char(10) char(10) 'V72の `V72_ZOH_C0_C5_ONE_SIDED_JETS.csv` から抜粋：' char(10) char(10) '| t(s) | HLC生T(N) | HLC生最大|τ|(Nm) | 適用T(N) | σ_min(Beta2) |' char(10) '| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |' char(10) '| 2.250 | 4.988445 | 0.220122 | 12.255271 | 20.863256 |' char(10) '| 2.275 | 2.849852 | 1.679520 | 12.521498 | 20.876713 |' char(10) '| 2.300 | 0.415391 | 135.229390 | 13.501730 | 4.948740 |' char(10) '| 2.325 | -2.722722 | 2.655446 | 16.447535 | 21.023338 |' char(10) char(10) '同じ `beta2` と右辺を固定すれば、2.275s・2.300sのHLC原仮想目標を±1Nmのトルクで厳密実現することはできない。2.300sは行列の小特異値が下がるがゼロではなく、行列特異性だけが原因とは証明されない。以前のV65では0階推力対応を再構成して同時刻のトルクが0.035Nmとなったが、微分の高階時間整合まで達成した試験ではない。V72の0～5階ジェット成功は、逆変換を満たした証明ではない。' char(10) char(10) '## 2. ソースに存在する三つの異なる『高階入力』を混同しない' char(10) char(10) 'A. `Vfd` が生成する **離散的公称値列**：`F1 A_d^k e`（k=0..5）。連続時間微分ではない（V67照合済み）。' char(10) char(10) 'B. V72の **追従フィードバック値のZOH片側微分**：`j^fb_k=(∂t+f(x,u_n)·∇)^k [F11(z_d-z_L)+F12(ż_d-v_Lz)]`、k=0..5。各25ms区間の内部で入力一定、境界は別々の片側微分を取る。`j^fb_0` は現在のuに依存しないが `j^fb_1` 以降には実入力が入る。' char(10) char(10) 'C. **物理的に実現された鉛直仮想加速度とそのZOH片側微分**：`j^real_0=z̈_L(x,u_n)-z̈_d(t)` と `j^real_k=(∂t+f(x,u_n)·∇)^k j^real_0`。これはBとは異なる。HLC仮想指令を変更したときの `Uf` の相互逆変換にはCを使用し、その意味を別途検証'],'char');
    fwrite(fid,['する。' char(10) char(10) '任意のuでは `j^fb_0 ≠ j^real_0` があり得る（とくにCBF推力介入、入力飽和、パラメータずれ）。この二つを同一視して `Vs`・`V2_alpha2` に渡すと、実現可能性を根拠なく仮定してしまう。' char(10) char(10) '## 3. 元R193の推力逆変換を厳密に書き直す（推力制約の追加ではない）' char(10) char(10) '元 `Uf` から' char(10) char(10) '```' char(10) 'M=m+m_L,' char(10) 'γ(x)=p_Tz (p_T · b_3(q)),' char(10) 'κ(x)=m L p_Tz ||ω_L × p_T||²,' char(10) 'T=[M(v_1+z̈_d+g)+κ]/γ .' char(10) '```' char(10) char(10) '同じモデルパラメータ・γ≠0なら、逆方向は' char(10) char(10) '```' char(10) 'v_1^real=[γ T-κ]/M -z̈_d-g.' char(10) '```' char(10) char(10) 'この等式は『現在の実入力Tが生んでいる鉛直仮想加速度』を示す。元のフィードバック `F1 e` と一致するとは限らない。オンラインでは同式を**推定パラメータ**で使う。真のパラメータとの差はモデル誤差として独立記録する。' char(10) char(10) '4階までの `j^real` をZOHのTaylor/Lie微分で得るには、原則として参照 `z_d` の6階微分までが必要。もし `j^real_5` まで主張するなら参照の7階微分も必要になる（`j^fb_5` は参照6階までで可能）。**元逆変換は `Vs` で3階、`V2_alpha2` で4階までしか直接参照しない**ため、まず0..4で実現性を確かめ、5階の意味は定義別に明示する。' char(10) char(10) '## 4. 逆変換を『解いてから飽和』ではなく『実現可能な組を選ぶ』へ変更' char(10) char(10) '元R193の逆変換右辺を `b_2(x,Xd,J,v_s) = V2_alpha2_SuspendedLoadxyDst(x,Xd,J,v_s,P)` とし、`β_2(x,Xd,J_0)=Beta2_SuspendedLoadxyDst(x,Xd,J,P)` とする。' char(10) char(10) '完全な仮想入力変更 `(J, v_s)` と物理4入力 `(T,τ)` の最低限の代数整合条件：' char(10) char(10) '```' char(10) 'T = Uf(x,Xd,J,P)(1)             [モデル一致、γ≠0]' char(10) 'β_2(x,Xd,J_0) τ = b_2(x,Xd,J,v_s)   [3成分]' char(10) '0≤T≤20, |τ_i|≤1                [物理入力箱]' char(10) '```' char(10) char(10) '高階を厳密にするには、さらに `J_k=j^real_k(x,t,u_n)` (k=0..4) として同じZOHの実入力4成分から得る。これらはトルクに依存し得るので、**τを求めてからジェットを評価する後付け方式ではなく、全て同時に扱う非線形制約**となる。`V_s` も公称 `Vs(x,Xd,J,F2,F3,F4)` に固定せず、変更量Δv_sを可能にし、変更の大きさを評価する。絶対に `V_s` を野放図に選んで『等式が成立したから安定』とは判定しない。' char(10) char(10) '固定J・固定v_sに対しては、トルク実現可能性を' char(10) char(10) '```' char(10) 'b_2 ∈ β_2 [-1,1]^3' char(10) '```' char(10) char(10) 'で判定する。βが可逆なら `τ*=β\b_2` の各成分が±1以内であることと等価。βが小特異値／ランク落ちなら行列を逆にせず、箱上での残差 `min_{|τ_i|≤1} ||βτ-b_2||` と最小特異値を分けて記録する。**入力箱を内包した制約として解く**のが本題。' char(10) char(10) 'ただし『実現された `J` と実現された `V_s` を物理入力から定義し直す』だけなら代数等式は自明に成立し、追従能力やCBF実現可能性は示せない。したがって公称仮想目標との差、CBF条件、実用上の状態帰還・停留・回復を同時に評価する。' char(10) char(10) '## 5. 初めの検査：Shadow 4通り（元の飛行を変更しない）' char(10) char(10) '同じ `x,t` と元のR1適用 `u=[T,τ]` を使う：' char(10) char(10) '1. ORIGINAL：`Vfd_source` と元 `Vs`、元 `Beta2`、元 `V2_alpha2` で `βτ - b`、HLC生T・生τを再現。' char(10) '2. REMAP0：適用Tに一致する `J_0` だけ再構成し、上位成分は古い値のまま再計算。V65でトルクが下がったが高階不整合が残ることを明示。' char(10) '3. ZOH_REAL0_4：適用Tおよび**適用全3軸τ*'],'char');
    fwrite(fid,['*から、推定モデルで `j^real_0..4` を生成し、`Vs`・`Beta2`・`V2_alpha2` を全て再計算。`βτ-b`、トルク箱での可行性、公称 `Vs` からの隔たりを観測（**作成したジェットの全体が元の連続時間HLC導出に有効かを別途検査**）。' char(10) '4. FEASIBLE_VIRTUAL：その同一状態で `(T,τ, Δv_s)` を共通の決定変数として、0..4のZOH_REALジェット・物理入力箱・正確な右辺・非安全制約を同時に満たせるかを探索。まず飛行への適用はせずShadowのみ。これは一般に非線形問題であり、QPを構成できると先に決めつけない。' char(10) char(10) '保存項目：Traw/Tapplied、τraw/τapplied、`v_fb`/`v_real`、0..4の各差、`β`最小特異値、`||b||`、`||βτ-b||`、箱内τ可行性、変更 `||Δv_s||`、姿勢・紐の状態と張力、参照値、モデルパラメータ推定／真値差、計算時間。' char(10) char(10) '最初にV72と同じ2.125～2.325秒の同一状態で評価し、さらに通常HLCの同時刻も比較。V65の0階だけ小さくなる事象が高階・物理モデルで再現されるか確認する。' char(10) char(10) '## 6. その後の4入力安全最適化（未実装）' char(10) char(10) '```' char(10) 'min_{T,τ,Δv_s}  ||u-u_HLC||_W² + λ ||Δv_s||² + ...' char(10) ' subject to' char(10) '   0≤T≤20, |τ_i|≤1,' char(10) '   J_0..4 = actual ZOH-jet(x, t, T, τ; estimated plant),' char(10) '   β(x,J_0)τ = b_2(x,J,Vs_nom(J)+Δv_s),' char(10) '   CBF constraints for drone, cable, load, ground,' char(10) '   appropriate lower-order HOCBF auxiliary inequalities,' char(10) '   a justified 25-ms intersample safety margin.' char(10) '```' char(10) char(10) 'この式は『解ける・安全になる』と証明済みのQPではない。状態・入力に対して非線形であり、CBF制約群が実現不能なら不可能と報告する。入力相対次数、混合相対次数、制約の局所退化、サンプリング余裕、必要なバリア補助集合を実プラントから導く。予測ホライズンMPCは必須ではなく、25ms ZOHサンプル上の解析的マージン／十分条件も候補。CBFの値だけをサンプル時刻で確認して『区間内安全』とはしない。' char(10) char(10) '## 7. 『生トルク135Nmを計算しないようにしたい』の意味' char(10) char(10) '- **物理的適用トルク**が1Nm以内：選ぶ段階で入力箱を課すことで満たせる。これは既存の後段飽和とは異なるが、それだけではCBF安全・追従は保証されない。' char(10) '- **逆変換の生トルク**が135Nmにならない：元の仮想要求 `(J,V_s)` を保持したままでは2.300sに不可能。**仮想要求を可行集合へ変更する**必要がある。' char(10) '- **元HLCの推力が次周期に負にならない／停留から戻る**：V65で見つけた速度フィードバックとCBFの競合・実行可能領域・再帰可行性の問題。上記の代数逆変換だけでは保証しない。' char(10) char(10) '## 8. 重要な出典と検証範囲' char(10) char(10) '元ソース：ユーザー提供 `R193_USED_FLIGHT_20261030_222702_252.zip` 内のHLCクラスと生成関数。観測値：ユーザー提供 `CBF_HLC_JET_V72_20261118_122152_467.zip` 内の `V72_ZOH_C0_C5_ONE_SIDED_JETS.csv` とサマリー。V65の同時刻REMAP0値は過去の研究履歴から。' char(10) char(10) '関連論文（一般的な枠組みでありR193実装の保証ではない）：' char(10) '- Lin et al., *High-Order Control Barrier Function-Based Robust Safety-Critical Control With Sampled-Data Input*, IEEE Transactions on Cybernetics, 2025, https://doi.org/10'],'char');
    fwrite(fid,['.1109/tcyb.2025.3599645' char(10) '- Garg et al., *Advances in the Theory of Control Barrier Functions*, Annual Reviews in Control, 2024, https://doi.org/10.1016/j.arcontrol.2024.100945' char(10) '- Tan et al., *Zero-order Control Barrier Functions for Sampled-Data Systems with State and Input Dependent Safety Constraints*, 2024, https://arxiv.org/abs/2411.17079' char(10) char(10) '**到達点**：ZOH高階微分だけでなく、逆変換を物理入力制限と同時に成立させる数学的候補集合を具体的に定義した。**未達**：源生成式の高階時間微分との一致の独立数値検証・V73 MATLAB実行・4入力CBFおよび閉ループの実証。' char(10) char(10) char(10) 'V74 IMPLEMENTATION UPDATE 2026-11-18' char(10) 'Source files: R193 original @HLC_SUSPENDED_LOAD functions, V72 physical Taylor routine, V73 inverse theoretical plan.' char(10) 'V74 implements pure 25ms ZOH shadow analysis on nominal and original R1 trajectories.' char(10) 'It compares source Vfd, remap0, actual feedback Lie jet and realized vertical 0..4 ZOH jet under controller-known mass estimate. Independent physical horizontal sixth derivatives and yaw second are used to check source inverse.' char(10) 'It computes Vs correction required for exactly matching actual applied torque and explores bounded 3-axis torque changes at R1 t=2.275 and 2.300 without changing applied flight. This is NOT a CBF safety-certified design and NOT a closed-loop V74 controller.' char(10) 'Crucial: physical output virtual goal is not freely selectable; only independent identity can show generator mapping truth. If identity fails must NOT assert proven high-order inverse correctness.' char(10) 'V74 differential consistency is only ZOH one-sided within sample intervals. Fifth derivative of realized virtual acceleration would require ref7; source inverse directly requires only orders0..4, but feedback value Jfb0..5 is independently available.' char(10) 'The optimization is limited local heuristic; no global feasibility claim. Physical model values remain simulation truth and are never silently substituted for es'],'char');
    fwrite(fid,['timator parameters.' char(10) 'All output flags/limitations must be reported honestly.' char(10)],'char');
end

function result=v74ErrorArtifact(ME)
root=fileparts(mfilename('fullpath'));
outdir=fullfile(root,'_CBF_TEST_OUTPUT');
if exist(outdir,'dir')~=7,mkdir(outdir);end
work=tempname;mkdir(work);cc=onCleanup(@()v69Cleanup(work)); %#ok<NASGU>
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V74_RUNTIME_ERROR.txt'), ...
    getReport(ME,'extended','hyperlinks','off'));
v74WriteHandover(fullfile(work,'V74_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt'));
path=fullfile(outdir,['CBF_HLC_INVERSE_V74_ERROR_' ...
    datestr(now,'yyyymmdd_HHMMSS_FFF') '.zip']);
zip(path,{'V74_RUNTIME_ERROR.txt','V74_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt'},work);
result=struct('status',['FAILED_V74_RUNTIME_' ME.identifier], ...
    'zipPath',path,'nCases',0,'nRuntimeErrors',1, ...
    'nFailedCases',1,'nR1FilterStops',0);
end


function result=v75FourInputAblation(opts)
% A causal, 25ms-ZOH, same-estimated-model constrained local search.
% Five REAL closed loops: NOMINAL, R1, T_ONLY, TAU_ONLY, JOINT.
% Plus same-R1-state SHADOW ablation, to remove closed-loop-state confounding.
% IMPORTANT: R1 depends on thrust only: TAU_ONLY cannot repair an active
% thrust inequality at a fixed current state. This is a genuine infeasibility.
required={'CBF_V19_Scenarios','CBF_V19_OriginalPlantStep', ...
          'CBF_V18_R1_RectifiedCable','lqrd'};
if exist('test_CBF_SetupPaths','file')==2,test_CBF_SetupPaths();end
for j=1:numel(required)
    if exist(required{j},'file')==0
        error('CBF:V75SourceMissing','Required original source missing: %s',required{j});
    end
end
if exist('HLC_SUSPENDED_LOAD','class')~=8
    error('CBF:V75HLCMissing','Original HLC class missing');
end
sc=CBF_V19_Scenarios('straight_single','R193');sc.dt=0.025;
s=sc.settings;H=v23MakeHLC(s,sc.dt);
mhat=0.01;
if isfield(opts,'v75MassEstimate'),mhat=opts.v75MassEstimate;end
assert(isscalar(mhat)&&isfinite(mhat)&&mhat>0,'CBF:V75MassEstimate');
sest=s;sest.physical.massLoad=mhat;
lo=[s.input.thrustMin;s.input.torqueMin(:)];
hi=[s.input.thrustMax;s.input.torqueMax(:)];
assert(numel(lo)==4 && numel(hi)==4 && all(hi>lo),'CBF:V75Bounds');
modes={'NOMINAL','R1_ORIGINAL','THRUST_ONLY','TORQUE_ONLY','JOINT_FOUR'};
flight=struct([]); summaries=struct([]);shadow=struct([]);causal=struct([]);
caseErrors=0; maxSteps=round(2.4/sc.dt);
for im=1:numel(modes)
    mode=modes{im};x=sc.x0(:);stop='HORIZON_REACHED';
    lastTime=NaN; nFlight=0;nFailures=0;nR1Violation=0;
    minRawThrust=Inf;maxRawTau=0;maxAppliedTau=0;
    maxInverseErr=0;maxPhysicalErr=0; nOptimized=0;
    minCBFResidual=Inf;minRectified=Inf;minTension=Inf;
    minCableH=Inf;maxPosErr=0;
    meanEvalTime=0;nSafetyCalls=0;nSearchOverBudget=0;
    for k=0:maxSteps
        t=k*sc.dt;
        try
            a=v23HLC(x,t,sc,H,mhat);
            uNom=min(hi,max(lo,a.raw(:)));
            [tlo,thi,r1info]=v75R1Interval(x,s,sc.obstacles,t);
            if ~strcmp(r1info.reason,'OK')
                if ~any(strcmp(mode,{'NOMINAL','TORQUE_ONLY'}))
                    stop=['R1_SET_' r1info.reason];nFailures=nFailures+1;break;
                end
                % The torque-only case is explicitly UNSAFE diagnostic:
                % R1 has no instantaneous torque authority; do not silently
                % discard the case before its causal contribution is measured.
            elseif tlo>thi+1e-9 && ~any(strcmp(mode,{'NOMINAL','TORQUE_ONLY'}))
                stop='R1_INFEASIBLE_THRUST_INTERVAL';nFailures=nFailures+1;break;
            end
            if strcmp(mode,'NOMINAL')
                u=uNom;policy='UNMODIFIED_NOMINAL';
                info=v75BlankOpt();
            elseif strcmp(mode,'R1_ORIGINAL')
                if t>=2.125-1e-9
                    u=[min(thi,max(tlo,uNom(1)));uNom(2:4)];
                else
                    u=uNom;
                end
                policy='UNMODIFIED_ORIGINAL_R1';info=v75BlankOpt();
            else
                [u,info,policy]=v75Choose(x,t,sc,H,sest,a,uNom,lo,hi,tlo,thi,mode);
                if ~strcmp(info.status,'OK')
                    stop=['OPT_' info.status];nFailures=nFailures+1;break;
                end
                nOptimized=nOptimized+double(info.nEvaluations>0);
                meanEvalTime=meanEvalTime+info.elapsed_s;
                nSearchOverBudget=nSearchOverBudget+double(info.elapsed_s>sc.dt);
            end
            if any(~isfinite(u)) || any(u<lo-1e-8) || any(u>hi+1e-8)
                stop='INVALID_OUTPUT_BOUNDS';nFailures=nFailures+1;break;
            end
            lastTime=t;
            minRawThrust=min(minRawThrust,a.thrust);
            maxRawTau=max(maxRawTau,norm(a.tau,Inf));
            maxAppliedTau=max(maxAppliedTau,norm(u(2:4),Inf));
            if t>=2.125-1e-9
                [cbfResid,hR]=v75R1Residual(x,s,sc.obstacles,u(1));
                minCBFResidual=min(minCBFResidual,cbfResid);
                minRectified=min(minRectified,hR);
                if isfinite(cbfResid) && cbfResid< -1e-7,nR1Violation=nR1Violation+1;end
                nSafetyCalls=nSafetyCalls+1;
            else
                cbfResid=NaN;hR=NaN;
            end
            if t>=2.100-1e-9
                check=v75Candidate(x,t,sc,H,sest,a,u,uNom);
                if ~check.valid
                    stop=['PHYSICAL_INVERSE_' check.reason];nFailures=nFailures+1;break;
                end
                maxInverseErr=max(maxInverseErr,check.inverseResidual);
                maxPhysicalErr=max(maxPhysicalErr,check.thrustIdentityError);
                minTension=min(minTension,v23Tension(x,s,u(1)));
                minCableH=min(minCableH,v23CableSafety(x,sc));
                maxPosErr=max(maxPosErr,a.posErr);
                pieces=v75ThrustPieces(x,t,sc,H,mhat);
                r=struct('mode',mode,'time_s',t,'status','OK', ...
                    'r1InstantaneousSafetyNotCertified',true, ...
                    'nominalRawThrust_N',a.thrust, ...
                    'nominalRawThrustNumerator',pieces.numerator, ...
                    'nominalThrustGeometryDenominator',pieces.gamma, ...
                    'nominalNumeratorVelocity',pieces.velocity, ...
                    'nominalNumeratorPosition',pieces.position, ...
                    'nominalNumeratorGravityReference',pieces.gravityRef, ...
                    'nominalNumeratorCable',pieces.cable, ...
                    'nominalRawTorqueInf_Nm',norm(a.tau,Inf), ...
                    'nominalThrustClipped_N',uNom(1), ...
                    'appliedThrust_N',u(1),'appliedTauX_Nm',u(2), ...
                    'appliedTauY_Nm',u(3),'appliedTauZ_Nm',u(4), ...
                    'r1AllowedThrustMin_N',tlo,'r1AllowedThrustMax_N',thi, ...
                    'r1ConstraintResidual',cbfResid,'r1RectifiedH',hR, ...
                    'inversePhysicalResidual',check.inverseResidual, ...
                    'invertedThrustError_N',check.thrustIdentityError, ...
                    'sourceVirtualVsMismatchInf',check.sourceVsMismatchInf, ...
                    'conditionalVsCorrectionInf',check.deltaVsInf, ...
                    'relativeVirtualOutputMismatch',check.relativeVsError, ...
                    'nominalPhysicalJetDifference',check.jetMismatchNorm, ...
                    'sourceHlcBetaSigmaMin',a.sigmaMin, ...
                    'realizedBetaSigmaMin',check.realBetaSigmaMin, ...
                    'estimatedLoadMass_kg',mhat,'plantTrueLoadMass_kg',s.physical.massLoad, ...
                    'positionError_m',a.posErr,'velocityError_mps',a.velErr, ...
                    'loadHeight_m',x(10),'cableTilt_rad',a.cableTilt, ...
                    'sampleCableGeometryH',v23CableSafety(x,sc), ...
                    'appliedTension_N',v23Tension(x,s,u(1)), ...
                    'optObjective',check.cost,'optEvaluations',info.nEvaluations, ...
                    'optElapsed_s',info.elapsed_s,'physicalChangeCost',check.physicalCost, ...
                    'relativeJetCost',check.jetCost,'relativeVirtualCost',check.virtualCost, ...
                    'chosenPolicy',policy,'causalZOH',true, ...
                    'r1SafetyCertified',false, ...
                    'fullFourInputHOCBFImplemented',false);
                if isempty(flight),flight=r;else,flight(end+1)=r;end %#ok<AGROW>
            end
            % SAME-STATE ABLATION on ORIGINAL R1 trajectory only.  No shadow
            % candidate changes x. This isolates the instantaneous control law.
            if strcmp(mode,'R1_ORIGINAL') && t>=2.125-1e-9 && t<=2.325+1e-9
                ucands=nan(4,3);
                for jm=1:3
                    shmode=modes{jm+2};
                    [su,si,sp]=v75Choose(x,t,sc,H,sest,a,uNom,lo,hi,tlo,thi,shmode);
                    ucands(:,jm)=su(:);
                    [sres,sset]=v75R1Residual(x,s,sc.obstacles,su(1));
                    if all(isfinite(su)) && all(su>=lo-1e-9) && ...
                            all(su<=hi+1e-9)
                        cj=v75Candidate(x,t,sc,H,sest,a,su,uNom);
                    else
                        cj=v75InvalidCandidate();
                    end
                    sr=struct('time_s',t,'mode',shmode,'status',si.status, ...
                        'sourceRawThrust_N',a.thrust, ...
                        'r1ReferenceAppliedThrust_N',u(1), ...
                        'candidateThrust_N',su(1), ...
                        'candidateTauInf_Nm',norm(su(2:4),Inf), ...
                        'r1MinThrust_N',tlo,'r1MaxThrust_N',thi, ...
                        'r1CBFResidual',sres,'r1RectifiedH',sset, ...
                        'r1FeasibleAtFixedThrust',isfinite(sres)&&sres>=-1e-7, ...
                        'modelInverseResidual',cj.inverseResidual, ...
                        'thrustInverseError_N',cj.thrustIdentityError, ...
                        'virtualCorrectionInf',cj.deltaVsInf, ...
                        'sourceVsMismatchInf',cj.sourceVsMismatchInf, ...
                        'relativeVirtualCost',cj.virtualCost, ...
                        'normalizedObjective',cj.cost, ...
                        'nEvaluations',si.nEvaluations, ...
                        'computeTime_s',si.elapsed_s,'policy',sp);
                    if isempty(shadow),shadow=sr;else,shadow(end+1)=sr;end %#ok<AGROW>
                end
                % Matched-state, one-ZOH-period causal attribution:
                % T-only / tau-only / joint variations at identical x,t.
                cc=v75CausalStep(x,t,sc,H,mhat,uNom,u,ucands);
                if isempty(causal),causal=cc;else,causal=[causal,cc];end %#ok<AGROW>
            end
            nFlight=nFlight+1;
            if k<maxSteps
                x=CBF_V19_OriginalPlantStep(x,u,s,sc.dt,4);
                if any(~isfinite(x)),stop='PLANT_NONFINITE';nFailures=nFailures+1;break;end
            end
        catch MEinner
            stop=['SAMPLE_ERROR_' MEinner.identifier];caseErrors=caseErrors+1;
            nFailures=nFailures+1;break;
        end
    end
    rec=struct('mode',mode,'stopReason',stop,'lastTime_s',lastTime, ...
        'nExecutedSteps',nFlight,'nCaseFailures',nFailures, ...
        'nR1IntersampleClaims',0,'nR1SampleViolations',nR1Violation, ...
        'minSampleR1Residual',v75FiniteOrNaN(minCBFResidual), ...
        'minRectifiedH',v75FiniteOrNaN(minRectified), ...
        'minSourceRawThrust_N',v75FiniteOrNaN(minRawThrust), ...
        'minAppliedTension_N',v75FiniteOrNaN(minTension), ...
        'minSampledCableGeometryH',v75FiniteOrNaN(minCableH), ...
        'maxPositionError_m',maxPosErr, ...
        'maxSourceRawTorqueInf_Nm',maxRawTau, ...
        'maxAppliedTorqueInf_Nm',maxAppliedTau, ...
        'maxPhysicalInverseResidual',maxInverseErr, ...
        'maxThrustIdentityError_N',maxPhysicalErr, ...
        'nSearchSteps',nOptimized,'totalSearchTime_s',meanEvalTime, ...
        'nSearchStepsExceeding25ms',nSearchOverBudget, ...
        'nSafetySamples',nSafetyCalls, ...
        'estimatedLoadMass_kg',mhat,'truePlantMass_kg',s.physical.massLoad, ...
        'physicalInputBoxRespected',true, ...
        'intersampleCBFCertified',false, ...
        'R1IsThrustOnly',true, ...
        'fourInputHOCBFImplemented',false);
    if isempty(summaries),summaries=rec;else,summaries(end+1)=rec;end %#ok<AGROW>
end
root=fileparts(mfilename('fullpath'));outdir=fullfile(root,'_CBF_TEST_OUTPUT');
if exist(outdir,'dir')~=7,mkdir(outdir);end
work=tempname;mkdir(work);cc=onCleanup(@()v69Cleanup(work)); %#ok<NASGU>
if isempty(flight),error('CBF:V75NoFlightData');end
if isempty(shadow),error('CBF:V75NoShadowData');end
if isempty(causal),error('CBF:V75NoCausalData');end
writetable(struct2table(flight),fullfile(work,'V75_FIVE_POLICY_CLOSED_LOOP.csv'));
writetable(struct2table(shadow),fullfile(work,'V75_SAME_STATE_ABLATION.csv'));
writetable(struct2table(causal),fullfile(work,'V75_CAUSAL_ONE_ZOH_PERIOD.csv'));
writetable(struct2table(summaries),fullfile(work,'V75_POLICY_SUMMARY.csv'));
v75WriteHandover(fullfile(work,'V75_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt'));
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V75_THEORY_AND_INTERPRETATION.txt'),v75Theory());
zipPath=fullfile(outdir,['CBF_HLC_INVERSE_V75_' ...
    datestr(now,'yyyymmdd_HHMMSS_FFF') '.zip']);
zip(zipPath,{'V75_FIVE_POLICY_CLOSED_LOOP.csv', ...
     'V75_SAME_STATE_ABLATION.csv','V75_CAUSAL_ONE_ZOH_PERIOD.csv', ...
     'V75_POLICY_SUMMARY.csv', ...
     'V75_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt','V75_THEORY_AND_INTERPRETATION.txt'},work);
assert(exist(zipPath,'file')==2,'CBF:V75ZIPMissing');
if caseErrors>0
    status='INCOMPLETE_V75_SAMPLE_RUNTIME_ERRORS';
elseif any([summaries.nCaseFailures]>0)
    status='V75_COMPARISON_RECORDED_WITH_POLICY_INFEASIBILITIES__NOT_CBF_CERTIFIED';
else
    status='PASS_V75_CAUSAL_ZOH_CONSTRAINED_ABLATION__NOT_CBF_CERTIFIED';
end
result=struct('status',status,'zipPath',zipPath,'nCases',numel(summaries), ...
    'nRuntimeErrors',caseErrors,'nFailedCases',sum([summaries.nCaseFailures]), ...
    'nShadowCases',numel(shadow),'nCausalCases',numel(causal));
end

function [lo,hi,rec]=v75R1Interval(x,s,obs,t)
lo=s.input.thrustMin;hi=s.input.thrustMax;
rec=struct('reason','OK');
if t<2.125-1e-9,return;end
for j=1:numel(obs)
    z=CBF_V18_R1_RectifiedCable(x,s,obs{j});
    if z.hR < -1e-9,rec.reason='RECTIFIED_SET_ALREADY_INVALID';return;end
    if z.nonAffineH2>1e-7 || z.earlyTorqueEffect>1e-8
        rec.reason='R1_ORIGINAL_ASSUMPTIONS_FAIL';return;
    end
    A=z.rectifiedCoefficient;rhs=z.rectifiedRHS;
    if ~isfinite(A)||~isfinite(rhs)
        rec.reason='NONFINITE_R1_COEFFICIENT';return;
    end
    if abs(A)<1e-10
        if rhs>1e-9,rec.reason='ZERO_INPUT_AUTHORITY';return;end
    elseif A>0
        lo=max(lo,rhs/A);
    else
        hi=min(hi,rhs/A);
    end
end
if lo>hi+1e-8,rec.reason='INFEASIBLE_SHARED_THRUST';end
end

function [minRes,minHR]=v75R1Residual(x,s,obs,T)
minRes=Inf;minHR=Inf;
for j=1:numel(obs)
    z=CBF_V18_R1_RectifiedCable(x,s,obs{j});
    minRes=min(minRes,z.rectifiedCoefficient*T-z.rectifiedRHS);
    minHR=min(minHR,z.hR);
end
minRes=v75FiniteOrNaN(minRes);
minHR=v75FiniteOrNaN(minHR);
end

function z=v75FiniteOrNaN(x)
if isinf(x),z=NaN;else,z=x;end
end

function info=v75BlankOpt()
info=struct('status','OK','nEvaluations',0,'elapsed_s',0);
end

function [u,info,policy]=v75Choose(x,t,sc,H,sest,a,uNom,lo,hi,tlo,thi,mode)
% Reduced nonlinear program: choose actual u. J_real(u) and the unique
% physical Vs(u) are recomputed under the SAME ZOH model for each trial.
% Algebraic virtual variables are eliminated (not chosen after a false solve).
% The deviation from conditional nominal Vs is part of the objective.
% This does not claim CBF full 4-channel authority, or guarantee an optimum.
info=v75BlankOpt();policy='CONSTRAINED_LOCAL_4D_ZOH';
u=uNom(:);
if t<2.125-1e-9,policy='SOURCE_HLC_BEFORE_CBF';return;end
switch mode
    case 'THRUST_ONLY'
        active=1;policy='THRUST_ONLY_TAU_FIXED';
    case 'TORQUE_ONLY'
        active=2:4;policy='TORQUE_ONLY_T_FIXED';
    case 'JOINT_FOUR'
        active=1:4;policy='JOINT_4_INPUTS';
    otherwise
        error('CBF:V75BadMode','Invalid ablation mode');
end
if tlo>thi+1e-9 && ~strcmp(mode,'TORQUE_ONLY')
    info.status='R1_THRUST_INTERVAL_EMPTY';return;
end
% Preserve the original nominal HLC EXACTLY whenever its current thrust
% already satisfies the original R1 affine inequality.  This avoids
% gratuitous virtual-mismatch optimization during safe nominal flight.
if uNom(1)>=tlo-1e-8 && uNom(1)<=thi+1e-8
    policy='ORIGINAL_HLC_UNCHANGED_NO_R1_INTERVENTION';return;
end
if strcmp(mode,'TORQUE_ONLY')
    torqueOnlyUnsafe=(uNom(1)<tlo-1e-8 || uNom(1)>thi+1e-8);
else
    u(1)=min(thi,max(tlo,uNom(1)));
end
lower=lo;upper=hi;
if ~strcmp(mode,'TORQUE_ONLY')
    lower(1)=max(lower(1),tlo);upper(1)=min(upper(1),thi);
end
if upper(1)<lower(1)-1e-8
    info.status='NO_SAFE_THRUST';return;
end
tic;
[bestCost,best]=v75CostTrial(x,t,sc,H,sest,a,u,uNom);
info.nEvaluations=1;
if ~best.valid
    info.status=['INITIAL_MODEL_' best.reason];info.elapsed_s=toc;return;
end
% The two passes search in BOTH T and 3 tau simultaneously as decision
% variables, respecting all fixed-channel and box constraints throughout.
for pass=1:2
    if pass==1,fract=.25;else,fract=.07;end
    progress=false;
    for j=active
        step=fract*(hi(j)-lo(j));
        for direction=[-1,1]
            z=u;z(j)=min(upper(j),max(lower(j),u(j)+direction*step));
            if norm(z-u,Inf)<1e-12,continue;end
            [val,candidate]=v75CostTrial(x,t,sc,H,sest,a,z,uNom);
            info.nEvaluations=info.nEvaluations+1;
            if candidate.valid && val<bestCost-1e-12
                bestCost=val;best=candidate;u=z;progress=true;
            end
        end
    end
    if ~progress && pass==2,break;end
end
info.elapsed_s=toc;
if any(~isfinite(u)) || ~best.valid
    info.status='NO_FINITE_CONSTRAINED_CANDIDATE';return;
end
if strcmp(mode,'TORQUE_ONLY') && torqueOnlyUnsafe
    policy='TORQUE_ONLY_UNSAFE_DIAGNOSTIC_R1_THRUST_UNSATISFIED';
end
end

function [cost,rr]=v75CostTrial(x,t,sc,H,sest,a,u,uNom)
rr=v75Candidate(x,t,sc,H,sest,a,u,uNom);
cost=rr.cost;
end

function rec=v75InvalidCandidate()
rec=struct('valid',false,'reason','NOT_COMPUTED', ...
    'cost',NaN,'inverseResidual',NaN,'thrustIdentityError',NaN, ...
    'sourceVsMismatchInf',NaN,'deltaVsInf',NaN, ...
    'relativeVsError',NaN,'jetMismatchNorm',NaN, ...
    'realBetaSigmaMin',NaN,'physicalCost',NaN, ...
    'jetCost',NaN,'virtualCost',NaN);
end

function rec=v75Candidate(x,t,sc,H,sest,a,u,uNom)
% The *input* is a real 4-vector; no unknown high derivatives are guessed.
% An independent physical-output Vs witness (load x/y sixth, yaw second)
% checks the inverse relation, not an arbitrary post-hoc Vs assignment.
rec=v75InvalidCandidate();rec.reason='INVALID_MODEL_STATE';
try
    [jr,~,yreal]=v74RealJet(x,u,sest,sc,t,H.F1,a.XD);
    mm=v74InverseMap(x,a,H,jr);
    if ~(isfinite(mm.rawTauInf) && min(svd(mm.beta))>1e-9)
        rec.reason='BETA_DEGENERATE';return;
    end
    alphaReal=H.obj.V2_alpha2_SuspendedLoadxyDst( ...
         x,a.XD,jr,yreal(:),a.HLCparam);
    res=norm(mm.beta*u(2:4)-alphaReal(:),Inf);
    terr=abs(mm.thrust-u(1));
    if res>1e-5*max(1,norm(mm.beta*u(2:4),Inf)) || ...
       terr>1e-6*max(1,abs(u(1)))
        rec.reason='PHYSICAL_INVERSE_IDENTITY_FAIL';return;
    end
    % Target high-order J is from the physics of a NOMINAL applied hold,
    % never from unlabelled source Vfd discrete samples.
    [jn,~,~]=v74RealJet(x,uNom,sest,sc,t,H.F1,a.XD);
    js=max(1,abs(jn(1:5)));jr=jr(1:5);
    jetcost=mean(((jr-jn(1:5))./js).^2);
    % This is the VIRTUAL output mismatch which the inverse equation must
    % eliminate. Its scale uses nominal source virtual command consistently.
    sy=max(1,abs(a.vsRaw(:)));
    dy=yreal(:)-mm.vs(:);
    virtualcost=mean((dy./sy).^2);
    % Baseline physical input is the normal HLC applied command, not the
    % original R1 response (same uNom per state across modes).
    pu=(u(:)-uNom(:))./[max(1,hiFromScenario(sc));1;1;1];
    physicalcost=mean(pu.^2);
    cost=virtualcost+0.2*jetcost+0.02*physicalcost;
    if ~isfinite(cost),rec.reason='NONFINITE_COST';return;end
    rec.valid=true;rec.reason='OK';rec.cost=cost;
    rec.inverseResidual=res;rec.thrustIdentityError=terr;
    rec.sourceVsMismatchInf=norm(yreal(:)-a.vsRaw(:),Inf);
    rec.deltaVsInf=norm(dy,Inf);
    rec.relativeVsError=norm(dy./sy,Inf);
    rec.jetMismatchNorm=norm((jr-jn(1:5))./js,Inf);
    rec.realBetaSigmaMin=min(svd(mm.beta));
    rec.jetCost=jetcost;rec.virtualCost=virtualcost;
    rec.physicalCost=physicalcost;
catch ME
    rec.reason=['EVALUATION_' ME.identifier];
end
end

function T=hiFromScenario(sc)
T=sc.settings.input.thrustMax;
end

function report=v75Theory()
report=sprintf([ ...
'V75 experimental comparison, 2026-11-18. Original HLC and plant unchanged.\n' ...
'FIVE modes: NOMINAL, ORIGINAL_R1, THRUST_ONLY, TORQUE_ONLY, JOINT_FOUR.\n' ...
'All use source 25 ms ZOH; no fictitious smooth actuator or input jets.\n' ...
'Shadow comparisons use exactly the same ORIGINAL_R1 state in 2.125-2.325s.\n' ...
'T-only: optimize T, tau fixed to boxed nominal HLC.\n' ...
'Tau-only: optimize tau, T fixed to boxed nominal HLC; R1 may be\n' ...
'violated. It is explicitly an UNSAFE causal diagnostic, not a safe CBF.\n' ...
'Joint: optimize all four actual physical input coordinates with R1 thrust\n' ...
'inequality and real ZOH input-to-output jet/inverse formula re-evaluated.\n' ...
'This R1 uses thrust as the input for the instantaneous safety condition.\n' ...
'There is NO claim that it fully exploits torque authority in a HOCBF.\n' ...
'Eliminated virtual decision: physical J_real(u), Vs_real(u) from same estimated\n' ...
'plant satisfy the inverse equality; Vs_real(u)-Vs_nom(J_real(u)) is penalized.\n' ...
'The physical identity is independently checked every evaluated sample.\n' ...
'This alone is a reduced model-consistent nonlinear program, not proof of\n' ...
'safe tracking and not a globally optimal four-input HOCBF.\n' ...
'Optimization uses deterministic bounded coordinate search (no toolbox).\n' ...
'No R1 intervention => the original HLC output is preserved exactly.\n' ...
'Torque only is an UNPROVEN AND POTENTIALLY UNSAFE COUNTERFACTUAL.\n' ...
'Cost = normalized virtual mismatch squared + .2 normalized J mismatch\n' ...
'+ .02 normalized physical delta squared, experimental not proven weights.\n' ...
'All outputs and stop reasons explicitly show hard R1 infeasibility.\n' ...
'Estimate mL=.01kg; true simulator mL=.14kg; never use truth in optimizer.\n' ...
'The model inverse identity is not an independent proof of real safety.\n' ...
'The causal 25ms branches are local counterfactuals, NOT safe rollouts.\n' ...
'No 25ms intersample CBF certificate; no ground, load, drone and cable full\n' ...
'four-input barrier set; no guarantee of return from trapped equilibrium.\n' ...
'Same-state seven-branch one-ZOH-period causal experiment decomposes\n' ...
'next raw nominal thrust into velocity/position/cable/gravity and geometry.\n' ...
'No artificial nominal thrust floor, no derivative substitutions, no\n' ...
'post-hoc torque saturation claims. Cases may fail or stop early.\n']);
end

function v75WriteHandover(path)
v74WriteHandover(path);
fid=fopen(path,'a');
if fid<0,error('CBF:V75HandoverAppend');end
cc=onCleanup(@()fclose(fid)); %#ok<NASGU>
fwrite(fid,sprintf('\n\n=== V75 IMPLEMENTATION AND LIMITATIONS ===\n%s',v75Theory()),'char');
end

function result=v75FailureArtifact(ME)
root=fileparts(mfilename('fullpath'));outdir=fullfile(root,'_CBF_TEST_OUTPUT');
if exist(outdir,'dir')~=7,mkdir(outdir);end
work=tempname;mkdir(work);cc=onCleanup(@()v69Cleanup(work)); %#ok<NASGU>
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V75_RUNTIME_ERROR.txt'), ...
    getReport(ME,'extended','hyperlinks','off'));
v75WriteHandover(fullfile(work,'V75_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt'));
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V75_THEORY_AND_INTERPRETATION.txt'),v75Theory());
path=fullfile(outdir,['CBF_HLC_INVERSE_V75_ERROR_' ...
    datestr(now,'yyyymmdd_HHMMSS_FFF') '.zip']);
zip(path,{'V75_RUNTIME_ERROR.txt','V75_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt', ...
    'V75_THEORY_AND_INTERPRETATION.txt'},work);
result=struct('status',['FAILED_V75_RUNTIME_' ME.identifier], ...
    'zipPath',path,'nCases',0,'nRuntimeErrors',1,'nFailedCases',1, ...
    'nShadowCases',0,'nCausalCases',0);
end


function records=v75CausalStep(x,t,sc,H,mhat,uNom,uR1,uc)
% Interventions at the SAME observed R1 state, same reference, same 25ms
% ZOH and true simulator (used ONLY to measure the result, not choose u).
% The raw HLC thrust is computed at t+dt, after propagating x with each u.
% No extrapolation of current torque to an instantaneous nominal T effect.
base=uc(:,3); % joint candidate already optimized as a physical input
U=[uNom(:),uR1(:),uc(:,1),uc(:,2),base, ...
    [uR1(1);base(2:4)],[base(1);uR1(2:4)]];
names={'NOMINAL_BOTH','ORIGINAL_R1_T','T_ONLY_OPT','TAU_ONLY_OPT', ...
       'JOINT_OPT','R1_T_PLUS_JOINT_TAU','JOINT_T_PLUS_R1_TAU'};
records=struct([]);p0=v75ThrustPieces(x,t,sc,H,mhat);
for jj=1:size(U,2)
    u=U(:,jj);
    status='OK'; pn=v75EmptyPieces(); nextRawTau=NaN;
    deltaP=NaN; deltaV=NaN; deltaCable=NaN;deltaTilt=NaN;
    try
        xn=CBF_V19_OriginalPlantStep(x,u,sc.settings,sc.dt,4);
        if any(~isfinite(xn)),error('CBF:V75NonfiniteNextState');end
        aa=v23HLC(xn,t+sc.dt,sc,H,mhat);
        pn=v75ThrustPieces(xn,t+sc.dt,sc,H,mhat);
        nextRawTau=norm(aa.tau,Inf);
        deltaP=norm(xn(8:10)-x(8:10));
        deltaV=norm(xn(11:13)-x(11:13));
        deltaCable=norm(xn(14:16)-x(14:16));
        deltaTilt=norm(xn(5:7)-x(5:7));
    catch ME
        status=['ERROR_' ME.identifier];
    end
    [sres,hR]=v75R1Residual(x,sc.settings,sc.obstacles,u(1));
    rr=struct('tBefore_s',t,'tAfter_s',t+sc.dt, ...
        'intervention',names{jj},'status',status, ...
        'appliedT_N',u(1),'appliedTauX_Nm',u(2), ...
        'appliedTauY_Nm',u(3),'appliedTauZ_Nm',u(4), ...
        'deltaTFromNominal_N',u(1)-uNom(1), ...
        'deltaTauFromNominalInf_Nm',norm(u(2:4)-uNom(2:4),Inf), ...
        'r1InstantResidual',sres,'r1RectifiedH',hR, ...
        'r1InstantThrustConditionMet',isfinite(sres)&&sres>=-1e-7, ...
        'rawNominalTBefore_N',p0.rawT_N, ...
        'rawNominalTNext_N',pn.rawT_N, ...
        'rawNominalDeltaT_N',pn.rawT_N-p0.rawT_N, ...
        'nextNominalRawTauInf_Nm',nextRawTau, ...
        'nextThrustNumerator',pn.numerator, ...
        'nextThrustDenominator',pn.gamma, ...
        'nextNumeratorPosition',pn.position, ...
        'nextNumeratorVelocity',pn.velocity, ...
        'nextNumeratorGravityReference',pn.gravityRef, ...
        'nextNumeratorCable',pn.cable, ...
        'nextLoadDeltaPos_m',deltaP,'nextLoadDeltaVel_mps',deltaV, ...
        'nextCableDirectionChange',deltaCable, ...
        'nextBodyOmegaChange',deltaTilt, ...
        'allFourInputsHeldFor25ms',true, ...
        'counterfactualNotClosedLoopCertificate',true);
    if isempty(records),records=rr;else,records(end+1)=rr;end %#ok<AGROW>
end
end

function p=v75EmptyPieces()
p=struct('rawT_N',NaN,'numerator',NaN,'gamma',NaN, ...
    'position',NaN,'velocity',NaN,'gravityRef',NaN,'cable',NaN);
end

function p=v75ThrustPieces(x,t,sc,H,mhat)
% R193 source Uf: exact decomposition under ESTIMATED controller mass.
% All terms below have units of thrust-numerator and no fake residual term.
a=v23HLC(x,t,sc,H,mhat);
P=a.HLCparam;
M=P(1)+P(6); q=x(14:16);w=x(17:19);
p=v75EmptyPieces();
p.position=M*H.F1(1)*(a.refPos(3)-x(10));
p.velocity=M*H.F1(2)*(a.refVel(3)-x(13));
p.gravityRef=M*(P(5)+a.refAcc(3));
p.cable=P(1)*P(7)*q(3)*sum(cross(w,q).^2);
p.numerator=p.position+p.velocity+p.gravityRef+p.cable;
p.gamma=a.thrustDenominator;
p.rawT_N=a.thrust;
err=abs(p.numerator-p.gamma*a.thrust);
if ~isfinite(err) || err>1e-7*max(1,abs(p.numerator))
    error('CBF:V75ThrustNumeratorDecomposition', ...
      'R193 Uf numerator decomposition mismatch %.12g',err);
end
end


% ========================================================================
% V76: TEST-ONLY vertical HLC gain sweep. NO source controller edits.
% ========================================================================
function result=v76VerticalGainSweep(opts)
% Each row uses the original R193 HLC functions, plant and 25ms ZOH;
% H.F1 is overridden only in this test's local H struct.
if exist('test_CBF_SetupPaths','file')==2,test_CBF_SetupPaths();end
req={'CBF_V19_Scenarios','CBF_V19_OriginalPlantStep',...
     'CBF_V18_R1_RectifiedCable','lqrd'};
for j=1:numel(req)
    if exist(req{j},'file')==0
        error('CBF:V76Dependency','Missing source dependency: %s',req{j});
    end
end
if exist('HLC_SUSPENDED_LOAD','class')~=8
    error('CBF:V76Dependency','Source HLC_SUSPENDED_LOAD class not available');
end
sc=CBF_V19_Scenarios('straight_single','R193');sc.dt=.025;
s=sc.settings;mhat=.01;
if isfield(opts,'v76MassEstimate'),mhat=double(opts.v76MassEstimate);end
assert(isscalar(mhat)&&isfinite(mhat)&&mhat>0,'CBF:V76EstimatedMass');
Hbase=v23MakeHLC(s,sc.dt);
list=v76GainConfigurations(Hbase,sc.dt);
if isfield(opts,'v76MaxGainCases')
    lim=opts.v76MaxGainCases;
    assert(isscalar(lim)&&lim>=1&&lim==floor(lim)&&lim<=numel(list),...
         'CBF:V76GainCount');
    list=list(1:lim);
end
mainEnd=2.4;releaseLen=.35;stressLen=1.0;
if isfield(opts,'v76MainEnd'),mainEnd=double(opts.v76MainEnd);end
if isfield(opts,'v76ReleaseDuration'),releaseLen=double(opts.v76ReleaseDuration);end
if isfield(opts,'v76StressDuration'),stressLen=double(opts.v76StressDuration);end
assert(mainEnd>=2.325 && mainEnd<=5 && releaseLen>0 && ...
    releaseLen<=2 && stressLen>=.25 && stressLen<=3 && ...
    all(abs([mainEnd releaseLen stressLen]/sc.dt-...
    round([mainEnd releaseLen stressLen]/sc.dt))<1e-8),...
    'CBF:V76TimeGrid');
releaseTimes=[2.275,2.300]; stressStart=2.125;
trace=struct([]); summary=struct([]); gainRows=struct([]); shadow=struct([]);
referenceR1States=struct('time',{},'x',{});
nErrors=0; nFailures=0;
for ig=1:numel(list)
    gain=list(ig);H=Hbase;H.F1=gain.F1;
    fprintf('[CBF V76] gain %d/%d: %s F1=[%.6g %.6g]\n',...
        ig,numel(list),gain.id,H.F1(1),H.F1(2));
    eigc=eig([0 1;-H.F1(:).']);
    grow=struct('gainID',gain.id,'type',gain.type,'Qposition',gain.Qp,...
        'Qvelocity',gain.Qv,'Rvirtual',gain.R,...
        'directPositionMultiplier',gain.kpScale,...
        'directVelocityMultiplier',gain.kvScale,...
        'F11',H.F1(1),'F12',H.F1(2),...
        'F11Baseline',Hbase.F1(1),'F12Baseline',Hbase.F1(2),...
        'continuousNominalPoleMaxReal',max(real(eigc)),...
        'nominalLinearModelOnly',true);
    if isempty(gainRows),gainRows=grow;else,gainRows(end+1)=grow;end %#ok<AGROW>
    % Two separate controlled trajectories with identical initial state.
    [z,ss,nm]=v76Run(sc,H,mhat,gain.id,'NOMINAL','NOMINAL',...
        0,mainEnd,sc.x0(:),[]);
    [trace,summary,nErrors,nFailures]=v76Append(trace,summary,nErrors,nFailures,z,ss);
    [z,ss,rr]=v76Run(sc,H,mhat,gain.id,'R1','R1',...
        0,mainEnd,sc.x0(:),[]);
    [trace,summary,nErrors,nFailures]=v76Append(trace,summary,nErrors,nFailures,z,ss);
    if ig==1,referenceR1States=rr;end
    % Matched-state comparison: all gains read the SAME baseline R1 state.
    keepTimes=[2.125 2.150 2.200 2.250 2.275 2.300 2.325];
    for kk=1:numel(keepTimes)
        ix=find(abs([referenceR1States.time]-keepTimes(kk))<1e-8,1);
        if isempty(ix),continue;end
        xx=referenceR1States(ix).x; tt=keepTimes(kk);
        sr=v76MatchedStateGain(xx,tt,sc,H,Hbase,mhat,gain.id);
        if isempty(shadow),shadow=sr;else,shadow(end+1)=sr;end %#ok<AGROW>
    end
    % Two releases PER GAIN, from that gain's actual R1 state, not a
    % replay of the baseline-gain flight state. OFF/CONTINUE share x(t_s).
    for j=1:numel(releaseTimes)
        t0=releaseTimes(j);idx=find(abs([rr.time]-t0)<1e-8,1);
        for modeIndex=1:2
            if modeIndex==1
                policy='NOMINAL';tag=sprintf('RELEASE_OFF_%04d',round(t0*1000));
            else
                policy='R1';tag=sprintf('RELEASE_CONTINUE_%04d',round(t0*1000));
            end
            if isempty(idx)
                [z,ss]=v76Unavailable(gain.id,tag,t0,...
                    'R1_CHECKPOINT_NOT_REACHED');
            else
                [z,ss]=v76Run(sc,H,mhat,gain.id,tag,policy,...
                    t0,t0+releaseLen,rr(idx).x,[]);
            end
            [trace,summary,nErrors,nFailures]=v76Append(trace,summary,nErrors,nFailures,z,ss);
        end
    end
    % Stress references at the SAME normal-flight checkpoint of this gain.
    idx=find(abs([nm.time]-stressStart)<1e-8,1);
    for test=1:2
        if test==1
            tag='NOMINAL_STATIC_DOWN_015';drop=.15;kind='STATIC';
        else
            tag='NOMINAL_SMOOTH_DOWN_075';drop=.75;kind='SMOOTH';
        end
        if isempty(idx)
            [z,ss]=v76Unavailable(gain.id,tag,stressStart,...
                'NOMINAL_CHECKPOINT_NOT_REACHED');
        else
            cc=sc;base=@(t)v57V19OriginalJet(sc,t);
            ref=@(t)v76ShiftRef(base,t,stressStart,drop,kind,1.0);
            cc.refFull=ref;cc.ref=@(t,k)v32XYZJet(ref,t,k);
            [z,ss]=v76Run(cc,H,mhat,gain.id,tag,'NOMINAL',...
                stressStart,stressStart+stressLen,nm(idx).x,[]);
        end
        [trace,summary,nErrors,nFailures]=v76Append(trace,summary,nErrors,nFailures,z,ss);
    end
end
root=fileparts(mfilename('fullpath'));
outdir=fullfile(root,'_CBF_TEST_OUTPUT');
if exist(outdir,'dir')~=7,mkdir(outdir);end
work=tempname;mkdir(work); ccCleanup=onCleanup(@()v69Cleanup(work)); %#ok<NASGU>
if isempty(trace),error('CBF:V76NoTrace');end
writetable(struct2table(trace),fullfile(work,'V76_GAIN_SWEEP_TRACE.csv'));
writetable(struct2table(summary),fullfile(work,'V76_GAIN_SWEEP_SUMMARY.csv'));
writetable(struct2table(gainRows),fullfile(work,'V76_GAIN_SETTINGS.csv'));
if ~isempty(shadow)
    writetable(struct2table(shadow),fullfile(work,'V76_MATCHED_R1_GAIN_EFFECT.csv'));
end
v76WriteHandover(fullfile(work,'V76_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt'));
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V76_THEORY_AND_PROTOCOL.txt'),v76Theory());
zipPath=fullfile(outdir,['CBF_HLC_GAIN_V76_'...
    datestr(now,'yyyymmdd_HHMMSS_FFF') '.zip']);
files={'V76_GAIN_SWEEP_TRACE.csv','V76_GAIN_SWEEP_SUMMARY.csv',...
   'V76_GAIN_SETTINGS.csv','V76_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt',...
   'V76_THEORY_AND_PROTOCOL.txt'};
if ~isempty(shadow),files{end+1}='V76_MATCHED_R1_GAIN_EFFECT.csv';end
zip(zipPath,files,work);
assert(exist(zipPath,'file')==2,'CBF:V76ZipFail');
if nErrors>0
    status='INCOMPLETE_V76_RUNTIME_ERRORS';
elseif nFailures>0
    status='V76_GAIN_COMPARISONS_RECORDED_WITH_PHYSICAL_OR_R1_STOPS';
else
    status='PASS_V76_GAIN_SWEEP_NOT_CBF_CERTIFIED';
end
result=struct('status',status,'zipPath',zipPath,'nCases',numel(summary),...
    'nRuntimeErrors',nErrors,'nFailedCases',nFailures,...
    'nGainConfigurations',numel(list));
end

function row=v76MatchedStateGain(x,t,sc,H,Hbase,mhat,gainID)
% Direct gain effect with x, t, reference, geometry, torque limits and R1
% obstacle EXACTLY matched. Do NOT confuse this with closed-loop dynamics.
a=v23HLC(x,t,sc,H,mhat);
ab=v23HLC(x,t,sc,Hbase,mhat);
M=a.HLCparam(1)+a.HLCparam(6);
ez=a.refPos(3)-x(10);ev=a.refVel(3)-x(13);
dp=M*(H.F1(1)-Hbase.F1(1))*ez;
dv=M*(H.F1(2)-Hbase.F1(2))*ev;
[tl,th,ri]=v75R1Interval(x,sc.settings,sc.obstacles,t);
row=struct('gainID',gainID,'time_s',t,...
    'baseRawThrust_N',ab.thrust,'newRawThrust_N',a.thrust,...
    'deltaRawThrust_N',a.thrust-ab.thrust,...
    'baseRawTorqueInf_Nm',norm(ab.tau,Inf),...
    'newRawTorqueInf_Nm',norm(a.tau,Inf),...
    'baseBetaSigmaMin',ab.sigmaMin,'newBetaSigmaMin',a.sigmaMin,...
    'F11',H.F1(1),'F12',H.F1(2),...
    'errorZ_m',ez,'errorVz_mps',ev,'numeratorDeltaPosition',dp,...
    'numeratorDeltaVelocity',dv,'predictedDeltaRawThrust_N',...
    (dp+dv)/a.thrustDenominator,...
    'identityError_N',abs((dp+dv)/a.thrustDenominator-...
       (a.thrust-ab.thrust)),...
    'r1AllowedMin_N',tl,'r1AllowedMax_N',th,...
    'r1IntervalStatus',ri.reason,...
    'sameStateComparisonNotClosedLoop',true);
if row.identityError_N>1e-7*max(1,abs(a.thrust))
    error('CBF:V76MatchedIdentity',...
      'Matched-state gain analytic identity failed at %s t=%g',gainID,t);
end
end

function configurations=v76GainConfigurations(H0,dt)
% LQR-Q/R tests and direct independent F11/F12 tests are deliberately
% distinguished. Direct scalings are not LQR-designed gains.
A=[0 1;0 0];B=[0;1]; configurations=struct([]);
rows={...
 'BASE','LQR',150,10,.01,1,1;...
 'QPOS_025','LQR',37.5,10,.01,1,1;...
 'QPOS_400','LQR',600,10,.01,1,1;...
 'QVEL_025','LQR',150,2.5,.01,1,1;...
 'QVEL_400','LQR',150,40,.01,1,1;...
 'R_400','LQR',150,10,.04,1,1;...
 'R_025','LQR',150,10,.0025,1,1;...
 'KP_050','DIRECT',nan,nan,nan,.5,1;...
 'KP_150','DIRECT',nan,nan,nan,1.5,1;...
 'KV_050','DIRECT',nan,nan,nan,1,.5;...
 'KV_075','DIRECT',nan,nan,nan,1,.75;...
 'KV_150','DIRECT',nan,nan,nan,1,1.5};
for i=1:size(rows,1)
    id=rows{i,1};kind=rows{i,2};qp=rows{i,3};qv=rows{i,4};r=rows{i,5};
    ps=rows{i,6};vs=rows{i,7};
    if strcmp(kind,'LQR')
        f=lqrd(A,B,diag([qp qv]),r,dt);
    else
        f=H0.F1.*[ps vs];
    end
    assert(all(isfinite(f)) && numel(f)==2 && all(f>0),...
        'CBF:V76BadGain','Bad F1 gain for %s',id);
    one=struct('id',id,'type',kind,'Qp',qp,'Qv',qv,'R',r,...
        'kpScale',ps,'kvScale',vs,'F1',f(:).');
    if isempty(configurations),configurations=one;
    else,configurations(end+1)=one;end %#ok<AGROW>
end
assert(norm(configurations(1).F1-H0.F1,Inf)<1e-9,...
    'CBF:V76Baseline','Gain sweep baseline does not reproduce R193 F1');
end

function [trace,summary,nErrors,nFailures]=v76Append(trace,summary,nErrors,nFailures,z,ss)
if ~isempty(z)
    if isempty(trace),trace=z;else,trace=[trace z];end %#ok<AGROW>
end
if isempty(summary),summary=ss;else,summary(end+1)=ss;end %#ok<AGROW>
nErrors=nErrors+double(startsWith(ss.stopReason,'ERROR_'));
nFailures=nFailures+double(~strcmp(ss.stopReason,'HORIZON_REACHED'));
end

function [trace,summary,checkpoints]=v76Run(sc,H,mhat,gainID,caseID,policy,...
                                     t0,tend,x,unused)
% One case of original 25ms ZOH. The gained HLC is calculated anew at
% every sample, without editing Controller_HL... or any generated functions.
% Checkpoints are states at the START of a control period, from an actually
% computed closed-loop trajectory. No future state is substituted.
unused=unused; %#ok<NASGU>
s=sc.settings;
lo=[s.input.thrustMin;s.input.torqueMin(:)];
hi=[s.input.thrustMax;s.input.torqueMax(:)];
N=round((tend-t0)/sc.dt);
trace=struct([]);checkpoints=struct('time',{},'x',{});
stop='HORIZON_REACHED';errorDetails='';lastTime=NaN;minRaw=Inf;maxTau=0;
minTension=Inf;minGeom=Inf;maxZErr=0;maxVErr=0;
minNum=Inf;minVelTerm=Inf;minPosTerm=Inf;
minBeta=Inf;nRawNegative=0;nRawTorqueOver=0;
nTorqueClip=0;nThrustClip=0;nViolation=0;
firstRawNeg=NaN;firstTorqueLarge=NaN;firstTensionZero=NaN;
firstIntervention=NaN;minResidual=Inf;maxDeviation=0;
for k=0:N
    t=t0+k*sc.dt;
    try
        a=v23HLC(x,t,sc,H,mhat);
        if any(~isfinite(a.raw)) || any(~isreal(a.raw)) ||...
                any(~isfinite(x))
            error('CBF:V76NonfiniteHLC','nonfinite HLC at %.4g',t);
        end
        checkpoints(end+1)=struct('time',t,'x',x); %#ok<AGROW>
        un=min(hi,max(lo,a.raw(:)));
        u=un; tlo=NaN;thi=NaN;cbfr=NaN;
        if strcmp(policy,'R1') && t>=2.125-1e-9
            [tlo,thi,ri]=v75R1Interval(x,s,sc.obstacles,t);
            if ~strcmp(ri.reason,'OK')
                stop=['R1_STOP_' ri.reason];break;
            end
            if tlo>thi+1e-8
                stop='R1_STOP_EMPTY_THRUST_INTERVAL';break;
            end
            u(1)=min(thi,max(tlo,un(1)));
            [cbfr,~]=v75R1Residual(x,s,sc.obstacles,u(1));
            minResidual=min(minResidual,cbfr);
            if cbfr< -1e-7,nViolation=nViolation+1;end
            if abs(u(1)-un(1))>1e-8 && isnan(firstIntervention)
                firstIntervention=t;
            end
        end
        if any(~isfinite(u))||any(u<lo-1e-9)||any(u>hi+1e-9)
            stop='ERROR_BAD_APPLIED_INPUT';break;
        end
        M=a.HLCparam(1)+a.HLCparam(6);
        q=x(14:16);w=x(17:19);
        pterm=M*H.F1(1)*(a.refPos(3)-x(10));
        vterm=M*H.F1(2)*(a.refVel(3)-x(13));
        gravterm=M*(a.HLCparam(5)+a.refAcc(3));
        cableterm=a.HLCparam(1)*a.HLCparam(7)*q(3)*sum(cross(w,q).^2);
        Nterm=pterm+vterm+gravterm+cableterm;
        if ~isfinite(a.thrustDenominator) ||...
           abs(Nterm-a.thrustDenominator*a.thrust)>...
                    1e-7*max(1,abs(Nterm))
            stop='ERROR_THRUST_NUMERATOR_IDENTITY';break;
        end
        ten=v23Tension(x,s,u(1));geom=v23CableSafety(x,sc);
        zerr=a.refPos(3)-x(10);verr=a.refVel(3)-x(13);
        r=struct('gainID',gainID,'caseID',caseID,'policy',policy,...
          'time_s',t,'F11',H.F1(1),'F12',H.F1(2),...
          'loadZ_m',x(10),'loadVz_mps',x(13),...
          'refZ_m',a.refPos(3),'refVz_mps',a.refVel(3),...
          'zError_refMinusLoad_m',zerr,'vzError_refMinusLoad_mps',verr,...
          'rawHLCThrust_N',a.thrust,'nominalClippedThrust_N',un(1),...
          'appliedThrust_N',u(1),'sourceRawTorqueInf_Nm',norm(a.tau,Inf),...
          'appliedTorqueInf_Nm',norm(u(2:4),Inf),...
          'rawTauPitch_Nm',a.tau(3),'appliedTauPitch_Nm',u(3),...
          'thrustNumerator',Nterm,'thrustDenominator',a.thrustDenominator,...
          'numPosition',pterm,'numVelocity',vterm,'numGravityReference',gravterm,...
          'numCable',cableterm,'v1Nominal',a.vfRaw(1),...
          'betaSigmaMin',a.sigmaMin,'positionError3D_m',a.posErr,...
          'velocityError3D_mps',a.velErr,'cableTension_N',ten,...
          'sampledCableGeometryH',geom,'r1MinThrust_N',tlo,...
          'r1MaxThrust_N',thi,'r1SampleResidual',cbfr,...
          'nominalThrustWasClipped',abs(un(1)-a.thrust)>1e-9,...
          'nominalTorqueWasClipped',any(abs(un(2:4)-a.tau)>1e-9),...
          'r1Intervened',abs(u(1)-un(1))>1e-8,...
          'inputZOHSeconds',sc.dt,'sourceHlcUntouched',true);
        if isempty(trace),trace=r;else,trace(end+1)=r;end %#ok<AGROW>
        lastTime=t;minRaw=min(minRaw,a.thrust);
        maxTau=max(maxTau,norm(a.tau,Inf));
        minTension=min(minTension,ten);minGeom=min(minGeom,geom);
        maxZErr=max(maxZErr,abs(zerr));maxVErr=max(maxVErr,abs(verr));
        minNum=min(minNum,Nterm);minVelTerm=min(minVelTerm,vterm);
        minPosTerm=min(minPosTerm,pterm);
        minBeta=min(minBeta,a.sigmaMin);
        maxDeviation=max(maxDeviation,abs(u(1)-a.thrust));
        nRawNegative=nRawNegative+double(a.thrust<0);
        nRawTorqueOver=nRawTorqueOver+double(norm(a.tau,Inf)>1+1e-8);
        nTorqueClip=nTorqueClip+double(any(abs(un(2:4)-a.tau)>1e-8));
        nThrustClip=nThrustClip+double(abs(un(1)-a.thrust)>1e-8);
        if isnan(firstRawNeg)&&a.thrust<0,firstRawNeg=t;end
        if isnan(firstTorqueLarge)&&norm(a.tau,Inf)>1+1e-8
            firstTorqueLarge=t;
        end
        if isnan(firstTensionZero)&&ten<=0,firstTensionZero=t;end
        if ~isfinite(ten) || ten<=0
            stop='PHYSICAL_MODEL_TENSION_NONPOSITIVE';break;
        end
        if k<N
            x=CBF_V19_OriginalPlantStep(x,u,s,sc.dt,4);
            if any(~isfinite(x))||~isreal(x)
                stop='ERROR_PLANT_NONFINITE';break;
            end
        end
    catch ME
        stop=['ERROR_' ME.identifier];errorDetails=ME.message;break;
    end
end
summary=struct('gainID',gainID,'caseID',caseID,'policy',policy,...
    'startTime_s',t0,'targetEndTime_s',tend,'lastTime_s',lastTime,...
    'stopReason',stop,'errorDetails',errorDetails,'nSamples',numel(trace),'F11',H.F1(1),'F12',H.F1(2),...
    'minRawThrust_N',v76Finite(minRaw),'maxRawTorqueInf_Nm',maxTau,...
    'minTension_N',v76Finite(minTension),...
    'minCableGeometryH',v76Finite(minGeom),...
    'maxAbsZError_m',maxZErr,'maxAbsVzError_mps',maxVErr,...
    'minThrustNumerator',v76Finite(minNum),...
    'minNumeratorVelocity',v76Finite(minVelTerm),...
    'minNumeratorPosition',v76Finite(minPosTerm),...
    'minBetaSigma',v76Finite(minBeta),...
    'nRawThrustNegativeSamples',nRawNegative,...
    'nRawTorqueAbove1NmSamples',nRawTorqueOver,...
    'nSourceThrustClipped',nThrustClip,'nSourceTorqueClipped',nTorqueClip,...
    'nSampleR1Violations',nViolation,...
    'minimumSampleR1Residual',v76Finite(minResidual),...
    'firstRawNegative_s',firstRawNeg,...
    'firstRawTorqueAbove1Nm_s',firstTorqueLarge,...
    'firstNonpositiveTension_s',firstTensionZero,...
    'firstR1Intervention_s',firstIntervention,...
    'maxRawAppliedThrustGap_N',maxDeviation,...
    'originMassEstimate_kg',mhat,'plantTrueLoadMass_kg',s.physical.massLoad,...
    'normalHLCSourceModified',false,'allInputsHeld25ms',true,...
    'R1IntersampleSafeCertified',false,'groundSafeCertified',false);
end

function x=v76Finite(x)
if ~isfinite(x),x=NaN;end
end

function [z,ss]=v76Unavailable(gainID,caseID,t,reason)
z=struct([]);
ss=struct('gainID',gainID,'caseID',caseID,'policy','NOT_RUN',...
    'startTime_s',t,'targetEndTime_s',NaN,'lastTime_s',NaN,...
    'stopReason',reason,'errorDetails','','nSamples',0,'F11',NaN,'F12',NaN,...
    'minRawThrust_N',NaN,'maxRawTorqueInf_Nm',NaN,...
    'minTension_N',NaN,'minCableGeometryH',NaN,...
    'maxAbsZError_m',NaN,'maxAbsVzError_mps',NaN,...
    'minThrustNumerator',NaN,'minNumeratorVelocity',NaN,...
    'minNumeratorPosition',NaN,'minBetaSigma',NaN,...
    'nRawThrustNegativeSamples',0,'nRawTorqueAbove1NmSamples',0,...
    'nSourceThrustClipped',0,'nSourceTorqueClipped',0,...
    'nSampleR1Violations',0,'minimumSampleR1Residual',NaN,...
    'firstRawNegative_s',NaN,'firstRawTorqueAbove1Nm_s',NaN,...
    'firstNonpositiveTension_s',NaN,'firstR1Intervention_s',NaN,...
    'maxRawAppliedThrustGap_N',NaN,...
    'originMassEstimate_kg',NaN,'plantTrueLoadMass_kg',NaN,...
    'normalHLCSourceModified',false,'allInputsHeld25ms',true,...
    'R1IntersampleSafeCertified',false,'groundSafeCertified',false);
end

function r=v76ShiftRef(base,t,start,drop,kind,duration)
r=base(t);
for j=0:6
    if strcmp(kind,'STATIC')
        y=double(j==0);
    elseif strcmp(kind,'SMOOTH')
        y=v32S7(t-start,duration,j);
    else
        error('CBF:V76BadReference');
    end
    r(4*j+3)=r(4*j+3)-drop*y;
end
end

function report=v76Theory()
report=sprintf([...
'V76 TEST-ONLY vertical gain variations; no source files changed.\n'...
'MATLAB v23MakeHLC(s,dt) is used to instantiate ORIGINAL HLC, then only\n'...
'local H.F1 is overridden. F2 F3 F4 / generated functions UNCHANGED.\n'...
'R193 sim baseline F1 = lqrd(A2,B2,diag([150,10]),.01,dt).\n'...
'Changing Q/R recomputes F1, not a physical T/tau objective weighting.\n'...
'DIRECT F11/F12 multipliers isolate effects but are NOT LQR-optimal.\n'...
'Baseline sim, R1 thrust-only, R1 release OFF vs CONTINUE at 2.275/\n'...
'2.300 from EACH GAIN''S OWN R1 state. If checkpoint cannot be reached,\n'...
'NOT_RUN is recorded instead of using another gain''s state.\n'...
'Non-CBF descent stress: static -0.15m reference and seventh-order smooth\n'...
'-0.75m descent, from each gain''s own normal 2.125s checkpoint.\n'...
'STATIC abrupt reference is discontinuous at switch: intentionally stress.\n'...
'SMOOTH reference uses 7th-order endpoint flatness and 0..6 derivatives.\n'...
'Mass estimate 0.01 kg vs plant true 0.14 kg. No EKF evaluation.\n'...
'State starts at original source sc.x0; holds full 4-input for 25ms;\n'...
'plant CBF_V19_OriginalPlantStep is unchanged. HLC output is clipped\n'...
'only by ORIGINAL [0,20]N / [-1,1]Nm physical bounds.\n'...
'R1 condition is the ORIGINAL thrust-only rectified cable condition;\n'...
'violation / infeasibility recorded; no new safety claim.\n'...
'Each sample records raw thrust numerator position/velocity/gravity/\n'...
'cable, denominator and actual raw/applied torque, tension and geometry.\n'...
'Matched-state gain audit at baseline R1 states analytically separates\n'...
'position and velocity gain contributions to raw thrust; the identity\n'...
'is independently checked to avoid attributing trajectory confounding.\n'...
'Gain comparisons cannot prove that a safer HLC exists without checking\n'...
'normal tracking, CBF safety, release, tension and physical limits.\n'...
'NO artificial nominal thrust floor; NO new controller gain file edits.\n'...
'R193 source Vfd uses a discrete-step predicted series. V76 DOES NOT\n'...
'claim that this is a continuous 0..5 derivative or high-order certified\n'...
'CBF controller. V72-75 results are unaffected.\n']);
end

function v76WriteHandover(path)
% Embed all available original history INSIDE the single test .m first.
v75WriteHandover(path);
fid=fopen(path,'a');if fid<0,error('CBF:V76HandoverFile');end
cc=onCleanup(@()fclose(fid)); %#ok<NASGU>
fwrite(fid,sprintf('\n\n=== V76 TEST-ONLY GAIN SWEEP PROTOCOL ===\n%s',...
    v76Theory()),'char');
fwrite(fid,sprintf([ ...
 '\n=== V75 OBSERVED RESULTS RETAINED FOR V76 ===\n' ...
 'V75 baseline min raw thrust 7.573 N, raw tau maximum about 0.002 Nm.\n' ...
 'V75 original R1 min raw thrust -2.723 N, raw tau maximum 135.23 Nm.\n' ...
 'V75 matched R1-state 2.300s 25ms causal branch: thrust change from\n' ...
 '0.415 to 13.502 N lowered next raw HLC thrust about 7.252 N; a\n' ...
 'selected pitch torque change 1 to .36 Nm shifted it about .00037 N.\n' ...
 'V75 torque effect was LOCAL at matched state/one period, not zero for\n' ...
 'all future trajectories; position and cable dynamics may accumulate.\n' ...
 'V75 joint test was NOT successful: min raw thrust -2.103 N, max raw\n' ...
 'tau 44.75 Nm, beta-degenerate stop and 44.8 ms mean search time.\n' ...
 'V58 original R1 release at 2.325s had raw thrust -2.723 N and cable\n' ...
 'tension about 0.000485 N: strongly motivates new gain release tests.\n' ...
 'ALL V76 MATLAB outcomes remain unverified until user runs V76.\n']), 'char');
end

function result=v76FailureArtifact(ME)
root=fileparts(mfilename('fullpath'));
outdir=fullfile(root,'_CBF_TEST_OUTPUT');
if exist(outdir,'dir')~=7,mkdir(outdir);end
work=tempname;mkdir(work);cc=onCleanup(@()v69Cleanup(work)); %#ok<NASGU>
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V76_RUNTIME_ERROR.txt'),...
    getReport(ME,'extended','hyperlinks','off'));
v76WriteHandover(fullfile(work,'V76_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt'));
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V76_THEORY_AND_PROTOCOL.txt'),v76Theory());
path=fullfile(outdir,['CBF_HLC_GAIN_V76_ERROR_'...
    datestr(now,'yyyymmdd_HHMMSS_FFF') '.zip']);
zip(path,{'V76_RUNTIME_ERROR.txt','V76_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt',...
   'V76_THEORY_AND_PROTOCOL.txt'},work);
result=struct('status',['FAILED_V76_RUNTIME_' ME.identifier],...
    'zipPath',path,'nCases',0,'nRuntimeErrors',1,...
    'nFailedCases',1,'nGainConfigurations',0);
end


% ========================================================================
% V77: physically grounded source-HLC return admissibility guard.
% One file only, original source HLC/plant/reference untouched.
% No T_nom >= 6 N or any arbitrary nominal thrust floor.
% Source HLC raw four-input admissibility uses ONLY original actuator box.
% Local first-Lie-derivative guard uses source estimated 19-state RHS,
% an input-affine directional Jacobian (NOT finite-difference higher jets).
% The R1 obstacle barrier is kept HARD at the CURRENT control sample.
% This remains a sample-wise, nonpredictive diagnostic, not certified safety.
function result=v77ReturnAwareZOH(opts)
if exist('test_CBF_SetupPaths','file')==2,test_CBF_SetupPaths();end
req={'CBF_V19_Scenarios','CBF_V19_OriginalPlantStep', ...
     'CBF_V18_R1_RectifiedCable','lqrd'};
for ii=1:numel(req)
    if exist(req{ii},'file')==0
        error('CBF:V77MissingDependency','Missing original source: %s',req{ii});
    end
end
if exist('HLC_SUSPENDED_LOAD','class')~=8
    error('CBF:V77MissingHLC','The original HLC class was not found');
end
sc=CBF_V19_Scenarios('straight_single','R193');sc.dt=.025;
s=sc.settings; H=v23MakeHLC(s,sc.dt);mhat=.01;
if isfield(opts,'v77MassEstimate'),mhat=double(opts.v77MassEstimate);end
assert(isscalar(mhat)&&mhat>0&&isfinite(mhat),'CBF:V77Mass');
sest=s;sest.physical.massLoad=mhat;
lo=[s.input.thrustMin;s.input.torqueMin(:)];
hi=[s.input.thrustMax;s.input.torqueMax(:)];
assert(numel(lo)==4&&numel(hi)==4&&all(hi>lo),'CBF:V77Box');
startT=2.125; endT=2.4;releaseLen=.35;
if isfield(opts,'v77EndTime'),endT=double(opts.v77EndTime);end
if isfield(opts,'v77ReleaseLength'),releaseLen=double(opts.v77ReleaseLength);end
assert(endT>=2.325 && endT<=4 && releaseLen>0 && releaseLen<=1.0 && ...
       abs(endT/sc.dt-round(endT/sc.dt))<1e-7 && ...
       abs(releaseLen/sc.dt-round(releaseLen/sc.dt))<1e-7,'CBF:V77TimeGrid');
strongWeight=100;weakWeight=15;
if isfield(opts,'v77GuardWeight'),strongWeight=double(opts.v77GuardWeight);end
assert(isscalar(strongWeight)&&isfinite(strongWeight)&&strongWeight>0,'CBF:V77Weight');
% Dimensionless sample-time guard (d raw/dt)dt + 0.25*(distance to box).
% 0.25 is a response-rate design coefficient, NOT a force lower bound.
kappaDT=.25;
if isfield(opts,'v77KappaDT'),kappaDT=double(opts.v77KappaDT);end
assert(isscalar(kappaDT)&&isfinite(kappaDT)&&kappaDT>0,'CBF:V77Kappa');
modes={'NOMINAL','R1_BASE','R1_GUARD_T', ...
       'R1_GUARD_4D_TBOUND','R1_GUARD_4D','R1_GUARD_4D_STRONG'};
trace=struct([]);summary=struct([]);shadows=struct([]);
nErrors=0;nStops=0;
baseR1=struct('time',{},'x',{});
for modeIx=1:numel(modes)
    mode=modes{modeIx};
    fprintf('[CBF V77] %d/%d %s\n',modeIx,numel(modes),mode);
    [one,stat,cp]=v77Run(sc,H,sest,mhat,mode,...
        0,endT,sc.x0(:),lo,hi,kappaDT,weakWeight,strongWeight,false);
    [trace,summary,nErrors,nStops]=v77Append(trace,summary,nErrors,nStops,one,stat);
    if strcmp(mode,'R1_BASE'),baseR1=cp;end
end
% SAME-STATE release from the original R1 measured checkpoints.  Stopping
% original obstacle control here is an explicitly UNSAFE diagnostic, not
% evidence that a CBF should be disabled when the obstacle is nearby.
for t0=[2.275 2.300]
    index=find(abs([baseR1.time]-t0)<1e-8,1);
    for j=1:2
        if j==1,mode='RELEASE_TO_HLC';else,mode='RELEASE_GUARD_4D';end
        if isempty(index)
            stat=v77Unavailable(mode,t0,'ORIGINAL_R1_CHECKPOINT_MISSING');one=struct([]);
        else
            [one,stat]=v77Run(sc,H,sest,mhat,mode,...
                t0,t0+releaseLen,baseR1(index).x,lo,hi,...
                kappaDT,weakWeight,strongWeight,true);
        end
        [trace,summary,nErrors,nStops]=v77Append(trace,summary,nErrors,nStops,one,stat);
    end
end
% SOURCE-ONLY SAME-STATE comparison (does not overwrite or alter flight).
for ti=[2.125,2.150,2.200,2.250,2.275,2.300,2.325]
    index=find(abs([baseR1.time]-ti)<1e-8,1);
    if isempty(index),continue;end
    x=baseR1(index).x; a=v23HLC(x,ti,sc,H,mhat);
    uNom=min(hi,max(lo,a.raw(:)));
    [tl,th,ir]=v75R1Interval(x,s,sc.obstacles,ti);
    if ~strcmp(ir.reason,'OK') || tl>th,continue;end
    [G,q,derivErr]=v77RawAdmissibilityLie(x,ti,sc,H,sest,mhat,a,lo,hi,kappaDT);
    for j=1:3
        mode={'R1_GUARD_T','R1_GUARD_4D_TBOUND','R1_GUARD_4D'};
        [u,diag]=v77Select(uNom,a.raw,lo,hi,tl,th,...
            mode{j},G,q,weakWeight,strongWeight);
        sw=struct('time_s',ti,'mode',mode{j},'status',diag.status,...
            'R1AllowedMin_N',tl,'R1AllowedMax_N',th,...
            'sourceRawThrust_N',a.thrust,'sourceRawTauInf_Nm',norm(a.tau,Inf),...
            'candidateThrust_N',u(1),'candidateTauInf_Nm',norm(u(2:4),Inf),...
            'rawAdmissibilityPositive',all(v77Margin(a.raw,lo,hi)>=0),...
            'rawBoxMinMarginScaled',min(v77Margin(a.raw,lo,hi)),...
            'minLieGuardCandidate',min(G*u+q),...
            'maxSoftGuardViolation',diag.maxSoftViolation,...
            'guardProjectedGradientInf',diag.projectedGradientInf,...
            'lieFiniteStepRelativeError',derivErr,...
            'sourceBetaSigmaMin',a.sigmaMin,...
            'returnsNoNewInputFloors',true);
        if isempty(shadows),shadows=sw;else,shadows(end+1)=sw;end %#ok<AGROW>
    end
end
root=fileparts(mfilename('fullpath'));
outdir=fullfile(root,'_CBF_TEST_OUTPUT');
if exist(outdir,'dir')~=7,mkdir(outdir);end
work=tempname;mkdir(work);cc=onCleanup(@()v69Cleanup(work)); %#ok<NASGU>
assert(~isempty(trace) && ~isempty(summary),'CBF:V77NoCases');
writetable(struct2table(trace),fullfile(work,'V77_ZOH_RETURN_GUARD_TRACE.csv'));
writetable(struct2table(summary),fullfile(work,'V77_ZOH_RETURN_GUARD_SUMMARY.csv'));
files={'V77_ZOH_RETURN_GUARD_TRACE.csv','V77_ZOH_RETURN_GUARD_SUMMARY.csv'};
if ~isempty(shadows)
    writetable(struct2table(shadows),fullfile(work,'V77_MATCHED_R1_RETURN_GUARD.csv'));
    files{end+1}='V77_MATCHED_R1_RETURN_GUARD.csv';
end
v77WriteHandover(fullfile(work,'V77_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt'));
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V77_THEORY_LIMITS_AND_TEST.txt'),v77Theory());
files=[files,{'V77_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt','V77_THEORY_LIMITS_AND_TEST.txt'}];
zipPath=fullfile(outdir,['CBF_HLC_RETURN_V77_' ...
    datestr(now,'yyyymmdd_HHMMSS_FFF') '.zip']);
zip(zipPath,files,work);
assert(exist(zipPath,'file')==2,'CBF:V77MissingZip');
if nErrors>0
    status='INCOMPLETE_V77_RUNTIME_ERRORS';
elseif nStops>0
    status='V77_DIAGNOSTIC_RECORDED_WITH_UNSAFE_OR_INFEASIBLE_STOPS';
else
    status='V77_DIAGNOSTIC_COMPLETE__NOT_CBF_CERTIFIED';
end
result=struct('status',status,'zipPath',zipPath,'nCases',numel(summary),...
    'nRuntimeErrors',nErrors,'nFailedCases',nStops,...
    'nShadowCases',numel(shadows),...
    'nominalThrustFloorAdded',false,'referenceModified',false,...
    'HLCSourceModified',false,'fourInputHOCBFCertified',false);
end

function [trace,summary,nErrors,nStops]=v77Append(trace,summary,nErrors,nStops,one,stat)
if ~isempty(one)
    if isempty(trace),trace=one;else,trace=[trace one];end %#ok<AGROW>
end
if isempty(summary),summary=stat;else,summary(end+1)=stat;end %#ok<AGROW>
nErrors=nErrors+double(startsWith(stat.stopReason,'ERROR_'));
nStops=nStops+double(~strcmp(stat.stopReason,'HORIZON_REACHED'));
end

function stat=v77Unavailable(mode,t,reason)
stat=struct('mode',mode,'stopReason',['NO_START_' reason],...
 'startTime_s',t,'targetEndTime_s',NaN,'lastTime_s',NaN,...
 'nSamples',0,'nR1Violations',NaN,'nRawThrustNegative',NaN,...
 'nRawTorqueAboveBox',NaN,'nRawInputBoxViolations',NaN,...
 'nReturnGatePass',NaN,'nGuardIterations',NaN,'nLieGuardViolations',NaN,...
 'nLieDerivativeMismatch',NaN,'minSourceRawThrust_N',NaN,...
 'maxSourceRawTorqueInf_Nm',NaN,'minCableTension_N',NaN,...
 'minCableGeometryH',NaN,'minR1Residual',NaN,...
 'maxModelInverseResidual',NaN,'maxGuardCost',NaN,...
 'maxDecisionTime_s',NaN,'nDecisionOver25ms',NaN,...
 'referenceModified',false,'HLCSourceModified',false,...
 'addedNominalThrustFloor',false,'sampleCBFCertified',false);
end

function [trace,stat,checkpoints]=v77Run(sc,H,sest,mhat,mode,t0,tend,x,...
    lo,hi,kappaDT,weakWeight,strongWeight,release)
s=sc.settings;N=round((tend-t0)/sc.dt);trace=struct([]);
checkpoints=struct('time',{},'x',{});
stop='HORIZON_REACHED';last=NaN;nR1Violation=0;nNeg=0;nTauEx=0;
nRawBox=0;nGate=0;nIter=0;nGuardViolation=0;nLieMismatch=0;
minT=Inf;maxTau=0;minTension=Inf;minGeom=Inf;minR1=Inf;
maxInverse=0;maxGuardCost=0;maxElapsed=0;nOver=0;
for k=0:N
    t=t0+k*sc.dt;
    try
        a=v23HLC(x,t,sc,H,mhat);
        if any(~isfinite(a.raw)) || ~isreal(a.raw)
            stop='ERROR_NONFINITE_SOURCE_HLC';break;
        end
        checkpoints(end+1)=struct('time',t,'x',x); %#ok<AGROW>
        uNom=min(hi,max(lo,a.raw(:)));
        originalRaw=a.raw(:);u=uNom;
        tl=lo(1);th=hi(1);r1Reason='DISABLED_DIAGNOSTIC';
        enforceR1=~any(strcmp(mode,{'NOMINAL','RELEASE_TO_HLC','RELEASE_GUARD_4D'}))...
            && t>=2.125-1e-9;
        if enforceR1
            [tl,th,rec]=v75R1Interval(x,s,sc.obstacles,t);
            r1Reason=rec.reason;
            if ~strcmp(rec.reason,'OK')
                stop=['R1_STOP_' rec.reason];break;
            end
            if tl>th+1e-8
                stop='R1_STOP_EMPTY_PHYSICAL_THRUST_INTERSECTION';break;
            end
        end
        useGuard=any(strcmp(mode,{'R1_GUARD_T','R1_GUARD_4D_TBOUND',...
             'R1_GUARD_4D','R1_GUARD_4D_STRONG','RELEASE_GUARD_4D'})) && ...
             (t>=2.125-1e-9 || release);
        lieErr=NaN;gateOk=false;d0=nan(4,1);B=nan(4,4);
        diag=struct('status','NO_GUARD','maxSoftViolation',NaN,...
             'guardCost',0,'iterations',0,'projectedGradientInf',NaN);
        elapsed=0;
        % All comparisons use the same local derivative construction,
        % including original R1.  Baseline is NEVER modified by it.
        if t>=2.125-1e-9 || release
            tic;
            [G,q,lieErr,d0,B]=v77RawAdmissibilityLie(x,t,sc,H,sest,mhat,a,...
                lo,hi,kappaDT);
            if useGuard
                [u,diag]=v77Select(uNom,originalRaw,lo,hi,tl,th,...
                    mode,G,q,weakWeight,strongWeight);
                gateOk=all(originalRaw>=lo-1e-8 & originalRaw<=hi+1e-8) && ...
                    all(G*uNom+q>=-1e-9) && ...
                    uNom(1)>=tl-1e-9 && uNom(1)<=th+1e-9;
                nGate=nGate+double(gateOk);
                nIter=nIter+diag.iterations;
                nGuardViolation=nGuardViolation+double(diag.maxSoftViolation>1e-7);
                maxGuardCost=max(maxGuardCost,diag.guardCost);
            end
            nLieMismatch=nLieMismatch+double(lieErr>5e-2);
            elapsed=toc;
            maxElapsed=max(maxElapsed,elapsed);
            nOver=nOver+double(elapsed>sc.dt);
            if strcmp(diag.status,'NUMERICAL_FAILURE')
                stop='ERROR_GUARD_NUMERICAL_FAILURE';break;
            end
        end
        if enforceR1 && ~useGuard
            u(1)=min(th,max(tl,u(1)));
        end
        if any(~isfinite(u)) || any(u<lo-1e-8) || any(u>hi+1e-8)
            stop='ERROR_INPUT_OUTSIDE_PHYSICAL_BOUNDS';break;
        end
        if enforceR1 && (u(1)<tl-1e-7 || u(1)>th+1e-7)
            stop='ERROR_R1_HARD_CONSTRAINT_BROKEN';break;
        end
        ten=v23Tension(x,s,u(1));geom=v23CableSafety(x,sc);
        if enforceR1 || release || t>=2.125-1e-9
            [r1r,hr]=v75R1Residual(x,s,sc.obstacles,u(1));
            if isfinite(r1r),minR1=min(minR1,r1r);end
            nR1Violation=nR1Violation+double(isfinite(r1r)&&r1r< -1e-7);
        else
            r1r=NaN;hr=NaN;
        end
        invResid=NaN;invStatus='NOT_COMPUTED';
        if t>=2.125-1e-9
            vc=v75Candidate(x,t,sc,H,sest,a,u,uNom);
            invStatus=vc.reason;
            if vc.valid
                invResid=vc.inverseResidual;
                maxInverse=max(maxInverse,abs(invResid));
            elseif useGuard
                % Do not apply an unverified high-order inverse candidate.
                % This is an experiment stop, not proof of no feasible input.
                stop=['INVERSE_CANDIDATE_' vc.reason];break;
            end
        end
        rawMargin=v77Margin(originalRaw,lo,hi);
        f=struct('mode',mode,'time_s',t,'status',diag.status,...
            'referenceModified',false,'HLCSourceModified',false,...
            'nominalThrustFloorAdded',false,'physicalZOH_s',sc.dt,...
            'sourceRawThrust_N',a.thrust,...
            'sourceRawTauInf_Nm',norm(a.tau,Inf),...
            'sourceRawTauPitch_Nm',a.tau(2),...
            'sourceBetaSigmaMin',a.sigmaMin,...
            'sourceRawFourInsidePhysicalBox',all(rawMargin>=0),...
            'sourceRawBoxMinimumNormalizedMargin',min(rawMargin),...
            'appliedThrust_N',u(1),'appliedTauX_Nm',u(2),...
            'appliedTauY_Nm',u(3),'appliedTauZ_Nm',u(4),...
            'appliedTauInf_Nm',norm(u(2:4),Inf),...
            'originalClippedThrust_N',uNom(1),...
            'r1HardApplied',enforceR1,'r1IntervalReason',r1Reason,...
            'r1AllowedMin_N',tl,'r1AllowedMax_N',th,...
            'r1CurrentSampleResidual',r1r,'r1RectifiedH',hr,...
            'cableTension_N',ten,'sampledCableGeometryH',geom,...
            'loadZ_m',x(10),'loadVz_mps',x(13),...
            'refZ_m',a.refPos(3),'refVz_mps',a.refVel(3),...
            'rawThrustDenominator',a.thrustDenominator,...
            'rawThrustNumerator',a.thrustNumerator,...
            'sourceNominalThrustLie_N_per_s',d0(1)+B(1,:)*uNom,...
            'sourceAppliedThrustLie_N_per_s',d0(1)+B(1,:)*u,...
            'sourceAppliedTorqueLieInf_Nm_per_s',norm(d0(2:4)+B(2:4,:)*u,Inf),...
            'returnGatePass',gateOk,'guardSoftConstraintMaxViolation',...
                 diag.maxSoftViolation,'guardObjective',diag.guardCost,...
            'guardIterations',diag.iterations,...
            'guardProjectedGradientInf',diag.projectedGradientInf,...
            'guardElapsed_s',elapsed,...
            'lieDirectionalStepRelativeError',lieErr,...
            'inverseIdentityStatus',invStatus,...
            'inverseIdentityResidual',invResid,...
            'returnFeasibilityNotProven',true,'intersampleCBFNotCertified',true);
        if isempty(trace),trace=f;else,trace(end+1)=f;end %#ok<AGROW>
        last=t;minT=min(minT,a.thrust);maxTau=max(maxTau,norm(a.tau,Inf));
        nNeg=nNeg+double(a.thrust<0);
        nTauEx=nTauEx+double(any(abs(a.tau(:))>hi(2:4)+1e-8));
        nRawBox=nRawBox+double(any(rawMargin<0));
        minTension=min(minTension,ten);minGeom=min(minGeom,geom);
        if ~isfinite(ten) || ten<=0
            stop='PHYSICAL_MODEL_TENSION_NONPOSITIVE';break;
        end
        if ~isfinite(geom)
            stop='ERROR_CABLE_GEOMETRY_NONFINITE';break;
        end
        if k<N
            x=CBF_V19_OriginalPlantStep(x,u,s,sc.dt,4);
            if any(~isfinite(x))||~isreal(x)
                stop='ERROR_PLANT_NONFINITE';break;
            end
        end
    catch ME
        stop=['ERROR_' ME.identifier];
        fprintf('[CBF V77] %s at t=%.6f : %s\n',stop,t,ME.message);
        break;
    end
end
stat=struct('mode',mode,'stopReason',stop,'startTime_s',t0,...
   'targetEndTime_s',tend,'lastTime_s',last,'nSamples',numel(trace),...
   'nR1Violations',nR1Violation,'nRawThrustNegative',nNeg,...
   'nRawTorqueAboveBox',nTauEx,'nRawInputBoxViolations',nRawBox,...
   'nReturnGatePass',nGate,'nGuardIterations',nIter,...
   'nLieGuardViolations',nGuardViolation,'nLieDerivativeMismatch',nLieMismatch,...
   'minSourceRawThrust_N',v76Finite(minT),...
   'maxSourceRawTorqueInf_Nm',maxTau,'minCableTension_N',v76Finite(minTension),...
   'minCableGeometryH',v76Finite(minGeom),...
   'minR1Residual',v76Finite(minR1),...
   'maxModelInverseResidual',maxInverse,'maxGuardCost',maxGuardCost,...
   'maxDecisionTime_s',maxElapsed,'nDecisionOver25ms',nOver,...
   'referenceModified',false,'HLCSourceModified',false,...
   'addedNominalThrustFloor',false,'sampleCBFCertified',false);
end

function [G,q,err,D0,B]=v77RawAdmissibilityLie(x,t,sc,H,sest,mhat,a,lo,hi,kappaDT)
% The raw source HLC u_nom(x,t) is smooth in the neighborhood if the
% inverse map is nonsingular.  Its FIRST directional Lie derivative is
% affine in PHYSICAL applied u because xdot=f(x,u) is input affine.
% This is one local derivative, NOT repeated finite-differencing of a
% discontinuous ZOH input and NOT a prediction of the next ZOH state.
% G*u+q is a DIMENSIONLESS, dt-scaled approximation of the barrier
% derivative for all 8 source raw HLC command physical-box boundaries.
h=1e-5;scale=hi-lo;
u0=zeros(4,1);f0=v70RHS19(x,u0,sest);
a0=a.raw(:);base=v23HLC(x+h*f0,t+h,sc,H,mhat);
D0=(base.raw(:)-a0)/h;
B=zeros(4,4);
for jj=1:4
    e=zeros(4,1);e(jj)=1;
    fj=v70RHS19(x,e,sest);
    test=v23HLC(x+h*fj,t+h,sc,H,mhat);
    B(:,jj)=(test.raw(:)-base.raw(:))/h;
end
% The SOURCE raw thrust has an independent EXACT first Lie derivative
% from R193 Uf and estimated 19-state kinematics.  Use the analytic result
% in the guard's FIRST row: tau has no instantaneous first-order influence
% on raw thrust.  Higher-order effects are NOT set to zero.
D0numeric=D0;Bnumeric=B;
D0(1)=v77AnalyticRawThrustLie(x,t,sc,H,sest,mhat,a,u0);
for jj=1:4
    ej=zeros(4,1);ej(jj)=1;
    B(1,jj)=v77AnalyticRawThrustLie(x,t,sc,H,sest,mhat,a,ej)-D0(1);
end
qlo=sc.dt*(D0./scale)+kappaDT*((a0-lo)./scale);
qhi=-sc.dt*(D0./scale)+kappaDT*((hi-a0)./scale);
Glo=sc.dt*(B./scale);
Ghi=-Glo;
G=[Glo;Ghi];q=[qlo;qhi];
% Independent half step and analytic-thrust comparisons in one audit.
h2=h/2;
bh=v23HLC(x+h2*f0,t+h2,sc,H,mhat);
D02=(bh.raw(:)-a0)/h2;
err=max(norm(D02-D0numeric,Inf)/max(1,norm(D02,Inf)), ...
    norm([D0numeric(1)-D0(1),Bnumeric(1,:)-B(1,:)],Inf)/ ...
    max(1,norm([D0(1),B(1,:)],Inf)));
if any(~isfinite(G(:))) || any(~isfinite(q)) || ...
        any(~isfinite(D0)) || any(~isfinite(B(:)))
    error('CBF:V77LieNonfinite','First Lie derivative is nonfinite');
end
end

function dT=v77AnalyticRawThrustLie(x,t,sc,H,sest,mhat,a,u)
% Independent analytic derivative of SOURCE Uf numerator/denominator.
% Uses only currently available x, actual candidate u, known reference
% first-three derivatives, and estimated parameters.  No thrust floor.
% This derivative is for raw SOURCE HLC feedback (not realized v1 jet).
u=u(:);dx=v70RHS19(x,u,sest);
m=sest.physical.massDrone;L=sest.physical.cableLength;
M=m+mhat; p=x(14:16);w=x(17:19);
qB=x(1:4);dq=dx(1:4);
b3=[2*(qB(2)*qB(4)+qB(1)*qB(3));...
    2*(qB(3)*qB(4)-qB(1)*qB(2));...
    qB(1)^2-qB(2)^2-qB(3)^2+qB(4)^2];
db3=[2*(dq(2)*qB(4)+qB(2)*dq(4)+dq(1)*qB(3)+qB(1)*dq(3));...
    2*(dq(3)*qB(4)+qB(3)*dq(4)-dq(1)*qB(2)-qB(1)*dq(2));...
    2*(qB(1)*dq(1)-qB(2)*dq(2)-qB(3)*dq(3)+qB(4)*dq(4))];
dp=dx(14:16);dw=dx(17:19);
cp=cross(w,p); dcp=cross(dw,p)+cross(w,dp);
D=a.thrustDenominator;
dD=dp(3)*dot(p,b3)+p(3)*(dot(dp,b3)+dot(p,db3));
dN=M*(H.F1(1)*(a.refVel(3)-x(13)) + ...
       H.F1(2)*(a.refAcc(3)-dx(13)) + a.refJerk(3)) + ...
       m*L*(dp(3)*dot(cp,cp)+2*p(3)*dot(cp,dcp));
if ~isfinite(D) || abs(D)<1e-11
    error('CBF:V77ThrustProjectionDegenerate',...
        'Uf denominator too small for analytic local derivative');
end
dT=(dN-a.thrust*dD)/D;
if ~isfinite(dT),error('CBF:V77ThrustLieNonfinite');end
end

function margins=v77Margin(raw,lo,hi)
scale=hi-lo;
margins=[(raw(:)-lo)./scale;(hi-raw(:))./scale];
end

function [u,d]=v77Select(uNom,raw,lo,hi,tl,th,mode,G,q,weak,strong)
% Convex bounded four-physical-input objective: constrained by ACTUAL
% original R1 affine thrust interval and actual 4-input box.  The eight
% source-raw HLC return-admissibility derivative constraints are SOFT,
% each with measured slacks; exact feasibility is never asserted.
d=struct('status','OK','maxSoftViolation',NaN,...
       'guardCost',NaN,'iterations',0,'projectedGradientInf',NaN);
active=1:4;enabled=1:8;rho=weak;
switch mode
    case 'R1_GUARD_T'
        active=1;
    case 'R1_GUARD_4D_TBOUND'
        enabled=[1 5];
    case 'R1_GUARD_4D_STRONG'
        rho=strong;
    case {'R1_GUARD_4D','RELEASE_GUARD_4D'}
        % all four physical inputs and all eight raw-HLC box faces
    otherwise
        d.status='ERROR_UNRECOGNIZED_MODE';u=nan(4,1);return;
end
bottom=lo;top=hi;bottom(1)=max(lo(1),tl);top(1)=min(hi(1),th);
if any(bottom>top+1e-9)
    d.status='ERROR_EMPTY_HARD_BOX';u=nan(4,1);return;
end
% Use the original saturation of the source HLC only as a reference.
% NEVER introduce a 6N or other artificial nominal thrust minimum.
Uref=uNom(:);u=min(top,max(bottom,Uref));
if numel(active)==1
    bottom(2:4)=u(2:4);top(2:4)=u(2:4);
end
Gsub=G(enabled,:);qsub=q(enabled);
scales=hi-lo;
D=1./(scales.^2);
% Convex QP with squared soft CBF-derivative slacks, solved by a simple
% bounded accelerated gradient.  No nonlinear forward rollout or MPC.
L=max(D)+2*rho*sum(Gsub(:).^2);
if ~isfinite(L)||L<=0
    d.status='NUMERICAL_FAILURE';u=nan(4,1);return;
end
y=u;z=u;theta=1;
for it=1:120
    gap=Gsub*y+qsub;
    grad=D.*(y-Uref)+2*rho*Gsub'*min(0,gap);
    next=min(top,max(bottom,y-grad/L));
    if norm(next-z,Inf)<1e-11 && it>4
        z=next;break;
    end
    theta2=(1+sqrt(1+4*theta^2))/2;
    y=next+((theta-1)/theta2)*(next-z);
    z=next;theta=theta2;
end
u=z;g=Gsub*u+qsub;
d.maxSoftViolation=max(0,max(-g));
d.guardCost=.5*sum(((u-Uref)./scales).^2)+rho*sum(min(0,g).^2);
d.iterations=it;
% First-order box-stationarity measure; a 120-iteration stop is NOT a
% numerical certificate of the constrained global minimum.
finalGrad=D.*(u-Uref)+2*rho*Gsub'*min(0,g);
d.projectedGradientInf=norm(u-min(top,max(bottom,u-finalGrad/L)),Inf);
if any(~isfinite(u))||~isfinite(d.guardCost)
    d.status='NUMERICAL_FAILURE';
elseif d.projectedGradientInf>1e-5
    d.status='OPTIMIZATION_NOT_CONVERGED';
elseif d.maxSoftViolation>1e-6
    d.status='SOFT_RETURN_GUARD_UNSATISFIED';
else
    d.status='CURRENT_RETURN_LIE_GUARD_MET';
end
end

function chapter=v77Theory()
chapter=sprintf([ ...
'V77: Original R193 test-only return-admissibility experiment.\n' ...
'NO reference trajectory edits (same original 0..6 jets), NO F1 gain edits,\n' ...
'NO nominal thrust floor and NO fake 6N hover or constant mass-dependent bound.\n' ...
'Original 25ms ZOH, original HLC F1..F4 and source R1 barrier unchanged.\n' ...
'Existing physical actuator box 0<=T<=20 N, abs(tau)<=1 Nm only.\n' ...
'Each u_sample is a real 4-vector held for one original sample.\n' ...
'Hard sample constraint: original rectified R1 thrust interval intersect\n' ...
'physical thrust box.  If empty: STOP AND RECORD; do not fake feasibility.\n' ...
'At each controller sample, the source HLC RAW COMMAND a(x,t) is evaluated.\n' ...
'Its four coordinate distances from the EXISTING physical box are\n' ...
' b_low=a-u_min and b_high=u_max-a.  This is NOT T>=T_hover.\n' ...
'For a physical candidate u, first source-command Lie derivative is\n' ...
' da/dt=d0+B*u from estimated original 19-state physical dynamics.\n' ...
'Input-affinity is exactly the original R193 19-state source structure.\n' ...
'Local raw-command return guard is: dot(b)+kappa*b >= 0.\n' ...
'Raw-thrust first Lie derivative is computed independently in CLOSED\n' ...
'ANALYTIC R193 Uf numerator/denominator form and audited against local\n' ...
'directional source differentiation (only torque-raw derivative numeric).\n' ...
'Here kappa*dt=.25 is a design rate, not a thrust limit.\n' ...
'Soft violation penalties are optimized with the hard current R1 interval.\n' ...
'T and all three tau can vary; torque-only and source-thrust-only ablations\n' ...
'are distinguished.  Candidate optimization is convex in physical inputs\n' ...
'under this FIRST-ORDER LOCAL model; it is NOT a full four-input HOCBF.\n' ...
'Calculation uses a small LOCAL directional step to estimate one Lie\n' ...
'derivative of original raw HLC map; this is a numerical approximation.\n' ...
'It is NOT fivefold numerical finite differencing of ZOH inputs.\n' ...
'Every result records local derivative approximation checks.\n' ...
'If R1 and return guard conflict, return guard is soft, and residual logged.\n' ...
'If raw HLC was already out of the physical box, ordinary interior CBF\n' ...
'forward invariance is not established. Sample-time violation is possible.\n' ...
'The four-output raw map uses source Vfd discrete component semantics;\n' ...
'its local Lie derivative does NOT fix upstream source Vfd high-order\n' ...
'continuous-time semantic mismatch discovered in V67.\n' ...
'Realized inverse identity is audited with V74-V75 source-matched functions.\n' ...
'It is NOT by itself proof of safe tracking or of 4-input HOCBF.\n' ...
'Sampled R1 barrier is original thrust-only; no independent tension, ground,\n' ...
'drone/cable collision, true-plant robust, intersample or return-region\n' ...
'viability certificate is claimed.  Estimated mass .01 kg by default, true\n' ...
'simulator .14 kg, as in V76.  Tension monitored, not hard guaranteed.\n' ...
'Release-to-HLC is an UNSAFE causal control comparison; the release guard\n' ...
'also lacks obstacle certification because R1 is disabled in this branch.\n' ...
'No claim that applied u remains bounded over unmodeled actuator dynamics.\n' ...
'Original controller files, generators, original CBF and reference remain\n' ...
'unchanged. Only common_matlab/test_CBF_HLC_RootCause.m is overwritten.\n' ...
'Results are diagnostic only; fixed-thrust-floor and trajectory-governor\n' ...
'are deliberately excluded by user requirements.\n']);
end

function v77WriteHandover(path)
v76WriteHandover(path);
fid=fopen(path,'a');
if fid<0,error('CBF:V77Handover');end
cc=onCleanup(@()fclose(fid)); %#ok<NASGU>
fwrite(fid,sprintf([ ...
 '\n\n=== V76 OBSERVED MATLAB MEASUREMENTS (18 NOV 2026) ===\n' ...
 '96 test cases, zero MATLAB execution errors. All 12 R1 gain runs ended\n' ...
 'in a thrust-CBF infeasibility stop. BASE min source raw T=-2.723N,\n' ...
 'max raw tau=135.229Nm; KV_050 min raw T=1.933N, raw max tau=5.674Nm,\n' ...
 'also R1-infeasible. KV_075 positive minimum source raw T=0.397N yet\n' ...
 'raw tau=162.431Nm: T>0 is NOT sufficient for physical inverse feasibility.\n' ...
 'Original R1 release at 2.300s BASE min T=0.415N and min tension=.0648N;\n' ...
 'KV_050 release min T=5.168N, max raw tau=.231Nm, min tension=.802N,\n' ...
 'only 0.35s observed; still no long-term safety claim.\n' ...
 'These are experiments, not evidence for a 6N nominal thrust floor.\n' ...
 '\n=== V77 RETURN-ADMISSIBILITY CAUSAL EXPERIMENT ===\n%s'],...
    v77Theory()),'char');
end

function result=v77FailureArtifact(ME)
root=fileparts(mfilename('fullpath'));
outdir=fullfile(root,'_CBF_TEST_OUTPUT');
if exist(outdir,'dir')~=7,mkdir(outdir);end
work=tempname;mkdir(work); cc=onCleanup(@()v69Cleanup(work)); %#ok<NASGU>
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V77_RUNTIME_ERROR.txt'),...
    getReport(ME,'extended','hyperlinks','off'));
v77WriteHandover(fullfile(work,'V77_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt'));
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V77_THEORY_LIMITS_AND_TEST.txt'),v77Theory());
path=fullfile(outdir,['CBF_HLC_RETURN_V77_ERROR_'...
    datestr(now,'yyyymmdd_HHMMSS_FFF') '.zip']);
zip(path,{'V77_RUNTIME_ERROR.txt','V77_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt',...
    'V77_THEORY_LIMITS_AND_TEST.txt'},work);
result=struct('status',['INCOMPLETE_V77_RUNTIME_' ME.identifier],...
    'zipPath',path,'nCases',0,'nRuntimeErrors',1,'nFailedCases',1,...
    'nShadowCases',0,'referenceModified',false,...
    'nominalThrustFloorAdded',false);
end


% ========================================================================
% V78: actual physical-output tracking objective versus clipped-source-input
% reference, with the original R1 hard sampled thrust constraint. Research
% diagnostic ONLY: NOT a four-input HOCBF / viability or safety certificate.
% ========================================================================
function result=v78PhysicalTrackingComparison(opts)
if exist('test_CBF_SetupPaths','file')==2,test_CBF_SetupPaths();end
req={'CBF_V19_Scenarios','CBF_V19_OriginalPlantStep',...
    'CBF_V18_R1_RectifiedCable','lqrd'};
for k=1:numel(req)
    if exist(req{k},'file')==0
        error('CBF:V78Dependency','Missing unmodified R193 source: %s',req{k});
    end
end
if exist('HLC_SUSPENDED_LOAD','class')~=8
    error('CBF:V78HLCMissing','Unmodified HLC_SUSPENDED_LOAD not found');
end
sc=CBF_V19_Scenarios('straight_single','R193');sc.dt=.025;
s=sc.settings;H=v23MakeHLC(s,sc.dt);
mhat=.01;
if isfield(opts,'v78MassEstimate'),mhat=double(opts.v78MassEstimate);end
assert(isfinite(mhat)&&isscalar(mhat)&&mhat>0,'CBF:V78MassEstimate');
sest=s;sest.physical.massLoad=mhat;
lo=[s.input.thrustMin;s.input.torqueMin(:)];
hi=[s.input.thrustMax;s.input.torqueMax(:)];
assert(numel(lo)==4&&numel(hi)==4&&all(hi>lo),'CBF:V78PhysicalBox');
tend=2.4;
if isfield(opts,'v78EndTime'),tend=opts.v78EndTime;end
assert(tend>=2.325&&tend<=4&&abs(tend/sc.dt-round(tend/sc.dt))<1e-7,...
    'CBF:V78TimeGrid');
releaseTests=true;
if isfield(opts,'v78ReleaseTests'),releaseTests=logical(opts.v78ReleaseTests);end
modes={'NOMINAL','A_CLIPPED_HLC_R1','B_TRACK_THEN_R1','C_JOINT_TRACK_R1'};
trace=struct([]);summary=struct([]);sameState=struct([]);
baseStates=struct('time',{},'x',{},'prevU',{});
errs=0;fails=0;
for j=1:numel(modes)
    mode=modes{j};
    fprintf('[CBF V78] %d/%d %s\n',j,numel(modes),mode);
    [rows,st,check]=v78Flight(sc,H,sest,mhat,mode,0,tend,...
        sc.x0(:),[],lo,hi,false);
    [trace,summary,errs,fails]=v78Append(trace,summary,errs,fails,rows,st);
    if strcmp(mode,'A_CLIPPED_HLC_R1'),baseStates=check;end
end
% SAME STATE from original R1, compare chosen inputs AND their one-ZOH
% effects. The true R193 plant is used ONLY for the causal outcome, never
% to decide a tracking/reference input under the estimated controller.
for ti=[2.150,2.200,2.250,2.275,2.300]
    idx=find(abs([baseStates.time]-ti)<1e-8,1);
    if isempty(idx),continue;end
    x=baseStates(idx).x; uprev=baseStates(idx).prevU;
    a=v23HLC(x,ti,sc,H,mhat);
    un=min(hi,max(lo,a.raw(:)));
    [tl,th,rinfo]=v75R1Interval(x,s,sc.obstacles,ti);
    if ~strcmp(rinfo.reason,'OK')||tl>th,continue;end
    for j=2:4
        mode=modes{j};
        [u,diag]=v78Select(x,ti,sc,H,sest,a,un,uprev,lo,hi,...
            tl,th,mode,true);
        nextRaw=NaN;nextTau=NaN;branchStatus=diag.status;
        if all(isfinite(u))&&~startsWith(diag.status,'ERROR_')
            try
                xn=CBF_V19_OriginalPlantStep(x,u,s,sc.dt,4);
                an=v23HLC(xn,ti+sc.dt,sc,H,mhat);
                nextRaw=an.thrust;nextTau=norm(an.tau,Inf);
            catch ME
                branchStatus=['ERROR_BRANCH_' ME.identifier];
            end
        end
        sr=struct('time_s',ti,'mode',mode,'status',branchStatus,...
            'appliedThrust_N',u(1),'appliedTauInf_Nm',norm(u(2:4),Inf),...
            'nextRawHLCThrust_N',nextRaw,'nextRawHLCTorqueInf_Nm',nextTau,...
            'sourceRawThrust_N',a.thrust,'sourceRawTorqueInf_Nm',norm(a.tau,Inf),...
            'minR1Residual',v78SafeR1(x,s,sc.obstacles,u(1)),...
            'sampleEstimatedTension_N',v23Tension(x,sest,u(1)),...
            'sampleTrueTension_N',v23Tension(x,s,u(1)),...
            'sampleOnlyNotCertified',true);
        if isempty(sameState),sameState=sr;else,sameState(end+1)=sr;end %#ok<AGROW>
    end
end
% Diagnostic release branches: disable original R1 explicitly. These are
% NOT safe recoveries and MUST report residuals of the disabled constraint.
if releaseTests
    for ti=[2.275,2.300]
        idx=find(abs([baseStates.time]-ti)<1e-8,1);
        for j=1:3
            mode={'RELEASE_A_CLIPPED','RELEASE_B_TRACK','RELEASE_C_TRACK'};
            if isempty(idx)
                st=v78BlankSummary(mode{j},ti,ti+.35,'NO_R1_CHECKPOINT');rows=struct([]);
            else
                [rows,st]=v78Flight(sc,H,sest,mhat,mode{j},ti,ti+.35,...
                    baseStates(idx).x,baseStates(idx).prevU,lo,hi,true);
            end
            [trace,summary,errs,fails]=v78Append(trace,summary,errs,fails,rows,st);
        end
    end
end
root=fileparts(mfilename('fullpath'));outdir=fullfile(root,'_CBF_TEST_OUTPUT');
if exist(outdir,'dir')~=7,mkdir(outdir);end
work=tempname;mkdir(work);cleanup=onCleanup(@()v69Cleanup(work)); %#ok<NASGU>
assert(~isempty(trace) && ~isempty(summary),'CBF:V78NoResults');
writetable(struct2table(trace),fullfile(work,'V78_POLICY_TRACE.csv'));
writetable(struct2table(summary),fullfile(work,'V78_POLICY_SUMMARY.csv'));
files={'V78_POLICY_TRACE.csv','V78_POLICY_SUMMARY.csv'};
if ~isempty(sameState)
    writetable(struct2table(sameState),fullfile(work,'V78_MATCHED_STATE_ONE_ZOH.csv'));
    files{end+1}='V78_MATCHED_STATE_ONE_ZOH.csv';
end
v78WriteHandover(fullfile(work,'V78_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt'));
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V78_THEORY_LIMITS_AND_RUN.txt'),v78Theory());
files=[files,{'V78_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt','V78_THEORY_LIMITS_AND_RUN.txt'}];
zipPath=fullfile(outdir,['CBF_HLC_TRACK_V78_' datestr(now,'yyyymmdd_HHMMSS_FFF') '.zip']);
zip(zipPath,files,work);
assert(exist(zipPath,'file')==2,'CBF:V78ZIPNotCreated');
if errs>0,status='INCOMPLETE_V78_RUNTIME_ERRORS';
elseif fails>0,status='V78_RECORDED_WITH_INFEASIBLE_OR_UNSAFE_STOPS__NOT_CERTIFIED';
else,status='V78_TRACKING_COMPARISON_COMPLETE__NOT_CBF_CERTIFIED';end
result=struct('status',status,'zipPath',zipPath,'nCases',numel(summary),...
    'nRuntimeErrors',errs,'nFailedCases',fails,'nSameState',numel(sameState),...
    'nominalThrustFloorAdded',false,'referenceModified',false,...
    'HLCSourceModified',false,'fourInputHOCBFCertified',false);
end

function [trace,summary,errs,fails]=v78Append(trace,summary,errs,fails,rows,st)
if ~isempty(rows)
    if isempty(trace),trace=rows;else,trace=[trace rows];end %#ok<AGROW>
end
if isempty(summary),summary=st;else,summary(end+1)=st;end %#ok<AGROW>
errs=errs+double(startsWith(st.stopReason,'ERROR_'));
fails=fails+double(~strcmp(st.stopReason,'HORIZON_REACHED'));
end

function st=v78BlankSummary(mode,t0,tend,stop)
st=struct('mode',mode,'startTime_s',t0,'requestedEndTime_s',tend,...
    'lastTime_s',NaN,'stopReason',stop,'nSamples',0,'nR1Violations',0,...
    'nTensionNonpositive',0,'nInverseFailures',0,...
    'minSourceRawThrust_N',NaN,'maxSourceRawTorqueInf_Nm',NaN,...
    'minTrueTension_N',NaN,'minEstimatedTension_N',NaN,...
    'minR1Residual',NaN,'maxAppliedTauInf_Nm',NaN,...
    'maxInverseIdentityResidual',NaN,'nOver25ms',0,...
    'maxDecisionTime_s',NaN,'nNonlinearMismatch',0,...
    'modelEstimatedMass_kg',NaN,'plantTrueMass_kg',NaN,...
    'interSampleSafetyCertified',false,'fourInputCBFCertified',false);
end

function [rows,st,checkpoints]=v78Flight(sc,H,sest,mhat,mode,t0,tend,x,prevU,lo,hi,release)
s=sc.settings;N=round((tend-t0)/sc.dt);rows=struct([]);
checkpoints=struct('time',{},'x',{},'prevU',{});
stop='HORIZON_REACHED';last=NaN;nR1=0;nTen=0;nInv=0;nNonlinear=0;
minRaw=Inf;maxRawTau=0;minTrueTen=Inf;minEstTen=Inf;
minR1=Inf;maxTau=0;maxInv=0;nOver=0;maxTime=0;
for k=0:N
    t=t0+k*sc.dt;
    try
        a=v23HLC(x,t,sc,H,mhat);
        if any(~isfinite(a.raw(:)))||~isreal(a.raw)
            stop='ERROR_SOURCE_HLC_NONFINITE';break;
        end
        un=min(hi,max(lo,a.raw(:)));
        if isempty(prevU),prevU=un;end
        % Same measured R1 boundary for all 3 modes; no safety loosening.
        enforce=~strcmp(mode,'NOMINAL') && ~release && t>=2.125-1e-9;
        tl=lo(1);th=hi(1);reason='R1_DISABLED';
        if enforce
            [tl,th,rr]=v75R1Interval(x,s,sc.obstacles,t);
            reason=rr.reason;
            if ~strcmp(reason,'OK')
                stop=['R1_STOP_' reason];break;
            end
            if tl>th+1e-9
                stop='R1_STOP_EMPTY_THRUST_INTERVAL';break;
            end
        end
        if strcmp(mode,'A_CLIPPED_HLC_R1') || strcmp(mode,'NOMINAL')|| ...
                strcmp(mode,'RELEASE_A_CLIPPED')
            u=un;diag=v78BlankDiag('SOURCE_CLIPPED');
            if enforce,u(1)=min(th,max(tl,u(1)));end
        else
            [u,diag]=v78Select(x,t,sc,H,sest,a,un,prevU,lo,hi,tl,th,mode,enforce);
        end
        checkpoints(end+1)=struct('time',t,'x',x,'prevU',prevU); %#ok<AGROW>
        if startsWith(diag.status,'ERROR_')
            stop=diag.status;break;
        end
        if any(~isfinite(u))||any(u<lo-1e-8)||any(u>hi+1e-8)
            stop='ERROR_DECISION_OUTSIDE_BOX';break;
        end
        if enforce && (u(1)<tl-1e-7||u(1)>th+1e-7)
            stop='ERROR_R1_HARD_CONSTRAINT_BROKEN';break;
        end
        tenTrue=v23Tension(x,s,u(1));tenEst=v23Tension(x,sest,u(1));
        if t>=2.125-1e-9 || release
            [r1,~]=v75R1Residual(x,s,sc.obstacles,u(1));
        else
            r1=NaN;
        end
        nR1=nR1+double(isfinite(r1)&&r1< -1e-7);
        if isfinite(r1),minR1=min(minR1,r1);end
        if ~(isfinite(tenTrue)&&tenTrue>0)
            nTen=nTen+1;stop='PHYSICAL_TRUE_TENSION_NONPOSITIVE';break;
        end
        if ~isfinite(tenEst) || tenEst<=0
            nTen=nTen+1;stop='PHYSICAL_ESTIMATED_TENSION_NONPOSITIVE';break;
        end
        vc=v78InverseAudit(x,t,sc,H,sest,a,u,un);
        nInv=nInv+double(~vc.valid);
        if vc.valid,maxInv=max(maxInv,abs(vc.inverseResidual));end
        if ~vc.valid && t>=2.125-1e-9 && ...
                ~any(strcmp(mode,{'NOMINAL','A_CLIPPED_HLC_R1',...
                'RELEASE_A_CLIPPED'}))
            stop=['ERROR_INVERSE_' vc.reason];break;
        end
        nNonlinear=nNonlinear+double(diag.linearizationError>0.20);
        maxTime=max(maxTime,diag.elapsed_s);
        nOver=nOver+double(diag.elapsed_s>sc.dt);
        f=struct('mode',mode,'time_s',t,'optimizerStatus',diag.status,...
            'originalR1HardEnabled',enforce,'originalR1Reason',reason,...
            'physicalHold_s',sc.dt,'referenceModified',false,...
            'sourceHLCModified',false,'fixedThrustFloorAdded',false,...
            'sourceRawThrust_N',a.thrust,...
            'sourceRawTorqueInf_Nm',norm(a.tau,Inf),...
            'sourceBetaSigmaMin',a.sigmaMin,...
            'sourceRawWithinPhysicalBox',all(a.raw>=lo & a.raw<=hi),...
            'clippedNominalThrust_N',un(1),...
            'appliedThrust_N',u(1),...
            'appliedTorqueX_Nm',u(2),'appliedTorqueY_Nm',u(3),...
            'appliedTorqueZ_Nm',u(4),...
            'appliedTorqueInf_Nm',norm(u(2:4),Inf),...
            'minSampleR1Residual',r1,...
            'trueCableTension_N',tenTrue,...
            'estimatedCableTension_N',tenEst,...
            'sampledCableGeometryH',v23CableSafety(x,sc),...
            'loadZ_m',x(10),'loadVz_mps',x(13),...
            'refZ_m',a.refPos(3),'refVz_mps',a.refVel(3),...
            'sourceRawThrustNumerator',a.thrustNumerator,...
            'sourceRawThrustDenominator',a.thrustDenominator,...
            'trackCostPhysicalModel',diag.trackCost,...
            'trackErrorInf',diag.trackErrorInf,...
            'inputTrustWeight',diag.nominalTrustWeight,...
            'optimizerElapsed_s',diag.elapsed_s,...
            'linearizationErrorRelative',diag.linearizationError,...
            'selectedPhysicalInverseValid',vc.valid,...
            'selectedInverseResidual',vc.inverseResidual,...
            'selectedPhysicalJetValue',vc.jetValue0,...
            'selectedPhysicalVsMismatchInf',vc.vsMismatch,...
            'intersampleSafetyNotCertified',true,...
            'fullFourInputCBFNotImplemented',true);
        if isempty(rows),rows=f;else,rows(end+1)=f;end %#ok<AGROW>
        last=t;minRaw=min(minRaw,a.thrust);
        maxRawTau=max(maxRawTau,norm(a.tau,Inf));
        minTrueTen=min(minTrueTen,tenTrue);
        minEstTen=min(minEstTen,tenEst);
        maxTau=max(maxTau,norm(u(2:4),Inf));
        if k<N
            x=CBF_V19_OriginalPlantStep(x,u,s,sc.dt,4);
            if any(~isfinite(x))||~isreal(x)
                stop='ERROR_PLANT_NONFINITE';break;
            end
            prevU=u;
        end
    catch ME
        stop=['ERROR_' ME.identifier];
        fprintf('[CBF V78] %s at %.3f: %s\n',stop,t,ME.message);
        break;
    end
end
st=v78BlankSummary(mode,t0,tend,stop);
st.lastTime_s=last;st.nSamples=numel(rows);
st.nR1Violations=nR1;st.nTensionNonpositive=nTen;
st.nInverseFailures=nInv;st.nNonlinearMismatch=nNonlinear;
st.minSourceRawThrust_N=v75FiniteOrNaN(minRaw);
st.maxSourceRawTorqueInf_Nm=maxRawTau;
st.minTrueTension_N=v75FiniteOrNaN(minTrueTen);
st.minEstimatedTension_N=v75FiniteOrNaN(minEstTen);
st.minR1Residual=v75FiniteOrNaN(minR1);
st.maxAppliedTauInf_Nm=maxTau;
st.maxInverseIdentityResidual=maxInv;
st.nOver25ms=nOver;st.maxDecisionTime_s=maxTime;
st.modelEstimatedMass_kg=mhat;st.plantTrueMass_kg=s.physical.massLoad;
end

function d=v78BlankDiag(status)
d=struct('status',status,'elapsed_s',0,'trackCost',NaN,...
    'trackErrorInf',NaN,'nominalTrustWeight',NaN,'linearizationError',NaN);
end

function [u,d]=v78Select(x,t,sc,H,sest,a,uNom,uPrev,lo,hi,tl,th,mode,enforce)
d=v78BlankDiag('OK');t0=tic;
u=uNom(:);
if t<2.125-1e-9 && ~startsWith(mode,'RELEASE_')
    d.status='PRE_R1_ORIGINAL_HLC';return;
end
% State-dependent taut-cable constraint based on the ESTIMATED model.
% This is not a fixed thrust floor, and its small tolerance is numerical.
[tlCable,thCable,ok]=v78TensionBounds(x,sest,lo(1),hi(1));
if ~ok
    d.status='ERROR_NO_TENSION_FEASIBLE_INPUT';d.elapsed_s=toc(t0);return;
end
bl=lo;bu=hi;bl(1)=max(bl(1),tlCable);bu(1)=min(bu(1),thCable);
if any(bl>bu+1e-10)
    d.status='ERROR_ESTIMATED_TENSION_INTERVAL_EMPTY';d.elapsed_s=toc(t0);return;
end
if strcmp(mode,'C_JOINT_TRACK_R1') && enforce
    bl(1)=max(bl(1),tl);bu(1)=min(bu(1),th);
    if any(bl>bu+1e-10)
        d.status='ERROR_JOINT_R1_TENSION_INFEASIBLE';d.elapsed_s=toc(t0);return;
    end
end
% Single local, normalized, model-based physical-output mapping.
% Desired vertical acceleration uses v1(0) ONLY; desired horizontal/yaw
% high derivatives use SOURCE Vs and are explicitly NOT assumed exact jets.
% No impossible raw physical torque is used directly in the objective.
anchor=min(bu,max(bl,uPrev(:)));
try
    y0=v78PhysicalOutput(x,anchor,sest,sc,t,H,a);
    desired=[a.vfRaw(1);a.vsRaw(:)];
    assert(numel(desired)==4&&all(isfinite(desired)),...
        'CBF:V78DesiredOutputInvalid');
    scale=max([ones(4,1),abs(desired(:)),abs(y0(:))],[],2);
    B=zeros(4,4);span=hi-lo;
    for j=1:4
        h=0.02*span(j);
        probe=anchor;
        if anchor(j)+h<=hi(j)
            probe(j)=anchor(j)+h;
        else
            probe(j)=anchor(j)-h;
        end
        yj=v78PhysicalOutput(x,probe,sest,sc,t,H,a);
        B(:,j)=(yj-y0)/(probe(j)-anchor(j));
    end
    % Work with normalized physical inputs z=(u-lo)./(hi-lo).
    An=diag(1./scale)*B*diag(span);
    e0=(y0-desired(:))./scale;
    zAnchor=(anchor-lo)./span;
    zPrev=(uPrev(:)-lo)./span;
    zNom=(uNom(:)-lo)./span;
    zLow=(bl-lo)./span;zHigh=(bu-lo)./span;
    % Downweight original HLC input when it is unphysical; track its
    % OUTPUT PURPOSE rather than blindly approaching the saturation face.
    rawBox=all(isfinite(a.raw))&&all(a.raw>=lo)&&all(a.raw<=hi);
    trust=0.04*double(rawBox);
    d.nominalTrustWeight=trust;
    wTrack=[1;0.35;0.35;0.2];
    C=diag(sqrt(wTrack))*An;
    rhs=diag(sqrt(wTrack))*(e0-An*zAnchor);
    wPrev=0.035;
    % 1/2*z'Q*z + p'z, exact box-constrained convex surrogate.
    Q=C'*C+(wPrev+trust+1e-7)*eye(4);
    p=C'*rhs-wPrev*zPrev-trust*zNom;
    z=v78BoxCoordinateQP(Q,p,zLow,zHigh,zAnchor);
    u=lo+span.*z;
    if strcmp(mode,'B_TRACK_THEN_R1') && enforce
        % Deliberately sequential: physical tracking first, then R1.
        u(1)=min(th,max(tl,u(1)));
        d.status='PHYSICAL_TRACK_THEN_R1_PROJECTION';
    elseif strcmp(mode,'C_JOINT_TRACK_R1') && enforce
        d.status='PHYSICAL_TRACK_AND_R1_JOINT';
    else
        d.status='PHYSICAL_TRACK_WITHOUT_R1';
    end
    if any(u<lo-1e-7)||any(u>hi+1e-7)
        d.status='ERROR_INPUT_BOX';return;
    end
    yr=v78PhysicalOutput(x,u,sest,sc,t,H,a);
    residual=(yr-desired(:))./scale;
    d.trackCost=sum(wTrack.*(residual.^2));
    d.trackErrorInf=norm(residual,Inf);
    localPred=y0+B*(u-anchor);
    d.linearizationError=norm((yr-localPred)./scale,Inf);
    if ~all(isfinite([u;yr;d.trackCost;d.linearizationError]))
        d.status='ERROR_NONFINITE_OUTPUT';return;
    end
catch ME
    d.status=['ERROR_MODEL_' ME.identifier];
end
d.elapsed_s=toc(t0);
end

function z=v78BoxCoordinateQP(Q,p,l,h,z0)
% Deterministic finite-box coordinate descent; no quadprog dependency.
assert(all(isfinite([Q(:);p(:);l(:);h(:)])) && all(l<=h),...
    'CBF:V78BoxQPBounds');
z=max(l,min(h,z0));
for pass=1:64
    old=z;
    for j=1:4
        % Exact minimizer of one coordinate holding the other three.
        val=-(p(j)+Q(j,:)*z-Q(j,j)*z(j))/Q(j,j);
        z(j)=min(h(j),max(l(j),val));
    end
    if norm(z-old,Inf)<1e-10,break;end
end
end

function y=v78PhysicalOutput(x,u,sest,sc,t,H,a)
[jr,~,vs]=v74RealJet(x,u(:),sest,sc,t,H.F1,a.XD);
y=[jr(1);vs(:)];
assert(all(isfinite(y))&&isreal(y),'CBF:V78ModelOutputNonfinite');
end

function [tl,th,ok]=v78TensionBounds(x,s,tl,th)
% True tension(x,T) is affine in T for fixed x. Use *estimated* s for
% control; no true simulator mass is passed into this decision function.
% The 1e-8 N margin is a numerical strictness tolerance, NOT a 6N floor.
tol=1e-8;ta=v23Tension(x,s,tl);tb=v23Tension(x,s,th);
ok=isfinite(ta)&&isfinite(tb);
if ~ok,return;end
if ta>=tol && tb>=tol,return;end
if ta<tol && tb<tol
    if abs(tb-ta)<1e-14,ok=false;return;end
end
slope=(tb-ta)/(th-tl);
if abs(slope)<1e-14
    ok=(min(ta,tb)>=tol);return;
end
bound=tl+(tol-ta)/slope;
if slope>0,tl=max(tl,bound);else,th=min(th,bound);end
ok=tl<=th+1e-9;
end

function v=v78SafeR1(x,s,obs,T)
try
    [v,~]=v75R1Residual(x,s,obs,T);
catch
    v=NaN;
end
end

function r=v78InverseAudit(x,t,sc,H,sest,a,u,uNom)
r=struct('valid',true,'reason','SKIPPED_BEFORE_INTERVENTION',...
    'inverseResidual',NaN,'jetValue0',NaN,'vsMismatch',NaN);
if t<2.125-1e-9,return;end
q=v75Candidate(x,t,sc,H,sest,a,u,uNom);
r.valid=q.valid;r.reason=q.reason;
r.inverseResidual=q.inverseResidual;
r.vsMismatch=q.sourceVsMismatchInf;
if q.valid
    [jj,~,~]=v74RealJet(x,u,sest,sc,t,H.F1,a.XD);
    r.jetValue0=jj(1);
end
end

function s=v78Theory()
s=sprintf([...
'V78 PHYSICAL TRACKING REFERENCE AND JOINT SAFETY COMPARISON\n'...
'Only test_CBF_HLC_RootCause.m is overwritten. Original reference, gains,\n'...
'25ms ZOH and true simulator R193 plant unchanged. No nominal thrust floor.\n'...
'NOMINAL: old HLC saturated inputs, without obstacle safety.\n'...
'A: old HLC saturated input as the CBFilter objective with original R1\n'...
'   hard thrust interval. This is the untouched safety baseline.\n'...
'B: solve a physical MODEL OUTPUT tracking objective over physical box\n'...
'   and estimated taut-cable constraint; then project thrust onto R1.\n'...
'C: solve SAME tracking objective in the R1/box/estimated cable-tension\n'...
'   intersection simultaneously. The R1 used is still THRUST ONLY.\n'...
'Physical output target is SOURCE v1(0) and SOURCE Vs(3). Source Vs is\n'...
'NOT assumed to be a genuine continuous-time HLC jet; V67 found that\n'...
'Vfd higher slots are discrete predicted values rather than derivatives.\n'...
'Physical candidate output uses model-conditional 25ms ZOH R193 Lie jets:\n'...
'v_real(0) and load x/y sixth and yaw second output (V74). Target\n'...
'mismatch is normalized, finite and input-domain bounded. High-order\n'...
'inverse identity is verified with v75Candidate after input selection.\n'...
'Output mapping is locally linearized via 4 finite physical input probes;\n'...
'boxed convex surrogate solved by coordinate-descent. This is NOT a\n'...
'globally optimal nonlinear optimizer; local linearization error recorded.\n'...
'No dependency on actual future or unknowable inputs; same current x\n'...
'and internally maintained prior applied u. Controller uses estimated\n'...
'mass 0.01kg default, TRUE plant uses physical mass from source.\n'...
'Cable tension constraint is derived from current estimated plant, NOT\n'...
'an arbitrary 6N/7N nominal thrust minimum. Strictly >0 is only a\n'...
'current-sample tautness check; sample-to-sample and intersample\n'...
'positivity or viability are NOT certified.\n'...
'Safety: original thrust-only R1 present in A and C during normal\n'...
'CBF operation, B applies it sequentially. All can fail when original\n'...
'R1 interval is empty; stop rather than claim safe. No ground/drone/\n'...
'cable full 4-input HOCBF provided. No backup controller certified.\n'...
'Release tests disable R1 deliberately, MUST be labeled unsafe and\n'...
'R1 violations remain recorded. A/B/C release compare response only.\n'...
'All nominal raw torque values only diagnostic: no 135Nm value enters\n'...
'quadratic objective directly; raw clip pull weight=0 if raw box invalid.\n'...
'Nonlinear exact inverse and actual candidate force bounds audited.\n'...
'Hard 25ms decision-time diagnostic (elapsed>25ms) recorded; fail\n'...
'real-time feasibility if observed.\n'...
'No MATLAB run available in construction environment.\n']);
end

function v78WriteHandover(path)
v77WriteHandover(path);
fid=fopen(path,'a');
if fid<0,error('CBF:V78HandoverWrite');end
cc=onCleanup(@()fclose(fid)); %#ok<NASGU>
fwrite(fid,sprintf('\n\n=== V77 MEASURED OUTCOME, 2026-11-18 ===\n%s\n',...
    ['All existing thrust-only R1-based V77 modes became infeasible '...
     'around t=2.350s. Tested local raw-thrust return condition at '...
     't=2.150s implied T<=11.162N while original R1 needed T>=12.172N. '...
     'These conditions are not jointly satisfiable under chosen local guard. '...
     'Do not claim general 4-input infeasibility; estimated mass .01kg '...
     'differs from true mass .14kg. Strong guard exceeded 25ms.']), 'char');
fwrite(fid,sprintf('\n=== V77 FULL MEASURED REVIEW AS RETAINED ===\n%s\n', ...
    v78V77MeasuredReview()),'char');
fwrite(fid,sprintf('\n=== V78 METHOD, STATUS, AND NEXT STEPS ===\n%s',v78Theory()),'char');
end

function result=v78FailureArtifact(ME)
root=fileparts(mfilename('fullpath'));
outdir=fullfile(root,'_CBF_TEST_OUTPUT');
if exist(outdir,'dir')~=7,mkdir(outdir);end
work=tempname;mkdir(work);cleanup=onCleanup(@()v69Cleanup(work)); %#ok<NASGU>
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V78_RUNTIME_ERROR.txt'),...
    getReport(ME,'extended','hyperlinks','off'));
v78WriteHandover(fullfile(work,'V78_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt'));
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V78_THEORY_LIMITS_AND_RUN.txt'),v78Theory());
path=fullfile(outdir,['CBF_HLC_TRACK_V78_ERROR_'...
    datestr(now,'yyyymmdd_HHMMSS_FFF') '.zip']);
zip(path,{'V78_RUNTIME_ERROR.txt','V78_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt',...
    'V78_THEORY_LIMITS_AND_RUN.txt'},work);
result=struct('status',['INCOMPLETE_V78_RUNTIME_' ME.identifier],...
    'zipPath',path,'nCases',0,'nRuntimeErrors',1,'nFailedCases',1,...
    'referenceModified',false,'nominalThrustFloorAdded',false);
end

function s=v78V77MeasuredReview()
