s=[...
    '# V77 Results Review — 2026-11-18' newline '' newline '## Source and scope' newline '- Original user-provided result ZIP: `CBF_HLC_RETURN_V77_20261118_152824_973.zip`' newline '- Source rows: `V77_ZOH_RETURN_GUARD_SUMMAR' ...
    'Y.csv` (10 cases), `V77_ZOH_RETURN_GUARD_TRACE.csv` (627 rows), `V77_MATCHED_R1_RETURN_GUARD.csv` (21 rows); `V77_THEORY_LIMITS_AND_TEST.txt`.' newline '- R193 original trajectory, LQR/HLC g' ...
    'ains and source controller unchanged. Physical box T in [0,20] N and each torque in [-1,1] Nm, 25-ms zero-order hold. No lower thrust floor, no trajectory modifications.' newline '- Tested o' ...
    'nly original thrust-only R1 current-sample obstacle condition and soft first-order raw-HLC-command box-return conditions. Not a 4-input HOCBF or a guaranteed viable return set.' newline '' newline '##' ...
    ' Definitive main outcome' newline '- R1_BASE, R1_GUARD_T, R1_GUARD_4D_TBOUND, R1_GUARD_4D, R1_GUARD_4D_STRONG **all stopped with `R1_STOP_INFEASIBLE_SHARED_THRUST`** after t=2.325 s (request' ...
    ' at t=2.350 s infeasible). None solved the sustained intervention problem.' newline '- The return guard is *soft* and frequently unsatisfied, even when R1 current-sample constraint remains s' ...
    'atisfied.' newline '- NORMAL HLC t=2.4 s is not a safe collision avoidance alternative: 11 sampled R1 violations reported, and no intersample safety certificate.' newline '' newline '## Main comparison (source ' ...
    'raw commands; NOT applied torque)' newline '' newline '| Mode | min raw HLC T (N) | max raw HLC |tau|_inf (Nm) | R1 end | Max decision time (s) |' newline '|---|---:|---:|---|---:|' newline '| NOMINAL | 7.57332 | 0.00200' ...
    '222 | HORIZON_REACHED | 0.0260776 |' newline '| R1_BASE | -2.72272 | 135.229 | R1_STOP_INFEASIBLE_SHARED_THRUST | 0.0113623 |' newline '| R1_GUARD_T | -3.3791 | 10333.5 | R1_STOP_INFEASIBLE_SHARED_THR' ...
    'UST | 0.0158877 |' newline '| R1_GUARD_4D_TBOUND | -2.72272 | 135.229 | R1_STOP_INFEASIBLE_SHARED_THRUST | 0.0111473 |' newline '| R1_GUARD_4D | -3.89465 | 1646.24 | R1_STOP_INFEASIBLE_SHARED_THRUST |' ...
    ' 0.0099018 |' newline '| R1_GUARD_4D_STRONG | -3.93232 | 1231.59 | R1_STOP_INFEASIBLE_SHARED_THRUST | 0.542508 |' newline '' newline 'Some strong-guard computation took 0.543 s, exceeding original 25-ms control' ...
    ' period. Other cases did not have a reported >25-ms case on this run, but no hard real-time guarantee is established.' newline '' newline '## Local incompatibility at first R1 intervention (estimated-' ...
    'model only)' newline 'At t=2.150 s, same state:' newline '- Raw source HLC thrust 8.867666 N.' newline '- Original R1 requires actual thrust at least 12.172245 N.' newline '- Estimated plant/source Lie derivative if appl' ...
    'ying original raw HLC thrust: -31.717079 N/s.' newline '- Estimated Lie derivative if applying original R1 thrust: -113.773808 N/s.' newline '- Affine derivative slope d(dot T_source)/dT_app = -24.831' ...
    '223 [N/s per N]; source raw torque does not have first-order instantaneous authority over source raw thrust Lie derivative under the model.' newline '- Tested lower source raw thrust box-fac' ...
    'e local guard: `dot(T_source) + (0.25/0.025) T_source >= 0`, so `kappa=10 s^-1`.' newline '- For the same state and tested guard, this implies `T_app <= 11.161535 N`, while R1 requires `T_ap' ...
    'p >= 12.172245 N`; the intervals do not intersect. This demonstrates conflict of *these particular local constraints*, NOT general impossibility of 4-input safe control.' newline '' newline '## Critic' ...
    'al model mismatch caution' newline 'V77 computes raw source-command Lie derivatives with `sest.physical.massLoad = mhat=0.01 kg` by default. Actual R193 simulator plant uses 0.14 kg (as docu' ...
    'mented in preceding results). Thus analytic-vs-difference checks validate internal derivative computation under *estimated* dynamics, not its agreement with the true closed loop.' newline '-' ...
    ' For NOMINAL flight, t=2.125 to 2.150 s, raw source thrust changes from 8.866646 N to 8.867666 N (a 25-ms average rate 0.040798 N/s), while estimated instantaneous local Lie deriva' ...
    'tive is -31.713802 N/s at t=2.125. Their difference is large. They are instantaneous-vs-interval values, not directly equal, but must be reconciled with true model and reference de' ...
    'rivatives before certification. Do not take guard''s estimated viability as factual flight viability.' newline '' newline '## Release-to-HLC diagnostic (obstacle R1 disabled for BOTH release modes!)' newline '' newline '|' ...
    ' Start | Method | Min cable tension N | Min sampled geometry H | Min R1 residual | Number of R1 violations | Number of RAW HLC box-violation samples |' newline '|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|' ...
    '---:|' newline '| 2.275 | RELEASE_TO_HLC | 0.442582 | 0.21254 | -1.71755 | 15 | 1 |' newline '| 2.275 | RELEASE_GUARD_4D | 0.859152 | 0.200736 | -2.40433 | 15 | 1 |' newline '| 2.300 | RELEASE_TO_HLC | 0.064752' ...
    '8 | 0.167734 | -2.67643 | 15 | 2 |' newline '| 2.300 | RELEASE_GUARD_4D | 0.710023 | 0.0864348 | -10.4873 | 15 | 12 |' newline '' newline 'At 2.300-s release, the guard increased minimum tension from 0.064753 N' ...
    ' (direct HLC) to 0.710023 N, but sampled R1 residual worsened from -2.676 to -10.487 and source raw HLC input box violations increased from 2 to 12. This is **not safe recovery**. ' ...
    'Both release branches deliberately disabled the obstacle R1 constraint, so a 0.35-s release test cannot establish safe post-CBF recovery.' newline '' newline '## Methodological cautions' newline '- `maxModelInv' ...
    'erseResidual` around 1e-12 indicates model-internal inverse identity, NOT feasible tracking nor physically safe CBF.' newline '- `nReturnGatePass` in source increments a test against `G*uNom' ...
    '+q` (the nominal clipped command), not necessarily the *selected* physical candidate; do not use it as certification of applied-input satisfaction. `guardSoftConstraintMaxViolation' ...
    '` and `status` are more informative.' newline '- Status `CURRENT_RETURN_LIE_GUARD_MET` can report success of only selected rows (e.g. thrust-box faces), not all eight raw-HLC box faces.' newline '- `n' ...
    'R1Violations=0` means the current sampled R1 scalar is maintained until stopping; intersample, tension, drone/ground/cable, model-robust safety are unproven.' newline '- First-order local gu' ...
    'ard is not a future recovery guarantee; once source raw HLC commands leave the physical input box, usual interior forward-invariance reasoning is not applicable.' newline '' newline '## Next actions (' ...
    'do not overclaim)' newline '1. First verify first-Lie raw thrust derivative against actual closed-loop 25ms measurements under both *estimated* and *true* mass; record drift and sensitivity.' ...
    ' Preserve original estimated state/parameter availability; do not sneak true unknown mass into operational controller.' newline '2. Derive the conflict boundary of sampled obstacle constrain' ...
    't and return condition *before* intervention; current R1 at t=2.150 is already too demanding for the tested first-order raw-thrust guard.' newline '3. Test a higher-relative-order physically' ...
    ' meaningful recovery/viability condition based on actual 19-state cable/drone/ground safety and the full 4 physical inputs, rather than only a local derivative of raw HLC command. ' ...
    'Do not impose arbitrary nominal thrust minimum or modify original trajectory, gains, 25ms ZOH.' newline '4. Keep obstacle and recovery safety hard only once joint feasibility is evidenced; i' ...
    'f no feasible solution, report it and do not label a soft optimization output as safe.' newline '5. Inspect and/or correct `nReturnGatePass` diagnostic semantics in test code on a later auth' ...
    'orized iteration; original controller source untouched.' newline '' newline '**Bottom line:** V77 provides a useful explicit demonstration of conflict between the existing thrust-only R1 correction an' ...
    'd the chosen first-order return guard. It does *not* solve raw thrust collapse, torque blow-up, nor safe release. Strong-guard computational overhead can violate the control period' ...
    '.' newline '' ...
    ];
end


% ========================================================================
% V79: FOUR-PHYSICAL-INPUT / THREE-DIMENSIONAL CORRECTION-INFLUENCE AUDIT.
% Method locked to source-confirmed V70/V72/V74 19-state ZOH Taylor jets.
% No trajectory modification; no HLC/gain edit; no thrust floor; no
% trajectory prediction to choose an input; no new CBF policy applied.
% h0..h4 are EXACT MODEL-CONDITIONAL right-sided derivatives for the
% CURRENT single 25ms ZOH input, not two-sided sample-boundary jets.
% Formal (D+lambda)^4 h is diagnostics, NOT HOCBF certification.
% ========================================================================
function result=v79FourInput3DInfluence(opts)
if exist('test_CBF_SetupPaths','file')==2,test_CBF_SetupPaths();end
required={'CBF_V19_Scenarios','CBF_V19_OriginalPlantStep', ...
    'CBF_V18_R1_RectifiedCable','lqrd'};
for k=1:numel(required)
    if exist(required{k},'file')==0
        error('CBF:V79MissingDependency','Original R193 file missing: %s',required{k});
    end
end
if exist('HLC_SUSPENDED_LOAD','class')~=8
    error('CBF:V79MissingHLC','Original HLC class unavailable');
end
sc=CBF_V19_Scenarios('straight_single','R193');sc.dt=.025;
s=sc.settings;H=v23MakeHLC(s,sc.dt);
mhat=.01;if isfield(opts,'v79MassEstimate'),mhat=double(opts.v79MassEstimate);end
assert(isscalar(mhat)&&isfinite(mhat)&&mhat>0,'CBF:V79Mass');
sest=s;sest.physical.massLoad=mhat;
lo=[s.input.thrustMin;s.input.torqueMin(:)];
hi=[s.input.thrustMax;s.input.torqueMax(:)];
assert(numel(lo)==4&&all(hi>lo),'CBF:V79Bounds');
lambda=2.0; % 1/s; DIAGNOSTIC differential polynomial, not CBF gain proof.
if isfield(opts,'v79Lambda'),lambda=double(opts.v79Lambda);end
assert(isscalar(lambda)&&isfinite(lambda)&&lambda>0,'CBF:V79Lambda');
checkTimes=[2.125,2.150,2.225,2.275,2.300,2.325];
if isfield(opts,'v79CheckTimes'),checkTimes=double(opts.v79CheckTimes(:).');end
assert(~isempty(checkTimes)&&all(isfinite(checkTimes))&&all(checkTimes>=0)...
    &&all(checkTimes<=2.325)&&all(abs(checkTimes/sc.dt-round(checkTimes/sc.dt))<1e-8),...
    'CBF:V79TimeGrid');
scales=[.8,1,1.2];
if isfield(opts,'v79ObstacleAxisScales')
    scales=double(opts.v79ObstacleAxisScales(:).');
end
assert(all(isfinite(scales))&&all(scales>0)&&numel(scales)<=5,...
    'CBF:V79ObstacleScales');
rows=struct([]);cases=struct([]);sens=struct([]);
for im=1:2
    if im==1,mode='NOMINAL';else,mode='ORIGINAL_R1';end
    x=sc.x0(:);stop='HORIZON_REACHED';nCP=0;
    for n=0:round(max(checkTimes)/sc.dt)
        t=n*sc.dt;
        a=v23HLC(x,t,sc,H,mhat);
        if any(~isfinite(a.raw(:)))
            stop='SOURCE_NONFINITE';break;
        end
        u=min(hi,max(lo,a.raw(:)));
        tl=lo(1);th=hi(1);r1reason='DISABLED';
        if im==2&&t>=2.125-1e-9
            [tl,th,ri]=v75R1Interval(x,s,sc.obstacles,t);
            r1reason=ri.reason;
            if ~strcmp(r1reason,'OK')||tl>th+1e-10
                stop=['R1_' r1reason];break;
            end
            u(1)=min(th,max(tl,u(1)));
        end
        if any(abs(checkTimes-t)<1e-8)
            nCP=nCP+1;
            [one,oneSens]=v79OneState(x,t,u,a,mode,sc,s,sest,lo,hi,tl,th,...
                lambda,scales,r1reason);
            if isempty(rows),rows=one;else,rows=[rows one];end %#ok<AGROW>
            if isempty(sens),sens=oneSens;else,sens=[sens oneSens];end %#ok<AGROW>
        end
        if n<round(max(checkTimes)/sc.dt)
            x=CBF_V19_OriginalPlantStep(x,u,s,sc.dt,4);
            if any(~isfinite(x)),stop='PLANT_NONFINITE';break;end
        end
    end
    one=struct('mode',mode,'stopReason',stop,'nCheckpoints',nCP,...
        'lastTime_s',t,'original25msZOH',true,...
        'sourceHLCUnmodified',true,'referenceUnmodified',true,...
        'fixedMinimumThrustAdded',false,'fourInputCBFCertified',false);
    if isempty(cases),cases=one;else,cases(end+1)=one;end %#ok<AGROW>
end
if isempty(rows)||isempty(sens),error('CBF:V79EmptyAudit','No diagnostic rows');end
root=fileparts(mfilename('fullpath'));outdir=fullfile(root,'_CBF_TEST_OUTPUT');
if exist(outdir,'dir')~=7,mkdir(outdir);end
work=tempname;mkdir(work);cleanup=onCleanup(@()v69Cleanup(work)); %#ok<NASGU>
writetable(struct2table(rows),fullfile(work,'V79_3D_BARRIER_ZOH_JETS.csv'));
writetable(struct2table(sens),fullfile(work,'V79_3D_FOUR_INPUT_AUTHORITY.csv'));
writetable(struct2table(cases),fullfile(work,'V79_SOURCE_FLIGHT_STATUS.csv'));
v79WriteHandover(fullfile(work,'V79_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt'));
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V79_CONFIRMED_HIGH_ORDER_METHOD_AND_LIMITS.md'),...
    v79Theory());
files={'V79_3D_BARRIER_ZOH_JETS.csv','V79_3D_FOUR_INPUT_AUTHORITY.csv',...
    'V79_SOURCE_FLIGHT_STATUS.csv','V79_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt',...
    'V79_CONFIRMED_HIGH_ORDER_METHOD_AND_LIMITS.md'};
zipPath=fullfile(outdir,['CBF_HLC_3D_INFLUENCE_V79_'...
    datestr(now,'yyyymmdd_HHMMSS_FFF') '.zip']);
zip(zipPath,files,work);
assert(exist(zipPath,'file')==2,'CBF:V79ZIPMissing');
nFailed=sum(~strcmp({cases.stopReason},'HORIZON_REACHED'));
result=struct('status','V79_3D_MODEL_CONDITIONAL_SHADOW_ONLY_NOT_CBF',...
    'zipPath',zipPath,'nCases',numel(cases),'nRuntimeErrors',0,...
    'nFailedCases',nFailed,'n3DJetRows',numel(rows),...
    'nAuthorityRows',numel(sens),'referenceModified',false,...
    'HLCSourceModified',false,'fourInputCBFCertified',false);
end

function [rows,sensitivity]=v79OneState(x,t,uR1,a,mode,sc,s,sest,lo,hi,...
    tl,th,lambda,scales,r1reason)
% Samples SAME x, t, original 3-D obstacle. Estimate and true mass
% evaluated separately: true mass is NEVER fed into decision making.
uBase=uR1(:); un=min(hi,max(lo,a.raw(:)));
choices={'APPLIED_BASE','CLIPPED_HLC','R1_T_LO','R1_T_HI',...
    'TORQUE_X_NEG','TORQUE_X_POS','TORQUE_Y_NEG','TORQUE_Y_POS',...
    'TORQUE_Z_NEG','TORQUE_Z_POS'};
U=repmat(uBase,1,numel(choices));U(:,2)=un;
U(1,3)=max(tl,lo(1));U(1,4)=min(th,hi(1));
for j=2:4
    U(j,5+2*(j-2))=lo(j);
    U(j,6+2*(j-2))=hi(j);
end
rows=struct([]);sensitivity=struct([]);
for model=1:2
    if model==1,ss=sest;which='ESTIMATED_CONTROLLER_MODEL';
    else,ss=s;which='TRUE_PLANT_MODEL_SHADOW_ONLY';end
    for scale=scales
        for c=1:numel(choices)
            % Size variants use the SAME BASE command only: avoid a huge
            % redundant offline sweep; full four-axis effects at scale=1.
            if abs(scale-1)>1e-12 && c>1,continue;end
            u=U(:,c);tic;
            [jets,names]=v79GeometryJets(x,u,ss,sc,scale);
            elapsed=toc;
            for ib=1:numel(names)
                v=jets(ib,:);psi=v79FormalPsi(v,lambda);
                one=struct('mode',mode,'time_s',t,...
                    'modelProvenance',which,'obstacleAxesScale',scale,...
                    'candidate',choices{c},'barrier',names{ib},...
                    'h0',v(1),'h1',v(2),'h2',v(3),'h3',v(4),...
                    'h4',v(5),'formalPsi1',psi(2),'formalPsi2',psi(3),...
                    'formalPsi3',psi(4),'formalPsi4',psi(5),...
                    'appliedThrust_N',u(1),'torqueX_Nm',u(2),...
                    'torqueY_Nm',u(3),'torqueZ_Nm',u(4),...
                    'deltaThrustFromBase_N',u(1)-uBase(1),...
                    'deltaTorqueInfFromBase_Nm',norm(u(2:4)-uBase(2:4),Inf),...
                    'sourceRawThrust_N',a.thrust,...
                    'sourceRawTorqueInf_Nm',norm(a.tau,Inf),...
                    'nominalR1Reason',r1reason,...
                    'originalR1IntervalLower_N',tl,...
                    'originalR1IntervalUpper_N',th,...
                    'originalR1ConstraintForUnscaledGeometryOnly',true,...
                    'estimatedOrTrueTension_N',v23Tension(x,ss,u(1)),...
                    'localJetElapsed_s',elapsed,'fourInputCBFCertified',false,...
                    'intersampleSafetyCertified',false);
                if isempty(rows),rows=one;else,rows(end+1)=one;end %#ok<AGROW>
            end
            if abs(scale-1)<1e-12
                % Finite differences at the SAME state use ordinary model-
                % conditional right jets, never fictitious u-derivatives.
                u0=uBase;[g0,barriers]=v79GeometryJets(x,u0,ss,sc,scale);
                for j=1:4
                    du=1e-3*(hi(j)-lo(j));
                    up=u0;um=u0;
                    up(j)=min(hi(j),up(j)+du);
                    um(j)=max(lo(j),um(j)-du);
                    if up(j)<=um(j)+1e-12,continue;end
                    gp=v79GeometryJets(x,up,ss,sc,scale);
                    gm=v79GeometryJets(x,um,ss,sc,scale);
                    deriv=(gp-gm)/(up(j)-um(j));
                    % h0 and h1 must not depend on current input.
                    if max(abs(deriv(:,1:2)),[],'all')>1e-6
                        error('CBF:V79JetInputOrder','h0/h1 depend on u at fixed state');
                    end
                    for ib=1:numel(barriers)
                        d=deriv(ib,:);
                        rec=struct('mode',mode,'time_s',t,...
                            'modelProvenance',which,'obstacleAxesScale',scale,...
                            'barrier',barriers{ib},'inputAxis',j,...
                            'inputName',v79InputName(j),...
                            'atBaseThrust_N',u0(1),...
                            'atBaseTorqueInf_Nm',norm(u0(2:4),Inf),...
                            'dH0dU',d(1),'dH1dU',d(2),'dH2dU',d(3),...
                            'dH3dU',d(4),'dH4dU',d(5),...
                            'absD4',abs(d(5)),...
                            'oneSidedZOHRightJet',true,...
                            'certifiedInputRelativeDegree',false);
                        if isempty(sensitivity),sensitivity=rec;
                        else,sensitivity(end+1)=rec;end %#ok<AGROW>
                    end
                end
            end
        end
    end
end
end

function name=v79InputName(j)
n={'THRUST','TORQUE_X','TORQUE_Y','TORQUE_Z'};
name=n{j};
end

function [h,labels]=v79GeometryJets(x,u,s,sc,axisScale)
% 0..4 continuous derivatives on the CURRENT ZOH open interval.
% Normalize neither time nor input to hide high derivatives.
N=5;X=zeros(19,N);X(:,1)=x(:);
U=zeros(4,N);U(:,1)=u(:);
for k=0:N-2
    DX=v70JetRHS(X,U,s);
    X(:,k+2)=DX(:,k+1)/(k+1);
end
L=s.physical.cableLength;rc=s.shape.cableRadius;
dm=s.cbf.safetyMargin;eps2=s.cbf.smoothEpsilon^2;
pL=X(8:10,:);q=X(14:16,:);pD=pL-L*q;
pC=pL-(L/2)*q;
a=L/2+rc;b=sqrt(a*rc);
h=zeros(3*numel(sc.obstacles)+2,N);labels=cell(size(h,1),1);
idx=0;
for i=1:numel(sc.obstacles)
    o=sc.obstacles{i};d=-pC;d(:,1)=o.center(:)-pC(:,1);
    r2=v70Dot(d,d);dq=v70Dot(d,q);
    supportCable=v79SqrtJet(b*b*r2+(a*a-b*b)*v70Mul(dq,dq)+...
        [eps2 zeros(1,N-1)]);
    v=o.R.'*d;scaleAxes=axisScale*o.axes(:);
    supportObstacle=v79SqrtJet(v70Dot(scaleAxes.*v,scaleAxes.*v)+...
        [eps2 zeros(1,N-1)]);
    margin=dm*v79SqrtJet(r2+[eps2 zeros(1,N-1)]);
    cjet=r2-supportCable-supportObstacle-margin;
    idx=idx+1;h(idx,:)=cjet.*factorial(0:N-1);
    labels{idx}=sprintf('CABLE_OBS_%d',i);
    for k=1:2
        if k==1,p=pD;r=s.shape.droneRadius;component='DRONE';
        else,p=pL;r=s.shape.loadRadius;component='LOAD';end
        z=p;z(:,1)=p(:,1)-o.center(:);
        % Conservative circumscribed sphere around obstacle ellipsoid:
        % squared-distance h (h>=0 implies clearance for this body).
        radius=max(scaleAxes)+r+dm;
        bj=v70Dot(z,z);bj(1)=bj(1)-radius^2;
        idx=idx+1;h(idx,:)=bj.*factorial(0:N-1);
        labels{idx}=sprintf('%s_OBS_%d',component,i);
    end
end
idx=idx+1;h(idx,:)=pD(3,:).*factorial(0:N-1);
h(idx,1)=h(idx,1)-s.shape.droneRadius-dm;
labels{idx}='DRONE_GROUND';
idx=idx+1;h(idx,:)=pL(3,:).*factorial(0:N-1);
h(idx,1)=h(idx,1)-s.shape.loadRadius-dm;
labels{idx}='LOAD_GROUND';
assert(all(isfinite(h(:)))&&isreal(h),'CBF:V79NonfiniteGeometryJet');
end

function s=v79SqrtJet(v)
% Taylor coefficients, NOT derivative values. sqrt at positive c0.
N=numel(v);s=zeros(1,N);
assert(v(1)>0 && all(isfinite(v)),'CBF:V79SqrtDomain');
s(1)=sqrt(v(1));
for k=2:N
    sumOther=0;
    for j=2:k-1
        sumOther=sumOther+s(j)*s(k-j+1);
    end
    s(k)=(v(k)-sumOther)/(2*s(1));
end
end

function psi=v79FormalPsi(h,lam)
psi=zeros(1,5);
for j=0:4
    for k=0:j
        psi(j+1)=psi(j+1)+nchoosek(j,k)*lam^(j-k)*h(k+1);
    end
end
end

function chapter=v79Theory()
chapter=[...
'# V79 high-order derivative method: VERIFIED METHOD vs UNPROVEN CBF' newline ...
'R193 19 state x = [q(4), body omega(3), load p(3), load v(3), cable pT(3), cable omega(3)].' newline ...
'Physical u = [T; tauX; tauY; tauZ]. Original input box [0,20] N and +/-1 Nm.' newline ...
'EXACT SIGNAL LAW ON EACH CURRENT HOLD: u(t) = u_k for t in [t_k,t_k+0.025); u^(j)=0 (j>=1) INSIDE this interval only. This is NOT an assumption about future control samples.' newline ...
'Use Taylor coefficients X(:,1)=x, U(:,1)=u, U(:,2:end)=0; recursively:' newline ...
'  D=v70JetRHS(X,U,s); X(:,k+2)=D(:,k+1)/(k+1), k=0..N-2.' newline ...
'  Physical d^k x/dt^k = factorial(k)*X(:,k+1) from the RIGHT of update.' newline ...
'Multiplication of coefficients is convolution; square root s0=sqrt(c0),' newline ...
'  sn=(cn-sum_{i=1}^{n-1} si*s(n-i))/(2*s0), n>=1.' newline ...
'At an update the LEFT and RIGHT derivatives use SAME x but different u_(k-1),u_k;' newline ...
'  J0 continuous; J1(right)-J1(left) = -F12*pTz*(pT.b3)*(Tnew-Told)/(m+mL).' newline ...
'V72 real MATLAB data: max model source24 RHS error 5.329e-15; J1 jump' newline ...
'  identity max R1 error 8.527e-14; local 1ms Taylor/RK4 ~1e-13.' newline ...
'V74 real MATLAB data: model-internal inverse identity residual R1 <=2.728e-12' newline ...
'  ONLY when realized horizontal-sixth and yaw-second outputs are also supplied.' newline ...
'Vfd original upper 6 items are F1*Ad^k*e, discrete NOMINAL SEQUENCE,' newline ...
'  NOT genuine continuous physical derivatives; do not substitute jets blindly.' newline ...
'V74 nominal v1 realized 0..4 for inverse; J_REAL[5] is UNAVAILABLE' newline ...
'  without reference seventh derivative; v1 feedback right jet J_FB 0..5' newline ...
'  CAN be computed with reference 0..6.' newline ...
'All equalities are based on estimated R193 model with mLhat=.01kg;' newline ...
'  true simulated mL=.14kg, and true outputs are SHADOW ONLY.' newline ...
'3-D cable-ellipsoid h: d = obs.center - (pL-L*pT/2); a=L/2+rc;' newline ...
'  b=sqrt(a*rc); sC=sqrt(b^2*d.d+(a^2-b^2)*(d.pT)^2+eps^2);' newline ...
'  sO=sqrt(sum((axes.*Rtrans*d)^2)+eps^2);' newline ...
'  h=d.d-sC-sO-margin*sqrt(d.d+eps^2).' newline ...
'Additional drone/load conservative sphere h=||p-bodycenter||^2-(r+maxaxes+margin)^2;' newline ...
'  ground h=body.z-bodyradius-margin. Geometric sufficiency only.' newline ...
'For every SAME measured state and CHOSEN current 4 input, generate h0..h4' newline ...
'  by Taylor algebra (no future unknown input, no precomputed trajectory).' newline ...
'  Test how all 4 physical inputs change h2, h3, h4; vary obstacle axes' newline ...
'  .8/1/1.2 for SHADOW geometry only (R1 interval stays for ORIGINAL geometry).' newline ...
'Formal (D+lambda)^4 h and lower (D+lambda)^j h are diagnostic ONLY:' newline ...
'  lower auxiliaries can depend on current held input; sample-boundary' newline ...
'  derivatives jump; ordinary continuous affine HOCBF theorem not yet applied.' newline ...
'This V79 does NOT implement new safety filtering, nor certify 25ms' newline ...
'  intersample invariance, recurrent feasibility, tension, or HLC recovery.' newline ...
'R1 trace is SOURCE unchanged. Source-HLC, gains, original reference fixed.' newline ...
'No fixed minimum nominal thrust, no new trajectory governor, no MPC.' newline ...
'Next: check per-geometry mixed relative order and rank; derive genuine' newline ...
'  4-input safe constraint and its lower-order admissible sets; account' newline ...
'  for thrust-induced HLC raw drop without forbidding thrust corrections.' newline ...
];
end

function v79WriteHandover(path)
v78WriteHandover(path);
fid=fopen(path,'a');
if fid<0,error('CBF:V79HandoverWrite');end
cleanup=onCleanup(@()fclose(fid)); %#ok<NASGU>
fwrite(fid,sprintf('\n\n=== V78 ACTUAL MEASURED OUTCOME ===\n%s\n',...
 ['User-run V78: A original R1 reached t2.325 then infeasible at 2.350;'...
  ' B and C halted at t2.325 on model inverse-degeneracy audit (NOT proven'...
  ' physically singular). At t2.300 B rawT=.910N/tau25.67Nm;'...
  ' C rawT=.835N/tau30.96Nm. Same-state 2.300 R1 thrust13.50173N,'...
  ' next rawT B=-2.72195N, C=-2.72272N. Thus no safe recovery.'...
  ' B/C source Vs target remains original HLC mixed derivative semantics;'...
  ' C objective relative tracking improvement does not fix 3D CBF.']), 'char');
fwrite(fid,sprintf('\n\n=== V79 CONFIRMED DERIVATIVE METHOD, NEW SHADOW ===\n%s',...
    v79Theory()),'char');
end

function result=v79FailureArtifact(ME)
root=fileparts(mfilename('fullpath'));outdir=fullfile(root,'_CBF_TEST_OUTPUT');
if exist(outdir,'dir')~=7,mkdir(outdir);end
work=tempname;mkdir(work);cleanup=onCleanup(@()v69Cleanup(work)); %#ok<NASGU>
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V79_RUNTIME_ERROR.txt'),...
    getReport(ME,'extended','hyperlinks','off'));
v79WriteHandover(fullfile(work,'V79_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt'));
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V79_CONFIRMED_HIGH_ORDER_METHOD_AND_LIMITS.md'),v79Theory());
zipPath=fullfile(outdir,['CBF_HLC_3D_INFLUENCE_V79_ERROR_'...
    datestr(now,'yyyymmdd_HHMMSS_FFF') '.zip']);
zip(zipPath,{'V79_RUNTIME_ERROR.txt','V79_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt',...
    'V79_CONFIRMED_HIGH_ORDER_METHOD_AND_LIMITS.md'},work);
result=struct('status',['INCOMPLETE_V79_RUNTIME_' ME.identifier],...
    'zipPath',zipPath,'nCases',0,'nRuntimeErrors',1,'nFailedCases',1);
end
% ========================================================================
% V80 — NEXT SAMPLE ONLY 25-ms reference-response experiment.
% This is not reference preplanning, not a new obstacle CBF, and not a
% proof of a 6-smooth globally switched reference. Original source remains.
% ========================================================================
function result=v80NextSampleReferenceExperiment(opts)
if exist('test_CBF_SetupPaths','file')==2,test_CBF_SetupPaths();end
req={'CBF_V19_Scenarios','CBF_V19_OriginalPlantStep',...
    'CBF_V18_R1_RectifiedCable','lqrd'};
for j=1:numel(req)
    if exist(req{j},'file')==0
        error('CBF:V80Dependency','Missing source dependency %s',req{j});
    end
end
if exist('HLC_SUSPENDED_LOAD','class')~=8
    error('CBF:V80MissingHLC','Original HLC class is unavailable');
end
sc=CBF_V19_Scenarios('straight_single','R193');sc.dt=.025;
s=sc.settings;H=v23MakeHLC(s,sc.dt);
mhat=.01;
if isfield(opts,'v80MassEstimate'),mhat=double(opts.v80MassEstimate);end
assert(isscalar(mhat)&&isfinite(mhat)&&mhat>0,'CBF:V80Mass');
sest=s;sest.physical.massLoad=mhat;
lo=[s.input.thrustMin;s.input.torqueMin(:)];
hi=[s.input.thrustMax;s.input.torqueMax(:)];
checkTimes=[2.125 2.150 2.225 2.275 2.300 2.325];
if isfield(opts,'v80CheckTimes'),checkTimes=double(opts.v80CheckTimes(:).');end
assert(all(isfinite(checkTimes))&&~isempty(checkTimes)&&...
    all(checkTimes>=0)&&all(checkTimes<=2.325)&&...
    all(abs(checkTimes/sc.dt-round(checkTimes/sc.dt))<1e-8),...
    'CBF:V80CheckTimes');
tend=2.650;
if isfield(opts,'v80EndTime'),tend=double(opts.v80EndTime);end
assert(isscalar(tend)&&isfinite(tend)&&tend>=max(checkTimes)+sc.dt...
    &&tend<=5&&abs(tend/sc.dt-round(tend/sc.dt))<1e-8,...
    'CBF:V80EndTime');
modes={'NOMINAL','ORIGINAL_R1','NEXT_PV_FULL','NEXT_PV_HALF',...
    'NEXT_JET6_FULL'};
% Independent mathematical Hermite boundary precheck.  It does NOT
% establish physical feasibility of the very high intersample derivatives.
probe=zeros(28,1);probe(3)=.001;probe(7)=.1;
[~,~,~,bridgeResidual]=v80C6ConnectorAudit(probe,sc.dt);
assert(isfinite(bridgeResidual)&&bridgeResidual<1e-7,...
    'CBF:V80C6EndpointIdentity');

traces=struct([]);summary=struct([]);shadow=struct([]);
for m=1:numel(modes)
    mode=modes{m};x=sc.x0(:);corr=zeros(28,1);
    stopReason='HORIZON_REACHED';lastTime=NaN;nSamples=0;
    minRawT=Inf;maxRawTau=0;minTension=Inf;minH=Inf;
    minR1=Inf;maxCost=0;nOver25=0;maxRef6=0;nR1Viol=0;
    for n=0:round(tend/sc.dt)
        t=n*sc.dt;
        tStart=tic;
        try
            a=v80HLCNext(x,t,sc,H,mhat,corr);
            if any(~isfinite(a.raw(:)))||~isreal(a.raw)
                stopReason='NONFINITE_HLC_RAW';break;
            end
            uNom=min(hi,max(lo,a.raw(:)));
            u=uNom;tl=lo(1);th=hi(1);reason='NO_R1';
            useR1=~strcmp(mode,'NOMINAL')&&t>=2.125-1e-9;
            if useR1
                [tl,th,rr]=v75R1Interval(x,s,sc.obstacles,t);
                reason=rr.reason;
                if ~strcmp(reason,'OK')||tl>th+1e-9
                    stopReason=['R1_STOP_' reason];break;
                end
                u(1)=min(th,max(tl,u(1)));
            end
            if any(~isfinite(u))||any(u<lo-1e-9)||any(u>hi+1e-9)
                stopReason='ACTUATION_BOX_FAIL';break;
            end
            tt=v23Tension(x,s,u(1));
            [geomMin,geomName]=v80StateGeometryMinimum(x,sc);
            if useR1,[r1,~]=v75R1Residual(x,s,sc.obstacles,u(1));
            else,r1=NaN;end
            if ~isfinite(tt)||tt<=0
                stopReason='TRUE_CABLE_TENSION_NONPOSITIVE';break;
            end
            if ~isfinite(geomMin)
                stopReason='GEOMETRY_NONFINITE';break;
            end
            % The current reference is already fixed when u is computed.
            % Only the NEXT sample receives a correction from this u.
            nextCorr=zeros(28,1);predDiff=zeros(19,1);
            predictedDelta=zeros(28,1);sixthNorm=0;
            predTime=0;predErr=NaN;bridgeD2=NaN;bridgeD4=NaN;
            bridgeD6=NaN;connectorCheck=NaN;
            xTrueNext=[];
            if n<round(tend/sc.dt)
                predStart=tic;
                [predDiff,predictedDelta]=v80PredictedCorrection(x,uNom,u,sest,sc.dt);
                predTime=toc(predStart);
                % Only a NEXT-TIMESTAMP target change.  No change to
                % the ORIGINAL target r_d(t), and no change at time t_k.
                if strcmp(mode,'NEXT_PV_FULL')
                    nextCorr=v80KeepPV(predictedDelta,1);
                elseif strcmp(mode,'NEXT_PV_HALF')
                    nextCorr=v80KeepPV(predictedDelta,0.5);
                elseif strcmp(mode,'NEXT_JET6_FULL')
                    nextCorr=predictedDelta;
                end
                xTrueNext=CBF_V19_OriginalPlantStep(x,u,s,sc.dt,4);
                if any(~isfinite(xTrueNext))||~isreal(xTrueNext)
                    stopReason='TRUE_PLANT_NONFINITE';break;
                end
                % Counterfactual true plant is SHADOW only, never used to
                % generate the actual reference correction (estimated model
                % only is used by v80PredictedCorrection).
                xTrueNom=CBF_V19_OriginalPlantStep(x,uNom,s,sc.dt,4);
                trueDiff=xTrueNext-xTrueNom;
                predErr=norm(predDiff([8:13])-trueDiff([8:13]));
                if any(abs(checkTimes-t)<1e-8)&&strcmp(mode,'ORIGINAL_R1')
                    try
                        [bridgeD2,bridgeD4,bridgeD6,connectorCheck]=...
                            v80C6ConnectorAudit(v80KeepPV(predictedDelta,1),sc.dt);
                    catch MEconn
                        bridgeD2=NaN;bridgeD4=NaN;bridgeD6=NaN;
                        fprintf('[V80 C6 audit] t=%.3f %s\n',t,MEconn.message);
                    end
                    [original,baseStatus]=v80TryShadowHLC(xTrueNext,...
                        t+sc.dt,sc,H,mhat,zeros(28,1));
                    [pv,pvStatus]=v80TryShadowHLC(xTrueNext,...
                        t+sc.dt,sc,H,mhat,v80KeepPV(predictedDelta,1));
                    [pvHalf,halfStatus]=v80TryShadowHLC(xTrueNext,...
                        t+sc.dt,sc,H,mhat,v80KeepPV(predictedDelta,.5));
                    [full,fullStatus]=v80TryShadowHLC(xTrueNext,...
                        t+sc.dt,sc,H,mhat,predictedDelta);
                    cc={original,pv,pvHalf,full};
                    statuses={baseStatus,pvStatus,halfStatus,fullStatus};
                    names={'ORIGINAL_NEXT','NEXT_PV_FULL','NEXT_PV_HALF','NEXT_JET6_FULL'};
                    for jj=1:numel(cc)
                        an=cc{jj};
                        z=struct('correctionFromTime_s',t,'targetEvaluationTime_s',t+sc.dt,...
                            'candidate',names{jj},'candidateStatus',statuses{jj},...
                            'baselineFlight','ORIGINAL_R1',...
                            'sameTRUEstateUsed',true,'controllerModelMass_kg',mhat,...
                            'truePlantMass_kg',s.physical.massLoad,...
                            'currentR1AppliedThrust_N',u(1),...
                            'currentClippedHLCThrust_N',uNom(1),...
                            'currentCBFThrustDelta_N',u(1)-uNom(1),...
                            'estimatedNextDeltaLoadZ_m',predDiff(10),...
                            'estimatedNextDeltaLoadVz_mps',predDiff(13),...
                            'estimatedNextDelta3DPos_m',norm(predDiff(8:10)),...
                            'estimatedNextDelta3DVel_mps',norm(predDiff(11:13)),...
                            'estimatedVsTrueDeltaPVError',predErr,...
                            'localTargetDeltaZ_m',an.refPos(3)-original.refPos(3),...
                            'localTargetDeltaVz_mps',an.refVel(3)-original.refVel(3),...
                            'localJetD2Inf',max(abs(predictedDelta([9 10 11]))),...
                            'localJetD4Inf',max(abs(predictedDelta([17 18 19]))),...
                            'localJetD6Inf',max(abs(predictedDelta([25 26 27]))),...
                            'nextRawThrust_N',an.thrust,...
                            'nextRawTorqueInf_Nm',norm(an.tau,Inf),...
                            'nextBetaSigmaMin',an.sigmaMin,...
                            'nextSourceHighDerivativeNorm',an.refDerivNorm,...
                            'C6BridgeMaxD2',bridgeD2,'C6BridgeMaxD4',bridgeD4,...
                            'C6BridgeMaxD6',bridgeD6,...
                            'C6BridgeBoundaryResidual',connectorCheck,...
                            'localJetOnlyNotGlobalC6',true,...
                            'referenceEditAppliedAtCurrentTime',false,...
                            'CBFSafetyNotCertified',true);
                        if isempty(shadow),shadow=z;else,shadow(end+1)=z;end %#ok<AGROW>
                    end
                end
            end
            sixthNorm=max(abs(corr([25 26 27])));
            elapsed=toc(tStart);
            row=struct('mode',mode,'time_s',t,...
                'targetWasUpdatedOnlyFromPreviousStep',norm(corr)>0,...
                'localTargetPVCorrection3D_m',norm(corr([1 2 3])),...
                'localTargetVelCorrection3D_mps',norm(corr([5 6 7])),...
                'localTargetD6CorrectionInf',sixthNorm,...
                'sourceRawThrust_N',a.thrust,...
                'sourceRawTorqueInf_Nm',norm(a.tau,Inf),...
                'sourceBetaSigmaMin',a.sigmaMin,...
                'referenceLoadZ_m',a.refPos(3),...
                'referenceLoadVz_mps',a.refVel(3),...
                'actualLoadZ_m',x(10),'actualLoadVz_mps',x(13),...
                'appliedThrust_N',u(1),'appliedTorqueInf_Nm',norm(u(2:4),Inf),...
                'CBFDeltaThrust_N',u(1)-uNom(1),...
                'R1Enabled',useR1,'R1Reason',reason,...
                'R1Lower_N',tl,'R1Upper_N',th,'R1Residual',r1,...
                'trueTension_N',tt,'minGeometricH',geomMin,...
                'minGeometryName',geomName,...
                'estimatedVsTrueOneStepDeltaPVError',predErr,...
                'estimatedOneStepPredictionElapsed_s',predTime,...
                'fullDecisionDiagnosticElapsed_s',elapsed,...
                'decisionOver25ms',elapsed>sc.dt,...
                'originalReferenceSourceUnmodified',true,...
                'onlyNextSampleJetModified',true,...
                'intervalC6ContinuityNotAssumed',true,...
                'fourInput3DCBFCertified',false);
            if isempty(traces),traces=row;else,traces(end+1)=row;end %#ok<AGROW>
            nSamples=nSamples+1;lastTime=t;
            minRawT=min(minRawT,a.thrust);
            maxRawTau=max(maxRawTau,norm(a.tau,Inf));
            minTension=min(minTension,tt);minH=min(minH,geomMin);
            if isfinite(r1)
                minR1=min(minR1,r1);nR1Viol=nR1Viol+double(r1< -1e-7);
            end
            maxCost=max(maxCost,elapsed);nOver25=nOver25+double(elapsed>sc.dt);
            maxRef6=max(maxRef6,sixthNorm);
            if n<round(tend/sc.dt)
                x=xTrueNext;
                corr=nextCorr; % applied ONLY on next HLC call at t_(k+1)
            end
        catch ME
            stopReason=['ERROR_' ME.identifier];
            fprintf('[CBF V80] %s t=%.3f: %s\n',mode,t,ME.message);
            break;
        end
    end
    one=struct('mode',mode,'stopReason',stopReason,'lastTime_s',lastTime,...
        'nSamples',nSamples,'minRawThrust_N',v75FiniteOrNaN(minRawT),...
        'maxRawTorqueInf_Nm',maxRawTau,...
        'minTrueTension_N',v75FiniteOrNaN(minTension),...
        'minSampleGeometricH',v75FiniteOrNaN(minH),...
        'minR1Residual',v75FiniteOrNaN(minR1),...
        'nR1SampleViolations',nR1Viol,...
        'maxDecisionDiagnosticTime_s',maxCost,'nOver25ms',nOver25,...
        'maxReferenceD6Correction',maxRef6,...
        'trueMassUsedOnlyForPlantAndAudit',true,...
        'originalReferenceAndHLCSourceUnmodified',true,...
        'onlyNextTimeTargetModified',true,...
        'fixedMinimumThrustAdded',false,...
        'CBF4DAndIntersampleSafetyNotCertified',true);
    if isempty(summary),summary=one;else,summary(end+1)=one;end %#ok<AGROW>
end
if isempty(traces)||isempty(shadow)
    error('CBF:V80NoData','V80 produced no trace or original-R1 matched state comparison');
end
root=fileparts(mfilename('fullpath'));
outdir=fullfile(root,'_CBF_TEST_OUTPUT');
if exist(outdir,'dir')~=7,mkdir(outdir);end
work=tempname;mkdir(work);clean=onCleanup(@()v69Cleanup(work)); %#ok<NASGU>
writetable(struct2table(traces),fullfile(work,'V80_NEXT_SAMPLE_CLOSED_LOOP_TRACE.csv'));
writetable(struct2table(summary),fullfile(work,'V80_POLICY_SUMMARY.csv'));
writetable(struct2table(shadow),fullfile(work,'V80_SAME_STATE_NEXT_HLC_COMPARISON.csv'));
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V80_THEORY_AND_EXECUTION.md'),v80Theory());
v80WriteHandover(fullfile(work,'V80_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt'));
files={'V80_NEXT_SAMPLE_CLOSED_LOOP_TRACE.csv','V80_POLICY_SUMMARY.csv',...
    'V80_SAME_STATE_NEXT_HLC_COMPARISON.csv','V80_THEORY_AND_EXECUTION.md',...
    'V80_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt'};
zipPath=fullfile(outdir,['CBF_HLC_NEXT_TARGET_V80_'...
    datestr(now,'yyyymmdd_HHMMSS_FFF') '.zip']);
zip(zipPath,files,work);
assert(exist(zipPath,'file')==2,'CBF:V80ZipMissing');
result=struct('status','V80_NEXT_SAMPLE_REFERENCE_TEST_NOT_SAFETY_CERTIFIED',...
    'zipPath',zipPath,'nCases',numel(summary),'nRuntimeErrors',...
    sum(startsWith({summary.stopReason},'ERROR_')),...
    'nFailedCases',sum(~strcmp({summary.stopReason},'HORIZON_REACHED')),...
    'nTraceRows',numel(traces),'nMatchedRows',numel(shadow),...
    'referenceSourceModified',false,'HLCSourceModified',false,...
    'nextSampleTargetOnly',true,'physicalZOH_s',sc.dt);
end

function a=v80HLCNext(x,t,sc,H,mhat,corr)
% Replace only the instantaneous 28-value reference JET at exactly this
% *control update*.  Original source trajectory stays untouched.  The jet
% defines a right-local 6-degree polynomial, NOT a C6 junction from prior
% update.  sc.ref and sc.refFull MUST agree at the evaluation instant.
assert(numel(corr)==28&&all(isfinite(corr)),'CBF:V80CorrectionFinite');
if ~any(corr)
    a=v23HLC(x,t,sc,H,mhat);return;
end
sg=sc;
sg.refFull=@(tt)v80FullJetAt(sc,tt,t,corr);
sg.ref=@(tt,j)v80ThreeJetAt(sc,tt,j,t,corr);
a=v23HLC(x,t,sg,H,mhat);
end

function [a,status]=v80TryShadowHLC(x,t,sc,H,mhat,correction)
try
    a=v80HLCNext(x,t,sc,H,mhat,correction);
    if ~all(isfinite(a.raw(:))) || ~isreal(a.raw)
        status='NONFINITE';
    else
        status='OK';
    end
catch ME
    status=['ERROR_' ME.identifier];
    a=struct('thrust',NaN,'tau',[NaN;NaN;NaN],...
        'sigmaMin',NaN,'refPos',[NaN;NaN;NaN],...
        'refVel',[NaN;NaN;NaN],'refDerivNorm',NaN);
end
end

function jet=v80OriginalJet(sc,t)
if isfield(sc,'refFull')&&isa(sc.refFull,'function_handle')
    jet=double(sc.refFull(t));jet=jet(:);
else
    jet=zeros(28,1);
    for j=0:6
        r=sc.ref(t,j);jet((1:3)+4*j)=r(:);
    end
end
assert(numel(jet)==28&&all(isfinite(jet)),'CBF:V80OriginalRef28');
end

function jet=v80FullJetAt(sc,t,updateTime,corr)
jet=v80OriginalJet(sc,t);
if abs(t-updateTime)<1e-10,jet=jet+corr(:);end
jet=jet(:).';
end

function r=v80ThreeJetAt(sc,t,j,updateTime,corr)
r=sc.ref(t,j);r=r(:);
if abs(t-updateTime)<1e-10 && j>=0 && j<=6
    r=r+corr((1:3)+4*j);
end
end

function c=v80KeepPV(v,factor)
c=zeros(28,1);
c([1 2 3 5 6 7])=factor*v([1 2 3 5 6 7]);
end

function [deltaState,deltaJet]=v80PredictedCorrection(x,uNom,uActual,sest,dt)
% CAUSAL: compare same measured state under two known input commands for
% the CURRENT, already selected hold.  This is NOT multi-step prediction;
% no future command and no future true mass is used to set a reference.
xc=v70Step(x,uActual,sest,dt,4);
xn=v70Step(x,uNom,sest,dt,4);
deltaState=xc(:)-xn(:);
deltaJet=zeros(28,1);
% The next-target PV part uses only the already predicted 25-ms response.
deltaJet([1 2 3])=deltaState(8:10);
deltaJet([5 6 7])=deltaState(11:13);
% Alternative diagnostic ONLY: high derivatives from LEFT ZOH jets of
% the just-ended hold, at the two predicted end states.  At the next hold,
% the control will be recomputed, so this is a reference construction,
% NOT a claim of actual future physical derivatives.
if norm(uActual-uNom)>0
    jc=v80PhysicalLoadJet(xc,uActual,sest,6);
    jn=v80PhysicalLoadJet(xn,uNom,sest,6);
    for j=2:6
        deltaJet((1:3)+4*j)=jc(:,j+1)-jn(:,j+1);
    end
end
assert(all(isfinite(deltaJet)),'CBF:V80NonfinitePredictedJet');
end

function out=v80PhysicalLoadJet(x,u,s,order)
N=order+1;X=zeros(19,N);X(:,1)=x(:);
U=zeros(4,N);U(:,1)=u(:);
for j=0:order-1
    D=v70JetRHS(X,U,s);
    X(:,j+2)=D(:,j+1)/(j+1);
end
out=zeros(3,N);
for j=0:order,out(:,j+1)=X(8:10,j+1)*factorial(j);end
end

function [maxD2,maxD4,maxD6,residual]=v80C6ConnectorAudit(corr,dt)
% For THEORETICAL junction C6 on [t_k,t_k+dt], solve 13th-degree Hermite
% polynomial with zero correction jets 0..6 at the start, and the next
% PV offset with 2..6 derivatives zero at the end.  This audit is NEVER
% supplied as a control reference.  It shows the hidden INTERSAMPLE cost.
A=zeros(7,7);
for j=0:6
    for i=1:7
        m=i+6;fac=1;
        for p=0:j-1,fac=fac*(m-p);end
        A(j+1,i)=fac;
    end
end
wanted=zeros(7,3);
for j=0:6
    wanted(j+1,:)=corr((1:3)+4*j).'*(dt^j);
end
coef=A\wanted;
residual=norm(A*coef-wanted,'fro')/(1+norm(wanted,'fro'));
assert(all(isfinite(coef(:)))&&isfinite(residual),...
    'CBF:V80C6BridgeFinite');
maxDer=zeros(7,1);
for ss=linspace(0,1,41)
    for j=0:6
        vv=zeros(1,3);
        for i=1:7
            m=i+6;factor=1;
            for kk=0:j-1,factor=factor*(m-kk);end
            vv=vv+factor*ss^(m-j)*coef(i,:)/(dt^j);
        end
        maxDer(j+1)=max(maxDer(j+1),max(abs(vv)));
    end
end
maxD2=maxDer(3);maxD4=maxDer(5);maxD6=maxDer(7);
end

function [minimum,name]=v80StateGeometryMinimum(x,sc)
% Sampled finite geometric monitor, not an interval CBF proof.
s=sc.settings;dm=s.cbf.safetyMargin;L=s.physical.cableLength;
pD=x(8:10)-L*x(14:16);pL=x(8:10);
minimum=v23CableSafety(x,sc);name='CABLE_OBSTACLE';
for j=1:numel(sc.obstacles)
    obs=sc.obstacles{j};center=obs.center(:);
    for which=1:2
        if which==1,body=pD;radius=s.shape.droneRadius;label='DRONE_OBS';
        else,body=pL;radius=s.shape.loadRadius;label='LOAD_OBS';end
        v=norm(body-center)^2-(max(obs.axes(:))+radius+dm)^2;
        if v<minimum,minimum=v;name=sprintf('%s_%d',label,j);end
    end
end
v=pD(3)-s.shape.droneRadius-dm;
if v<minimum,minimum=v;name='DRONE_GROUND';end
v=pL(3)-s.shape.loadRadius-dm;
if v<minimum,minimum=v;name='LOAD_GROUND';end
end

function report=v80Theory()
report=[...
'# V80: CBF correction affects NEXT 25ms target, NOT current target' newline ...
'Only the existing test_CBF_HLC_RootCause.m file is changed. The source HLC,' newline ...
'original 3D reference, gains, physical actuator limits and original R1 remain.' newline ...
'No prescribed minimum thrust, no obstacle direction chosen, no trajectory' newline ...
'preplanning or multiple-control-step constant-input extrapolation.' newline ...
'' newline ...
'CAUSAL TIMING: at t_k, compute HLC with target J_k already committed;' newline ...
'original R1 changes physical u_k for the HOLD [t_k,t_k+0.025).' newline ...
'From SAME measured x_k, use CONTROLLER ESTIMATED 19-state R193 model' newline ...
'(mLhat=.01kg) to integrate the known u_k and clipped nominal uNom_k,' newline ...
'ONLY for the current 25ms. Let dx=Phi(x_k,u_k)-Phi(x_k,uNom_k).' newline ...
'At t_(k+1) compute local 0..6 reference jet J_d(t_(k+1))+C_k.' newline ...
'PV: C0=dx(load position xyz), C1=dx(load velocity xyz), C2..6=0.' newline ...
'PV_HALF: 50% of the same current-interval PV correction (sensitivity).' newline ...
'JET6: C0,C1 as PV, C2..6= differences of LEFT 0..6 physical load jets' newline ...
'at the END of the just-finished known hold under its respective u.' newline ...
'JET6 is a mathematical candidate and may be physically nonsensical as a' newline ...
'new reference, because the next applied input is not yet selected.' newline ...
'ALL control references are 3D, none steer to a fixed axis; yaw untouched.' newline ...
'The initial time t_k reference is NEVER revised by the correction;' newline ...
'next-sample update is not cumulative, and original reference is preserved.' newline ...
'' newline ...
'THE SIXTH DERIVATIVE ISSUE: a 0..6 JET is locally realizable by a' newline ...
'6th degree Taylor polynomial on the RIGHT of t_(k+1). This alone' newline ...
'DOES NOT imply the total spliced reference is globally C6 in time.' newline ...
'The existing physical ZOH can jump input at update times, but that fact' newline ...
'DOES NOT make source HLC high-order reference discontinuities harmless.' newline ...
'To test global C6, construct a mathematical 13th-degree Hermite connector' newline ...
'over EXACTLY 25ms: all correction derivatives 0..6 start at zero;' newline ...
'at the end impose position/velocity deltas and correction derivatives 2..6=0.' newline ...
'The connector is NOT applied; its peak 2/4/6 derivatives inside the' newline ...
'25ms are RECORDED; enormous values can occur even when both end jets' newline ...
'look benign. Hence pointwise C6 cannot certify viable global tracking.' newline ...
'' newline ...
'FOUR-INPUT ACTUAL EFFECT: physical u_k includes thrust and all 3 torques.' newline ...
'The original R1 policy still imposes THRUST ONLY; this is NOT a new' newline ...
'four-input high-order CBF and is NOT certified safe for all obstacles.' newline ...
'Matched-state next raw HLC values are compared for original/PV/PV_HALF/JET6.' newline ...
'Closed loops are run for nominal, R1, PV full/half, and JET6 full.' newline ...
'R1 infeasible stops stay explicitly labeled, not hidden as success.' newline ...
'True plant mL=.14kg is used for flight and a SHADOW one-step difference' newline ...
'only; it NEVER generates the target correction. Logs compare the mismatch.' newline ...
'Source Vfd higher components remain original nominal discrete A_d^k e,' newline ...
'NOT physical continuous derivatives. V72/V74 exact ZOH jets retain' newline ...
'their prior verified meaning, not a proof of new reference compatibility.' newline ...
'No source changes, no globally smooth return-to-original generated here.' newline ...
'Actual MATLAB run, runtime and safe return remain unverified here.' newline ...
];
end

function v80WriteHandover(path)
v79WriteHandover(path);
fid=fopen(path,'a');
if fid<0,error('CBF:V80HandoverFile');end
cleanup=onCleanup(@()fclose(fid)); %#ok<NASGU>
fwrite(fid,sprintf('\n\n=== V79 MEASURED OUTCOME AND RESEARCH ===\n%s\n',...
 ['V79 user ZIP CBF_HLC_3D_INFLUENCE_V79_20261118_170810_341.zip:' ...
  ' source nominal and R1 each yielded 6 checks 2.125..2.325.' ...
  ' High-order 3D geometry sensitivities show thrust and torque' ...
  ' have different effective derivative orders, condition dependent.' ...
  ' R1 remains thrust-only and fails at next step near 2.350 in' ...
  ' earlier flights. Quantitative V79 audit: thrust dH2/dT approx' ...
  ' [-2.8331,+2.3994], torques X/Y no h2/h3 sensitivity but' ...
  ' up to 4th derivative X+25.8754, Y-1469.8585 in sampled' ...
  ' conditions; torque Z approx zero through h4 (sample-specific).' ...
  ' Not a high-order four-input safety certificate.']), 'char');
fwrite(fid,sprintf('\n\n=== V79 DIRECT LITERATURE MOTIVATION ===\n%s\n',...
 ['Related studies: Marchese et al., High-Order Control Barrier' ...
  ' Functions: Safety Can Lead to Instability (ECC 2025);' ...
  ' Choi et al., When Are Safety Filters Safe? On Minimum Phase' ...
  ' Conditions of Control Barrier Functions (2025);' ...
  ' Mestres et al., Control Barrier Function-Based Safety Filters:' ...
  ' Characterization of Undesired Equilibria, Unbounded Trajectories,' ...
  ' and Limit Cycles (2025). These are motivations for investigating' ...
  ' full closed loop; none proves R193 recovery.']), 'char');
fwrite(fid,sprintf('\n\n=== V80 NEXT-SAMPLE REFERENCE STUDY ===\n%s',...
    v80Theory()),'char');
end

function result=v80FailureArtifact(ME)
root=fileparts(mfilename('fullpath'));
outdir=fullfile(root,'_CBF_TEST_OUTPUT');
if exist(outdir,'dir')~=7,mkdir(outdir);end
work=tempname;mkdir(work);cleanup=onCleanup(@()v69Cleanup(work)); %#ok<NASGU>
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V80_RUNTIME_ERROR.txt'),...
    getReport(ME,'extended','hyperlinks','off'));
v80WriteHandover(fullfile(work,'V80_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt'));
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V80_THEORY_AND_EXECUTION.md'),v80Theory());
zipPath=fullfile(outdir,['CBF_HLC_NEXT_TARGET_V80_ERROR_'...
    datestr(now,'yyyymmdd_HHMMSS_FFF') '.zip']);
zip(zipPath,{'V80_RUNTIME_ERROR.txt','V80_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt',...
    'V80_THEORY_AND_EXECUTION.md'},work);
result=struct('status',['INCOMPLETE_V80_RUNTIME_' ME.identifier],...
    'zipPath',zipPath,'nCases',0,'nRuntimeErrors',1,'nFailedCases',1);
end

function result=v81CumulativeReferenceExperiment(opts)
if exist('test_CBF_SetupPaths','file')==2,test_CBF_SetupPaths();end
req={'CBF_V19_Scenarios','CBF_V19_OriginalPlantStep',...
    'CBF_V18_R1_RectifiedCable','lqrd'};
for j=1:numel(req)
    if exist(req{j},'file')==0
        error('CBF:V80Dependency','Missing source dependency %s',req{j});
    end
end
if exist('HLC_SUSPENDED_LOAD','class')~=8
    error('CBF:V80MissingHLC','Original HLC class is unavailable');
end
sc=CBF_V19_Scenarios('straight_single','R193');sc.dt=.025;
s=sc.settings;H=v23MakeHLC(s,sc.dt);
mhat=.01;
if isfield(opts,'v80MassEstimate'),mhat=double(opts.v80MassEstimate);end
assert(isscalar(mhat)&&isfinite(mhat)&&mhat>0,'CBF:V80Mass');
sest=s;sest.physical.massLoad=mhat;
lo=[s.input.thrustMin;s.input.torqueMin(:)];
hi=[s.input.thrustMax;s.input.torqueMax(:)];
checkTimes=[2.125 2.150 2.225 2.275 2.300 2.325];
if isfield(opts,'v80CheckTimes'),checkTimes=double(opts.v80CheckTimes(:).');end
assert(all(isfinite(checkTimes))&&~isempty(checkTimes)&&...
    all(checkTimes>=0)&&all(checkTimes<=2.325)&&...
    all(abs(checkTimes/sc.dt-round(checkTimes/sc.dt))<1e-8),...
    'CBF:V80CheckTimes');
tend=2.650;
if isfield(opts,'v80EndTime'),tend=double(opts.v80EndTime);end
assert(isscalar(tend)&&isfinite(tend)&&tend>=max(checkTimes)+sc.dt...
    &&tend<=5&&abs(tend/sc.dt-round(tend/sc.dt))<1e-8,...
    'CBF:V80EndTime');
modes={'NOMINAL','ORIGINAL_R1','V80_OVERWRITE','V81_CARRY',...
    'V81_CARRY_RETURN','V81_CARRY_RELEASE_2300',...
    'V81_CARRY_RETURN_RELEASE_2300'};
% Independent mathematical Hermite boundary precheck.  It does NOT
% establish physical feasibility of the very high intersample derivatives.
probe=zeros(28,1);probe(3)=.001;probe(7)=.1;
[~,~,~,bridgeResidual]=v80C6ConnectorAudit(probe,sc.dt);
assert(isfinite(bridgeResidual)&&bridgeResidual<1e-7,...
    'CBF:V80C6EndpointIdentity');

traces=struct([]);summary=struct([]);shadow=struct([]);
for m=1:numel(modes)
    mode=modes{m};x=sc.x0(:);corr=zeros(28,1);
    stopReason='HORIZON_REACHED';lastTime=NaN;nSamples=0;
    minRawT=Inf;maxRawTau=0;minTension=Inf;minH=Inf;
    minR1=Inf;maxCost=0;nOver25=0;maxRef6=0;nR1Viol=0;
    for n=0:round(tend/sc.dt)
        t=n*sc.dt;
        tStart=tic;
        try
            a=v80HLCNext(x,t,sc,H,mhat,corr);
            if any(~isfinite(a.raw(:)))||~isreal(a.raw)
                stopReason='NONFINITE_HLC_RAW';break;
            end
            uNom=min(hi,max(lo,a.raw(:)));
            u=uNom;tl=lo(1);th=hi(1);reason='NO_R1';
            useR1=~strcmp(mode,'NOMINAL')&&t>=2.125-1e-9;
            releaseMode=contains(mode,'RELEASE_2300');
            if releaseMode && t>=2.300-1e-9,useR1=false;end
            if useR1
                [tl,th,rr]=v75R1Interval(x,s,sc.obstacles,t);
                reason=rr.reason;
                if ~strcmp(reason,'OK')||tl>th+1e-9
                    stopReason=['R1_STOP_' reason];break;
                end
                u(1)=min(th,max(tl,u(1)));
            end
            if any(~isfinite(u))||any(u<lo-1e-9)||any(u>hi+1e-9)
                stopReason='ACTUATION_BOX_FAIL';break;
            end
            tt=v23Tension(x,s,u(1));
            [geomMin,geomName]=v80StateGeometryMinimum(x,sc);
            [r1,~]=v75R1Residual(x,s,sc.obstacles,u(1));
            if ~isfinite(tt)||tt<=0
                stopReason='TRUE_CABLE_TENSION_NONPOSITIVE';break;
            end
            if ~isfinite(geomMin)
                stopReason='GEOMETRY_NONFINITE';break;
            end
            % The current reference is already fixed when u is computed.
            % Only the NEXT sample receives a correction from this u.
            nextCorr=zeros(28,1);predDiff=zeros(19,1);
            predictedDelta=zeros(28,1);sixthNorm=0;
            predTime=0;predErr=NaN;bridgeD2=NaN;bridgeD4=NaN;
            bridgeD6=NaN;connectorCheck=NaN;
            xTrueNext=[];
            if n<round(tend/sc.dt)
                predStart=tic;
                [predDiff,predictedDelta]=v80PredictedCorrection(x,uNom,u,sest,sc.dt);
                predTime=toc(predStart);
                % Only a NEXT-TIMESTAMP target change.  No change to
                % the ORIGINAL target r_d(t), and no change at time t_k.
                deltaPV=v80KeepPV(predictedDelta,1);
                if strcmp(mode,'V80_OVERWRITE')
                    nextCorr=deltaPV;
                elseif startsWith(mode,'V81_CARRY')
                    nextCorr=v81CarryUpdate(corr,deltaPV,sc.dt,...
                        contains(mode,'RETURN'),norm(u-uNom,Inf)<=1e-12,2);
                end
                assert(numel(nextCorr)==28 && all(isfinite(nextCorr)),...
                    'CBF:V81CorrectionFinite');
                xTrueNext=CBF_V19_OriginalPlantStep(x,u,s,sc.dt,4);
                if any(~isfinite(xTrueNext))||~isreal(xTrueNext)
                    stopReason='TRUE_PLANT_NONFINITE';break;
                end
                % Counterfactual true plant is SHADOW only, never used to
                % generate the actual reference correction (estimated model
                % only is used by v80PredictedCorrection).
                xTrueNom=CBF_V19_OriginalPlantStep(x,uNom,s,sc.dt,4);
                trueDiff=xTrueNext-xTrueNom;
                predErr=norm(predDiff([8:13])-trueDiff([8:13]));
                if any(abs(checkTimes-t)<1e-8)&&strcmp(mode,'ORIGINAL_R1')
                    try
                        [bridgeD2,bridgeD4,bridgeD6,connectorCheck]=...
                            v80C6ConnectorAudit(v80KeepPV(predictedDelta,1),sc.dt);
                    catch MEconn
                        bridgeD2=NaN;bridgeD4=NaN;bridgeD6=NaN;
                        fprintf('[V80 C6 audit] t=%.3f %s\n',t,MEconn.message);
                    end
                    [original,baseStatus]=v80TryShadowHLC(xTrueNext,...
                        t+sc.dt,sc,H,mhat,zeros(28,1));
                    [pv,pvStatus]=v80TryShadowHLC(xTrueNext,...
                        t+sc.dt,sc,H,mhat,v80KeepPV(predictedDelta,1));
                    [pvHalf,halfStatus]=v80TryShadowHLC(xTrueNext,...
                        t+sc.dt,sc,H,mhat,v80KeepPV(predictedDelta,.5));
                    [full,fullStatus]=v80TryShadowHLC(xTrueNext,...
                        t+sc.dt,sc,H,mhat,predictedDelta);
                    cc={original,pv,pvHalf,full};
                    statuses={baseStatus,pvStatus,halfStatus,fullStatus};
                    names={'ORIGINAL_NEXT','NEXT_PV_FULL','NEXT_PV_HALF','NEXT_JET6_FULL'};
                    for jj=1:numel(cc)
                        an=cc{jj};
                        z=struct('correctionFromTime_s',t,'targetEvaluationTime_s',t+sc.dt,...
                            'candidate',names{jj},'candidateStatus',statuses{jj},...
                            'baselineFlight','ORIGINAL_R1',...
                            'sameTRUEstateUsed',true,'controllerModelMass_kg',mhat,...
                            'truePlantMass_kg',s.physical.massLoad,...
                            'currentR1AppliedThrust_N',u(1),...
                            'currentClippedHLCThrust_N',uNom(1),...
                            'currentCBFThrustDelta_N',u(1)-uNom(1),...
                            'estimatedNextDeltaLoadZ_m',predDiff(10),...
                            'estimatedNextDeltaLoadVz_mps',predDiff(13),...
                            'estimatedNextDelta3DPos_m',norm(predDiff(8:10)),...
                            'estimatedNextDelta3DVel_mps',norm(predDiff(11:13)),...
                            'estimatedVsTrueDeltaPVError',predErr,...
                            'localTargetDeltaZ_m',an.refPos(3)-original.refPos(3),...
                            'localTargetDeltaVz_mps',an.refVel(3)-original.refVel(3),...
                            'localJetD2Inf',max(abs(predictedDelta([9 10 11]))),...
                            'localJetD4Inf',max(abs(predictedDelta([17 18 19]))),...
                            'localJetD6Inf',max(abs(predictedDelta([25 26 27]))),...
                            'nextRawThrust_N',an.thrust,...
                            'nextRawTorqueInf_Nm',norm(an.tau,Inf),...
                            'nextBetaSigmaMin',an.sigmaMin,...
                            'nextSourceHighDerivativeNorm',an.refDerivNorm,...
                            'C6BridgeMaxD2',bridgeD2,'C6BridgeMaxD4',bridgeD4,...
                            'C6BridgeMaxD6',bridgeD6,...
                            'C6BridgeBoundaryResidual',connectorCheck,...
                            'localJetOnlyNotGlobalC6',true,...
                            'referenceEditAppliedAtCurrentTime',false,...
                            'CBFSafetyNotCertified',true);
                        if isempty(shadow),shadow=z;else,shadow(end+1)=z;end %#ok<AGROW>
                    end
                end
            end
            sixthNorm=max(abs(corr([25 26 27])));
            elapsed=toc(tStart);
            row=struct('mode',mode,'time_s',t,...
                'targetWasUpdatedOnlyFromPreviousStep',norm(corr)>0,...
                'localTargetPVCorrection3D_m',norm(corr([1 2 3])),...
                'localTargetVelCorrection3D_mps',norm(corr([5 6 7])),...
                'targetOffsetX_m',corr(1),'targetOffsetY_m',corr(2),'targetOffsetZ_m',corr(3),...
                'targetOffsetVx_mps',corr(5),'targetOffsetVy_mps',corr(6),'targetOffsetVz_mps',corr(7),...
                'newCorrectionPVnorm',norm(predictedDelta([1 2 3 5 6 7])),...
                'localTargetD6CorrectionInf',sixthNorm,...
                'sourceRawThrust_N',a.thrust,...
                'sourceRawTorqueInf_Nm',norm(a.tau,Inf),...
                'sourceBetaSigmaMin',a.sigmaMin,...
                'referenceLoadZ_m',a.refPos(3),...
                'referenceLoadVz_mps',a.refVel(3),...
                'actualLoadZ_m',x(10),'actualLoadVz_mps',x(13),...
                'appliedThrust_N',u(1),'appliedTorqueInf_Nm',norm(u(2:4),Inf),...
                'CBFDeltaThrust_N',u(1)-uNom(1),...
                'R1Enabled',useR1,'R1IntentionallyReleased',releaseMode && ~useR1 && t>=2.300-1e-9,...
                'R1Reason',reason,...
                'R1Lower_N',tl,'R1Upper_N',th,'R1Residual',r1,...
                'trueTension_N',tt,'minGeometricH',geomMin,...
                'minGeometryName',geomName,...
                'estimatedVsTrueOneStepDeltaPVError',predErr,...
                'estimatedOneStepPredictionElapsed_s',predTime,...
                'fullDecisionDiagnosticElapsed_s',elapsed,...
                'decisionOver25ms',elapsed>sc.dt,...
                'originalReferenceSourceUnmodified',true,...
                'onlyNextSampleJetModified',true,...
                'intervalC6ContinuityNotAssumed',true,...
                'fourInput3DCBFCertified',false);
            if isempty(traces),traces=row;else,traces(end+1)=row;end %#ok<AGROW>
            nSamples=nSamples+1;lastTime=t;
            minRawT=min(minRawT,a.thrust);
            maxRawTau=max(maxRawTau,norm(a.tau,Inf));
            minTension=min(minTension,tt);minH=min(minH,geomMin);
            if isfinite(r1)
                minR1=min(minR1,r1);nR1Viol=nR1Viol+double(r1< -1e-7);
            end
            maxCost=max(maxCost,elapsed);nOver25=nOver25+double(elapsed>sc.dt);
            maxRef6=max(maxRef6,sixthNorm);
            if n<round(tend/sc.dt)
                x=xTrueNext;
                corr=nextCorr; % applied ONLY on next HLC call at t_(k+1)
            end
        catch ME
            stopReason=['ERROR_' ME.identifier];
            fprintf('[CBF V81] %s t=%.3f: %s\n',mode,t,ME.message);
            break;
        end
    end
    one=struct('mode',mode,'stopReason',stopReason,'lastTime_s',lastTime,...
        'nSamples',nSamples,'minRawThrust_N',v75FiniteOrNaN(minRawT),...
        'maxRawTorqueInf_Nm',maxRawTau,...
        'minTrueTension_N',v75FiniteOrNaN(minTension),...
        'minSampleGeometricH',v75FiniteOrNaN(minH),...
        'minR1Residual',v75FiniteOrNaN(minR1),...
        'nR1SampleViolations',nR1Viol,...
        'maxDecisionDiagnosticTime_s',maxCost,'nOver25ms',nOver25,...
        'maxReferenceD6Correction',maxRef6,...
        'trueMassUsedOnlyForPlantAndAudit',true,...
        'originalReferenceAndHLCSourceUnmodified',true,...
        'onlyNextTimeTargetModified',true,...
        'fixedMinimumThrustAdded',false,...
        'CBF4DAndIntersampleSafetyNotCertified',true);
    if isempty(summary),summary=one;else,summary(end+1)=one;end %#ok<AGROW>
end
if isempty(traces)||isempty(shadow)
    error('CBF:V81NoData','V81 produced no trace or original-R1 matched state comparison');
end
root=fileparts(mfilename('fullpath'));
outdir=fullfile(root,'_CBF_TEST_OUTPUT');
if exist(outdir,'dir')~=7,mkdir(outdir);end
work=tempname;mkdir(work);clean=onCleanup(@()v69Cleanup(work)); %#ok<NASGU>
writetable(struct2table(traces),fullfile(work,'V81_NEXT_SAMPLE_CLOSED_LOOP_TRACE.csv'));
writetable(struct2table(summary),fullfile(work,'V81_POLICY_SUMMARY.csv'));
writetable(struct2table(shadow),fullfile(work,'V81_SAME_STATE_NEXT_HLC_COMPARISON.csv'));
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V81_EXECUTION_AND_THEORY.md'),v81Theory());
v81WriteHandover(fullfile(work,'V81_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt'));
files={'V81_NEXT_SAMPLE_CLOSED_LOOP_TRACE.csv','V81_POLICY_SUMMARY.csv',...
    'V81_SAME_STATE_NEXT_HLC_COMPARISON.csv','V81_EXECUTION_AND_THEORY.md',...
    'V81_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt'};
zipPath=fullfile(outdir,['CBF_HLC_NEXT_TARGET_CARRY_V81_'...
    datestr(now,'yyyymmdd_HHMMSS_FFF') '.zip']);
zip(zipPath,files,work);
assert(exist(zipPath,'file')==2,'CBF:V81ZipMissing');
result=struct('status','V81_CARRY_REFERENCE_TEST_NOT_SAFETY_CERTIFIED',...
    'zipPath',zipPath,'nCases',numel(summary),'nRuntimeErrors',...
    sum(startsWith({summary.stopReason},'ERROR_')),...
    'nFailedCases',sum(~strcmp({summary.stopReason},'HORIZON_REACHED')),...
    'nTraceRows',numel(traces),'nMatchedRows',numel(shadow),...
    'referenceSourceModified',false,'HLCSourceModified',false,...
    'nextSampleTargetOnly',true,'physicalZOH_s',sc.dt,...
    'releaseModesUnsafeByDesign',true);
end



function next=v81CarryUpdate(previous,newPV,dt,returnEnabled,noInputChange,omega)
% State [d,w]: d in meters, w in meters/sec. Only current selected hold.
assert(numel(previous)==28&&numel(newPV)==28,'CBF:V81JetSize');
next=zeros(28,1);
for axis=1:3
    ii=axis;jj=axis+4;
    state=[previous(ii);previous(jj)];
    if returnEnabled && noInputChange
        A=[0 1;-omega^2 -2*omega];
        state=expm(A*dt)*state;
    else
        state=[1 dt;0 1]*state;
    end
    next([ii jj])=state+newPV([ii jj]);
end
assert(all(isfinite(next)),'CBF:V81CarryNonfinite');
end

function txt=v81Theory()
txt=['V81 causal 25ms reference-carry test. ORIGINAL_R1 and V80 overwrite ' ...
    'are reference baselines. V81_CARRY uses d_next=d+dt*w+delta_p, ' ...
    'w_next=w+delta_v; V81_CARRY_RETURN applies critically damped ' ...
    'homogeneous propagation at omega=2rad/s only when R1 does not ' ...
    'modify physical input, then adds delta PV. RELEASE_2300 modes ' ...
    'intentionally DISABLE the R1 filter at/after 2.300s and are unsafe ' ...
    'diagnostics. Physical source/HLC gains/original trajectory unchanged. ' ...
    'Reference at current time not retroactively modified. Each local ' ...
    '0..6 reference jet is pointwise defined, NOT global C6. The ' ...
    'R1 remains thrust-only and does NOT certify 3D continuous safety. ' ...
    'True mass only for plant and shadow audit, estimated mass for causal ' ...
    'one-hold 19-state target difference. One future 25ms hold is NOT ' ...
    'assumed to use same input. MATLAB execution unverified.'];
end

function v81WriteHandover(path)
v80WriteHandover(path);
fid=fopen(path,'a');
if fid<0,error('CBF:V81HandoverFile');end
c=onCleanup(@()fclose(fid)); %#ok<NASGU>
fwrite(fid,sprintf('\n\n=== V81 RECOVERY AND PROTOCOL ===\n%s\n',v81Theory()),'char');
fwrite(fid,sprintf(['\nV81 rebuilt from V80 uploaded MATLAB source because uploaded V81 error ZIP did not contain a MATLAB source. ' ...
    'Invalid struct identifier 25msOriginalZOH eliminated. Please compare with any locally saved V81 original.\n']),'char');
end

function result=v81FailureArtifact(ME)
root=fileparts(mfilename('fullpath'));
outdir=fullfile(root,'_CBF_TEST_OUTPUT');
if exist(outdir,'dir')~=7,mkdir(outdir);end
work=tempname;mkdir(work);c=onCleanup(@()v69Cleanup(work)); %#ok<NASGU>
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V81_RUNTIME_ERROR.txt'),...
    getReport(ME,'extended','hyperlinks','off'));
v81WriteHandover(fullfile(work,'V81_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt'));
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V81_EXECUTION_AND_THEORY.md'),v81Theory());
zipPath=fullfile(outdir,['CBF_HLC_NEXT_TARGET_CARRY_V81_ERROR_' ...
    datestr(now,'yyyymmdd_HHMMSS_FFF') '.zip']);
zip(zipPath,{'V81_RUNTIME_ERROR.txt','V81_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt',...
    'V81_EXECUTION_AND_THEORY.md'},work);
result=struct('status',['INCOMPLETE_V81_RUNTIME_' ME.identifier],...
    'zipPath',zipPath,'nCases',0,'nRuntimeErrors',1,'nFailedCases',1);
end

% ========================================================================
% V82: Is v1(0..5) high-order consistency necessary AFTER V81_CARRY?
%
% Same flight: V81_CARRY target PV state-memory, 25ms ZOH original R1
% thrust-only policy, original HLC, unchanged true R193 19-state plant.
% Only a SHADOW source-inverse decomposition is added.  All variants see
% THE SAME x, t, original reference + carried PV, and fixed physical u.
% No source files, gains, trajectory generator or R1 mathematics change.
% 0: inverse with v1(0) remapped exactly from applied thrust (V60)
% k=1..4: (a) add CBF-caused derivative INCREMENTS relative to same-state
%         ZOH nominal physical command and (b) separately replace the
%         v1 series by ABSOLUTE realized same-ZOH derivative jets.
%         Then recompute v2..4 and the original torque inverse.
% k=5: only differential v1^(5) is observable without reference order7;
%      test this fifth-column sensitivity separately, NEVER call it an
%      absolute physically consistent 5-jet.
% Source nominal Vfd high columns are DISCRETE design sequences. The
% incremental mixed-column tests k=1..3 are sensitivity probes, not
% claims that a piecewise hybrid 5-jet can be physically realized.
% ========================================================================
function result=v82V1JetNecessityAfterCarry(opts)
if exist('test_CBF_SetupPaths','file')==2,test_CBF_SetupPaths();end
req={'CBF_V19_Scenarios','CBF_V19_OriginalPlantStep', ...
    'CBF_V18_R1_RectifiedCable','lqrd'};
for j=1:numel(req)
    if exist(req{j},'file')==0
        error('CBF:V82Dependency','Missing source dependency %s',req{j});
    end
end
if exist('HLC_SUSPENDED_LOAD','class')~=8
    error('CBF:V82MissingHLC','Original source HLC class unavailable');
end
sc=CBF_V19_Scenarios('straight_single','R193');sc.dt=0.025;
s=sc.settings; H=v23MakeHLC(s,sc.dt);
mhat=0.01;
if isfield(opts,'v80MassEstimate'),mhat=double(opts.v80MassEstimate);end
assert(isscalar(mhat)&&isfinite(mhat)&&mhat>0,'CBF:V82Mass');
sest=s;sest.physical.massLoad=mhat;
lo=[s.input.thrustMin;s.input.torqueMin(:)];
hi=[s.input.thrustMax;s.input.torqueMax(:)];
probeTimes=2.125:0.025:2.350;
if isfield(opts,'v82ProbeTimes'),probeTimes=double(opts.v82ProbeTimes(:).');end
assert(~isempty(probeTimes)&&all(isfinite(probeTimes))&& ...
    all(probeTimes>=0)&&all(probeTimes<=2.350+1e-9)&& ...
    all(abs(probeTimes/sc.dt-round(probeTimes/sc.dt))<1e-8), ...
    'CBF:V82ProbeTimes');
if isfield(opts,'v82FifthProbe')
    fifthProbe=double(opts.v82FifthProbe);
else
    fifthProbe=1;
end
assert(isscalar(fifthProbe)&&isfinite(fifthProbe)&&fifthProbe~=0, ...
    'CBF:V82FifthProbe');

x=sc.x0(:);corr=zeros(28,1);
flight=struct([]);rows=struct([]);diagnostics=struct([]);
stopReason='HORIZON_REACHED';lastTime=NaN;nShadowFailures=0;
N=round(2.350/sc.dt);
for n=0:N
    t=n*sc.dt;
    try
        a=v80HLCNext(x,t,sc,H,mhat,corr);
        if any(~isfinite(a.raw(:)))||~isreal(a.raw)
            stopReason='NONFINITE_HLC_RAW';break;
        end
        uNom=min(hi,max(lo,a.raw(:)));
        u=uNom;useR1=t>=2.125-1e-9;reason='NO_R1';
        tl=lo(1);th=hi(1);
        if useR1
            [tl,th,rr]=v75R1Interval(x,s,sc.obstacles,t);
            reason=rr.reason;
            if ~strcmp(reason,'OK')||tl>th+1e-9
                stopReason=['R1_STOP_' reason];break;
            end
            u(1)=min(th,max(tl,u(1)));
        end
        if any(~isfinite(u))||any(u<lo-1e-9)||any(u>hi+1e-9)
            stopReason='ACTUATION_BOX_FAIL';break;
        end
        current=struct('time_s',t,'R1Enabled',useR1,'R1Reason',reason, ...
            'V81TargetOffsetPosInf_m',norm(corr(1:3),Inf), ...
            'V81TargetOffsetVelInf_mps',norm(corr(5:7),Inf), ...
            'sourceRawThrust_N',a.thrust, ...
            'sourceRawTorqueInf_Nm',norm(a.tau,Inf), ...
            'sourceRawTauX_Nm',a.tau(1), ...
            'sourceRawTauY_Nm',a.tau(2), ...
            'sourceRawTauZ_Nm',a.tau(3), ...
            'clippedNominalThrust_N',uNom(1), ...
            'appliedThrust_N',u(1), ...
            'appliedTauInf_Nm',norm(u(2:4),Inf), ...
            'CBFDeltaThrust_N',u(1)-uNom(1), ...
            'R1Lower_N',tl,'R1Upper_N',th, ...
            'sourceBetaSigmaMin',a.sigmaMin, ...
            'targetD2toD6Unmodified',~any(corr(9:end)), ...
            'truePlantUsedForPropagation',true);
        if isempty(flight),flight=current;else,flight(end+1)=current;end %#ok<AGROW>
        lastTime=t;
        if useR1 && any(abs(probeTimes-t)<1e-8)
            try
                [newRows,diagRec]=v82OneState(x,t,u,uNom,corr,a, ...
                    sc,H,sest,lo,hi,fifthProbe);
                if isempty(rows),rows=newRows;else,rows=[rows newRows];end %#ok<AGROW>
                if isempty(diagnostics),diagnostics=diagRec;
                else,diagnostics(end+1)=diagRec;end %#ok<AGROW>
            catch MEshadow
                nShadowFailures=nShadowFailures+1;
                fprintf('[CBF V82 shadow] t=%.3f: %s %s\n', ...
                    t,MEshadow.identifier,MEshadow.message);
                diagRec=v82DiagTemplate(t);
                diagRec.status=['ERROR_' MEshadow.identifier];
                if isempty(diagnostics),diagnostics=diagRec;
                else,diagnostics(end+1)=diagRec;end %#ok<AGROW>
            end
        end
        if n<N
            [~,deltaJet]=v80PredictedCorrection(x,uNom,u,sest,sc.dt);
            corr=v81CarryUpdate(corr,v80KeepPV(deltaJet,1), ...
                sc.dt,false,norm(u-uNom,Inf)<=1e-12,2);
            x=CBF_V19_OriginalPlantStep(x,u,s,sc.dt,4);
            if any(~isfinite(x))||~isreal(x)
                stopReason='TRUE_PLANT_NONFINITE';break;
            end
        end
    catch ME
        stopReason=['ERROR_' ME.identifier];
        fprintf('[CBF V82 flight] t=%.3f: %s %s\n', ...
            t,ME.identifier,ME.message);
        break;
    end
end
if isempty(flight)||isempty(rows)||isempty(diagnostics)
    error('CBF:V82NoData','No flight and jet-order diagnostics produced');
end

% Summary is descriptive: no safety or high-order necessity certificate.
stages={'SOURCE_NOMINAL','REMAP0','DELTA_1','DELTA_2', ...
    'DELTA_3','DELTA_4','REAL_1','REAL_2','REAL_3', ...
    'REAL_4','DELTA5_ONLY','FIFTH_UNIT_PROBE'};
sm=struct([]);
for j=1:numel(stages)
    one=rows(strcmp({rows.stage},stages{j}));
    good=strcmp({one.status},'OK');
    raw=[one.mappedTorqueInf_Nm];raw=raw(isfinite(raw));
    del=[one.mappedTorqueChangeFromRemap0Inf_Nm];del=del(isfinite(del));
    vs=[one.v234ChangeFromOriginalInf];vs=vs(isfinite(vs));
    over=[one.rawTorqueWithinBox];
    z=struct('stage',stages{j},'nSamples',numel(one), ...
        'nSuccessful',sum(good),'nInverseFailures',sum(~good), ...
        'maxRawMappedTorqueInf_Nm',v82NanMax(raw), ...
        'maxTorqueDifferenceFromRemap0Inf_Nm',v82NanMax(del), ...
        'maxV234DifferenceFromNominalInf',v82NanMax(vs), ...
        'nWithinRawPhysicalTorqueBox',sum(over));
    if isempty(sm),sm=z;else,sm(end+1)=z;end %#ok<AGROW>
end
root=fileparts(mfilename('fullpath'));
outdir=fullfile(root,'_CBF_TEST_OUTPUT');
if exist(outdir,'dir')~=7,mkdir(outdir);end
work=tempname;mkdir(work);c=onCleanup(@()v69Cleanup(work)); %#ok<NASGU>
writetable(struct2table(flight),fullfile(work,'V82_V81_CARRY_FLIGHT.csv'));
writetable(struct2table(rows),fullfile(work,'V82_V1_JET_ORDER_COMPARISON.csv'));
writetable(struct2table(diagnostics),fullfile(work,'V82_PHYSICAL_JET_DIAGNOSTICS.csv'));
writetable(struct2table(sm),fullfile(work,'V82_ORDER_SUMMARY.csv'));
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V82_THEORY_AND_EXECUTION.md'),v82Theory());
v81WriteHandover(fullfile(work,'V82_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt'));
files={'V82_V81_CARRY_FLIGHT.csv','V82_V1_JET_ORDER_COMPARISON.csv', ...
    'V82_PHYSICAL_JET_DIAGNOSTICS.csv','V82_ORDER_SUMMARY.csv', ...
    'V82_THEORY_AND_EXECUTION.md','V82_FULL_CUMULATIVE_HANDOVER.txt'};
zipPath=fullfile(outdir,['CBF_V82_1_V1_JET5_V81_CARRY_' ...
    datestr(now,'yyyymmdd_HHMMSS_FFF') '.zip']);
zip(zipPath,files,work);
assert(exist(zipPath,'file')==2,'CBF:V82ZipMissing');
nStageErrors=sum(startsWith({rows.status},'ERROR_'));
nRuntimeErrors=nStageErrors+nShadowFailures+double(startsWith(stopReason,'ERROR_'));
nFailedCases=sum([sm.nInverseFailures]>0)+ ...
    double(nShadowFailures>0 || startsWith(stopReason,'ERROR_'));
if nRuntimeErrors>0
    runStatus='INCOMPLETE_V82_SHADOW_RUNTIME_ERRORS';
else
    runStatus='V82_1_JET_ORDER_SHADOW_COMPLETED_NOT_SAFETY_CERTIFIED';
end
result=struct('status',runStatus, ...
    'zipPath',zipPath,'nCases',numel(stages)+1, ...
    'nRuntimeErrors',nRuntimeErrors, ...
    'nFailedCases',nFailedCases, ...
    'stopReason',stopReason,'lastFlightTime_s',lastTime, ...
    'nJetRows',numel(rows),'nProbeTimes',numel(diagnostics), ...
    'shadowOnly',true,'v81CarryFixed',true, ...
    'physicalR1AndPlantUnchanged',true,'fifthIsDifferentialOnly',true);
end

function [rows,diagRec]=v82OneState(x,t,u,uNom,corr,a,sc,H,sest,lo,hi,fifthProbe)
scg=sc;
scg.refFull=@(tt)v80FullJetAt(sc,tt,t,corr);
scg.ref=@(tt,j)v80ThreeJetAt(sc,tt,j,t,corr);
[vReal,~,vActual,~]=v74RealJet(x,u,sest,scg,t,H.F1,a.XD);
[vNomReal,~,~,~]=v74RealJet(x,uNom,sest,scg,t,H.F1,a.XD);
deltaV1=vReal-vNomReal;
assert(all(isfinite([vReal(1:5),vNomReal(1:5),deltaV1(1:5)]))&& ...
    all(isfinite(vActual)), ...
    'CBF:V82PhysicalJetsNonfinite');
vf0=v60EquivalentV1(a,u(1));
% No reference 7th derivative is available: only the same-state,
% same-reference fifth ORDER DIFFERENCE is measurable here.
delta5=NaN;diffStatus='OK';
try
    JA=v80PhysicalLoadJet(x,u,sest,7);
    JN=v80PhysicalLoadJet(x,uNom,sest,7);
    delta5=JA(3,8)-JN(3,8);
    if ~isfinite(delta5),diffStatus='NONFINITE_SEVENTH_LOAD';end
catch MEdiff
    diffStatus=['ERROR_' MEdiff.identifier];
end
base=v74InverseMap(x,a,H,vf0);
stages={'SOURCE_NOMINAL','REMAP0','DELTA_1','DELTA_2', ...
    'DELTA_3','DELTA_4','REAL_1','REAL_2','REAL_3', ...
    'REAL_4','DELTA5_ONLY','FIFTH_UNIT_PROBE'};
rows=struct([]);maps=cell(1,numel(stages));
for k=1:numel(stages)
    stage=stages{k};vf=a.vfRaw(:).';
    if k>=2
        vf(1)=vf0(1);
    end
    if startsWith(stage,'DELTA_') && ~strcmp(stage,'DELTA5_ONLY')
        highest=str2double(stage(end));
        vf(2:highest+1)=a.vfRaw(2:highest+1)+deltaV1(2:highest+1);
    elseif startsWith(stage,'REAL_')
        highest=str2double(stage(end));
        vf(2:highest+1)=vReal(2:highest+1);
    elseif strcmp(stage,'DELTA5_ONLY')||strcmp(stage,'FIFTH_UNIT_PROBE')
        vf(2:5)=a.vfRaw(2:5)+deltaV1(2:5);
        if strcmp(stage,'DELTA5_ONLY')
            vf(6)=vf(6)+delta5;
        else
            vf(6)=vf(6)+fifthProbe;
        end
    end
    r=struct('time_s',t,'stage',stage, ...
        'status','NOT_EVALUATED', ...
        'appliedThrust_N',u(1),'appliedTauInf_Nm',norm(u(2:4),Inf), ...
        'CBFDeltaThrust_N',u(1)-uNom(1), ...
        'originalHlcTorqueInf_Nm',norm(a.tau,Inf), ...
        'sourceFifthV1',a.vfRaw(6), ...
        'physicalFifthDifference',delta5, ...
        'physicalFifthDifferenceStatus',diffStatus, ...
        'physicalV1Remap0Mismatch',abs(vf0(1)-vReal(1)), ...
        'cbfIncrementalV1HigherJetInf',norm(deltaV1(2:5),Inf), ...
        'candidateV1_0',vf(1),'candidateV1_1',vf(2), ...
        'candidateV1_2',vf(3),'candidateV1_3',vf(4), ...
        'candidateV1_4',vf(5),'candidateV1_5',vf(6), ...
        'mappedThrust_N',NaN,'thrustMapError_N',NaN, ...
        'mappedTauX_Nm',NaN,'mappedTauY_Nm',NaN, ...
        'mappedTauZ_Nm',NaN,'mappedTorqueInf_Nm',NaN, ...
        'mappedTorqueChangeFromRemap0Inf_Nm',NaN, ...
        'mapResidualAtActuallyAppliedTauInf',NaN, ...
        'rawTorqueWithinBox',false,'Beta2SigmaMin',NaN, ...
        'v234ChangeFromOriginalInf',NaN, ...
        'v234AdjustmentToMatchActualTauInf',NaN, ...
        'residualAfterV234AdjustmentInf',NaN, ...
        'affinityWitnessResidualInf',NaN, ...
        'actualPhysicalV234DifferenceInf',NaN, ...
        'actualPhysicalInverseResidualInf',NaN, ...
        'sameStateSameAppliedInput',true, ...
        'onlyShadowMapChanged',true,'v81ReferenceCarryPreserved',true, ...
        'mixedColumnsNotAnExecutableInputJet',true);
    try
        if any(~isfinite(vf))
            error('CBF:V82FifthNonfinite','Fifth order differential unavailable');
        end
        m=v74InverseMap(x,a,H,vf);
        maps{k}=m;
        r.Beta2SigmaMin=min(svd(m.beta));
        r.mappedThrust_N=m.thrust;
        r.thrustMapError_N=m.thrust-u(1);
        r.v234ChangeFromOriginalInf=norm(m.vs-a.vsRaw(:),Inf);
        r.mapResidualAtActuallyAppliedTauInf= ...
            norm(m.beta*u(2:4)-m.alpha,Inf);
        if rcond(m.beta)>=1e-12
            tor=m.beta\m.alpha;
            r.mappedTauX_Nm=tor(1);r.mappedTauY_Nm=tor(2);
            r.mappedTauZ_Nm=tor(3);r.mappedTorqueInf_Nm=norm(tor,Inf);
            r.rawTorqueWithinBox=all(tor>=lo(2:4)-1e-9)&& ...
                all(tor<=hi(2:4)+1e-9);
            if k>1
                if isfinite(base.rawTauInf) && rcond(base.beta)>=1e-12
                    tor0=base.beta\base.alpha;
                    r.mappedTorqueChangeFromRemap0Inf_Nm=norm(tor-tor0,Inf);
                end
            end
        end
        if k>=2 && k<=11
            [dvs,res,~,affineErr]=v74MatchVs(x,a,H,vf,u,m);
            r.affinityWitnessResidualInf=affineErr;
            if isfinite(res)
                r.v234AdjustmentToMatchActualTauInf=norm(dvs,Inf);
                r.residualAfterV234AdjustmentInf=res;
            end
        end
        if strcmp(stage,'REAL_4')
            r.actualPhysicalV234DifferenceInf=norm(vActual(:)-m.vs,Inf);
            alphaReal=H.obj.V2_alpha2_SuspendedLoadxyDst( ...
                x,a.XD,vf,vActual(:),a.HLCparam);
            r.actualPhysicalInverseResidualInf= ...
                norm(m.beta*u(2:4)-alphaReal(:),Inf);
        end
        if ~all(isfinite([r.mappedThrust_N;r.Beta2SigmaMin; ...
                r.mappedTorqueInf_Nm;r.v234ChangeFromOriginalInf]))
            r.status='INVERSE_NONFINITE';
        elseif abs(r.thrustMapError_N)>1e-7*max(1,abs(u(1))) && k>1
            r.status='THRUST_REMAP_FAILED';
        else
            r.status='OK';
        end
    catch MEstage
        r.status=['ERROR_' MEstage.identifier];
    end
    if isempty(rows),rows=r;else,rows(end+1)=r;end %#ok<AGROW>
end
% Differential fifth does NOT require a 7th reference: the same
% reference cancels between two physical ZOH commands at the same state.
% Probe must NOT be presented as a realizable standalone correction law.
diagRec=v82DiagTemplate(t);
diagRec.status='OK';diagRec.sourceThrust_N=a.thrust;
diagRec.appliedThrust_N=u(1);
diagRec.deltaAppliedThrust_N=u(1)-uNom(1);
diagRec.v1Real0MinusRemap0=vReal(1)-vf0(1);
diagRec.deltaFifthPhysical=delta5;
diagRec.fifthDifferenceStatus=diffStatus;
diagRec.v1RealJet0=vReal(1);diagRec.v1RealJet1=vReal(2);
diagRec.v1RealJet2=vReal(3);diagRec.v1RealJet3=vReal(4);
diagRec.v1RealJet4=vReal(5);
diagRec.deltaCBFV1Jet0=deltaV1(1);
diagRec.deltaCBFV1Jet1=deltaV1(2);
diagRec.deltaCBFV1Jet2=deltaV1(3);
diagRec.deltaCBFV1Jet3=deltaV1(4);
diagRec.deltaCBFV1Jet4=deltaV1(5);
diagRec.physicalV234X6=vActual(1);
diagRec.physicalV234Y6=vActual(2);
diagRec.physicalV234Yaw2=vActual(3);
diagRec.sourceFifthV1=a.vfRaw(6);
if all(isfinite([rows(6).mappedTauX_Nm,rows(11).mappedTauX_Nm, ...
        rows(12).mappedTauX_Nm]))
    z4=[rows(6).mappedTauX_Nm;rows(6).mappedTauY_Nm; ...
        rows(6).mappedTauZ_Nm];
    z5=[rows(11).mappedTauX_Nm;rows(11).mappedTauY_Nm; ...
        rows(11).mappedTauZ_Nm];
    zu=[rows(12).mappedTauX_Nm;rows(12).mappedTauY_Nm; ...
        rows(12).mappedTauZ_Nm];
    diagRec.delta5TorqueEffectInf_Nm=norm(z5-z4,Inf);
    diagRec.unit5TorqueEffectInf_Nm=norm(zu-z4,Inf);
    diagRec.delta5V234EffectInf=norm(maps{11}.vs-maps{6}.vs,Inf);
    diagRec.unit5V234EffectInf=norm(maps{12}.vs-maps{6}.vs,Inf);
end
end

function s=v82DiagTemplate(t)
s=struct('time_s',t,'status','NOT_EVALUATED', ...
    'sourceThrust_N',NaN,'appliedThrust_N',NaN, ...
    'deltaAppliedThrust_N',NaN,'v1Real0MinusRemap0',NaN, ...
    'deltaFifthPhysical',NaN,'fifthDifferenceStatus','NOT_EVALUATED', ...
    'v1RealJet0',NaN,'v1RealJet1',NaN,'v1RealJet2',NaN, ...
    'v1RealJet3',NaN,'v1RealJet4',NaN, ...
    'deltaCBFV1Jet0',NaN,'deltaCBFV1Jet1',NaN, ...
    'deltaCBFV1Jet2',NaN,'deltaCBFV1Jet3',NaN, ...
    'deltaCBFV1Jet4',NaN, ...
    'physicalV234X6',NaN,'physicalV234Y6',NaN, ...
    'physicalV234Yaw2',NaN,'sourceFifthV1',NaN, ...
    'delta5TorqueEffectInf_Nm',NaN, ...
    'unit5TorqueEffectInf_Nm',NaN, ...
    'delta5V234EffectInf',NaN, ...
    'unit5V234EffectInf',NaN);
end

function v=v82NanMax(x)
if isempty(x),v=NaN;else,v=max(x);end
end

function txt=v82Theory()
txt=sprintf([ ...
    '# V82: Necessity of v1 higher jets after V81_CARRY\n\n' ...
    'Purpose: decide whether altering v1(0) for R1 physical thrust needs ' ...
    'v1(1..4) and associated v2,v3,v4 re-inversion while keeping the ' ...
    'V81_CARRY target-PV update unchanged. Fifth v1 is audited.\n' ...
    'R193 19-state true plant, true mass as original; mhat=0.01 kg for ' ...
    'HLC and one-hold estimated differences. 25 ms original ZOH.\n' ...
    'Unchanged original HLC generated mapping, gains, source reference, ' ...
    'and thrust-only R1. No new CBF is implemented.\n\n' ...
    'All candidates are same-state same-fixed-applied-physical-input ' ...
    'SHADOW re-inversion only; ONLY V81_CARRY/R1 advances the true flight.\n' ...
    'SOURCE_NOMINAL is the unmodified source vf, v234 and inverse.\n' ...
    'REMAP0 changes v1(0) to match R1 actual thrust; leaves higher ' ...
    'nominal derivative columns, recomputes v234 and inverse.\n' ...
    'DELTA_1 .. DELTA_4 add only the CBF-caused jet differences ' ...
    'between actual and nominal same-state physical 25-ms ZOH ' ...
    'commands onto the nominal Vfd 1..4; avoids falsely assigning ' ...
    'ordinary nominal-vs-physical discrepancies to the CBF.\n' ...
    'REAL_1 .. REAL_4 progressively replace v1 derivatives with the ' ...
    'estimated-plant ZOH right-time jets under same actual u. Intermediate ' ...
    'mixed jets are NOT physically realizable time jets. Full REAL_4 ' ...
    'is the model-based 0..4 jet. The source Vfd columns originally ' ...
    'come from a nominal DISCRETE design, not actual CBF derivatives.\n' ...
    'The fifth physical v1 derivative requires zLoad^(7) - zRef^(7), ' ...
    'but ref7 is not provided. Instead DELTA5_ONLY adds only ' ...
    'zLoadActual^(7)-zLoadNominal^(7) at same x and reference; ' ...
    'this does not prove absolute fifth-jet realizability. ' ...
    'FIFTH_UNIT_PROBE independently perturbs only Vfd(6), relative ' ...
    'to the DELTA_4 mapping.\n' ...
    'Original source inverse directly uses v1(0..4); fifth may be ' ...
    'irrelevant to INSTANTANEOUS algebraic torque but matter in ' ...
    'a future dynamic smoothing/extended input design.\n\n' ...
    'Inspect V82_ORDER_SUMMARY and V82_V1_JET_ORDER_COMPARISON for ' ...
    'mapped torque changes, torque limits, Beta2 singularity, ' ...
    'v234 source difference, and affine v234 correction needed to ' ...
    'reproduce fixed actual tau. Compare physical-jet identity at REAL_4.\n' ...
    'If a synthetic high-order map changes torque, this establishes ' ...
    'a sensitivity; it does NOT prove higher derivatives are required ' ...
    'for a DIRECT physical-input CBF. Nor does a zero effect mean ' ...
    '5th derivative can be dropped from a future dynamic extension.\n' ...
    'Never infer global C5 continuity from 25-ms ZOH; not a safe CBF, ' ...
    'not a proof of intersample obstacle or ground safety, and R1 ' ...
    'is expected to become infeasible near t=2.350s.\n' ...
    'V82.1 default probe times include 2.350s, the largest recorded ' ...
    'R1 thrust intervention (7.148 N) in the uploaded V82 flight. ' ...
    'The flight/inverse is otherwise identical to V82. ' ...
    'No MATLAB run was done in authoring environment.\n']);
end

function result=v82FailureArtifact(ME)
root=fileparts(mfilename('fullpath'));
outdir=fullfile(root,'_CBF_TEST_OUTPUT');
if exist(outdir,'dir')~=7,mkdir(outdir);end
work=tempname;mkdir(work);c=onCleanup(@()v69Cleanup(work)); %#ok<NASGU>
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V82_RUNTIME_ERROR.txt'), ...
    getReport(ME,'extended','hyperlinks','off'));
v23WriteText(fullfile(work,'V82_THEORY_AND_EXECUTION.md'),v82Theory());
zipPath=fullfile(outdir,['CBF_V82_V1_JET5_V81_CARRY_ERROR_' ...
    datestr(now,'yyyymmdd_HHMMSS_FFF') '.zip']);
zip(zipPath,{'V82_RUNTIME_ERROR.txt','V82_THEORY_AND_EXECUTION.md'},work);
result=struct('status',['INCOMPLETE_V82_RUNTIME_' ME.identifier], ...
    'zipPath',zipPath,'nCases',0,'nRuntimeErrors',1,'nFailedCases',1);
end
